|| śrīḥ ||

ācāryadaṇḍiviracitā

avantisundarī



[hiraṇyagarbhamīśānamādyaṃ ca puruṣaṃ harim |

trīnapyasatyanānātvān vande viśvaśarīriṇaḥ || 1 ||

hṛdyo rāmāyaṇaṃ nāma yanmukhānmadhunirjha(raḥ) |

...... || 2 ||

martyayantreṣu caitanyaṃ mahābhāratavidyayā |

arpayāmāsa tatpūrvaṃ yastasmai munaye namaḥ || 3 ||

babhūva jihvābhinayaḥ kavīnāṃ yadanugrahāt |

anuśāsitṛ śabdānāṃ tannamāmi...... || 4 ||

......parāḥ |

yeṣāṃ jagattrayālekhyavicitrāścittabhittayaḥ || 5 ||

subandhuḥ kila niṣkrānto bindusārasya bandhanāt |

tasyaiva hṛdayaṃ baddhā vatsarājo...... || 6 ||

tamānavadeva yā

gomukhānvitayā jātiḥ kā bṛhatkathayojjhitā || 7 ||

sanārāyaṇadattā yā devadattāśrayā kṛtiḥ |

mūladevodi...... || 8 ||

(śū)drakeṇāsakṛjjitvā svacchayā khaḍgadhārayā |

jagadbhūyo′bhyavaṣṭabdhaṃ vācā svacaritārthayā || 9 ||

apyatikramya lokasya śrutivartmani...... |

......bhāratī || 10 ||

suvibhaktamukhādyaṅgairvyaktalakṣaṇavṛttibhiḥ |

pareto′pi sthito bhāsaḥ śarīrairiva nāṭakaiḥ || 11 ||

rājñā śrīsarvasene(na)...... |

......vijayaṃ hareḥ || 12 ||

seturūpeṇa tiṣṭhanto loke sadvastudarśinaḥ |

paṭpañcāśat pramāṇatvaṃ gatā naḥ kavipuṅgavāḥ || 13 ||

svayaṃ madu...... |

......kiyān bhāro′vagacchataḥ || 14 ||

liptā madhudraveṇāsan yasya nirvivaśā giraḥ |

tenedaṃ vartma vaidarbhaṃ kālidāsena śodhitam || 15 ||

cakṣuḥ kṣati...... |

......|| 16 ||

vyāptuṃ padatrayeṇāpi yaśśakto bhuvanatrayam |

tasya kāvyatrayavyāptau cittaṃ nārāyaṇasya kim || 17 ||

sarvatomukhamapyādyaṃ kavimadya...... |

kastaṃ na stautyanunmattaḥ kavīnāṃ cakravartinam || 18 ||

bhinnastīkṣṇamukhenāpi citraṃ bāṇena nirvyathaḥ |

vyāhāreṣu jahau līlāṃ na mayūraḥ...... || 19 ||

......citrīyate mama |

varṇahīnāpi yā jātā jātyutkarṣaguṇāspadam || 20 ||

dhavalaprabhavā rāgaṃ sā tanoti manovatī |

kavigandhagajairebhiḥ...... || 21 ||

.....ṇna dāmodaravaṃśajaḥ |

āvarjane tiraścāmapyeti hṛdya iva dhvaniḥ || 22 ||

dhigastu kavikākasya tasya tadvaktradarśinaḥ |

prasārayati...... || 23 ||

......ḍhuṃ duruktaṃ nāma duṣkaram |

kṣālayiṣyati kaḥ kārṣṇyaṃ dvijāteḥ kauśikadviṣaḥ || 24 ||

khalakākamukhālīḍhāpyamalaiva sarasvatī |

tatkiñci...... || 25 ||

rvāṃ parasparamanugrahāt

edhantāmṛddhikīrtibhyāmitaretaravallamāḥ || 26 ||

asurāḥ parājayantāṃ jayantu devāḥ sarasvatī jayatu |

jayatu mahākavisarthaḥ...... || 27 ||

.....ḍigaṅganāmukhe patrāṅguliriva sakalojjvalavarṇaśobhinī sanniviṣṭā śravaṇacāmaramañjarīvākṣīṇadānasantānajanitasaurabhasamṛddhyā dakṣi......vottamāṅganāhitā cakravartikṣetralakṣmyāḥ kāmaprasavopadānakṣamā kalpadrumayaṣṭiriva jambūdvīpanandanasya hemaratnācitapa......kośasañca.....ṣadalinīpītagandhakṣamudapuṇḍarīkāvadātagāḍhasalilayā surānaikavāsānavāsavatyāginī ceyamityavajñāya vasvokasārākośa.....ṭayā madamañjulahaṃsagadgadaravayā yuvatijanakṣacakṣodajanitavīcīvegayā vegavatyā viracitakhātakṛtyā kroḍīkṛtya sarvasaritsamudradvīpapattanotpanna.....ṭubhūtamutsṛjya jalatvaṃ svayamacalebhyo′pi sthiratareṇābaddhaparikaraṃ sthitena śītakālavadātasudhā]nvitena dugdhajaladhineva, kailāsaśikha[ra]mālāviḍambinā prākāravalayena sa(rvaiśva)ryagrahagrāmaṃ gagajābhogamiva [grasamānā, diggajairiva digantasthāpitairambarasaridambudhautakumbhamaṇḍalaiścaturbhi]rgopuradvārairupetā, gopuragurupha(lā? ṇā) maṇḍalasphuranmaṇista(mba ? ba)karāgarañjitaviyadviśālārṇavairbahuguṇa[bhāgavistāra-] vāhibhi[ranekanāgāṅganāgamajanitarddhibhiḥ, praśastatakṣakādi]ghaṭitairbhujagarājairiva bhogavatīmahāpathairupaśobhitā, maṇimayasamagrabhūtalatvādaparaviyadvitarkā......ṇai rdivyavimānairivā[maragaṇādhyāsitairnalinakādibhirmahā]prāsādairitaraiśca mahāpuruṣocitairmahāpuruṣairiva lakṣaṇopapannapādajānubāhugrīvā(ka?)nāsikālalāṭaśirobhirdṛḍhaprakoṣṭhaska[ndhakūṭairaślathakṣañja]rākṣaiścaturavṛttajātibhiratyudārairu[da]graśaktibhiḥ kutavedibhiragrāmyālaṅkārairalaṅkṛtā, sañjātatilakaiḥ lakṣyasurabhināgairaśokarāgavahairmahā[bhavyai]rvijṛmbhitapalāśaiḥ kesaribhirarjunalalitairmādhavīmanoharaiḥ kāmarathairiva kāntaka(rṇa ? rṇi)kāracakraiḥ, prīti(pra ? prā)sādairiva cārupārāvatānvitaiḥ, ratinagarairiva kṛtasālaparikaraiḥ, śṛṅgārāntaḥpurairivāmalajātikāntibhiḥ, līlācitrakārairiva nānāvarṇavallikāparivṛtaiḥ, rāgasamudrairiva sphuratpravālapaṭalaiḥ, dharmabālāpatyairiva dhātrīsamadhiṣṭhitaiḥ, kāmukairiva racitapriyālakaiścārakoddeśairiva sahakārālayaiḥ, kauravairiva pāṇḍucchāyodayadamanakaiḥ, gaurīcaritairiva prasavasampadāvarjitaśrīkaṇṭhamanoharaiḥ, bhāratasamarairiva kauravakāraṇadalitaraṇoddhatarasasthūlakaravīravihāraiḥ, aṅgairiva cārucampakaiḥ, magadhairiva kāntapuṣpapurajanavallabhaiḥ, bhavāṅgairiva nāgavallīpūgaśobhitaiḥ, satsaṅgatairivāmlānakaramaṇīyaiḥ, giribhirivonnidrapuṇḍarīkavanairindranagaravijigīṣayā nandanavanairiva saṅgṛhītairbāhyairābhyantaraiśca vardhitapramadājanapramadaiḥ pramadavanairnidāghabhiyā śaraṇāgataṃ śiśiramivābhipālayantī, mathanāyāsagalitalāvaṇyairvardhitapṛthuromabhiramṛtahaṭhāpahārasāhasakṛte sarvasuragaṇena svabhavanakuṭumbinā yugapadeva dharmādhikaraṇe vyavaharttumamburāśimivāgatya bahirniviṣṭaiḥ, jvalateva baḍavāgukhena kamalakānanena parigṛhītaiḥ, ravikararasabharaṇavihatikṛtabahalakalakalamiva kalavirutimadakalamanibhṛtagatijalavihagakulaṃ vahadbhiḥ, anekapakulavihṛtibhiḥ avanatamiva jaladharajālamambupā(ṭa ? na)lampaṭaṃ darśayadbhirnabhaḥsthalaviśālaistaṭākamaṇḍalairbhāvyamānasasyaparikarā, maratakavedikāharitakamalinīpalāśasthiteva vitatasitabhavanasālamālāpakṣarājinī rājahaṃsīvilambivikramalalitanitambinīkadambakanitambabimbapralambitamañjuśiñjānakāñcīdāmā kāñcīpuraṃ nāma rājadhānī |

yayā saha pitāmahenonmīyamānā sāralāghavādivoparyabhramadamarāvatī | yasyāṃ ca bhaumasudhāsamucitā divyasudhāsvādalālasā [iva] rajanīṣu rajanīkaramullihanti loladhvajadukūlajālarasanāḥ prāsādapaṅktayaḥ | yasyāṃ ca mañjuvācāṃ kuñcita[keśa]pakṣacchāyātarjitāni[trāsādiva satata]mākrandantyuttaṃsamadhukarakulāni | līlākaṭākṣalaṅghitāni śokādivāśyāmalimānaṃ (a?)darśayanti śrava[ṇendī]varāṇi | smita[candrāṇi vihasitāni vailakṣyādiva ku]ṇḍalitānyāvṛtaśravaṇaṃ śerate dantapatrāṇi | dantacchadacchāyākadarthitāni duḥkhādi(va ta)nimānamudvahanti stanā[varaṇāruṇāṃśukāni | karakisalayaviḍambitāni tāpādiva śanairmlā]yanti vibhramāmbhoruhāṇi | nakhamaṇimarīcimañjarīparibhūtāni khedādiva muhurmuhurucchvasanti vi[lāma]kusumāni | śroṇibimbalā[vaṇyābhibhūtavarṇotkarṣāṇi viṣādādiva daśāmantyāṃ dadhatyuttarīyāṇi | pādapa]ṅkajasahajarāgāvadhīritā rujeva ca pade pade patanti piṇḍālaktakarasāḥ | yasyāṃ cakrabhakṣitamiva candrakāntaśilātaleṣvandhakārakabalita[mivendranīlājireṣu tadavamānalajjākṛtāgni]praveśamiva padmarāgabhūmipu taddāhavedanāvagāḍhasalilamiva sphaṭikabhittibhāgeṣu sakalamiva divasamatitaralaṃ bhrama(nti ? ti) pratibimbapataṅgamaṇḍalam |

yā cā[ṅgīkṛtānaṅgabhā]vayogyābhiranekaśatapuruṣopagrahaprakārābhirapi pūtoṣmabhiraparapratyayavidhibhiraśeṣasampradānakarmakārakavibhaktibhapaṇḍitābhirakliṣṭagamyayogābhiravikārāgamodbhavānabhijñābhiranupasargavedinībhirapūrvābhyāsakaraṇakuśalābhirguṇavṛddhipadaviṣayitasarvavarṇābhiścaturākāravacanābhiraparaśābdi(kī)bhirivākālapratyākhyāyinībhiḥ veśavilāsinībhirvilāsadevatābhiriva sañcarantībhiḥ avadhīritarūpalāvaṇyavaidagdhyasauṣṭhavatayā śokaniścetanībhūtamivāparispandamamarabhavanabhitticitreṣvādarśayati divyasīmantinījanam |

yasyāśca viśālatayā nāstī(pa ? va) hi bhuvanam, uccatayā saudhānāṃ loṣṭakā iva girayaḥ, ratnabahutvādāpaṇānāṃ riktā iva jalanidhayaḥ, cāturyeṇa paurāṇāṃ grāmya iva makaraketuḥ, gāmbhīryeṇa dīrghikānāmuttānamiva sāgaratalam, atiśatena śilpakṛtāmakiñcijjña iva viśvakarmā, matibalena śāstravidāṃ (a)pakvā iva kāvyāṅgirasarauhiṇeyāḥ |

tasyāḥ patirapara iva pākaśāsano na pātā surāṇāṃ, na kṣapayitā sapakṣabhūbhṛtāṃ, na karttā gotrabalavidhvaṃsasya, na vartayitā varṣopadravāṇāṃ, nābhyupetā pāparucyanurodhasya, nābhilaṣitā dīrghatapaḥparigrahasya, nābhiṣektā janārdanasya, dinakara iva dīptavigraho, hara iva paraśukriyāviśāradaḥ, śaśadhara iva tārakeśaḥ, keśava iva snigdhaghoṣaḥ, yakṣarāja iva nityodagraradaḥ, pratyūṣa iva padmarāgaprabhādharo, dharābhoga iva pṛthulalāṭabhūmiḥ, umāgururivāyatabhujagabhogaḥ, kapiketuriva karṇāntadarśanaḥ, sālapādapa ivātipīvaraskandhaḥ, prāsāda iva praśastatuṅganāsikaḥ, samarodyata iva sadāsannābhiyogī, jāṅgaloddeśa iva samasūrasthalo, rāgīva sutanumadhyavṛttiḥ, dardurāca(la) iva ghanonnakharapṛthunitambaratnarañjitāmbaraḥ, kiṅkareśa iva sthirorudaṇḍadharaḥ, sāmāmnāya iva śubhakaracaraṇalakṣaṇaḥ, kṣaṇadākarādiva rājaśabdāmarṣādākṛṣṭakāntisarvasvaḥ sarvarājakahariṇayūthamathanarājasiṃhaḥ siṃhaviṣṇu(carmaki ? varmeti) nāmnā nayasambhāvanānā (?) pallaveṣu rājā babhūva |

yaḥ sambhramacalanacalitanārāyaṇanābhinalinoddhūtadhūlisaṅgadhūsaritayā rājyābhiṣekadiṣṭivṛddhipiṣṭātakarajorājipiñjaritaśarīrayevānandarabhasamādisiṃhāsanākrame samāliṅgyata śriyā |

yasya ca sakalajaladhijalavalayasamullaṅghanābhilāṣukeṇa salilataraṇābhyāsahetorabhiṣekapayasi bahala......ṣi sphuṭitamivāsakṛt pratāpānalena | yasya ca krodhadahanadahyamānakvathadarātijīvitakabalagrahasaṃbhṛtasantāpayeva prakāmapītatoyayā.....ṃauktikopalataleṣu muhuralulyata ghanakaṭhorayā khaḍgalatayā | yena ca prathamamevābhinavayauvanāpū[ryamāṇabhu]jaśikhara......vadeva śaraṇamitarasya raṇapayitasya(?) | yasmiṃśca bhūbhuji bhuñjati bhujastambhena bhuvaṃ bhogabhaṅgo bhujaṅgamānāṃ na(ca bhujaṅgamāḥ) | ......kuṇḍakānāṃ na ca kuṇḍakāḥ | parasparapāto golakānāṃ na ca golakāḥ | sūktātikramo naktañcarāṇāṃ na ca naktañcarāḥ | tamaḥprasaraḥ pra[doṣāṇāṃ na ca pradoṣāḥ] | .....ṇāṃ, na ca nistriṃśāḥ | pādāpīḍā kaṇṭakānāṃ na ca kaṇṭakāḥ | dvijihvābhyavahāryatā prabhañjanānāṃ na ca prabhañjanāḥ | rūpadhvaṃso lubdhānāṃ na ca lubdhāḥ [citramāsī]......prajānām |

atha sa rājā sarvadevatārādhanaparaḥ paraṃ dhiṣaṇopapanno′pi divyānandajananeṣu kaviguṇeṣu prītimānabhūt | avibudho′pi ka(yā ? thā)mṛtarasaṃ kalāvṛtameṣāvaṇa(?) |

ekadainaṃ sabhāgatamabhinavo gandharvastumbururiva jambhaśatrumityupāvīṇayat——

danujapatihṛdayabhūdharavibhedavijñātaśaktinakhakuliśam |

jagadudayahetu viṣṇoravatu vapurnārasiṃhaṃ vaḥ ||

sa imāmāryāmākarṇya guṇakutūhalī tamaprākṣīt—— ‘bhadra! kasyaitānyakṣarāṇi vikaṭabaddhānyojasvīni ca lakṣyante, kasya ceyaṃ varṇaracanā mādhuryavatī prasannā cendukarakalikeva śravaṇānandamutpādayati’ iti |

sa tu sampraṇipatya vyajñāpayat—— deva! paramanugṛhīto′smi, kṣaṇamavadhānadānādanugṛhītatamaḥ kriyatāmayaṃ janaḥ | “asti diśi paścimottarasyāmāryadeśaśikhāmaṇirānandapuraṃ nāma brāhmaṇānāṃ mahānāvāsaḥ | tato hi nissṛtā sarasvatīva brahmalokādagastyamūrttiriva pītodgīrṇagambhīraśabdasamudrā dakṣiṇāṃ diśamanugṛhṇantī sakalakitavasiddhāntaprapañcamūlana mūladevena sakhyuracalasya kṛte niveśitamacalapuraṃ nāma gavaprodakapuṣpavāsitakalamakānanāyāsikabhūmau(?) nagaramaparamiva dharaṇigocaramamaralokam, āspadaṃ puṇyakarmaṃṇāmalaghu viviktamantravistārasambhṛtadhṛtiradhivasati kuśikavaṃśavardhanī sarvātithirapratigrahītrī mahatyudārarūpā brahmarāśirbrahmasantatiḥ |

tatrodapādi bhagavato vidhivadāhṛtasarvasaptatanturūpiṇo nārāyaṇasvāmino nābhipadma iva brahmaikadhāma dāmodarasvāmināmā tejo(yamaḥ ? mayaḥ) kumāraḥ | sa yauvanārambha evātisubhagākṛtirakṛtakavākyadarśitapuṇyasadbhāvayā sarvāṅgamanoharayā sarvakalāvidagdhayā sarvabhāṣāpravīṇayā pramāṇayuktayā lalitapadavinyāsayā caturahṛdyālaṅkārayā viśuddhajātivṛttayā sarasvatyā svayaṃvara (e ? iva) kanyakayā svayamupetya sasnehamasvajyata | ko hi nāma bhagavatīṃ bhavitavyatāmatikramya yathāsamīhitena sādhayati pathā, yataḥ kauśikakumāro mahāśaivaṃ mahāprabhāvaṃ gavāṃ prabhavaṃ pradīptabhāsaṃ bhāraviṃ ravimivenduranurūpyadarśa iva puṇyakarmaṇi viṣṇuvardhanākhye rājasūnau praṇayamanvabadhnāt |

ekadā ca mṛgayāṃ gacchatāmunā nītastannirbandhādasvakulasamucitamahutaśeṣaṃ māṃsamā.....ṇayaiva lajjayā pitrorantikamanu(pa)sṛtya tīrthayātrāprasaṅgena digantarāṇyabhramat | bhramaṇaśīlakīrttergāṅgeyakuladhvajasya durvinīta iti vi[parītanāmnaḥ].....ġuṇanidhiramṛtadhāmna iva kumudākaro gocaramagamat | amunā ca sādhulaṅghanamūlamātramātmanivedanādisaujanyaṃ darśayatā yaśīkṛta[stadabhyāśe vasati | āryeyamiyaṃ ca va]......(ta)sya dvijakumārasya mativilasitam | viditaṃ nāma tasya sadasadvidyamānakaṃ bhuvaneṣu | vayasā cāsau viṃśativarṣadeśīyaḥ” [iti kṣititalanihitamauliḥ praṇamyācāra]......bhṛti bhūpatirjātakautūhalo haladhara iva sarasvatītīrthāni sambhāvayan anekaśrīmukhamaramparānukṛṣṭamenamātmasādakarot | [māhātmyādatiśayadarśitārādhitapuru]......caturānanasyādikaverdvijottamasya prākṛtānāṃ ca vastubhedānāṃ tatpūrvaṃ prakaṭayitustatya putrīkaraṇena darśitātiprasādastadanurūpamana[lpapatrapari]......prādācca brahmadeyaparimitam | ekadā ca prākṛtagānāni kānicittena preṣitāni śrutvā paraṃ prītaḥ strīsahasrakulaṃ ca kāñcanāmamatre surabhi.....ṃāpūrya tvadguṇapremaprasnutānāṃ tvanmātṝṇāṃ stanyamidam | atibahutvādapasāṃ pratyekaṃ stanapānayatnagauravaṃ tava syād, ato′smābhirekatraiva saṃbhṛtamiti prajighāya | evaṃvidhāśca sammānabhājaḥ pratimāsaṃ pratipakṣaṃ pratidinamityavarttayat pṛthivīpatiḥ |

sa ca tathānugṛhyamāṇo gandhamādanaprabhṛtibhiśca varakṛtaiḥ saṃskṛtaprākṛtānāṃ ca kāvyānāṃ lakṣaṇairdakṣiṇāpathaṃ sanāthamakarot | nṛpatinirbandhapariṇītaśca brahmamayān samagravāḍyayādhārabhūtānanantamūlānacalakulasthitivihitasanniveśānamburāśigambhīrānujjvalarājahaṃsopagrahaprakāśatejaso lokāniva trīn siṃhaviṣṇumanorathātilobhanāmnastanūjānajījanat | yeṣāṃ gṛheṣu prādhītapaṭubrahmaghoṣaḥsthānavyākhyāyamānasarvaśāstradhvaniḥ, aṅganājanacaraṇapadmajalpākanūpurāhṛtabhavanadīrghikākalahaṃsakolāhalaḥ, sakalātithisārthasantarpaṇakalakalo, gandhaparimalabhrāntabhṛṅgamaṇḍalījhaṅkārālaṅkṛtirabhimatagṛhadevārādhanaparapurandhrimaṇḍalārabdhabahuvidhotsava—svanaśca pallavadānaśaktighoṣaṇāpaṭaha iva divāniśamiñcitatpadacaturasañcaratsarasvatībhūṣaṇaravamantharo dadhvān |

madhyamastu teṣāṃ manoratha iva cireṇopamannaḥ kalijigīṣordharmasya māhātmyavato mahitamahāśabdaughapūritān mahībhṛnmānitān maryādārakṣaṇocitān mahāguṇaratnarāśibhājo mahāsattvān mahodadhīniva madhyamo lokaścaturo dāmodarabhavadāsasiṃhaviṣṇu(vīra)dattanāmno brahmādhiṣṭhitān sutānalabhata |

teṣāṃ tu kanīyaso nisargaśuddhavṛttasya vīradattaśarmaṇo brahmarṣervasiṣṭhasyevārundhatī satīnāma[gra]gāminī gaurī nāma māṭharasagotrā brāhmaṇī gṛhiṇīpadamadhyatiṣṭhat | sa tasyāmanekaduhitṛjanmajātodvegaśāntaye tantumekaṃ daṇḍināmānamavindata | piturasya preyasī sapatnīputra ityakṛtvā matsaraṃ mahānubhāvā saptamādvarṣādārabhya sarasvatyeva suprasannā daṇḍinamavarddhayat |

tasmiṃścopanīte paṭhati tadgururgurudidṛkṣayeva svaragāt | tasmiṃścāntare paracakrapīḍayā paryākuleṣu dramiḷacoḷapāṇḍyeṣu, parāmṛṣṭāsu kulavadhūṣu, virateṣvagnihotreṣu, vilupteṣu dhānyakūṭeṣu, vidruteṣu kuṭumbiṣu, jṛmbhiteṣva......bhinnāsu maryādāsuchinnāsvārāmapaṅktiṣu, bhagnāsu sabhāprapāsu, paryastāsu satraśālāsu, nihateṣu dhaniṣu, prahateṣu kāpatheṣu, dramileṣvavalīḍheṣu, .....ḍiva kalau kārayatyekarājyamuparatapranaṣṭabandhuvargaḥ pradru(ma?)taprāyaparijanaḥ pravṛttavṛttikṣayo durbhikṣakṣīṇakośaḥ kauśikadārako daṇḍī.....ẏā deśāntarāṇyabhramat | avasacca ciramabhilakṣiteṣu gurukuleṣu, alabhata cānavadyāṃ vidyām | garīyasīṣu ca brahmakṣatrasaṃsatsvitaradu......khātamāva......kasya kalpavṛkṣakriyāvismāpitadurjayasya māndhātṛnāmnaḥ sthapateḥ praśastavāstu, śāstrārthasārasāmastyasaṃhāronmīlitaprayogatantra......vistārakuśalaḥ ṣaṇṇavatiprāsādavidhiviśārado yānāsanaśayanādinānāvikalpanāpaṭuḥ sthitacaradhāradvīpajvaravyāmiśrasaṃjñānāṃ ṣaḍvidhānāṃ yantrā[ṇāma]......[tīyaprayoktā ṣaṭtriṃśadācārya]guṇairalaṅkṛto lalitālayanāmā samastasūtragṛhī varddhakī takṣakapakṣapratī[kṣyaṃ ? kṣyaḥ]kṣatritaiśca saṃskṛtaḥ sthapatirabhyetya viracitāñjalirārdradṛṣṭirnirdiṣṭāyāṃ bhūmāvupāviśat |

dṛṣṭe′pi tasmin vismayaspṛśo janasya, ‘ayaṃ kila yantrapuruṣairdvārayuddhamahīnamādarśitavān, anena kila alīkajaladharadhārājalajāladanturamantarikṣaṃ kṛtam, eṣa kila yantramayamindrajālikaṃ kṛtavān, eṣa kila saṃkhyeṣvasaṃkhyānāṃ yugapadeva bhinatti śatruhastināṃ mastakasthalāni musalamātrābhiriṣubhiḥ, amunā kila dramiḍabhāṣayā śūdrakaracitamupaniba[ndha ? ddham], asya kila pitrā yavanānapyatiśayānena kṣudhito′yamiti yantreṇābhidhāpitam, ayaṃ tato′pyadhikaḥ kila’ ityevamāsan vikasitakutūhalāḥ pralāpāḥ |

praśānte ca kalakale sakale sa daṇḍinamavādīt——“asti kiñcid vijñāpya(m | a)vasitā eva sarve nityapramādaśaithilyābhyāṃ śilpātiśayāḥ | yato′dya tvevaṃ prayogaleśo′pi vismayāya lokasya | yuṣmādṛśāṃ tu brahmendraparāśaraprabhṛtipraṇītaśāstrahṛdayavedināṃ kiyadivaitasmin naipuṇamapi | tadanugrahārthameva kevalam anumahāmallapuram urutaraṅgahastasaṃvāhyamānapādapaṅkajasyormimālino bhagavato bhujagavaraśayanamanugṛhṇataḥ śailasya śārṅgadhanvanaḥ kenāpi kāraṇena maṇibandha eva bhagno dakṣiṇaḥ karaḥ | sa tu mayā pratighaṭitaḥ | kimasāvatimahadbhiḥ pūrvācāryaistasyā divyākṛterghaṭitāyā anurūpaṃ ghaṭate na veti draṣṭumarhatha | na hi vaḥ śakyamasmādṛśāmasādhāraṇenābhyarthitamakṛtvā sthātum” iti |

atha sannidhāvevopaviṣṭo ′dhiṣṭhānamiva sarvasadguṇānāṃ, sarvasvadānadīkṣayāpyasantu(ṣṭā ? ṣṭa)tyāgaśaktiḥ sa nityakalāsamāgamasabhāgṛhaṃ, sarva(nnā ? nā)garikānukaraṇīyalīlāsauṣṭhavaḥ sarvavīrāgresaro vīravatāmaparanāmā raṇamallasenāpatikumāraḥ sahapāṃsukrīḍāsambhṛtasneharāśirabravīt——“ārya, sambhāvya evāsya śilpivarasya praṇayaḥ | bahvāścaryāṇi girisamudrakānanāni | mitraṃ ca tavaiṣa viśvabrahmarāśeḥ kalpasūtraṭīkākārasya sakalavidyānadīpūravāridhestriṃśatkratuvibhūtibhāvitatrayastriṃśasya śāpānugrahasamarthasya brahmarṣerbhavarātanāmnaḥ putraḥ, tatputrāṇāṃ tatsamānamedhādisarvasampadāṃ dvitīyastrayyāmaṅgeṣvai[tihyakalāsu]kavitāyāṃ cādvitīyaḥ suhṛnmatanirvikāradattahṛdayo guruparicaryāparaḥ paramamāheśvaro labdhavarṇakarṇadhāraḥ karṇamapi nāparā......kastyāgaśaktyātikrānto mantrārthatattvavyākhyānacaturaścaturvedavit sarvajanamātṛbhūtakaruṇāvṛttirmātṛdattaḥ tadā caiṣā......[karasvāmino dehabhaja (?)sahajakīrttirāmnāyanidhira......bhūmidevanivahacūḍāmaṇirdevaśarmā tvaddarśanāya keralebhyaḥ kāḥ.....ṭadeṣāmapi saṅkalpānukūlo′yamārambho nirvicārama......paredyuḥ saha mitrajanaiḥ śrījayantanārāyaṇabhajanānandaprabhṛtibhiḥ saha....l̤īnakṣmābhṛtpakṣacchedākṣamasahasrākṣadai......vairiṇamamaragaṇamasurasainyasaṅgaho.....ṃadanekapapotakākulitavanaṃ vanaṣaṇḍamivod......ścaryodbhavakūṭasākṣiṇamiva kālakūṭāderiṇa.....ṇabhaso bhāsurabhujaṅgarājasphuṭaphaṇāratnacakravālakarālitaṃ......] saridaṅganābhisaraṇaprakāśasaubhāgyarāśimamburāśim, āśīviṣabhogabhīṣaṇaiśca rāvaṇabhujadaṇḍairiva rājatācalaṃ kailāsamullāsibhirudanvadūrmibhiḥ spṛśyamānamūlaṃ rājamandigmudīkṣamāṇaḥ, taralataraṅgabhaṅgabhagnagarbhaśuktigarbhonmuktamuktāphaladalaśabalavālukena śītalagandhodgandhimālināpi mukulabakulacakrapravaralāñchitena pracuracūtaparimalena sphītasurabhicampakāśokavṛkṣotpalapunnāgatilakasālasinduvāravāritāmodena kramukanālikeramālinā jaladhivelāpathena kiñcidantaramatikramya vyākośakuvalayadāmaśyāmalābhirlakṣmīkaṭākṣamālābhiriva lavaṇasāgarataraṅgarājibhirllaṅghyamānaśarīraṃ dūrotthitaphaṇāsahasrasphuritatāmradṛṣṭimālena punarapi madhukaiṭabhadānavābhipatanaśaṅkānirūpyamādiśeva śeṣeṇohyamānaṃ yoganidrāmantharamukulitekṣaṇaprabhāvapravāheṇa nābhirandhramuktenāścaryasahasrapatreṇānugṛhyamāṇakamalāsanaṃ bhagavantamutphullena cakṣuṣaikṣata |

svaṃ ca hastayugalamayatnenaiva ku(ḍ)malitamadhāpatiṃ(?) gurubhaktibhāranamramūrdhā nirdhautātmaka(rva ? lma)ṣa iva tadaṅgasparśapāvanaiḥ pārāvāraśīkarasalilabindubhiravahitena cakṣuṣāntatastadarcāśarīramabhinirūpya kvacidapyanadhigataghaṭanāprasthānabhedastameva sthapatimālokya ‘apacayitasya pustakarmaṇaḥ kāṣṭheyam, atra tu kastvayā pratisaṃhitaḥkara’ ityabhāṣata |

sa tu vinītaśramaḥ śilpivaryaḥ kṛtārtho′hametāvateti racitāñjaliranaṃsīt |

asminneva cāntare jhaṭitikāribhiradabhrasaṃbhramabhramitapakṣapālibhirvelodyānabhramaramaṇḍalairyugapadeva pratyudgato, bhagavannābhitāmarasavāsodbhavabhrāntiheturaparapārijātodbhedasandehadāyī, yoganidrāciraniruddharatyutsavotkaṇṭhamānalakṣmīniḥśvāsaprasarasorabhyasaṃśayāvahaḥ śatamakhaparibhujyamānadigvadhūparimalāyamānaḥ pratyaṅmukho ghrāṇalepī ko′pi divyaḥ saurabhātiśayo′bhyāgamat | kimidamiti prabalavismayaprahitadṛṣṭayaḥ sarva eva te kimapyullasatpravālavallarīvalayapāṭalamivonmiṣaduragaphaṇāratnalāvaṇyalepa.....ḍaurvapāvakajvāloparaktamivotpatatsapakṣaparvataśikharāgralakṣyakalpavṛkṣastabakatāmramiva ca sandhyāyamānaṃ samudroddeśamadrākṣuḥ | kṣaṇādiva......[ca paśyatāṃ teṣāṃ] lolakallolamālollāsitopasrastaṃ syandanacakrādhikapramāṇamutkesarapaṅkti kiñcit paṅkeruhaṃ tadāsīt | āsīcca punaracyutacaraṇāravindasparśa......[ra ? ntreṇaiva divyasraganulepanābharaṇaḥ] kṛpāṇadhārāmarīcimañjarībhāsuraikabāhuritarakarakalitaratnoccitracarmamaṇḍalaḥ pratighnanniva svatejasārkabhāsaṃ ko′pi vidyā......[sa ca bhagavantaṃ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya hetigarbhamañjalimupā]racayat | utpatanaraṃhaḥpreṅkholitaprālambahārajālacalabālākamālābahalakhaḍgaprabhāmbuvāhavāhī sahasaiva divasa......[testu loko′timātravismayavismṛtā]ntarātmā nirantarodañcaduccaro(ta ? mā)ñcapuñjakañcukitaścintām |

atha citrīyadbalātkṛtacittasaṅgataḥ kathetihāsarasāsvādarasikaḥ smitapūrvābhibhāṣī viśe......[lyavandhyavāgalabhyarandhrasthūlalakṣo]vi(la?)kṣaṇaḥ kalāsu, vinīto vidyāsu, visrabdhaḥ suhṛtsu, vimukhaḥ pāpeṣu, subhagaḥ sukumāraścaturaḥ saṃvibhāgī kṛpāluḥ śīlavānudārasattvaḥ satyaratiścolābhija[no viśvāmitra]gotraḥ kṛtī rāmaśarmā nāma bālamitraṃ cittānuvartaneṣu dā(dho? so) durnayanivāraṇeṣu gururvisrambheṣu hṛdayamasubhirapi spṛhaṇīyāyāṃ priyabhūmau kila daṇḍinamavādīt | nanu gaurīputrasyāpi pratyakṣa evāyam | adhyakṣayadbhirapyaśraddheyo garīyānadbhutodayo yathedamagresaraḥkusumitalujjihānena(?) mihiramaṇḍalānukāriṇā raktapuṇḍarīkeṇa punaramuṣya puṣkarasya pariṇatiḥ puṣkarekṣaṇacaraṇapadmasampātānantaraṃ keyūriṇī kirīṭinī maṇḍalinī maṇḍalāgraṇī(ce ? co)dagānmarutvatpatham | adyatvevaṃ punarīdṛśānāmasulabhadarśanatvādalaghuvismayaprasarabhārapīḍitaṃ no hṛdayamalamasi khalvanumānagatyā vidūramunnetum | ata iha kathamavakalpayatyatrabhavato matiriti |

sa taṃ pratyavocat——sakhe! na(tu ? nu) sarveṣāmeva naḥ samānaṃ darśanam | iyadiha śakyamunnīyāvagantum——‘eṣa ko′pi nabhaścareśvaraḥ kasyāpi roṣaṇasya maharṣeḥ puṣpasambandhāparādhāpakāritādanuvyāhārādamburuhatvamavāpyāmbarādambhasāṃ nidhau patitaḥ srotobhirvā sthalādupahṛtaḥ kālakalpamanalpaṃ vāridheḥ kṣāravāriṇi paribhramyasyāpi hi me′smin vismayavastuni jijñāsayā samākrāntameva hṛdayam | tadehi gacchāma iti saha sahāyaiḥ kāñcīmeva nyavarttata |

tadāścaryaśravaṇarāgāvarjitamanobhistu mātṛdattarāmaśarmavimataprabhṛtibhiḥ priyasakhairmuhurmuhuḥ preryamāṇo gaṇarātrakṛtātmaśobhano dvādaśyāmaśrāntabhaktiyogaḥ kalpoktena vidhinā vidhāya viṣṇupūjāṃ darbhaśayanamadhyaśeta | tathā śayānaṃ cāśarīrā sarasvatī svapne enamanvagrahīt | “vatsa! samṛddhaṃ te samīhitam, suprasannaste surāsuragurustrayīśarīrastribhuvanapatistridhāmā | pratibhātu tavaitadāścaryabhūtaṃ sarvapuruṣārthopadeśaguru sarvadvīpavṛttāntabahurasaṃ sarvakalākalāpagarbhagambhīraṃ sarvasamayarasasambhedasammataṃ sarvādirājavaṃśavarṇanamanoharakathaṃ sarvadevāsuravṛttakīrttanādbhutaṃ sarvamanujagandharvasiddhavidyādhareśvarasya rājavāhananāmno [......pāramat | upāramata yāminī | vismayapratibuddhasya cāsya lot......] devajalāplutaḥ suciropasthitapūrvasandhyaḥ svanuṣṭhitabhagavadārādhanaḥ svāducatuḥsamāna(?)santarpitadvija(pa ? va)raḥ svayaṃ ca prāśitahaviṣyāśanaḥ praśastamaṅgalyaveṣaḥ śuśrūṣave suhṛdgaṇāya kathāpavantisundarīmāciravyāsurityabhāṣata | yuṣmatprārthitānuṣṭhitaprayatnena mayā madhunarakāriṣṭakeśikaṃsadhvaṃsanasya tribhuvanaikamaṅgalasya bhagavato bhaktabhayaharaṇavidhivicakṣaṇasyā[mbujekṣaṇa]sya prasādādambunidhāvambujasyāmbarecaratvaprāptyavasānamadbhutamatimahat kathāśarīraṃ dṛṣṭam | asti cet kutūhalamayamahaṃ kathayāmi | śrūyatām:——

[āsannasaṅkīrṇaviviktavarṇāśramā....r̤yapaśyā asūryaṃpaśyāḥ sundarapurandhrayo niravagahanni]svārambhagurukuṭumbivargā(?) raṅgodraṅgasaṅgatādyaṅgatuṅgāgāraśīpharāḥ saralakākusairikajanāḥ sarvajanīnasarvajanāstvārya......vagrahaṃ nirbhayāḥ nirādhivyādhisambhavāḥ stambakariharitasaribhataḥ(?) tāmarasavisarasurabhayo nāvyanadīpravāhā yavyayavakyaṣaṣṭikyoddeśapeśalāḥ śā......kedārabhāgā godhūmīnakṣetrakāṇḍāḥ pṛthulatilyasthalyābhogāḥ praśastakaulastha(lī ? kī)nasthalā mahitamāṣyabhaktaya uddhamau(gī ? dgī)norvarā māsurīṇa[varabhuvaḥ pracuramañjīrakapariya?].....ṭarājamāṣāḥ niṣpāvanikarakarburā gaurasarṣapatadhīparikarā(?)jaraṭhakusumbhakuḍmalavijṛmbhaṇāruṇapradeśāḥ prasupānaprasurakarapreṭaka(?)prakaṭayo[nipoṣā go]jāvimahiṣapoṣiṇo bāṣpacchedyaśaṣpakavacitavividhavīthayaḥ prāsādādīyadāku(?)vardhanadravyavanarājayo bahuphalegrahidrumasamagrodagragrāmasīmānaḥ sārasakalahaṃsāvataṃsasarasavikaṭataṭākamaṇḍalāḥ pracchāyasukhaprapāpaṅktayaḥ prasrigdhatalasubhagasadbhāvakāḥ pratyudapānaprakḷptāṭahāriṇaḥ(?) puṇyārāmamālino magadhā nāma janapadāḥ |

tasminnāmāpi nāgṛhyata rājadrohasya | vārttāpi nāvarttatopadravāṇām | kathāpi nākriyata kaleḥ | smṛtirapi nājāyata janyasya | cintāpi nāsīt tāskaryasya | prasaṅgo′pi nābhavadabhiṣaṅkāṇām | tasmiṃśca paṅkaḥ paṅkasyopakāramātrako, na hi na hyadhiko′pyasti vadhūnāṃ kucataṭeṣu kuṅkumapaṅkaḥ | kevalamākrīḍācalataleṣūpalāḥ | kaṇṭakaḥ kamalanāleṣveva dṛṣṭaḥ, ātiṣṭhatupunarapi dṛṣṭaḥ priyatamānāmāliṅganeṣu | śreṇiḥ prāsādaśikharārohaṇeṣvevāptīt | duravadhṛtamidamāsannaṃ ca viharatsu jalavihaṅgameṣu tena(?) cānyonyasannikṛṣṭadhanadhānyaśailakūṭasahasralaṅghanāyāsabhayādivāpraveśakṣamo durbhikṣakālakalikaśca kalyāṇodyatadundubhidhvaniprabandhavidrāvitaḥ sarabhasamahāsyateva vikasvareṇa kumudakokanadasarassahasreṇa | tasmiṃśca śaṅke kalaśodbhavapānabhayādibodhassu dhenūnāṃ līnaḥ kṣīrasāgaraḥ | harikuliśavyasanaśaṅkayeva tiraskṛtyātmānaṃ surabhavanībhūtāni bhūdharakulāni | rāhumukhaviṣaniṣekadūṣaṇabhiyeva somena sudhārasaḥ puṇḍrekṣuṣu kṣiptaḥ | prabalapavanaparyāsatrāseneva cāpahāya marutpathamavanilagnāni taruṣaṇḍacchalena meghamaṇḍalāni |

tasya caivaṃvidhasya maṇḍanaṃ magadhaviṣayasya, mahyāḥ svargavijayasādhanaṃ, apavargasukhatiraskārakāraṇaṃ jīvojjīvasya, jāhnavīparibhogarāgaroṣitenormimālineva mahatā khātavalayoparuddham uttuṅgadhavalaprākāramadhyavartitayā paurataruṇasundarīkāntibhāvanāhetorindumaṇḍalādivotkīrya kṣiptam, amalamaṇibhūmigarbhasaṃkrāntapratibimbatayā vitatamaṇimayūkhajālapakṣaistārkṣyairiva rasātalamuragoddharaṇahetorviśadbhirdārusāramayaiḥ mahāprāsādairupaśobhitam, udayasamudragādhadarśanotkṣiptapuradevatābhujalatānukāribhiḥ khātavalayapinaddhairmaṇitoraṇaiḥ samullāsitam, unmīladanekaratnarāgavalayibhiratirabhasarativihāravicchinnairlakṣmīmekhalāguṇairiva vipaṇipathairupetam, unmadahaṃsamaṇḍalacalitendī....r̤ājibhirunmiṣattārakāgaṇakarālitāndhakārasandhyārāgairambaraikadeśairiva maṇḍalīkṛtaiḥ maṇita(da ? ṭa)raśmijālasandigdhavāribhiḥ sarobhirudbhrājamānam, upavana.....ṭabahuvidhakusumadhūlipāṭalapaṭam uparilagnamuṣṇīṣamiva sakalanagarādhipatyacihnamudvahadbhiḥ, grahaṇoparigamanāvalepavāraṇāyeva prakaṅkamānocchritapa[tākavyastam akhilajambūdvīpalakṣmīla]taikakusumaṃ kusumapuraṃ nāma samagrastrīpuruṣaratnasārasaṃbhūtisāgarāyamāṇaṃ nagaramabhavat |

abhraṃlihabhavanasahasroparuddhagatiramarṣajvalita ivo[tsarpadaruṇamaṇiprabhāpravāhoparaktavapura]mbaramadhyasthito′pyamuktaśaiśavacchāya iva yatra lakṣyate bhagavān bhānumālī | yasya ca sāragauravādiva saptasāgarataraṅgasaṅghātadhorābhighātāyāsitā [pi na kadācana calati bhūtadhātrī | (yaṃ ca ? yacca)] nivasatā dhanapatisahasreṇārādhayatyalakāpuram, upahasatyanaṣṭātmabhiśca vasubhiramarabhavanam, anantaiśca bhogibhirbhogavatīm |

yasmiṃśca paurā na madhupāyino dānarucayaśca, na kṛśānugāminaḥ prakaṭitabhūtayaśca, na bhaṅgurabhogavṛttayo bhoginaśca, na bahubhāṣiṇo bṛhatkathāvyasaninaśca, na jalāśayāḥ setubandhalagnāśca, na pramadaspṛśaḥ kādambarīrasāvitṛṣṇāśca, na suradviṣaḥ kāvyadarśanābhiraktāśca, na mandṛṣṭayaḥ samandākṣāśca viśrutabahuśrutāśca rāmāyaṇavido rāmāśubhāpātānabhijñāśca, dṛṣṭamahābhāratā bhīmagadābhidhātavārttāmugdhāśca, pramāṇavidaśchalavyavahā(ra ? rā)paṇḍitāśca sarvavirodhaikāyatanamadhivasanto nirvirodharamaṇīyamabhyasyamānapuṇyakarmāṇaḥ prativasanti |

yatra ca sarasi citraḥyaṇyāṃ kātyāyanasya bhagavato hutāśanasyātmajasyā bhiṣekahetoramaralokādaṃśenāvatatāra mandākinī |

yasmiṃśca bahvāścarye saptacchadapādapaḥ kāmayamānakāminīkapolapāṇḍuvati madhūkapuṣpam(?) | puṣpapuraṃ ca tat puṣkara ivānantabhogamutkṛṣṭasainyavāhano harivāhana iva sukṛtināṃ padaṃ kṛtāgasthirapakṣacchedanaḥ, naravāhana iva puṇyajanāśrayaṃ nidhīśvaraḥ, haridaśva iva udayasthā(na)marcyamahāprabhāvarṣipādaḥ, gandhavaha iva ghanakṣayamaśeṣakṣi(ta ? ti)parāgavikāravidhvaṃ(si ? sa)naḥ, haimavata iva ratnākaramakhaṇḍapakṣaḥ, śeṣa iva bhoginilayamakhilalokadhṛtikaraḥ, kusumāyudha ivojjvalapramadavanamātmaguṇābhibhūtaphālgunaśrīḥ, cakravāka iva padmālayaṃ maṇḍalaikagatiradhyatiṣṭhad ātmayaśaḥkumudabhūṣaṇabhuvanasaraḥkrīḍaikarājahaṃso rājahaṃso nāma rājā |

yamatimānuṣākārasampadamasahya(pā? pau)ruṣaṃ ca haranayanahutavahoṣmānubandhasambhūtapratāpaśamanaṃ punarjātamiva mīnaketuṃ menire prajāḥ | yena ca govardhanadharaṇīdharadhāraṇoddāmadāmodaradarpadamanāyevāropitabhuvanabhāramadharīkṛtamerugauravaṃ bhujabhūdharayugalamanārataṃ bibharāñcakre | yaśca nayanādharakaracaraṇaprabhābhirabhinavabandhujīvapāṭalābhirnijavakṣaḥsthalanivāsalābhanirvṛtalakṣmīvismṛtāni kadarthayāñcakāreva kamalakānanāni | yasya ca mattamātaṅgatuṅgakumbhakūṭapāṭaneṣu subhaṭamaṇḍalapṛthuloraḥkavāṭabhittibhedaneṣu varaturagabalapralayasāgarormivyāvarttaneṣu syandanavṛndavajrapañjarabhañjaneṣu ca vyāpāritaḥ tadāyāsapipāsita iva samaramaṇḍaleṣu bāhudaṇḍo maṇḍalāgramecaka......puñjakañcukitaḥ ketakīmukuladhūlidhavalamariyaśaḥkṣīrasāgaramaśeṣamācūcuṣat | yaśca samyakpraṇīyamānavarṇacatuṣṭayo′pi kṣīrasāgarapralayapū.....ẏaśāḥ sarvaśvetaṃ jagaccakāra | yasmācca sarvasvamarthino′bhayamarayaḥ, parājayamindriyāṇi, kadarthanāṃ kalirāsyaṃ sarasvatī, hṛdayaṃ mitravargaḥ, sarvameva ca śarīraṃ mahā[puruṣalakṣaṇāni pratyava].....ḍandhagajaghaṭābhiḥ kaṇṭharajjukaṣaṇakhaṇḍitatvaco gaṇḍamadasindhuraṃhojarjaritajaṭilamūlasaṃhatayaḥ sthūlakarāvalūnakavālapravālamuṇḍa[mūrddhānoddhṛtaprasūnamukulapalla]....l̤ajhaṅkāramilitavallarīviśleṣaciṣaṇṇamadavidāhavinodābhyamastakaghātabhagnaskandhamuktaraṭitāḥ paṭutarapīḍovipa[tte vyasmarannapi manye kākutsthakapi](?).....ṃudravelāvanadrumāḥ | yaśca ke (padma ? vala)mavanereva gotvamāpādya garvito venasūnuriti ūrjitāśayaḥ śaśikaraśiśiraguṇairdivaṃ pṛthivīṃ diśaśca sarvāḥ surabhīca.....ṇvāyyātikramaśca na varṇavyatikaro navarṇavyatika(raṃca ? raśca) na rājāvinayaśaṅkā narājāvinayaśaṅkāśca nāśanacintā nāśanacintā cājani prajānām | yasmiṃśca......pākaśāsano′pi nāvagrahaṃ śaśāka karttuṃ kimaṅga punaranye |

sa ca rājā sakalarājamaṇḍalagrāsarāhujihvayā saṃrambhadajvalanasaṃbhāradhūmalekhayā mānamattamataṅgajadānapaṭṭikayā pratibalarabhasābhipātavihativelāvanarekhayā ripujīvitamadhucūṣaṇabhramaramālayā bhuvanamahānidhānarakṣaṇabhujaṅgavadhvā yuddhāmṛtamathanaprathamakālakūṭodgamaśyāmikayā nijabhujācalaśikharanilīnamegharāśikayā vīrakāmukavijayalakṣmīsaṅketābhisaraṇatriyāmayā yamamahiṣaviṣāṇabhīṣaṇākārayā khaḍgarekhayā kāmadūtyeva catussamudramekhalāṃ saṅkulaśailaku(ñca ? nta)lāṃ sakalakusumasaṃbhāra(ha ? bha)ritāraṇyadhammillabandhām antarikṣanīlāṃśukottarīyāṃ viśvāmeva viśvaṃbharāṃ prasādhya viśrāntaḥ premavatsu pitṛpaitāmaheṣu samastaśāstravistāraviviktabuddhiṣu sakalakalāvagāḍhavaicakṣaṇyeṣu (dṛ ? du)ṣṭarājalakṣmīkareṇukāvijayanivāraṇāṅkuśeṣu daṇḍanītiprayogacatureṣu mahāvarāhacaraṇeṣviva padabandhavidhuritabhujaṅgalokeṣu taraṅgamāliṣviva pravaraguṇaratnarāśisaṃbhaveṣu nisumbhasūdanabāhudaṇḍeṣviva śrīratnaharaṇakāraṇabhūtabhūbhṛnmaṇḍalāvalambaneṣvairāvataviṣāṇakāṇḍeṣviva gurupratimāneṣu sumatisumitrasuśrutasumantrākhyeṣu mantrimukhyeṣvāsajya rājyabhāramabhinavayauvanopadiṣṭena rāgavartmanā manmathapratimakāntirantaḥpureṣvaramata |

āsīcca tasya mahīpateḥ samastasīmantinīvargadevatāyamānā mālatīkusumadāmakakṣyāmapyatikramyānyonyasadṛśasaukumāryairavayavai[rasādhāraṇamārdavābhyāṃ ca.....ṃānasābhyāmupetā tathā sukumā......bhruvai]va kārmukaṃ, mukhacchāyayaiva candramasaṃ, śvāsenaiva surabhiparimalaṃ malayamārutamavadhūnvatī, bimbādhararāgabālātapabhītakuṇḍalitāndhakārabhāranibhena svabhāvasurabhiṇā navābhrajāleneva saratnamekhalavipulaśilīccayanitambacumbinā madanavyālahastibālahastena patyabhisāradurdinamiva darśayantī, vadanacandramaṇḍalahaṭhāvakṛṣṭapuṇḍarīkalakṣmīsmehānādrukābhyāṃ (?) mṛṇālikābhyāmiva śirīṣadāmakomalābhyāṃ bhujalatābhyāmudbhāsamānā, sarvaśarīrasaṃvibhaktaśeṣābhyāṃ saundaryapuñjābhyāmiva sthāpitābhyāṃ haradagdhamanobhavauddhatyasārakośābhyāmiva tathākṛtopayogābhyāṃ dhātrā candanadhavalasudhālepaucityābhyāṃ nivāsakumbhābhyāmiva rāgasya svacchamānasarasātirekapūritābhyāmiva gurutarābhyāṃ payodharābhyāṃ bhrājamānā, gajakumbhakaṭhorapīvarakucātibhārasādharmyaviparamāṇutvāde(?) dhruvamabhaṅgurāṃ bibhratī madhyayaṣṭim, atighanajaghanābhogabhārakhinno[rudaṇḍa]sthirīkriyopayuktabhūyovayavata eva tanutarībhūtena jaṅghādvitayena rājamānā, praṇayakalahatāḍitapriyatamahṛdayojjvalitarāgaliptayoriva na[khacandradaśakaraśminālīkasahasracūṣi]tenāśeṣabhuvanavārijavanaprabhāsañcayenaiva satatamāpyāyamānapāṭalimnoramalarāgalāvaṇyacchalāda[ruṇāśokapādapebhyaḥ stabakarāśīniva dohadapūraṇa]tāḍaneṣu dātuṃ saṃgṛhṇatoḥ mukhakamalāmodanirjitavasantakaradattamiva sarvapallavasaukumāryamudvahatoścaraṇāravindayodva[ndvena saindhūrīriva dūrabhavaḥ(?) kurvatī, taraṅgamayī bhrūpatākayoḥ], indīvaramayī nayanayuge, raktotpalamayī dantacchade, kumudamayi īṣatsmiteṣu, saugandhikamayī śvasiteṣu, amṛtamayī vacasi, prasādamayī manasi, cakravākamayī payodharayoḥ, [āvarttamayī nābhirandhre, pulinamayī] nitambataṭeṣu, puṣkaramayī ca pādatalayoḥ, amarasadmana iva rājahaṃsopabhogāyāvatīrṇā mandākinī, līlā(karā ? kalā)kāntirāgacāturyāṇi pañcaiva pa[ñca bhūtasthā]ne pratividhāya nirmiteva prajāpatinā, prāvṛḍiva ghanagambhīrastananābhiramaṇīyā, śaradiva sarasāṃ kāntimudvahantī, hemantavṛttiriva prālambinīhāramālinī, śiśiraśrīriva navanavamālikā, vasantavaleva cārubhujavalyullāsabhūṣitatanulatā, dharmasampadiva komalapāṭalādharā, sarvarttusamavṛttitayeva nandanasvabhāvā, sarvāvarodhajanapradhānabhūtā ratiriva kandarpakasya, śacīva śatamakhasya, śailasuteva viśveśvarasya, lakṣmīriva puṣkarekṣaṇasya, buddhiriva dhanādhipasya, devaseneva senāpateḥ, gauriva pracetaso, rohiṇīva budhabhavanasyārundhatīva śaktigurorasubhyo′pi vallabhā devī vasumatī nāma ||

tasmiṃśca samrāji rājīvalocanayā tayānyābhirapyavikalakalāśālinībhiraviruddhānekadharmārthā(bhya ? dya)natisaṅgamaṅgajasukhamaśnuvāne kadācidabhiṣektumiva digjayāya puṣpajamājagāma drumalatādhṛtairmadhunivahavāhibhiḥ kuḍmalapuṭaghaṭasahasraiḥ kusumalakṣmyāḥ samayaḥ | madhvavatāravegoddhūtamiva himajalaṃ jagāla | dakṣiṇāmapyupekṣya digvadhūmupeyuṣi paṭau pataṅge′tīvorutarabhuttarāśā saubhāgyamuvā(ca?)ha | dinakaravirahe samagṛhītāyā diśo dīrghaniśvāsa iva mandamandamutsasarpa tapyamānapānthajano malayamārutaḥ | malayamarutpreritena smaravaiśvānareṇaikabhavana iva tribhuvane surāsurabhunimanujamādīpyamāne taddāhapratokārakṣamāṇi payodharakalaśasahasrāṇi śaraṇamekamacakamata kāmijanaḥ kāminīsamājasya | cittopasṛtapriyoṣṇa bāṣpavāripūrapluteṣu proṣitānāṃ hṛdayeṣu pāyayitukāma iva kāmajyotkaraḥ prakāmadīptāniṣūn cikṣepa | sahakāratarutalāstīrṇakisalayaśayanaśāyinīnāṃ kāmaya(māna)kāminīnāṃ kāmaśa(rī?)rakṣateṣu kṣārakṣepa iva marmasu madhurasavisaraḥ parabhṛtanakhamukhoddalitakuḍmalagarbhanirgalitaḥ papāta | tasmiṃśca samaye ratisamaravidhiviśāradakusumaśaraśibiranīrājanajvalanajvālāvalīṣu ca rājapurandhri(ja?)māhārajatottarī yāṃśukapadīṣu sakalajagatplāvanodvelarāgasāgarataraṅgaveṇikāsu vikasantīṣu raktakuravāśokaśalmalīpalāśavādibhadraḍāḍimajapārājiṣu, ramaṇīcaraṇanalinatāḍitāśokaroṣaprotsāhitāśeṣavanasamāhṛtaśaśikarakalāvibhrameṣu, nirantarapatacchilīmukhaprakarajarjaritanyakṣavanavividhavṛkṣavigrahadhavaḷarkṣapaṭubandheṣu, andhakamathanamanyusanvukṣitekṣa ṇāśuśukṣaṇikṣapitahṛcchrayoccayabhasmabhāsureṣu smereṣu karīrakesareṣu, sitasindu vāravakulasā[latilaka]navamālikādiṣu, lalitamādhavapītavāsasi madhūkavanasthalīdiṣṭivṛddhipiṣṭātakaprakaressudantikaṭakiṅkirātakarṇikāracampakaprakarepu(?) sa gaja | mattavā[raṇa iva vaśābhirmattakāśinībhiḥ parivṛto] madhumattamadhukaraka, mbakāndha kāritakroḍāni krīḍāvanānyavagāhata |

tatra ca madarakta(kata ? tama)kāminīkapolarāgasandhyāgamavidhuritasagśca[kravākamithunakāni badhnatpānagoṣṭhīmaṇḍalāni] tridivamedinī(ma ? mā)nojñakāntaradidṛkṣayā kautukādivāvyavasthitagaganānāṃ khedakhedi[vā ? tā]laktakaraktamedhapallavāni bhrāntakuntalabhra[mitadurdino.....ġīyamānakhavi]kramāpadānāni paśyan yantradolāpreṅkhitānīra(?)komalaku(su)makisalayottaracchadāsu vilolapallavāntarapraviṣṭapavanālolitalatāgṛhodaramaṇive[.....ṭacī]nāṃśukāntarīyāṇāmapi karanakhamaṇiraśmisaṃvalitaratnamekhalāmayūkhajālajalpitadukūlakarmaṇāmantaḥpurasundarīṇāmāraṇitaratnaśakvarītulākoṭipārihāryāṅgadāni preṅkholitahāradīdhitiprakarakarpūracūrṇāvamucyamānaśramasvinnakucataṭāni madhuravivādadattadantacchadacchinnasandhipratisamādhānadattasadayalīlācumbanāni gāḍhāliṅga(na)mṛditakaṇṭhadāmapratinidhīkṛtapriyatamekṣaṇakuvalayasrañji mañjuvihaṅgabhaṅgirātiprapaṅcamūrcchitāṅgajavidāhavegāni rāgasāmyasamāhitarasotkarṣāṇi rājavṛṣo ratāni nirviśannupavanaviṣayiṇīmṛtuvibhūtimanubabhūva |

pravṛttayośca vicitrapuṣpayoścaitravaiśākhayordaityarājyamiva śuciśukramayaṃ, yamasaurājyamiva pratidinamaruṇāyamānenakaravirasīkriyamāṇalokaṃ, rakṣorājvamiva parilaghuplavaṅgalaṅghyamānahīnavāhinījalaṃ, kiṃpuruṣarājyamiva drumagaṇagurūṣmavāraṇavanotsekarāgadṛptakiṃpuruṣaṃ, manmatharājyamiva marudgaṇabhramitapatramaṇḍaloparuddhasurabhava(na)mugrātapamanububhūṣuḥ utphullakamalaraktotpalāni pradīptānīva gharmabhayapraviṣṭena kandarpānalena, dalaśītalajālikājātaśītalajalatalāni(?) dāruṇanidāghagalitaśiśirakārāgṛhāṇīva madhukarakulabahalakālāndhakārakālodarāṇi karatalodarībhiḥ saha sarāṃsyavajagāhe |

praviśantīṣu ca praṇayinīṣu priyasakhīṣviva pratyudasthuḥ prasāritormihastadattagāḍhakaṇṭhagrahā vāpyaḥ | prabalavipakṣavikṣepavāridurgapratistabdhaiḥ prasabhamivodīrṇadaṇḍaiḥ puṇḍarīkairvimuktāstatpratidvandviṣu mandaśabdaṃ sundarīmukheṣu śilīmukhā nipetuḥ | nijamajjanābhyupāyavyasanitasya puruṣapātaniṣṣadhaṃragaṇasya bhoghā bhrāntididṛkṣavaḥ kaṭākṣā jambābho (?)garbhaśāyinīnāṃ pakṣmalākṣīṇāmudavartanta kṣobhataralitāstaruṇaśapharakāḥ | nṛpanitambinībimbādharacumbino nābhijajñuraticapalāḥ sarastaraṅgāḥ ardyamānamānamānasam(?) apitu vilasanto visarpiṇāṃ rāgamūhuḥ | pratimukhasthitakuvalayakopādivātivāmāni bhāminīnāmarajyanta locanāni | cakōralocanākucārohacakrasammarde′pi kaluṣībhavadbhirambubhirautpattikatvaṃ jalatvamanakṣaramācacakṣe | gurūnapi nirapekṣo jaghāna vārivego varorūṇāmuroruhabharān | na hi vivekaḥ kṣubhitasya | jalamadhye maunamācaranto mekhalākalāpāḥ sthāna eva guṇatvaṃ samarthayāmbabhūvuḥ | apāstālaktakairapi rāgeṇaiva daśanacchadakisalayairvyajīyanta raktakuvalayavanāni | hyeṣāmanekaśo ratiraṇapraṇītotthitānāṃ pratispardhijaye sahāyakṛtyam(?) | itthaṃ ca varttamānāsu varapavatuṇītīnāṃ vaktravyatikīrṇāpi vikīrṇitormiṣu karapuṭasalilasekalīlābhūtālikāsu prahelikāsu(?) mahīśo′pi mahāvarāha iva vahan vakṣasā vasumatīṃ devīmākulākulāmālolayannapa[ścacāla | cikurāṃsataṭaścikrīḍa] krīḍāsu prakīrṇaplutanimnagādhavasyāsthalavyacārapatitadravyavicayavyatikarabhedādaṣṭamārgayā jalakrīḍayā | tatpradhānāṅgeṣu ca [sphuṭagadgadagambhīrabhedādisvareṇa]nigṛhītāmuktasaṃjñena salilavādyenānekamadhurakaraṇaramaṇīyena ramamāṇaṃ ramaṇyaḥ kāścit karapallavasampuṭotpīḍitamuktaiḥ [prītipallavadravairivainaṃ dhārājalaiḥ].....ġuraśṛṅgakoṇamukhamuktābhiḥ kuṅkumajaladhārābhiranaṅgapannagamukhaśikhiśikhābhirivāvacakaruḥ | aparā vipakṣavyañjitavi[lāsarāgaroṣitā rakta]kaṭākṣamālābhireva jihmanāmnībhiḥ kausumbhasaridbhiriva sarabhasā vidhurāyamāṇamācakṛṣuḥ | itarāstamasīva payasi durvibhāgagatayaḥ karatalakamalāvaṣṭambhaprasṛptā yādṛcchikairnāma taccaraṇamūlaghaṭṭanaiḥ sparśātiśayānumeyamānaprārthanāpraṇipātā na kṛpaṇamanvatiṣṭhanta |

avanipo garvitā vyākulayan, mugdhāḥ santārayan, bhītāḥ samāśvāsayan, kupitāḥ prasādayan, muditāḥ protsāhayan, prasthitāḥ pratirundhan, kāsāṃcidutpalāśāṃ vallīmiva saphalayan, kāsāṃcit padmarāgaṃ ratnamiva sampādayan, kāsāṃcidamandamārabhamano(?)raṃśukānyalakṣyagatirākṣipan, kāsāṃcit kamalarajassaṅgadhūnanacchalānnirañjanasnigdhatāmrataraḷatārāṇi netrodarāṇi cumban, kāsāṃcit kāmāyataneṣu kāmaśarānivādṛśyapātānnakhānarpayan, nibirīsavilāsaścaṇḍātakaparihitaḥ paryākuṭilakuntalottarāpāṅgalocanaḥ kuṅkumarāgalohitaughaplutāṅgaḥ santrāsitasakalarājahaṃsanivaho vihṛtya samarādiva sarasaḥ saha(prayābhijñaṃ ? priyābhirjaya)śrībhiriva nirjagāma jagāma ca |

majjanānantaramanuṣṭhitayathocitābhiṣekamaṅgalo yathāvidhyupasthāya tigmabhānuṃ, bhagavantamupāsya citrabhānum, abhirādhya ca devaṃ devakīsūnuṃ, saha suhṛdbhistvaganusāriṇā surabhicandanarasena kṛtasamālambhanaḥ kuśalasūdasādhitena śodhanakalpanaprakṣālanapratistambhanamārdavakaraṇaśītīkaraṇaprasādanasnehagrahaṇavarṇakriyāgandhopasaṃhāraṣaḍvargasampādanasnehavicārapaṅktisaṃjñābhistrayodaśavidhābhiranekāvāntaravikalpābhiḥ kriyābhirupasaṃskṛtena svātmocitena sarasaṃ khādyenāmṛtātiśāyinā paṭupāṭalaparimalāmodanirhāriṇā sparśānumeyena pānīyenāhitadhṛtirādhāya dhūmavartibhācānto bahaḷapārijātasaurabhodgārikramukaphalaśakalāni śakavadhūṭīgaṇḍapāṇḍurāṃ ca tāmbūlavīṭikāṃ jaraṭhapāṭalīpuṭakroḍapāṭalaṃ ca śaṅkhacūrṇaṃ trayaṃ ca tiktakaṭukaviśadaṃ vimardoṣṇaṃ lapanalāghavakaraṃ copayujya rajyamānadaśanāvaraṇo maṇikuṭṭimapathena gatvā prasādhitaṃ bhuktāsthānamaṇḍapamatimṛduni kṣaumapāṇḍuni sthānadattacīnapaṭṭopadhānake puṣpavāsasurabhiṇi haimaprītipādukāpratiṣṭhi(ta)pravararatnacitrapāde pādapīṭhasanāthapārśve pratyāsannasauvarṇapratigrahe śayanaparyaṅkatale muhūrtalabdhaviśramaḥ sannihiteṣṭasāmanta(ḥ) citrālāpaciravinodino visṛjya ṇad(?) vilambamāne kadambamukulakiñjalkapuñja(ra?)tviṣi tvaritapravartitasyandane sandhyāmukhacumbanābhilāṣiṇi krameṇa mandāyamānoṣmaṇi maṇiśikhāsukālokalopaneva(?) sukhaviviktodgandhinaipathyaramaṇīyena vijṛmbhamāṇamallikāmukuladāmapralambottarīyaramaṇīyena sundarījanena candanasalilasaṃkṣāḷanaśiśireṣu smeramallikopahārepu saudhaharbhyeṣu (su ? sa)magaṃsta | saṅgītagītagoṣṭhībhiśca priyavidagdhasuhṛtsakhaḥ pradoṣamanaiṣīt | [uttarayāmadvayamunmada] mañjuvādinījanamanovidheyavṛttiragamayat |

evaṃ ca parisamāpitagrīṣmasyāśeṣaśirīṣaśrīmuṣaḥ kṣapitakarañjamañjarītviṣastviṣimatsomago[lakaratiraskriyārambhajajambhakājanābhiniba]rhaṇājñā[vijṛmmi]tāmbhodakoṭayaḥ kuṭilakomalataṭito vidhaṭamānakuṭacakuḍmalāmodaliptakakubhaḥ kesarasurabhitanabhasaḥ suracāpa......[candrakibarhottarārasitā bhūmnyopaguptārkagogaṇā]gaṇatithadṛptātakasrajaḥ(?)sujātajātijātayo muditamugdhayūthikāvarṣannavavārṣikīlatā lalitalāṅgalīkalikā mukulitanicuḷavathiyaḥ phalitapūtajambūpaṅktayaḥ [vikacakadambacumbi]vācālamadhulihaḥ salilakaṇasyandimandamaruto rutamukharabhekabherībhīmāgamaniśīthā niśithinībhedābdadurdinadinā(?)drutamanobhisārikābhidrutadayitodavasitā vikasitavalākā[līdha]valitabhuvo bhinnasilindhrabandhanāḥ sindhuramāmandagarjitaghanāghanastanayitnavo navajalasekanirvṛtivinītaketakīgarbhakhedāḥ pādacārakṣamaśyāmalaśāḍvalavanasthalā nīlakaṇṭhanṛttalīlāvilāsinaḥ sannapannagakulāḥ kūlamudrujodakodravatsarittaraṅgiṇīśatāḥ śatamakhagopāvalīpravālamekhalādhṛtavanasthalīnitambapārśvaviśvaviśvambharāṅgārarūḍhasarasaḥ sya yauvanāvanajapanavasya sanadāyino(?) dīyamānadānavāriyoganidrāsukhāḥ sukhamayā iva prādurāsan prāvṛṣeṇyā vāsarāḥ |

(tāsu ? teṣu) ca grīṣmātapāturatrilokalakṣmīviśrāntidhārāgṛheṣu varṣāvāsareṣu kuṭacakuḍmalahāramālinībhirlambakadambakāñcīdāmabhiḥ ketakabarhadantapatrabhūṣitaśravaṇapāśābhirmadamayalalāmalāñchitalalāṭikābhirārdragairikarāgarañjitacaraṇapallavābhiḥ kuntalavalayinībhiḥ sundarībhiḥ kṛtakirātanitambinīveṣavibhramābhiraṭanmṛgeṣu naṭacchikhaṇḍiṣu, sphuṭannīpeṣu, raṭannirjjhareṣu, varṣajaladhārādhautaratnopalataleṣu krīḍāparvateṣu vijahāra | dhārāravadviguṇabṛṃhitamadarāgaṃ ca vārṣikavṛkṣavallīgulmagulucchakacchannamārgeṣu kṛṣṇāgarusāradhūpasañcāroṣṇeṣu maṇidarīgṛheṣu mattarāmādvitīyo reme |

maṇḍalacaturaśrāyatāsu cāvartavatīṣu ca ratnamaṇṭapagarbhavāpikāsu kaduṣṇavāripūritāsu kanakapadmaśatāvataṃsitāsu gharma iva līlayā gandhagajagāminībhiḥ samaṃ samakrīḍata | nibiḍitāsu ca niśīthinīṣu manmathamathitadhṛtīnāṃ durdinābhisārikāṇāmāsārajalāparādhakliṣṭanaipathyeṣu gātreṣvādarapratisamādhīyamānamaṇḍanastāsāṃ ca svajanavañcanāpadeśakauśaleṣu śrūyamāṇeṣu saṃharṣeṇevāsannakṛtakalīlānīlāṃśukāvaguṇṭhanasyāndhakārarāśerupakriyāyāmupanyastāyāmātmani puruṣābhimānamāropayan, kvacidbhavanabhittisparśaparamparonnītapaddhatau kvacittaralasaudāminīdāmadarśitapurobhāge kvacinnāgarikapaṭahaśabdagambhīragarjitamuhūrtamātravihvalāvasthāne kvacitpratirodhakānāmivāmbaragrāhiṇāṃ prathamābhrāṇāmaviralaśaravarṣāsārasambhramāśliṣṭamandirāṅgaṇamārgapādapaskandhe prasaṅgodīritarāgābhisaraṇasāhase sānukampaprama(pa?)damāpadyamānaḥ svatiśayopacārasāntvanamahala (?) rasamanekadhā suratalāsyamatyudārataralitavibhramaṃ babandha |

bandhāgāragarbhādivābhrapañjarānnirgacchati punarucchvāsabhāji bhuvane′ntargatairāvatapravagna iva svastemavane (?) ciranirodhasampīḍikāsvatāmāmarṣitārtakarapratīkeṣviva (?) prakṣīṇavāriṣu vāridharamahāhradodareṣu, sva......[moddhoṣa]ṇavirāmamūkeṣu sto(ki ? ka)keṣu, galitapayodharāṃśukāsu lajjayeva kvāpi līnāsu hrādinīṣūdadhimahāvalāhakācūṣitavarṣavāripūrasyāntarikṣasaraso [marakatakuṭīṣdhiva sphuṭībhavantīṣu] nīlakaṇṭhakaṇṭhamecakāsu dikṣu śunāsīraśarāsanakalavarṇeṣu śīrṇeṣu śikhibarheṣu pratibaddhamukundalocināravindavāritavāridharabhayeṣvi[va prabṛtteṣvitastato vijṛmbhitamambhoruhavaneṣu pannagebhya]iva nirviṣebhyaḥ payodebhyo vihāyabhayamatipatatsu rātrindivamadhvano′dhvanīneṣu, sakalābdakaluṣitāsu bahumukhāsārapā[tāvi.....ḍat svayameva kramādu]pāgataprasādāsu cirakṣobhānubandhalajjayeva mandamandaṃ varuṇālayamupasarpantīṣu pratanīyasīṣu phenamālinīṣu, madhuponmādabandhane madagandhavidagdhaviśārade śārade vidārayati manāṃsi mānavatāmanaṅgavāraṇānīke saptaparṇavane, kusumadhavalamūrtiṣu kusumaśaraśarāvalīṣviva (vi)rahi(ta?)janahṛdayadāriṇīṣu samantataḥ patantīṣu haṃsamālāsu, vasudhāvibhramahemacūrṇairasanareṇubhirabhinavamanasijāturākhi(bha ? va) subhagadarśanāsu vanasthalīṣu bāṇamālinīriṣudhiriva manobhuvo bhuvaḥ pariharatsu mādhicchedaśaṅkiṣu(?) svamukhānekavārodīritamadhuraśātkṛtigrāhiṇīnāṃ śukaśreṇīnāmacakitamuktamañjulapratiśātkāraśāsitāsvanumanyamānakalamakaṇiśabhaṅgāsu kalamagopikāsu, sakalakāmukānīkotkampakāriṇīṃ khaḍgadhārāmiva śyāmāmālambamāne dviguṇatejasi jyotiṣāmadhīśe, śāntagarjitāni śaśāṅkapādacchāyāśrayīṇi śalmalītūlaparilaghūni meghakulāni vilokya darpādiva mattamadhukarīmadhuradhvānagarbhaṃ hasantīṣu kumudinīṣu, viśadāyāṃ śaradi śāradaśaśikarasitacandanadhavalahimajalabinduśīkaraśītalāsu ślathamānaśiśiraśephālikopahārahāsinīṣu harmyamālāsu madhubhāṣiṇīmadhūni mādhavānubhāvapūrṇeṣvapi manomaṇicaṣakeṣu svakaratalopadhānacchāyoparaktā riktā iti mugdhayuvatayaḥ kṣaṇamanīhamānāḥ pātumasthuḥ(?) | prahasatā punaḥ priyeṇāvāryanta | mattakāśinīvaktrāmbujacumbanāśayevāsava(tā ? tara)ṅgamālāsu chāyāmayaḥ papāta rājahaṃsaḥ | saha madhunā suvadanābhipīta eva pratimāsu śaśītyunmadānāṃ tāsāṃ ruruduriva svādāpadeśā(dā)nanendavaḥ | tathā snigdhāḥ santo′pi paśyanta eva tārāpaterātmani saṃkramāstīstaralatārāstārakā(?) na pratyācacakṣire mṛgākṣīṇāṃ prakṣaritasvedabindavo mukhendavaḥ | kasya vā strīnimittaṃ na hi vidyante prītayaḥ | so′pi somastā ivānusarannipatya tatrai(va) samamajjat | na tvaśakat pratyāhartum | sa tairapi tārāntarasaṅkrāntimantharairvalambala(?)nitambinīnāṃ vadanapaṅkajaiḥ kumudavāndhavaḥ | phalitaṃ hi gurutalpagasya tasminneva dehe pātakamarhati(?) | (hi)makaraparābhavadarśanapraviṣṭā ivāndhakārākṛtayo nanṛturnatabhruvāṃ bhruvaḥ | sudhīro′pi ripuvyasane harṣādvikriyeta, kimuta nisargacañcalāḥ | kapolasaṅkrāntacandraścandrodaya ivonmadānāmunmīlitakumudakānano varānanā(nā)māvirāsīdamṛtasammitaḥ smitodgamaḥ | madirātaraṅgabhaṅgaraṅgaṃ mṛgāṅkalakṣmaṇi cabake dūramagnasahacaradhiyā kṛpaṇabaddhadṛṣṭiṣu karuṇamārasantīpu bhramarakāminīṣu kalagiro′pi madakalāstathaivānvaśoca(ya?)n | prahasatpriyaprabodhyamānāśca yāthārthyajñānayogāt lokitakuraṅgalāñchanāḥ tamapi prabuddhabandhujīvavanavi(la ? ḍa)mbinā svalocanaprabhāsañcayena sañcchādya tatrāpyadṛśyamānamṛgakalaṅkā bhaṅguritāñcībhruvo(?) vañcakāsmān vañcayasa iti karṇakuvalayaiḥ kāntamaṃsayorataḍāyan |

asā[vapi priyatamopahṛtā]nanavanajavāruṇīgaṇḍūṣapānaraktagaṇḍo gaṇḍalagnarajatapuṇḍarīkamiva karṇacāmaravibhramaṃ pratibimbamṛgāṅkamamalaṃ dadhānaścandanadhavalamūrti[rindravāraṇa iva mandākinīpayasi candrikājālake] vijahāra | hariṇadharakarapuṭāvasicyamānāmṛtalavāpanīyamānakhedaśca rājapeśalātiśiñjānavalayamañjulamañjīrakāñcīguṇāni garjadaṅgajāni va....r̤atāni rātriśa(?)tatāna |

tadanu tāmarasavanāni pāṇivadanapunaruktadoṣaparihārārthamiva saṃharannabalālocanadyutivilambanaduravaliptāni kuvala [yavanāni mṛdnan dāruṇa] śaradātapadrāvitajalīkṛtāni ghanakulāni tuhinaśīkaravyājādivā(va)kiran himakaragṛhyatayeva sarvauṣadhiṣu gauravamāropayannīhāradrohādiva nityopagūḍhapāvakān vanaspatīṃstirayan, nijaripuvārijanmavardhanaruṣeva jalānyudbāṣpayan, sapakṣānujighṛkṣayeva nisargaśī talāni mauktikābharaṇāni viśramayan, akhilajīvalokatatkulatāṣaṇḍaphalabharākāṇḍaluṇṭākaḍāmarīkadamanadīkṣita iva patimaṇḍalāni saṅkocayan, sakalatribhuvanarasahaṭhāpahāraparābhavadurvikatthanaṃ taskaramiva bhāskaraṃ nirundhan divi, natavāllabhyavardhitāni dinavidāhavisphūrjitāni vartayan nigṛhītasarvasattvasvacchandaparyantaḥ saṃvṛtaprāyasarvārambho vyajṛmbhata svabhāvaśītalo hemantasamayaḥ |

tasminnapi samaye dalitahimajālimadbhiḥ(?)analajvālākabalitamalayajaidhasāmāyasīnāṃ hasantikānāṃ sahasraiḥ sannihitavilāsinīyauvanavidāhāvāhitanidādheṣviva mahatsu mandirābhyantareṣu tuhinapaṭalātibhārabhayanilīnanabhastalāsvivānavaratadahyamānakṛṣṇāgarubahaḷadhūpadurdināndhakārāsu malinadigaṅganāmukhavilokanākṣa(ma)tayeva gāḍhavivṛtagavākṣekṣaṇāsu prāsādapaṅktiṣu gandhatailāvasekasurabhigandhibhiḥ karatalakalitābhirdopikābhirlokasaṅkocakṛto hemantarajanīrivānvicchatā parijanena parivṛto yathartuveṣaḥ sa(ha) mahiṣyā mahārhaṃ śayanamāruroha |

tasmiṃśca raktanīladhavalakāntinā priyatamekṣaṇārdhaprabhāsañcayena citrakañcukeneva chādyamāno, hṛdayavijṛmbhamāṇamanmathahutāśanodgārakalpena tatkālocitena kuṅkumāṅgarāgeṇeva rāgeṇādharapallavasyānulipyamānaḥ, karṇakathanīyamanmathaguhyākhyāneṣu kundakalikābhiriva smitamayūkhamañjarīmiḥ kriyamāṇavataṃsaḥ, kṣaṇamadhivāhya praṇayakathābhirupapāditaratotsavopakaraṇāsu nirgatāsu parijanavadhūṣu madhuracumbanopakramapravṛddharāgāveśo, vivaśasphuṭapatitadaśanapaddhatiruddhūtavedanākalahitalābhapallavā(?)dviguṇapīḍitādharamaṇimukhagrahaṇavigrahopayujyamānaśikharanakharalīlāyudhaḥ salalita visaṃvādanirgamapratibaddharuddhanīvikāṃśukaparipanthikopalīlākuñcitabhrukuṭitarjito, rabhasakacagrahavyākulaviloladhammillabandhasandhukṣitamanmathātisa(mbhrā ? mbhramā)ntaritavirodhāvarodhanapayodharānigāḍho (?) gurunitambasammardavardhitākrandacalatulākoṭikamuddhatastanataṭanibiḍapīḍākampramadhyayaṣṭi daṣṭādharasambhramabhrāntamugdhalocanamañcitakararuhalikhyamānakapolavihva(na?)lānanavyañjitastanitakūjitamalake cumbanavimṛditāgarutilabhāṅgapāriplavakhedabindurekhamuddāmarāgadīyamānayuvatipauruṣamupoḍhālaktakapadapālīraktabhaṅgurataraṅgottaracchadamuccalitacikurapallaci......paritagarbhagṛhatalamaḷakavāsacūrṇavisaradhūsaritopadhānamagrāmyavikalpavibhramaramaṇīyamāyatāyataṃ suratamācacāra |

gamitahemantaśca hemantātiga......[śatye śaityaśāntaśakuntakāntā]muktakoṭaraśate śītālujagatpratīkṣyamadhyandinātape tāpasatapaḥsambhārabhāvanocite′pi tuhinadrohadurmukhapathikajanaprāṇā[pālanajvalitapuṇyānalasakalasahe(?) subhagabhāsurahasantikāsahasre] sahasraraśmiśritaśītaghṛṇiśile ślādhanīyapakṣmaṇi mṛgaromaṇi dāmāvahelahetau bahulitabahaḷapravāraspṛhe priyapriyaṅgujanma[ni manmagnavakulavṛndānandikuñjakuñje pañjarajālakārarīpuṭa] ghananayācñāvācāṭahimajaladha(?)jaṭharapuṣkare puṣkarādgajirodhrasampadi (?) gatidhṛtakandarāśayāluśayuśvāsoṣṭhaniścalasukhāyamā[namṛgaśiśau śaśa]vicayākṣaṣvakuṇḍyake (?) śayyātalamuktyaśaktakāmukamithune nūtanagarbhabhāramantharamādhavīlate lalitamārutākarṣaṇasukaraṇapariṇamattarupalāśe śīte(?) itarataṭākakīlālamagnanagnikākulatumuladhūmukadhūmadhūmaḷoṣasi dussahapradoṣadurbhagoḍupe durbhedasphaṭikadalabahutuhinaghanaghanasāraharitapuṣkarahariṇaśapharuke śiśirakāle mīlayati bhuvanamagnikadūṣa(?) romakambalakṛtāvaguṇṭhanaḥ parimṛdutrāṇacarmakañcukitacaraṇapadmo himasatrāsisārita(?)pramadavanaprāsādavedikādattasaṅketamaṅkajātalaṅghitabhāminībhayamantaḥpu(na?)ranāṭakīyakanyakājanamabhinavarasāsvādalālaso′bhisṛtya susaṅgītaparijanāgatapratīhārabhūmikeṣu ghaṭitagavākṣāvaraṇasampuṭeṣu līlāpacakareṣu(?) madhurāśvāsanamitavallabhāśaṅkamaṅkāśravaṇāya ca kṣaṇavihastāsthānamāyastahastapallavavyavahitādharapuṭavighaṭitasa(ra?)rasacumbanārambharāgavivalitatanulatollasatkaṭhinakucamukulamudbhinnapuḷakajālajarjarakaṭhorapāṇḍurekhamasakalagaḷadaṃśukaśroṇibimbajhaṇajhaṇāyamānapravāḷakāñcīguṇam aviralagharmavārivarṣadūṣitaviśeṣakanyāsamadarśitapathapralabdhasadayadanta......vasanāsvādamākampamānaprathamayantraṇonmāthamantharorudaṇḍamakāṇḍavalanabhaṅguritaratilayamaṅgastambhitāntarakṣīṇavirāmadattāśvāsamaśrugarbhataraḷatārakekṣaṇabhramaṇakāritakaruṇamā(tu)rakṛpaṇakomalāñjalighaṭanayācitāvasānamanalasopalabhyamānasadbhavarasaṃ corikāsuratara(sa)tṛptimantragacchat |

śīlajñavallabhāpasarpaviditavibhramaśca samaradurlabhaṃ bhayamuvāha | prakupitapradhānāvarodhasaṅgṛhītaśca tajjaghananiravakāśaraśanāguṇanigaḷitacaraṇaḥ praṇayakopakuñcitābhirbhrūlatābhirāhata iva tāsāmāsāditahṛdayavepathuraruṇāśokapallavairiva caraṇakisalayairurasi tāḍyamāno madanaśarakṣaritaiḥ kṣatajairiva sāmarṣasvedasalilakṣālitaiḥ pādālaktaka(dagrai ? dra)vairāmreḍitakuṅkumāṅgarāgo bahurasamaharavāhayat | anukūlatuhinamāru(ta)sparśavejitānāma[va]yavānāmanyabheṣajatvā(?) punaranunīya svayamasitalocanābhirvāsabhavanamanīyata | śiśiramarutparāmarśaparuṣitādharavraṇarujābhiścākṛtāparādho′pi bhrukuṭibandhakuṭilatakaṭākṣamāyatākṣībhiraikṣyata |

evaṃ ca nirantarāyaramaṇīyān nijabhujabalasaṃbhṛ.....ṇiyārthān yathākāmamaśnuvānaḥ kadācidagramahiṣīṃ vasumatīmāsannasattvaparijanādantarvatnīmaśṛṇot | ārūḍhaharṣaśca vi(kī ? ti)rṇapūrṇapātraḥ svapnadohalādikama......śeṣāṃ yaśovatīṃ nāma papraccha | sā tu vijñāpayāmāsa——‘deva! devyāḥ khalu vṛtte caitramāse susnātāyāḥ śucidukūlavāsinvāḥ svapne surabhiparimaḷākṛṣṭa....r̤āpya śātakumbhakumbhasambhṛtairambhobhiḥ kṛto′bhipekaḥ | spṛhayantī ceyamānīlagurupayodharamukhamantharadarśana......pviva snehavatīṣu nistriṃśadhārāsu patati baddharāgā dṛṣṭiḥ iti | ākarṇya divyānubhāvaṃ garbhamākalayannamṛtavarṣeṇeva savoṅgasamā......śanīkāśāsu sparśānumeyāsvākāśasphaṭikaharmyā(di)bhūmiṣvākāśavihāradohalamasyā niravartayat | utsavottareṇa ca yathāvidhi prayukte......vardhamāne garbhe krameṇābhyarṇaprasavasamayāyāṃ ca devyāmaharaharabhivardhamānānandamavanipālamekadā bhuktāsthānamaṇḍapagatamāptakatipayamitrāmātya......bhyetya mahāpratīhāraḥ praṇāmapūrvaṃ vyajñāpayat |

deva! devadarśanamabhilaṣāmīti bruvāṇaḥ ko′pi maskarī parivrāḍ dvārabhūmau vartata iti | anujñātena ca praveśyamāna(ma ? mā)dhibhirniyamaiśca kṣāmamadhvadhūḷibhirduḥkhaiśca malinīkṛtavigrahamāgṛhītapādukāditanupustakākṣamālikākamaṇḍalutridaṇḍādikopakaraṇamuccaghoṇamalpakarṇamānimnadṛśaṃ kṛśakapolamavanipālaḥ parivrājamapaśyat | kṛtayathopacāraśca vetrāsanopaviṣṭamutsāritaparijanastamupahvare sahāmātyaḥ papraccha——‘kathamasi (tve ? tva)mevāgata’ iti | so′bravīt——‘viditameva devasya yathāhamevaṃliṅgo mālaveṣu nagaryāmanekaśiṣyagaṇapari(plu ? vṛ)tastvadādeśena prativasāmi | tatra ca mālaveśvaro mānasāro nāma narapatirutkhātapratiropitastvayā tvaccaraṇakamalareṇunikaranicitamatibharamiva duḥkhaduḥkhena śiro′vahat | amarṣajvarajaritarājyasukhārocakaḥ parityajya surayuvatitulitalāvaṇyamadhigatalalitakathāprapañcamañcitamṛdukathitahasitamamijanavinayavantamantaḥpurasundarījanamatanīyasi tapasyavartata | tapasā ca punaranyajanmaphaladānocitena, duḥsādhamākalayya phalamaihikaṃ, mahākāḷe mahāmāṃsavikrayamakarot | āmardakena bhagavatā śauryātiśayasantoṣitena bhavadvijayāya ko′pi nistriṃśo dattaḥ | sa codgirati viṣadhara iva hutavahārciṣaḥpakṣirāja iva patati pataṅgavartmanā, subhaṭa iva ca svāmyādeśena dṛṣṭipathe tiṣṭhatāmanapahṛtya jīvitaṃ na nivartate | taṃ ca bhujasahāyamāsādya mandīkṛtabhavatprabhāvaśaṅkaḥ śaṅkaragatamapi pāramaiśvaryamākramopalabhyamānameva manya(māna)stavoparyabhiyogāya (pha ? ba)lasamutthānaṃ karoti | paraṃ tu devaḥ pramāṇa’miti |

rājā tu jātavaimanasyo′pi svabhāvadhīratayā nigṛhya vikriyāṃ tu——nanu śrutamavisaṃvāditātmano′sya vacanam | anurūpaṃ hi mānamayasya mahībhujāṃ hṛdayasyāriparibhavāsahiṣṇutvam | uttamānāṃ cātmanirapekṣāṇi sāhasāni samarthānyeva daivatānyapi vismāpayitum | avandhyasantoṣāśca devatā durlabhānapi kāmānupahareyuḥ | ato′muṣminnaupayikamamartyopasthite′tipātinyarthajāte vicintyatām | āgamānusārapravṛttā ca buddhiranugacchati sarvatraivāvakāśam | ākāśe′pi vicaranti, ambunāthamapyatitaranti, pātāḷamapi praviśanti, asuravivarāṇyapyāvasanti, meruśikharamapyārohanti, viṣadharairapi krīḍanti, kupuruṣairapi vyavaha(ra)nti, kuṃñjarānapi vaśīkurvanti, mṛgapatīnapi vadhnanti, vilāsinīhṛdayānyapyāvarjayanti......pyārāghayanti niyatamupāyapṛṣṭhodyamā manuṣyāḥ | nirupāyasya karagatamapyaśa(kta ? kya)mevopayoktumityavihvalamacalabandhamacalaṃ guhāsiṃhabṛhi......

teṣāṃ tu......pathaciravicāritamatiḥ sumatirabhāṣata——‘deva daiva(ma)cintyamiti yadabhihitamarthaśāstrakāraistadevedamāpatitaṃ.....ṃasādhyaṃ ca sarvapuruṣakārāṇāmāmardakaprasādaḥ | tadevaṃgate parabalasambhūtānubhāvasya riporātmārpaṇena prasādanamu.....ṣaṃśayakaram, itarad bhogātyantavirodhi | tathāpīdameva śāstre.....ẏayātrona nidarśanena nidarśitam, ekāntaparājaye satyubhayataḥ prajākṣayādadharmye.....ṣtadādāya.....ṣārabhūtaṃ kośavāhanamanabhijñeyaṃ kañcid durgavanamāśritāḥ kālameva prata.....ḍevīṃ vā vindhyagiri(kā ? kanda)rālayāṃ śabarākulita(?)racitanarapaśupiśitopahāratuṣṭāmiṣṭavarapradānapaṇḍitāṃ caṇḍikāmārādhayiṣyāma’ iti | apare ca mantriṇo jīvite(va ? ca) sati bhadramityasyaiva matamuccāvacābhirupapattibhirupācinvata |

śrutvā tu sattvaguṇamiva labdhavṛttimacchasmitacandrikācchalena darśayan viśāṃpatiḥ rāmānuśayānurūpāṃ giramimāmupādatta vaktum——‘astīdamātmaśarīrarakṣākṛte janapadapuramālinī ratnākaravalayamekhalā kṣitirapi ananyameva ta ayaṃ tvasyarṇāyasya(?) gauravātiśayastrivargasādhanopakaraṇatayābhyanujñātaḥ kṛtātmabhiḥ, anyathā punaradhanyasyāsya karbhabhūmisamudbhavasyānekaśākhābhedasañcitātmanaḥ, payodharaprasekavardhitasya, snāyusirālatāvitānagahanasyāsthisthāṇuśatanicitasya, capalendriyamṛgagaṇavicaritasya kusumaśarāśīviṣādhivāsabhīṣaṇahṛdayakoṭarasya, pavanabalapacalitasya, vijṛmbhamāṇatṛṣṇāpiśācikādhiṣṭhitasya, rudhirapaṭalapallavasya, palitakusumajanmanaḥ pariṇāmanidāghaśoṣaṇīyasyāntakavanagajabhañjanīyasya, kāyasaṃjñasya śūnyāraṇyasya kīdṛśaṃ sāraṃ, kva copayogaḥ | dṛśyatāṃ ca tāvaccharīrayantram, triśatyāsthikīlānāṃ, saṣaṣṭyā vā saptaśatyā sirārajjūnāṃ, pañcāśatā piśitapeśīpralepānāṃ, caturviṃśatyā rasavāhānāṃ dhamanīsrotasāṃ, saptabhirdhātubhistribhirdoṣaiḥ, pañcabhirmarudbhirekādaśabhirindriyaiḥ, saptabhiśca tvagbhiranyena caivamātmakena duṣprapañcenāvicāraprasiddharāmaṇīyakamuparacita(mi ? ma)tivicakṣaṇena karmaśilpinā marmaṇāṃ kila śatena saptottareṇa | yatrakvacidavadhaṭṭitamapratighaṭanakṣamaṃ tatkṣaṇa eva vyāpadyate | śakyaṃ caita(d)dharmayantramasthipañjaraṃ sirāgahanaṃ rudhirahradaṃ piśitarāśimedaḥ kumbhamalajambāḷaṃ roganīḍamityanyatamena nāmnā vyapadeṣṭum | atra duṣkadirenduḥ khalāsaṃ(?)vasati jñānadaridraḥ puruṣaḥ | atra mavallīke(?) bhogavikārānupaharati naikamukhastṛṣṇāmahāhiḥ | atra viṣavṛkṣe janmaphalāni bhakṣayanti lolupāḥ pañcendriyaśakunayaḥ | atra kāsāre prajñāsalilamāvṛṇotyabhedya(mitya ? ma)vidyābhrapaṭalam | atra śmaśāne dadāti sānnidhyamudbhūtabhūtiparuṣito ripuṣaḍvargapitṛgaṇaḥ | kaṣṭaṃ bata pāpapārthivasyāsyānavasthitaṃ balamanabhimukhā duḥkhopadrutāśca viṣayāḥ, niyatamāyāsabhūyasī yātrā, naikavidhavyādhayaḥ pratihantāraḥ, mukhamekam, anekamukhāni chidrāṇi, anavasthitā varṇasthitiḥ kośaikādhiṣṭhānaṃ darśanam āśayo dopagrāhī, raktasya tiraskāro′ntargatāḥ prabhañjanāḥ, śirasa....r̤uṇannoparamatyakṣakrīḍātvamārgadaṇḍadhṛtirapariṇītasya ata eva hyaikāntikanaśvaratvaṃ śāśvat pradīpaśikhā, niścalo navajalaughaḥ sthiratarāṇi salilabu......pi nāyaṃ ravasthāstuḥ(?) | asyaiva ca durātmanaḥ kṛtaghnasya kṛte(?)raparabhavanā dvārasthagaḷagrahānanubhavanti, asīkṣepanirastitikṣu(?).....ṃuparacayanti, gātrāṇi saṅkocayanti, mastakena mahīṃ masṛṇayanti, dāsyamapyupagacchanti, uccheṣaṇamupabhuñjate, mi.....ḍhūnapavadanti, māhātmyamapahnuvate, mitrāṇyabhidruhyanti, gurūnapakṣipanti, prāṇān vikrīṇate, steyamācaranti, māyāḥ pravartayante, vṛddhimupajīvanti, kupya.....ṃāṃsapiṇḍamahānitapīti.....ṭ(?)kṣapayitumabhiniviṣṭā durmatayaḥ | tadevametadanekātiprayāsaparamparāvardhyamānamapyakasmādeva kṣudrasaṅgatamiva vibhajyate, nopa.....ṇti, nopalālitaṃ gaṇayati, nānuvṛttimavabudhyate, na pakṣapātaṃ paśyati, na bahumānaṃ manyate, sulabhavināśakāraṇatvācca niṣeka eva vyāpadyate, garbha eva vā sravati, śavībhūtameva vā jāyate, jātamātrameva vā naśyati, śaiśava evoparamati, yadi kadācit karmabalena kālasāmarthyādīśvarecchayā yadṛcchayā vā tāvantamatipatati kṣemeṇa nativaṃghya(?)madhvānamanabhirāmayā gabhīrakāsacchalena tarjayantyā kāḷarātrī | vājasrasrutalālāsyandivisrasayā suniyogataḥ sakacagrahaṃ haṭhādākṛṣyate |

kaṣṭaṃ jarābhibhūtasya jantorantakasannikarpopasarpaṇamayādivodvepante yātrāṇi | mahāprayāṇaprayāsacintā(diva?)vaiklavyādiva jāyate gatisādaḥ | doṣṇa(?)darśanakarmādhikāriṇī jīvita eva kāladū(ta ? tā)gamananivedanārthamantarviśati dṛṣṭiḥ | akṣigūhanahetujijñāsārthamivānupatati sthānabhraṃśaduḥsthitā bhrūḥ | bhūyovayavaśaithilyādaciradhavaḷaromajālaśabalāyāḥ śayanaikarasāyāḥ kambaḷa iva (la)mbate carmasañcayaḥ | pañjara iva rāśakuntyāstātaśvāsakāsinyā (?) sphuṭībhavatyasthirāśiḥ | viśadāyante navayauvanakṣaraṇakulyāvalyaḥ | pariṇāmadahanadagdhasya yauvanasya bhasmeva palitarāśiratyāsaṅgāduttamāṅgenohyate | pratimukhāpatitapaṇḍavārdhakyaghaṭṭanādiva praviśīryante dantāḥ | pretaviṣayaprayāṇārambhaprahatagambhīrakāsadundu(bhi)bhirjīvitasya mārgālocanadūtā ivāgrataḥ prasarpantyutkathitaratiravānukarṣaṇā iva pūtigandhayaḥ śvāsāḥ | nopayāti vikṛtarūpamapratyabhijñāna(va)tīva smṛtiḥ | asyevamiti vyapadeśādapatrapamāṇevāpasarpatyapatrapā | pāpīyasī ceyaṃ jarā nāmāvamānasya mātā, dhikkṛtānāṃ dhātrī, kārpaṇyasya bhaginī, bhayasyāyatiḥ, abhāvasya prāgavasthā, dhairyasya viratiḥ, ahaṅkārasyāvasānamanitya(sa?)tāyāḥ sakhī, sammohasya santatiḥ, aśaucasyāvatāravīthī, narakavedanānāṃ pūrvarūpaṃ, śṛṅgāravilasitānāmapathyabhūmiḥ, dīpikamadanaṃ rakṣikadarthina(?)manuddhṛtanayanamandhīkaraṇamaśalyavākyaṃ karṇaśaktyavasādanamabhīmayuddhaṃ gadābhighātasaṅkulamanabalāmukhaṃ tilakāḷakaprasādhanamamoghametadantakāyudham |

evaṃ ca jātijarāmṛtibhistisṛbhistrikhaṇḍakalpābhiratibhayānakamājavaṃ java(?)jaladhimavagāhamānasya naurive(yat ? yaṃ) pratikṣaṇāśaṅkanīyabhaṅgā tanuḥ | tathā cāsya dehasya tridoṣasyāpi doṣānudāharanto nādyāpi pāraṃ paśyanti maharṣayaḥ rasamayamapyekāntavirasamevaṃ vijānatāmanekajantusahasrasambādhasaṅkulamapi śūnyamevaitadālocyate | taccedamanekasārayogamapyasāramanekāntajālaveṣṭitamapyabandhamasahyasantāpakāraṇamapyaśuci rūpaṃ abhayaṅkarapa......ktataraṃ saromākhyavyavāryā(?)svādarasamantarguruśukramapyanāthamapyantargalamasambha(?)mapyanavasthānamantaścarapavanapañcakamapi satata....l̤amantargatamada.....ṃatisphuṭasandhiśabdamapi (vi)grahavyapadeśyamaśivamaśāntamanarthamūlam | athaca kilaitadduratyajam | atra kilāyaṃ kṛtābhiṣvaṅgaḥ pu.....ẏodurapakāraye′munā(?) kimapi sādhyamadhyavasyanti | asya tu me babhūva yukto′yaṃ bhūtasamavāyastathāpi kṣatrakulakuṃ.....ṭmava devyā vasumatyā rājalakṣmīryuṣmati dīpikāprakāśikena(?)ca yathāsukhamasambādharamaṇīyena vartmanā muktatandratandritāḥ pramodanabhājā.....ṃiṣṭāni vasūni svarato′rthivargaḥ suhṛdgaṇāśca saṃva(rji ? rdhi)tāḥ svanirviśeṣaṃ bhogaprapañcaiḥ | paśyāmi nātaḥ paraṃ karaṇī(ye)ṣvanyataram | uta santatipratiṣṭhā.....ṣvapnadohalapratyayena snigdhādeśavyāhṛtena svacittavṛttiprāmāṇyena ca mahānubhāvaḥ ko′pi devyā garbhavartī kulasya nistārakastanturiti śakyamadhya(vātu ? vasātu)m | ayamasāvaham, asti hi vacanam ‘ātmā vai putraḥ’ iti | asāveva yathācintitena śreyasā yojanīyaḥ | tato mama ca matpitṝṇāṃ ca prajānāṃ ca bahūpakṛtaṃ bhavati | sa khalvahamanālocana (ra)maṇīyamakāṇḍabhaṅguraṃ śarīramāhavaśirasi kṣatrakulocitena vartmanā vyayīkṛ(ta ? tya) śaradindumanoharamāsaṃsārasthāyi yuṇyatamaṃ ya(śaḥ)śarīramamaralokavihāri cānekādhvaraparamparāprārthyamānama(ya?)śrameṇa (śarīram?) āsādayitumicchāmi | necchāmi duḥkhāyāvarṇāya caitatkaḷevaraṃ dhārayitum’ iti |

abhihitavatyavasite manujabhartari, jānannapi tadvyavasāyamaprāvartyaṃ(?) bhartṛsnehaparavatā dhairyastambhitābhi(ṣa)ṅgeṇa cetasā sumitraḥ pratyavādīt——‘deva! jñāta eva kātarasya jīvitavyamivetarasya priyamaraṇe martavyami(tā ? ti) | ārtatrāṇadīkṣayā cādyāpi nyāyanirvyūḍhayā yathārthamūḍhaḥ kṣatraśabda ityetadapyanapalāpameva | na cedamanārataṃ (dhi ? ni)jagurusuhṛdbandhukṛtyopayogāt kṛtaprayojanena svataḥ punaradhanyenāninyenāśunā(?) duḥkharūpeṇa cetasā samprati raṇayajñāṅgatāṃ gatenāmmanā saṅghāte(?) | na khalvamahāvarāho mahīṃ samuddharati, nāśambhurabhragaṅgāṃ dhārayati, nāhiraṇyagarbho bhuvanatrayīmudbhāvayati, nādugdhodadhissudhāmāviṣkaroti | na cābhavān bhavatsantatimutthāpayituṃ samarthaḥ | na(nva ? hya)nantādanyenānū(ḍhabharo ? ḍho)bharaḥ kaiṭabhāreḥ | viditameva khalu viditaveditavyasya yathemāḥ pratipadasulabhāntarāyā duryodhanasādhanasamavāyāśca sampattayaḥ | prārthyamānaduravāpā samārādhyamānaduḥkhaśīlā rakṣyamāṇaprapalāyinī ca lakṣmīḥ |

lakṣmīviḍambanam——pratyakṣameva cāsyāścāpalam | eṣā khalu devasya pitṛpitāmahasaṃvardhitāpi ripuṣaḍvargasambādhamuktacittena suciralālitāpi pravīrakaradaṇḍamaṇḍalīkṛtapracaṇḍacāpacakraṭaṅkāramukhariteṣu śarīraṃ jīvitamapyanavekṣya rakṣitāpi yatheṣṭalābhasaṃvardhitā tuṣṭadvijavarāśīrvādābhinanditāpi nityārādhanaprasannakuladevatādhiṣṭhāpi(tāpi) nityodyuktavidyādharavṛddhasamājājasragrāhyamāṇavinayāpi caturudadhivalayamadhyavartisakalanarapatikulaviracitāñjalikamalavanavihāramānitamanorathāpi svabhāvadoṣeṇa durmatiraparicitā jīvatyeva tasminnarijīvi(te ? ta)lehalolakhaḍgajihve mahāhibhogabhīṣaṇe bha.....ṃetasyāmindukaradalitakumudakuḍmalodaradalāvadātāmapaharitabṛhaspatau(?) tiṣṭhatyeva tasmin bhayapalāyanodvignasakalakṣatrakīrtimāninī....r̤iceyaṃ pataṅgarathamayīva bhujaṅgabhoginī muhūrtamapyaviśramya paribhramati | upanatāpi daivādurasi ca mada......viditakṛtyākṛtyamākulīkṛtākṣamanakṣaramanubhavaduḥkhamaṅganirbhogairācakṣāṇamārūḍhaśaṅkāsādhvasairavasthānurūpa....r̤uṣamapratyapekṣāpradhānapati(?) madhukṛdbhiriva malinavarṇaiḥ kṣudrātmakaiḥ śikṣitā karkaśapuruṣasāhasaikahāryamanāsyā(?) durgraheṣve.....ḍvārohati duṣṭa markaṭīyaṃ tamakasmādeva kṣo(pa ? bha)yitvā vicyutaphalamuddhūtapatramutsṛjya viṭapama(hyaṃ ? nyaṃ) saṅkrāmati |

yatra ca lagnā jvalanaśikheva tamavaśyaṃ.....ṭyaiva praśāmyati | manye ca kālakūṭasyāsyāśca bhagavatyā nippatā(?) nirviṣībhūtaḥ svastimānidānīṃ dugdhasindhuḥ | athavā neyaṃ kāḷakūṭatulyakakṣyā lakṣayitavyā, yadamunaikasyeśvarasya kaṇṭhamātraṃ dūṣitam, anayā śatasahasrāṇīśvarāṇāṃ sarvākāraṃ dūṣitāni | saiṣā mandaroddhūtamahāsamudravīcivalayavegāsphālanavijṛmbhitāṅgabhaṅgajva(re ? rā) mahāntamūṣmāṇamudvamati, sthānāsanaśayaneṣu dhṛtimupagacchati muhurmuhurveṣṭate bhaktaṃ dveṣṭi, dṛṣṭimudbhramayati, jīvitaṃ ca paryasyamānā bhayānakāṃ daśāmāvāhayati, acalakṣobhatumulajaladhigarbhamūrcchanmārutātirekasvīkṛteva (ka?)jātavātaprakṛtirasaṅgataśīlā cānavasthitā ca kṣudrā ca niṣṭhurapralāpakāriṇī ca kṛśavarṇā ca kṛtapralobhanā ca svapnarūpairvibhramairbhṛśaṃ dunoti | (kāratā?)muraganāyakasya vāsukermandarākarṣaṇakhedavihvalasya niḥśvāsanijvaraviṣāgnidhūmamaṇḍalāgnikṛteva(?) sadasacca na paśyati, parapraṇeyāsatīmajasramālambate, mahāpathe′pi skhalati, narapaśūnapi samāpatati, aspṛśyānapi spṛśati, aśucimapyadhitiṣṭhati, cakṣuṣmadbhiśca paribhūyate | satyamacalavṛtterapyudagrasyāpi bhūbhṛto′syāḥ samudbhave dvijihvasaṃveṣṭanamatighorā ca bhrāntirāsīt | sarvāneva devān brahmamukhān paribhūya samastamāyāsidvāntatantratīrthakaraṃ nārāyaṇamātbhanopasṛtya bhajamānayānayoddhoṣitamasādhāraṇaṃ dhārṣṭyam | amunātimāye(na ? ne)māṃ rakṣatādhokṣajenārabhūtāvamānatādiṃ nānāvidhā (?) viḍambanārthaparā ceyaṃ dugdharāśerapasṛta | caṭulakaṭākṣadṛṣṭikṣeponmāditapuruṣā svanimittasaṅkalpitāni vigrahasaṃgrahāṇi paśyantī vaśyeva rājakuleṣu līlāvaṣṭambharasapragalbhaṃ bhramati | soṣma(ta)yeva jātiṃ mlāpayati | tejorūpatayeva vaṃśasantatiṃ dahati | tamomayatvādiva sadbhavanāni malinayati | vyabhicāritayeva mahākulāni pāṃsulayati | citramidam ayaśodāpi vardhayati (ma?)balam, asubhadrāpi vijayamānuguṇyenākarṣati, adamayantyapi lokapālānavadhūya nalasāraṅgagurukaroti(?) | amaraikasatvāda(?)pārijātaṃ ratnākaramapi nādhivasati, viratavigrahaṃ makaradhvajamapi puruṣabuddhyā nābhinandati | kulāsaṃgrahaśīlakuliśa(?) ityasukhāyamāneva śaṅke śaśāṅke′pi na vasati | surabhigandhasampannamanyamasahamāne(nai?)va manye mahotpale′pi na pātayati padam | aṅgīkṛtamasurasnehopacāramityasūyayantyeva nūnamasidhārātale′pi na caṅkramate | tarkayāmi cāsyāḥ sannidhānādevāvadāte′pi candramaṇḍale sphuṭībhūtaḥ kaḷaṅkaḥ, pāvaneṣvapi kamalavaneṣu pradīryate rajovikāraḥ | svacche′pi ca kṛpāṇadhārājale ja......ṣa bhedanaśaktiḥ | tyāgaśaktimutkarṣiṇīmiva darśayantī tyāgaśīlāneva tyajati | śūraiḥ saha śauryamiva prakāśayantī vigṛhyaiva tiṣṭhati | vinīte′pi vinītatareva tiraskarotyanurāga......va na sukhamāste | hrīmatsu nitāntahrīteva na rūpamātmano′bhivyanakti | dharmaraticaṇḍarāgāratiyantraṇāsahiṣṇutayeva(?) nāveśayati vidvatsu jaḷapa......bhyupaiti praṇayam | adīneṣu dīnasatvā śīlabhedādiva nāvalambate maitrīkaṃma(?) (u)cchriteṣu kṣudrārohitayeva nā(ddhi ? dhi)roḍhuṃ kṣamate | śākaṭa......pratāpamlānaṃ praśrayamanuvelamavakirantī pravartate | ambugarbhā rāgamiva vidāhadūṣitalamābhijātyaṃ pratikṣaṇamavamṛkāti (?) caraṇamivānuraktamatyadhastādvartayati.....ṭanutaraṃ dadhāti | ūrudaṇḍamiva sthitamupahitorujālaṃ kleśayati | jaghanamiva mahābhogamāvṛṇoti | uramiva madhyasthaṃ bhagnakalutvamudvati(?) | nābhirandhramiva gambhīraṃ bahvāvartamupasthāpayati | stanataṭamiva pravṛddhaṃ bandhayati | bhujapāśamiva mṛdumavāṅmukhayati | adharamiva parispandavantaṃ kṣatavasthana(?)māpādayati | daśananiveśamivāmalamadharatiraskāryamāracayati | locanayugaḷamiva snigdhaṃ vibhrameṇa yojayati | keśahastamivāyatimantaṃ saṃyamayati | kharatareṣu cāsau khaleṣu pātitā dhānyapūlīva (?) durjanavaraṇamātrasaṃhṛtā niḥśaṅkatāṃ gatā viphalīkriyate | nirbhayādavibhramā ca mattamātaṅgānapi bhramarīvābhisarati | vidyudvilāsataraḷā megharājiriva rā(ja)haṃsānpyudvejayati | jaḷānapyandhānapi mūkānapi kṣayiṇo′pi śvitriṇo′pi vyaṅgānapi virūpānīpa vṛddhānapi klībānapi kṛpaṇānapi lubdhānapi mugdhānapi niṣṭhurānapi svairi(ṇīna ? ṇo′)pi harati | asadṛśānekadurjanopabhoganirdayakadarthitāpi nāpatrapate |

kiṃ bahunā | na guṇamapekṣyābhivardhate, nā(bhibhoṣe ? pi doṣe)ṇa vyāvartate | tathāhi——ajātaśatrordhārmikatāmanilasambhavasyādhyavasāyasāmarthyamarjunasya parākramaṃ, yamayostvatimānuṣarūpamanurudhyamānā śakuniracitamakṣa(pyū ? dyū)takapaṭaṃ cārīkṛtya kṣudrama(lo ? lī)kābhimānagarvaṃ duryodhanamatinirbharamāliliṅga lakṣmīḥ | kimanayā nācaritamindrajāleṣu, kimanabhyastaṃ pralambhaneṣu, kimu śeṣitaṃ mahāpātakeṣu, kimagaṇitamakāryeṣu, kimapravartitaṃ varṇasaṅkareṣu, kimabhinnaṃ maryādāsu, kimanudbhāvitaṃ mohavilasiteṣu, kimapratihataṃ jālavartmasu | rajjuriyamudbandhanāya satyavāditāyāḥ, viṣamiyaṃ jīvitaharaṇāya māhātmyasya, śastramiyaṃ viśasanāya satpuruṣavṛttānām, agniriyaṃ nirdahanāya dharmasya, salilamiyaṃ nimajjanāya saujanyasya, dhūḷiriyaṃ dhūsarīkaraṇāya cāritrasya | citrīyate cedaṃ sīmantinīvisaṃvādi vṛttamasyāḥ | ya(tā ? to)yameva puruṣameṣā samāśliṣyati svayameva tamuddāmakāmaṃ parastrīsahasreṣu yojayati | sa(jāpī ? dāpi) vāruṇīṃ hateyamātmanaḥ sa(ma)kṣamāsevamānamutsāhayati | guṇānapi doṣīkaroti, doṣānapi guṇīkaroti | asyāśca cāpalātiśaye prakānte prastāvo′pi (nācirādhīṣā ? rciṣām) | na vārtāpi karikaḷabhakarṇapallavānām | na kathāpi kadalikāprāntacārikāṇām | kevalamanāryabuddherevaināmanavasthitatvenānusartumasti śa(sti ? ktiḥ) | evaṃvidhāpi ceyaṃ durācārāsakṛdvyabhicāritāpi svabhāvacāpalena bhūyo′pyasādhāraṇapuruṣakārabhūṣaṇairbhavādṛśaireva śa(kṣya ? kya)te pratyāhartum | dhārtarāṣṭrānucchriṣmita(?)kapaṭadyūtahāritāpi khalvaraṇyavāsavinivṛttaiḥ pāṇḍuputraiḥ pratyuddhṛtaiveyamaparimitamahāmahībhṛtprabhūtavāhinīvaraparibṛṃhitamanekaśatasahasranāgasaṃkulaṃ kurukulabalajaladhimanupraviśya śukti(?kte)riva vṛttamuktālakṣmīḥ | durlabhaśca sa.....ẏasyeyaṃ niścalā | calitāmeva khalvimāṃ duṣṭaceṭīmiva punaḥ punaravagṛhya nigaḷayitvānītavataṃ kālam(?) acalaśikhākūṭavikaṭamāṃsaḷāṃsapīṭhāḥ pīṭhīkṛtasaptadvīpasakalārāja......caraṇā dharaṇibhujaḥ | śrūyate ca navanaḷinanālatantugarbhalīno nahuṣaprabhāvasamayaṃ samagrameva cakṣame sahasrākṣaḥ | puna ramuṣmin pulomakanyakārucira.....ḍhirūḍhe nigrahāmarṣitasya maharṣeragastyasya śāpādajagarabhūyaṃ gatavatyanaghavṛttaṃ kaḷatramanāyakāṃ ca nākalakṣmīṃ prāpadyata | nanu ca...... hyatāmbujaśriyaṃ pratyākarṣan pratyakṣa eva devo divākaraḥ | lakṣmīviḍambanaṃ samāptam ||

prasīda deva! nivartasva sāhasādapahartastaya parikara....r̤acaladurgamalaṅghyabhāśritaḥ pratīkṣasva kālam | utpannavarabalopayogasantuṣṭo rāṣṭropalabdhisiddhayātrāphalaḥ phalavadbhūmirāmaṇīyakākṛṣṭacittavṛttiratraiva varteta vāsameva janapadam(?) | avasitaprayojanasyāpi ca viṣamaśailadurgajuṣastyaktātmanaśca nāsmānanu prahatya śatroḥ phalam | prabhaviṣṇu hi praharaṇamamaraṣrasādopalabdhaṃ tadapi dṛṣṭigocarasthiteṣu śrūyate |

śrutopapanne ca bhinnaśaiśave śāsanakṣamaikamāyāvarmahare kumāre kariṣya(ti ? si) kadanamātmanirapekṣaḥ pratipakṣasya kakṣeṣu vā kālamakṣayeṇa tapasā kṣapayiṣyasi | na sāmpratamevedamadya kanyakāstathā hīti dviṣā hane(?) svadehāhute ratisañjanam | atha yadi yadṛcchāmātrasādhyamaśeṣapuru(ṣa)kāragocarānītameva manyase mahadaratu yadṛcchavakasyārti(?)daśāyāmātmecchayā parivarteta devasya kalyāṇī kulasantatiḥ | ete′pi vayamiha nirupayogamātmānamagramaraṇenopayokṣyāmaha ityuparacitapraṇāmāñjaliḥ pracalacūḍena mastakena mahīṃ jagāma |

maśita(?)madhurapraśrayastu pṛthivīpatirutthāpya tamūrjitārthaṃ vacanamācacakṣe——yad bravīṣi mānamlānamalīmasānapi prāṇānaraṇyānīnilīnaḥ svasa(ntyu ? ntatyu)pakriyāyai dhārayeti, tatra ca ci(nta ? nte)yaṃ——parabhṛtabalāvalepo ripuḥ kimitomuktapurajanapadamapagatapradhānasādhanamanucitaprajopakrośapāṃsulamuparatapratāpatayā proṣitātmacchāyamuṣṇakarapratāpavāraṇāya kāmapi kāntārapādapacchāyāmupāsīnamenaṃ janaṃ nānubadhnīyāt? | ātmaśarīraikaśeṣaḥ śaphara iva salilamūlatalanilīno′pi kimanabhidruto duryodhanaḥ pūrvanikārasmaraṇadāruṇena rudhirapūritodareṇa vṛkodareṇa? | mānī ca mānasāraḥ prasāritapratāpaḥ kṛtopakāraśca purā mayāsmadvairasyaṃ manyamāno′pasāryatayā hyeva rāṣṭrādinā dhṛtimanubaddhasya vāriṇā suciropārjitasannihite svatejasi prakāśake na śakyamadṛśyenātmanā bahaḷatamatamassassavīva(?) gahaneṣu sthātum | nahi noya(?) nijāpadānochritayaśaḥśarīraḥ śaśaka iva kvacit sambhavati gulmakukṣau | tathā ca satyanudrutasya dviṣā sudūramapi gatvātmamaikāntikaḥ śarīravyayaḥ | sannihi(taṃ nihi?)takaḷatrasya me vyāpattau sāpi santatiḥ saṃśayamāpadyeta | yadarthamarthitvamavarṇopahate jīrṇatṛṇalavalaghuni jīvite′pi kuryāyāḥ saparyāmapadiśadbhi(?)rbalavadbhirāgṛhītasārakośairaparibhāvayadbhiḥ kālamanugatapradhānamūlabhṛtyāmaviditāsmadvyasanavṛttāntatayā parisṛtagarbhakhedāmito′pavāhya devīṃ yathopapannairupāyairavagṛhyārthayogyānāṭavikānasrutān modantestāvadāsitavyaṃ yāvatopapatsyate prakṛtārthasiddhiḥ | astyeva cedamanekapratyūhanityāghrātā vipannāśca sampadaḥ | durlabhā ca durabhirakṣā ca kṣapitaśīlā ca khalaikavallabhā ca niṣkaruṇā ca niṣkāraṇavilobhanī cālakṣaṇā lakṣmīḥ | prabuddhajanaṃprahata eṣa panthāḥ | nātra saṃśayaḥ | tathāpi kā gatiḥ | jātena jagati jīvitārthe niyogato yatna......pāyavargasya sāmādeḥ śāstradṛṣṭena vartmanā vārtādīnāṃ cānuṣṭhānam | tathānuṣṭhīyamānasya cārthasya siddhirdaivamevopakrośayati na puruṣam | atre......jāye nāsyā na poṣaṇe rakṣaṇe ca vinayādhāne ca yatitavyam | etāvati puruṣasyādhikāraḥ, paraṃ tu daivaṃ na tatra pauruṣaṃ kramate......śriyam | śrūyante hi kuśalavādayo vanamṛgaiḥ sa(ga?)hāśrameṣu vṛddhāḥ punarupetya rājyaṃ gṛhītavantaḥ | pratīpayanti bhavyamarthaṃ ramaṇīyamaramaṇīyaṃ vā(?) | yatamānastu yāvacchakti vidvānātmānamavācyamāpādayati | tada(mu)ṣminnakṛtaprajñaduṣkare karmaṇyapratipattiniṣṭhureṇa rāgapṛṣṭhaprasthitena cetasā kulakramādvāgatasyāptabhāvasya, sahapāṃsukrīḍopabṛṃhitasya snehasambhārasyottarottarāpatitamādhuryaprakarṣasya paricayasya, sarvarahasyaniḥśaṅkālāpasaṃbhṛtasya visrambhasya, svadehanirviśeṣānuṣṭhitasya nirupaskārakāntasya saṃvyavahārasyaikapade bhavadbhiḥ prākṛtairivānātmabhirivāvicārakṣamairivānabhyastanayaprayogairiva ca na parimlānirāneyā | na hi mamaikamālambanaṃ pāta ityupārūḍhāyā yuṣmāsu sambhāvanāyāḥ pralaghūni prāṇatṛṇānyavakīrya pratikṛtaṃ bhaviṣyati |

kṣaṇikena hi samādhinā sādhanīyo jīvitasya vyayaḥ | yāvajjīvitena nikṣeparakṣaṇam | ato′sau rakṣyatāṃ nikṣepaḥ, sthirīkriyatāmātmā, mucyatāṃ kātaratvam, utthāpyantāṃ yaśaḥpatākāḥ, pradarśyatāṃ śrutaprabhāvaḥ, prasthāpyatāṃ satpuruṣavṛttam, uddho(ṣya)tāṃ tattvadarśitvam, ārādhyatāmātmasvāmivaṃśaḥ, sudṛṣṭaśca kriyatāmapunardarśanasambhavādupanataparalokaprayāṇo jano′yam | astvayamavyājagarjayorjitya(?)nirjitamaruttakārtavīryasya sphītakīrtestātasya putraḥ, pautraśca puruṣapauruṣagrīṣmoccūṣitāśeṣasapatna(sya?) sampatteranavarataraṇamahāmahasya pitāmahasya | na hi rājakesariṇāmudārasyānvayasya yujyate hariṇastantuḥ | ato nirantaramaviraḷavistṛtaśaralatāvitānadhavaḷitanabhasi rudhirapaṭalapāṭalasphuritabandhujīvabhūṣaṇāyāmajara(?)bhīṣaṇāyāṃ śaradi vidhibalamapi nijabalena viparivartya puruṣasahasrāṇyabhūyaḥprabodhanāya svāpayeyam |

atra cediha bhavantaḥ pratiṣedhākṣaravirasamātmasāhāyyadānasambaddhaṃ vā padamanucitavirahavihvalatvādupā(ma ? da)dīrannaya(ma)hamaviraḷasāradārukabaḷagrahavalitārciṣi pītasphītasarpiṣi sphuri(ta)sphuliṅgavipruṣi viṣamārciṣi viraṃsyāmityavasite vacasi vāsavānubhāvasya bharturamodhanirgamatvāduttamapuruṣasaṅgarāṇām, apratilo(ma ? bha)nakṣamatvāt prabhutvasyādṛṣṭakriyopacitatvād bhṛtyabhāvasyāpratibandhayogyatvād vidhiceṣṭitānāmanavasādapratikriyatvādanarthopacitānāmadhyavasāyasahacaratvānmahāsattvatāyāḥ, vyasanakālavikasitatayā ca vidyābalasya (ma?)balavatīmapi nyakkṛtya śokapravṛttimuddhṛtamapyupaṣṭbhya hṛdayamudīrṇamapyudasya raṇaraṇikāmuddāmāmapi niyamyoṣṇabāṣpadhārāmudbhūtamapi ni(rvartyoktaṃ ? vṛtyotkaṃ)pamutkrāntakalpamapyuparudhya jīvitaṃ jīvanmaraṇamivārimavirāmā(?)ramyarūpamabhyu payanto mantriṇastatheti vaidhuryaniścitayā vācā gatyantaramalabhamānāḥ patyurājñāṃ pratya(vaseta ? sevanta) |

devīṃ ca viditadevārcanavṛttāntāṃ (arcanaṃ?)jñātabhartṛsaṅkalpatayā svairānuṣṭhīyamānaprayāṇopakaraṇasaṃbhārāmakārayan | avanipatirapyu(?tyu)dayamivābhiyogamareḥ kāṅkṣannatisattvatayā vikramarasatiraskṛtasvajanavirahaduḥkhaḥ ni(rve ? rvṛ)tena cetasā tamaparabhāga(ma)haḥ samagrāṃ ca yāminīmanaiṣīt |

athāparedyurudayamārurukṣati kṣatajarāgapāṭale pādapātaparā(ga?)hatakṣubhitagarjadvāhinīpatau paṭutarakarāsphālanollasa.....ṇyatejastiraskāriṇi raktacakradhāriṇi dharaṇimṛnmakuṭadhaṭitaspaṣṭamaṇḍalāgrakiraṇasaṃhatau pratikṣaṇavijṛmbhamāṇaduḥsahoṣmaṇi pratipakṣatā.....ḍyādharamaprastutastutau subhaṭa iva rathāvarādhirūḍhe parivartayati kālamātmagatyanusāreṇa deve saptasaptau kṛtaprabhātamaṅgalāma(ṅgale ? ṅge)ṣu grauḍhagarbhabhāramantharepva......ṣu racitabhūṣaṇāmudayagūḍhacandramaṇḍalāmivālpālpatārakāsphuraṇāṃ śaratpradoṣa(ba ? ve)lāṃ maulavṛddhavarṣavarādhiṣṭhitāmanusṛtasthavirahaṃsabṛndāmiva mandākinīṃ devīmutsukapriya(jā ? janā)nuvartanamuhūrtalambitaparijanāṅganāsasambhramānuyātāṃ puraskṛtya kāladūtairiva gatimaniṣṭāṃ gamayadbhirbharturājñākṣaraiḥ preryamāṇāḥ duḥkhopahatamukhatviṣaḥ kṛṣyamāṇabalāvayavā dakṣiṇāṃ diśamabhi pratyadya(?) sakaḷatrā api trāṇamanyadalabhamānā vindhyagirimabhyavartanta mantriṇaḥ |

anantaraṃ ca sarvasyāmevorvyāṃ sarvakṣatrapiśunāḥ kālarūpā iva caritumārabhanta (co ? gho)rarūpā mahotpātāḥ | tathāhi——prathamameva svabhartṛkālakṣayāsattitrāsādivodakampata kṣitiḥ | abhyarṇara(to ? ṇo)dayādiva vyajṛmbhanta dviguṇamudgarja(ya?)nto vāhinīpatayaḥ | jaṅgamabhūbhṛcchirobhaṅgasaukaryapratyayotpādanāyeva kenāpyabhajyanta sthāsnūnāmavanisphuritaratnopalāni bhūbhṛtāṃ śirāṃsi | samarotsukarājalokasāhāyyārthamivartavaḥ sarva eva svacihnalakṣyāḥ samantataḥ samaṃ samājagmuḥ | akhilamiva dharaṇipṛṣṭhamāhavāṅkaṇīkurvantaḥ prasabhotpāṭitanirastavṛkṣavīrudhaḥ kṣuṇṇapāṣāṇaśarkarāḥ kṣaṇamapi nopare(mū ? muru)grasvanāḥ prabhramantaḥ prabhañjanāḥ | kālāpasarpā iva kālasarpāḥ prasarpantaḥ sarvapārthivānāmāviviśuḥ śayyāgṛhāṇi | aṭavyā iva daṇḍavikṣepā vyāghrādayaḥ purāṇyarundhanta | rājāsthāneṣūdatiṣṭhannalakṣmīparivārārthamiva sthūlasthūlā rohitastriyaḥ | pravahadadhamahāghabudbudānīvodbhavadbhaṅgurāṇi hīnātiriktapāṇipādānyāśirāṃsi(vi?) vikṛtaghorarūpāṇi mānuṣeṣu tiryakṣu ca prabhūtāni bhūtānyabhūtaye bhuvaḥ pratibhayāni bhūyasā babhūvuḥ | abhāvacintākātarāṇāmiva karituraṅgamāṇāmanabhinanditayavasapallavānāmānanādagaḷannaśrubindavaḥ | sarvaśaktyāsaṅkha eva dhvanimiva śaṅkhadundubhimukhairnigrahe′pi svaśabdo na vyasṛjata(?) | prabhūtaprāṇirāśiprakṣayaśuceva rurudurdevatāpratimāḥ | pūrṇaśaśibhrāntarāhuśira ivātapatreṣu babhrāma bhramarapaṭalam | śastreṣvebhanti(?)darpādiva darpaṇeṣvapi patituṃ neṣuḥ pārthivānāṃ mukhāni | tejasvinamarkamapyabhijagmuścchāyātmānaḥ mānimāṃ(?) | saṃprahāratva(ra)yeva kośebhyaḥ śastrāṇi svayameva prajvalanti nirjagmuḥ | āhūyamānānāmārohaṇaparibhavasahiṣṇugandhahastigarhaṇāyeva tanmado hastinīnāṃ kapolamāśiśleṣa | apraṇipātapraṇunnānīva muhurmuhu(ra)vartanta pratiṣṭhāsūnāṃ vāhanāni | sudūramapi gateṣveva mano bhāvinī duśetyādvegādivādāvevāvannātapatradhvajapatākādīni(?) rājacihnāni | abhajyanta ca rathaśakaṭādayaḥ | katipayaja(va?)nāparādhakupitakāḷarātriprabhāracitamekhalāpravāḷamaṇaya ivāśrupātāḥ śaṅkhadeśeṣvalakṣyanta | kṣatrapi......kāḥ kujaśca nānāvidhā roddhumiva sāhasaṃ vileguraṅgeṣu(?) | sadasattāmārgadarśināmiva guṇaviparyayaḥ kāryakāle mandatīkṣṇānāṃ vājināmabhūt | puṃgavatvādiva praṇadantaḥ kakudmantaḥ pratimukhaṃ balānyabhyadravanta | apraga pāpeṣi.....ṣavyaṃ pakṣiṇaḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ ca vanamṛgāḥ paripatanto nirbhayaṃ cāvagāhamānā vyabhajanniva sainyānyanyonyamāmiṣatvena | kākairapi kālasāmarthyamiva.....ṭad dhyānamlānā vājikuñjaramanuvājāmakhuralelikhyamānabhūtalānāṃ ca vājināmaṅgāni abhinabhavabhinnānīva puṣpacumbina(?)ivābhyalīyanta....r̤abhanakarakabandhādīni ghoratarāṇi darśayadbhiśca valayapratilomabhīmarūkṣagarjitānāśanibhi(?)raviraḷarudhiramadhuvasātailopaloragamakarā.....ṭaṭitpiśaṅgahemadaṇḍaiścaṇḍa(ra?)marudbhirabhyarditānāṃ sahasradhaiva sainikānāmabhidyanta hṛdayāni | māhyā(?)samājaprekṣārthidikpālaracitahemamañcā.....ḍahyamānā diśaḥ | kṣatrakṣobhabhayādudvasantava(?) jughūrṇire gandharvanagarāṇi | prabuddhagrahāyendrapreṣitānīvendrāyudhāni yāminīṣvadṛśyanta | bharaivasvaravirasavirāsinīnāmaśivānāṃ śivānāṃ pratyutthīyamānā ivonmukhīnāṃ mukholkābhirutkābahudaṃṣṭrāpāṭyamānaśaśalakṣmaśa(śi ? śa)rudhiradhārābhyaktā iva prajvalantyaḥ pradoṣeṣu petuḥ(?) | pranṛttamṛtyubāhava iva bahudhā dhūmaketavaḥ prāvṛṇvan di(va?)śaḥ | sarvabhūtakṣayadarśanākṣamatvādiva svayaṃ sṛtatārakāndhakāri(kā ? tā) dhaurabhūt | tādṛśīṃ divamivānuśocan praśāntāṅgāraniṣprabhaḥ prabhākaro ripuṇā svarbhānunābhyasūyata | rāmalakṣmaṇāviva malinasantāpinau somasūryau kabandhenograṃ jagrasāte | tadevaṃ bhaumāntarikṣadibyairmahotpātairvāryamāṇamapi rājamaṇḍalaṃ magadhamālavendrayorājñayā kāladūtyevākṛṣyamāṇaṃ samājagāmaiva samarāya 

tadā ca rājā rājahaṃsaḥ sajjabhūyiṣṭhasainyamaṇḍalo mahādarśanaṃ(dadā ? mā) lavendradūtaṃ dvāraprāptaṃ dvāramukhādupalebhe | jñātaprāyaprayojanastamīṣadāviddhamanyunā manasā mānaveśaḥ praveśayāmāsa |

praviśya cāsau rājānubhāvajanitasādhvasaṃ hṛdayamabhinigṛhṇan brāhmaṇāyano dakṣiṇapāṇimudyamya svastiśabdamuccairuccārayāmāsa | ripuvacoharaṃ ca tamagrāmyāmijā(tya)saumyarūpamaniṣṭhurapragalbhadṛṣṭisañcāramākṛtipratyayāda(pra ? prā)kṛto′yamityavadhārya (taga ? da)rbhāsane sajjanādanujagrāha magadharājaḥ | 

āsīnaṃ ca taṃ muhūrtaviśrāntamupagṛhya nisargasnigdhayā dṛśā mālaveśvarasyaṃ kṣemārogyaṃ papraccha |

darśitādarastu dūtastatheti kṣemārogyakathanānantaramanukrameṇa svamāgamanaprayojanamitthamācacakṣe——deva! devena mālavendreṇāsmi bhavatsakāśaṃ kuśalavārtāparijñānārthaṃ prahitaḥ | snihyati sa rājā nisargato′tra nibaddhapakṣarāgaḥ | niṣkāraṇame(va)vā janmāntaraniratyayapravṛttakarmavāsanābalena vā dehārambhakabhūtabhūmasāmarthyena vā darśanamātreṇaiva kvacit kaścidāropayati peśalaṃ praṇayam | atpetaraṃ cāpratisaṃhāradāruṇaṃ drohamitaratra | saiṣā lokasthitiḥ | smarati cāsau māhātmyanibandhasya nirvyājavijṛmbhamāṇavīryāhṛtaharṣavismayasya vamadvahnivarṣabhīṣaṇapraharaṇābhipātavyatikarasya kātarabhayāsanasyā(ṣṭā ? nyā)dṛśodārapuruṣasvādīyasaḥ samprahāraparicayasya | tāni tāni tatpratiba(ndhā ? ddhā)ni śauryatyāgasatyaurjityasaṃhitāni kathāntarāṇi rasātirekeṇa puḷakitakapolaḥ sabhāsu sampravartayanna tṛptimeti | āha caiva manmukhena sa(ra ? ma)kṣamiva snehacakṣuṣā paśyanniha bhagavantam | dhanyaṃ bata mānuṣyakaṃ yatrāsi.....ṣubhagā bata bhagavatī bhūtadhāriṇī yā tvayā sanāthīkṛtā | saiva ca devī mahābhāgā sa(hasra?)magradoṣaduṣṭāyāḥ sīmantinīsṛṣṭestorthasnānaśuddhiriva pāpa......vānalpatejā diśaḥ prācyāḥ samadhyuṣitavān nasya nādā mā javaṃ javena vikālasrotasyadyāpi(?)kiñcidevaṃbhūtaṃ bhūtapūrvama.....ṭejasvī cakravartī devastigmaraśmirna bha(vasvā ? vā)nivānekarājamaṇḍalakṣapaṇayogyāṃ śaktimudvahati, noccalitadhāturāgaraktāna.....ṇekavarṇānandamudīrṇahaṃsaśabdo vikaroti na kṣatrakulāni cānena tejasā tiraskriyante | kāmaṃ ca mahābalaḥ prabhañjanātmā cāñjanāhṛdayavallabha......krāntāśca punaranena balajavalulitasakalajaladhivelāvanenāvaneravanamayatā śirāṃsyucchritānāmanekaśaścakravāḷam, api tu nityaṃ bhavānivāpāṃsulai.....ẏathā pravartituṃ kṛtapratijñaḥ | kṛtārthajanmanaśca tānavaimi yeṣāṃ mahāhaveṣvatrabhavataḥ prativyūhya viratānāmihābhūtasambhavasthāsnu sthitaṃ yaśaḥśarīram | paratra ca vīrakaḷatraślāghābhāvanībhiranaghayauvanābhiḥ sahāpsarobhirutphullakalpa pādapapārijātasantānakamandārāsu nandanavanabhūmiṣu mandamandaṃ mandākinītaraṅgavāyubhirāyāsitabālacāmīkarāravindasaraḥśatairaṅgāni suratakhedasuptāni saṃvāhayadbhirānuguṇyasandhyukṣyamāṇakandarpāśuśukṣaṇi ramamāṇānāṃ pradakṣiṇībhavatyakhaṇḍakalakalyāṇarāśiḥ | mama tu mandabhāgyasya bahutithamamalaprahārajanitamohamūrcchāndhakāramuṣitacetaso raṇāṅgaṇatalāstīrṇakambalaśayitasya śirasi madūrjitapratigarjitārjitāmarṣeṇa tvayā sa(ha?)rabhasābhighātakhaṇḍitakaraṇḍakocchalavṛttalaṇḍajaṭilitāmbaraṃ caraṇamanavaśeṣakṣatriyasamakṣaṃ nikṣipatā nistīrṇatuṅgasaṅgarabharalaghurātmā kṛtaḥ | kṛtaścāhaṃ hāsyavastu nistalavṛttakīrtimuktāvalimaṇḍanānāṃ manasvinām | subharo hi bhāraḥ kṣiteruparilagna uccaiḥśirasāṃ, na tu laghīyān parasya pādareṇuḥ | paracaraṇākrāntamastakasya ca manuṣyasyoṣṇīṣamivottamāṅgāgravartī dūramapanīyate jātidhavalaṃ vīravratam | uttaṃsamadhukarakulānīva jhaṭityutpatanti svabhāvamalīmasātinī vaktyāni (?) | kusumasraja iva komalāvadātā mlāyanti kīrtayaḥ | vāsacūrṇaprakara iva prayatnaropitaḥ prakṣarati kulābhimānaḥ | cūḍāmaṇigvi sphuritarāgaścūrṇībhavatyahaṅkāraḥ | keśakalāpa iva dīrghakā saṃvarvita ryākulībhavati prabhāvaḥ | bhāvāśca punarabhāvā evāsya | manya paramparākasyāsmin(?) mūla eva nikṛtya mastakena mahīspṛśā pareṇa pātite chinnāśeṣasākhe śākhinīva kagracagradhārā(?) dārayantī hṛdayamatiniṣṭhurā patati laukikānāmavajñādṛṣṭiḥ | atastvāmekavīraṃ bhūyo′pi samarapravartanāya prārthaya | yatraiṣa cālatavīrabāhupādapavananapavanavāhinī(?) mamāvakīryeta mahānavamānarāśiḥ, tadatibhāranāmitaṃ vā durudvahaṃ śiraḥ | śreyānasāveka eva yaḥ śilīmukhaprapātakavacitāśokapunnāganāgavyūheṣu sampūrṇe kāmabhūlamitraparabhṛtaśreṇikhalādulāraṇyake sphuratprabhāsilatāvanādahāsabhāsureṣu(?) raṇavanantavāsareṣu vīḥgāṣṭhīvihāraśīlaḥ sthānadattadantakharataranakharaprahāro rāgapāṭalamocanādaraḥ sarabhasadaṣṭadantacchado rasakaṇṭakitāṅgayaṣṭirlīlāyamānā vijayalakṣmīṃ sakacagrahaṃ rantumākarṣati | tadbadhāna parikaram, uddāmadarpanirbharabhaṭārbudabṛhatkalabarortabhadhave tu bandhaskhalitatvāhinībalakīlālavāhinī(?) kārtavīrya va kartumaśūgamugrāṇi ca tāni......vallabhāni bhūyo′pi prabhūtāmbhaḥbhambhārādhmātalambādarāmbhodharadhvānagambhīrāṇi nartyamānadṛptabhaṭaśikhaṇḍimaṇḍalāni kaṇṭhagarjitā ta cha.....ṃukhavihārasindūrāḷindasundaramindīvarapatranīlavarṇa(lā ? yā) kālarātryeva trāsayantyā jagadvijṛmbhikābhirvikaṭakuṭilā bhrukuṭirekhā.....ḍvayaṃ locayugaḷagaḷatuhāro(?) bhāratasamara iva sampatyapi samastadṛptakṣatrapakṣamaṃ(ra?)kṣayeṇa kṣiteḥ kṣaritakṣatajakulyā....l̤eṣu rudhiracandanā(ra ? nu)liptamūrtayastridaśavāravilāsinīsābhilāṣakaṭākṣalakṣitā vilasantu vikramakrīḍayā yaudhapuruṣāḥ | pratiromakūpanipatitani......jarjarāṇi pravīramāṃsāni parihṛtya raktapānamācaratu pranṛttaśrāntaḥ piśācavargaḥ | saṃvartatāṃ ca vyavaśāntadarpoṣamaṇā subhaṭajīvitāhāropahāreṇa bhagavān vaivasvataḥ | svatantraśca mumāni marmahā vīramutsṛjya sukhāśayaḥ kulodyato mukhaṃ pravāvanti(?) | ityeṣa vaḥ samarasambandhino yaśaḥśarīrakalyāṇakāmasya māḷaveśvarasya madānanāpitaḥ sandeśa iti |

upasaṃhṛte vacasi vacohareṇa smayamānamukho mahīpatiḥ prativyājahāra——samarthamidaṃ samagram | artho hi mahātmanāmanucchinnasantatiryaśaḥpravāhaḥ | sa ca vinā puruṣakārādananyasādanā(na?)dhīnaḥ kṣatrabandhāḥ | lakṣmīrapi bāhudaṇḍanirdayabhramitabhūbhṛnmaṇḍalena cākarṣaṇīyeti surāsurāmṛtamathanamārgeṇaivāyamartho nirṇītaḥ | paralokavijayadvāraṃ ca rājanyasyālabhyamānamahāpaśukṛtarucirājyāvartanopabṛṃhitapratāpānalo mahāvīravijṛmbhaṇātibhīṣaṇaḥ prastutaśastravyatikaro madakāraṇakalpamanāmṛtāyamāṇasurāṃśasucirayamadhvaro(?)  maraṇātmako vidhicoditatvādāhavo nāma | nedṛśamaparamakṛpaṇamasti trivargasādhanaṃ yathaitat prathanakarmasatra(pa ? vi)jayasādhitacatugntādhipatyajīvanaṃ maraṇalabhyasyābhyudayasya balapratīhāraḥ(?) | kiṃ bahunā yuddhaṃ nāma siddhimukhānāṃ prathamam | evaṃ cātiramaṇīye karmaṇi pravartayitukāmena cāmunā viśāleśvareṇa yattat priyatamamatibahaḷakathitaṃ tatpunaramṛtavāyanopacchandanamiva lakṣayāmi |

athavā naiva jānātyābhijātyaṃ priyādanyallāpayitum | icchaṃścāsmatpriyahitaiṣiṇā mānasāreṇa māḷaveṣveva sannipatyāhavaśirasi tatsandeśavastunaḥ prāptarūpaṃ prativyāhariṣyāmi | athavā puṇyatamaḥ prayogoddeśastatraiva nosmāgato′stu(?) | kāmaṃ ca vāsaro′yamananukūlastadapi na kāryārādhanakṣamaḥ | kālakṣepo maṅgalatithinakṣatreṣṭatvaṃ hi lābhavighnamavajjamaghyapatermadhyacittakaiḥ(?) | ato′dyaivābhiyogāya sannahyatāṃ sainyam, uddhuṣyatāṃ prayāṇāya paṭaha ityuparacitāñjalimupasthitaṃ balādhyakṣaṃ harṣanāmānamādideśa | dūtaṃ mahatyārthapūjayā yojayitvā hṛṣṭavarṇaṃ yathādiṣṭanivedanāyāgre visasarja | svayaṃ ca sannahanagrahaṇāya visarjitarājalokaḥ siṃhāsanāduttasthau |

utthite ca rājanyudadhirivodacaladutkṣepaḍolāyamānataraḷataraṅgaphenanikaranirgamottarīyasamantaḥ sāmantalokaḥ | sambhramotthitānāṃ cetaretarāsphālacālacālabhugnabhujāratnakoṭayo jagararivābhyarṇājikarmabhūrigarvaḥ(?) | bhūbhujāṃ bhujārgaḷāgaḷitagaṇḍamūlamadarāganirmṛjāni bhairavaraṇavārtāśravaṇavihvalāni vāmāṃsāvasaktacārucāmarāṇāṃ vārasundarīṇāmāsannacandramaṇḍalaparāhataprabhāṇi.....ṇānopahārakusumabhaktidhūsaracchavayaścalitajanacaraṇaśatābhighātabhagnapakṣatīnāṃ ṣaṭcaraṇakadambakānāṃ śiñjānanitambaratna.....ṇādhanyatāghrātamātmānamivānuśocantaśrukruśurmaṇikuṭṭimāḥ |

narapatirapi kubjavāmanakirātaprāyaparijanagaṇaparivṛto.....ṇagālinī nīlalohita iva kailāsagahvaramabhyantaramaviśat |

athainaṃ sāṃvatsaraḥ saha purodhasopasṛtya vijñāpayāṃcakāra——deva gurubhārgavagargādyanekācāryasandarśanamārgayāthātathyavedino devasya yat phalāni nāvagāhate matirato′yamarthaḥ pratyucyate | kathaṃ nu guṇamavadhārayatyevaṃbhūte bhūtavaikṛtye atyugravigraheṣu sāṃkhye vahnidaivatya raktavāre cāsminnakṣatre tithau navamyāṃ diśaṃ pratīcīnamārabdhāyāṃ kayānmāyāgamapramāṇo deva iti(?) tamasāvatāmasāśayaḥpratyuvāca——yuktamiṃdamāryeṇāsmi pratibodhitaḥ, kiṃ tu bhūvijayaiṣiṇāmeṣa mārgo yaddinādisampat pratīkṣyāma iti | svargavijayaiṣuṇo viparītameva śobhate | prajopapīḍāśāntyarthaṃ tu durnimittaśamanadṛṣṭaśaktayaḥ śāntayaḥ kriyantāmityātharvaṇikamaikṣata |

so′pi nanūtpātānāmārambhāt prabhṛtyeva dīkṣānurūpaṃ gṛhātithyamudakagrahaṇaṃ vāstuśamanaṃ nirṛtihomaḥ pṛthaktantramapratiratho dakṣiṇetyaṣṭānāmaṣṭādaśānāṃ cāmṛtovāktakalpanāṃ rudrendravaruṇavāyukuberaviṣṇusantatitvāṣṭraprājāpatyāgnikumāranirṛtiḥ rudgaṇagandharvairāvatapṛthivīlakṣaṇānā bhayāyāśvābhayārthāyā mahāśānte(?) ghṛtakambalaprabhṛtīnāṃ ca karmaṇāṃ puṇyatamānāmanyeṣāṃ cātharvadṛṣṭānāmanuṣṭhānaṃ kriyata eva | yadyeṣa eva sarga svastyastu devasya bhavatu vijayāya snānamaṅgalabhiti purohitamya vācamanuruvyamānasta padiṣṭena vartmanā kṛtābhiṣekastejaḥspṛhayeva samupamyā vidhivadbhagavantaṃ bhānumantaṃ dviṇapayatna puro(dhāḥ ? dhasā) puṇyātharvanaśānta bhiradbhigbhyusitamauliḥ śuklamālyāmbarā jagati jātasya durjātajātasya śāntaye kṛtsnameva kośajā(taṃ) dvijātisāccakāra |

tataḥ kṣaṇādaruṇarāgarañjitadinamukhānukārī haritabhuvanābhyantaravivaro(?) dinakaramaṇḍalasphaṭikapāṭalīkaraṇapiṇḍālaktakarasaḥ piṇḍitasakalajagadupaplavadrumāraṇyānīdahanadāvānalaḥ khalakalikṣaṇadācarakaṭakaluṇṭākakākutsthakapilāyamāno gaganasaraḥkamalarāśiraṃśāmukharocanāccharaṇakalpaḥ kalpayanniva kalpitahi(ra)ṇmayāṇḍasambhavaṃ kalpamūla(?) divamutsasarpa vipragaṇapraharṣaprasāritasya meruśikharavivaramya(?) kanakarāśerā(ma ? ra)ktaśakavilāsinīkapoladyutiratimahānālokapravāhaḥ | yasya ca vijambhamāṇasyāvakāśadānārthamiva tirodhatte sma samagrā durnimittasaṃhatiḥ | anaṃhamāṃ ca brahmasaṅghānāṃ yathābhilāṣaṃ hemaratnāni, svīkurvatāditi babhūvuruccāvacāḥ pracuravismayagurukutū(ha)lacalitaprasṛtalocanāḥ pralāpāḥ | labdhamidaṃ prabhūtamarthajātaṃ, śakyamanena somasaṃsthāḥ kartum | pūrṇamidaṃ suvarṇamasaktamavāpyate na sarvārthyam(?) | eṣa mahāhiraṇyarāśiḥ, kāryamanena sārāmaṃ prātiveśyaṃ gṛhaniviṣṭāya me jyeṣṭhaputrāya | bhrājiṣṇurayaṃ prabhūtapūrṇamāsīndumukho muktāhāraḥ, prāya imaṃ pratimoktuṃ brāhmaṇī me jihreti | sakala eṣa kanyālaṅkāraḥ, dāsyāmi sutāmanenālaṅkṛtām | eṣa viṣaharo harinmaṇiḥ pavitratamaśca, bandhayāmyenamasminnaṅgulauyake | mahārho′yaṃ jātirāgaḥ padmarāgaḥ kṛtyamanena cintayannapi na paśyāmi | hemaratnacitro′yaṃ mekhalākalāpaḥ, idānīṃ yathārheṇa mūlyenainaṃ grahīṣyati | kathamayamaṣṭasahasrayaṣṭi.....ẏānyavantamanena mā kariṣyati | bandhuro′yaṃ bhaṅgiparvā vidrumāṅkuraḥ, karomyekaṃ bālakasya kaṇṭhābharaṇam | etāni pramāṇavanti pra......kiñcit piturme karṇamudrikāyāmarpayiṣyate | tadidaṃ kalitapanīyaṃ nāma pañcavarṇaḥ suvarṇayeniruttamavarṇaḥ | imāni tāni.....ḍiva haimavata......ṣāṇi śuktiśaṅkhaprakīrṇayonīni mauktikāni | ta ete vaiḍūryaśirīṣapuṣpakādambavaṃśarāgendranīlacandrakāntādayo maṇayaḥ | tānīmāni nānāgandhavarṇāni lāghavādi yuktāni candanāni | ta ete vividhavarṇagandhaguṇayonayaḥ kāḷāgarutailaparṇikādayo bhogadravyasambhārāśca | ratnamidaṃ nīlakaṇṭhakaṇṭhakāntanāmakaṃ praiyyakamenannīlapītaśvetalekhatayendrāyudhodgāribinducitraṃ ca, sā caiṣā dvādaśagrāmīyā dvādaśāṅgulāyāmā visī mahāvisīcī ca(?) | śyāmikeyaṃ kāpilā binducitā ca | kāḷikeyaṃ kapilā kapotavarṇā ca | kadalikeyamapuruṣahastāyatā ca | candrottareyaṃ candracitrā | ṇyākuleyaṃ(?) kadalītribhāgā kolāmaṇḍalacitrā ca | bahūnyetāni strigdhabahularomasukumārāṇyajinaratnāni | āviko′yamanekayāvanaprakāraḥ ka(da?)mbalādiḥ | eṣā vaṅgapuṇḍrādisambhavā dukūlajātiḥ | etā magadhapuṇḍrasuvarṇyakuḍyadeśyanāgalikucabakuḷavaṭayonayaḥ patrorṇāḥ | kauśeyamidam, ete cīnapaṭṭāḥ, kārpāsikametat, tadāparāntikam, etanmādhuraṃ, māhiṣakamidam, eṣa kupyarāśiḥ ko′sya voḍhā dṛḍhaṃ badhāna ratnabhāṇḍaṃ yathā pathi na bhraśyati | bharo garīyānaśakto′yaṃ boḍhum, api dhik tvāṃ bhoktumeva jātam | uddhara yatnenāropaya snigdhamudvaha(n sa?) bhajyate′dya svādhyāyaḥ | kīnāśa kiṃ mamāṅge′pi hastamarpayasi, kopanaka svameva tāvanme dūramudvaha | hā dṛṣṭasāraṃ me phalgunā viparivartayasi | durmukha! dṛṣṭamebhiḥ sārataraṃ mayā labdhamakharakamarkakarkaramakañcukamayamakamarakṛmakarmakamasiktaṃ ca me muktājātamidaṃ tuṣṭaḥ kathaṃ kathamihāgatamasantuṣṭakiṣṭaduṣṭenaikena(?) bahūni nistalasthūlavṛttasnigdhabhrājiṣṇuguruśvetadeśaviddhānyamūni mauktikāni, prabhūtānyetāni jātarūparūpyatāmrapātrāṇi | tvamapi caiṣāmarthamudvaha, mahādānamidaṃ pravṛttam | aho mahātmā mahārājo naivaṃ nāparāhṇikaḥ karṇo rājā vā yudhiṣṭhiro dṛṣṭavān vasūni(?) | kāraṇamatra manye mantriṇāmasannidhiḥ | mā maivaṃ, na te′pi śuṣkaṣāṅguṇyayogaśraddhāruddhaparalokadṛṣṭayaḥ | haṃsaścāyaṃ haṃsaparivāraśca | sarvathā samara enaṃ rakṣantu śakramukhyā lokapālāḥ | labhatāmayamaṣṭādaśadvīpalakṣmīṃparigrahamagresaraṃ cakravartināmatyādityatejasaṃ tanayam | ityetāni cānyāni ca yathāśraddhaṃ vyāharadbhirvahadbhirvāhayadbhiśca dyumnajātaṃ dvijātibhiruparudhyamāneṣu vartmasu balanirgamadarśanabaddharāgaiḥ paurayuvakadambakairanyonyavimardasambādhamāruhyamāṇāsu saudhaharmyavaḷabhīsabhāgradevatāyatanacaityavṛkṣaprākāravalayapratoḷīṃṣu bhartṛsnehavihvalākulābalālocanajalaprasaraniruddhanirgamānāṃ plava(?) ivāpatati dṛḍhatare sevādharmasmaraṇe harihayavajrābhipātaghargharitakulagiriguruśilāpakṣanirghoṣabhīṣaṇaṃ raṇitamātatāna prayāṇadundubhiḥ |

dundubheśca praḷayāśanidaṇḍacaṇḍapātena bālibhujeneva hemakoṇenābhihanyamānasya rasitamākampitatribhuvanamanteṣu diśāṃ daśānāṃ caskhāla | yena sarabhasamāhato bhīta iva pratikhabalaviṣamavaladajagarabhogajihmairguhāmukhaiḥ sutarāmārarāsa lokālokaḥ | yasya ca śikhikulānīva jaladharārasitasyānuneduruddāmaromaharṣaṇāni sakalasyaiva balasamūhasya sannāhatūryāṇi | tasmiṃśca muhūrte mukhapavanāpūrito bhīta ivādareṇa sajīveneva tārataraṃ śabdāyamānena......ṅkhamaṇḍalena saṃvarta ivodvartanta caṭulataraturaṅgataraṅgapaṅktayaḥ | pariplavapravaraśastrapaṇyaprapūrṇarathānīkaniyutaprotavrātā(?) sphītajanaghanaugharuddhadaśadiśaśceta......jaladhayaḥ |

bhūpatistu purohitopadiṣṭena vartmanā vidhāya sarvaṃ prāsthānikaṃ kriyākalāpaṃ candrālokamayamiva netraniveśābhirāmadhavalamaṃśukayugalamudvahan......śaradabhrakuleneva kalkatena(?) tadanusāriṇā candanena kṛtasamālambhanaḥ pratimuktamauktikaprāyasakalabhūṣaṇo bhīmānabhīrapiśunaṃ tāvarṣamivātidarpādātmanaiva(?) līlayā dadhāno, dhavalamālatīsmitamukhamukulakalpitamuṇḍamālikākusumakomalayā bhramaṇīyadigantarālālokanayārūḍhāgralavāgresarasarvoccaiḥśirasātmakīrtyā sarvaśuklaśca, kailāsa iva daśamukhabāhudaṇḍaścakre(?) sakalalokapālotkampanakāriṇi draḍhīyasi vyavasāye vartamānaḥ, sthānadattataruṇatoraṇajālajaṭilapālikāsahasrādibhiḥ(?)navakamalinīharitavarṇaprastararatnakuṭṭimāduparitalādhaḥpārśvadattakīlalambamānaratnakāñcanakusumasañcayasukhasañcāreṇa maṇimayāḷindavartmanā padmarajaḥsparśaparihārāyormikarakamalairiva svapratibimbalaiḥ pade pade dhāryamāṇacaraṇaścaraṇābhyāmeva nirjagāma |

nirgatya ca prasaratyapi praṇāmalālasānāṃ vasumatīpatīnāmunmeṣiṇi cūḍāmaṇimarīcijālātape sasambhramāvarjitamakuṭapracyutāpīḍakusumadolāyamānamadhukarakulāndhakārakalmāṣitaṃ kuḍmalāyamānakomalāñjalikamalavanasahasraṃ citrīyamāṇamabhbaratalaṃ dadarśa |

jaya jayeti ca tārataramudgāyato vandivṛndasyāmandadundubhidhvānānuyātamāyataśaṅkhaśabdamiśram atikalakākalīkalitakāhalaraṇamūrjitaprahatamardamasnigdhaniprādamāṃsaḷamanusṛtakāṃsyatālasaṃkulamālokaśabdamālokayan (?) ākarṇapallavamābhūmilambabālanīlacāmarakalāpāmamalakārtasvarakalitālaṅgārakāntāṃ cārukomalapuṣkarakarāṃ jayalakṣmīmiva jayalakṣmī.....ṣasambhramādhoraṇasaṃjñāniveditāṃ dviradakanyakāmāruroha |

āruhya ca haṃsatūlagarbhamradiṣṭhacīnapaṭṭopadhāne paristomavatyanekaratnacitraparyantatayā yātrārambhayogyānīndramivādau jitvā gṛhītānīndracakrāṇīvāvahati suvihitapraharaṇācāpe(?) mahati kanakaparyāṇake sukhaniṣaṇṇaḥ paścimāsanagatena hemāṅgadavalayaratnahāradīdhitistabakacitravāravāṇena bāṇadevanāmnā sāmantaputreṇa kalpavṛkṣeṇeva phullarajatapuṇḍarīkasyohyamānasya madhyārpitamahāmaṇimayūkhapaṭalapāṭalāṃśukacitalīlāveṣṭanasya bālātaparaktaśāradāmbhodharānukāriṇaścāmīkaravikaṭadaṇḍasya pralambataralasthūlamuktākalāpasmeraparyantabhāgasya mahataḥ śvetātapatrasya nisargaśiśirachāyayā vāryamāṇamārtāṇḍakarāvalepaḥ, pakṣakareṇuvarṇinībhirvārayuvatibhirādhūyamānacāmarābhiḥ prāvṛṇmegha ivopāntacalavalākābhirabhrālotsaṃginībhi  (?) saudāminībhirudbhāsamānaḥ samatikramya duruchvāsaṃ vahan mahājanatvājjagadudgāriṇīva samagrāṇi(?) sakutūhalapaurasundarījālajālamārgaprahitalocanasahasrasaṃchāditāmudañcadutpalapracayamecakāmiva bhavanadīrdhikāṃ rājahaṃso rājavīthīmavajagāhe |

nagaryāśca sapadi balamarapīḍyamānabhūbhāgaśithilamūlaḍolāyamānabhavanamaṇḍalāyā(ta?) mattagajakarṇatālapavanaparāhatadhvajapatākāyā bhartṛviyogaduḥsvāt sabhujavikṣepaṃ vyāveṣṭamānā(nā ? yā) iva baddhajanakolāhalamatimahadākulatvamalakṣyata | bāṣpajalabindava iva nagaradevatānāmavanipatau peturārdravaṃśavalayanto(?) lājamuṣṭayaḥ | kṛṣṇāgarudhūmamaṇḍalagrastamantaritamivāntarikṣamavanipālayā(trāṃ ? trāyāṃ) vijayāṃsatā jīmūtapaṭalena | dhvajavanamaruddhūtakarikumbhasindūradhūlimilanāruṇai raṇonmukhasya rājñaḥ kanakanārācairiva dāruṇaistaraṇimarīcibhirambaraśaradhirāpūryata | niryayau ca narapatiraṇḍādiva hiraṇyagarbho lokamākarṣannagarāt | nagare ca tasminnanyonyavimardasa.....ṣetubandharuddharevājalapravāhānukārīṇi prācāriṣurdikcakravālamābaddhakaḷakaḷāni |

tatra keciduttamahayairaṣṭahāyanaistūrṇapadāharaṇapūritātiraktaṃ parvā.....ṃuhurmuhurjavabhivodgiradbhirjāgatabrahmacaryasamāvṛttairiva kṣipraprayuktapāṇigrahaṇaiḥ kāśyapīyapāṭhakairiva kramakṛtāvāla(?)sthitibhirvijigīṣubhiriva ṭaśītalavupadānuvartanavyasanavigrahaiḥ(?) samaraśiraḥsamādhūnanairupetena mārgavallibhiḥ prajagmuḥ(?) |

anye pratatamahocchvāsārambhakṣubhitamūlamiva stuva(?)mādhūnvadbhiścirakṛtabandhasthāpanatvādiva ruddhagatyāveṣṭamānairvikramakauśalādiva balīmuktvāndhuraṃ paripīḍitā mudvahadbhiścaturaḥ śate(?) vāme vāmairdakṣiṇe dakṣiṇairantarā ca laṅghayadbhistūpacālīmārgavallibhisturaṅgamairagaman |

apare samucchritapūrvakāyatayā vilambya darpahārāvaṣṭambhādiva jaghanabhāgeṣu vamadbhirunmṛśadbhiścāpamṛśa(dbhi)śca śirasā pādaiśca tadanurūpaiḥ pavanajavajayādiva mallilālaṃ(?) vilambayadbhiśca ślāghitamārgeṇa valgadbhiḥ saptibhiḥ pra(ta)sthire |

tathāpare paripīḍitasakalāṃgamacalitākṣamatyābhunnagātraṃ susthitāsanabālaṃ caraṇacatuṣṭayasamunmuktapṛthvītalamanatyuccamajihvā ivāpoṣanta(?) |

keciddahyamānacaraṇā iva kṣipramuktabhuvo vinamitordhvakandharāḥ saṅkiranta iva pāṇibhyāmuragā iva prārabhanta laṅghayitum |

ta(dai ? thai)ke vāhīkāḥ saṃpiṇḍitapūrvagātramavarārdhavikṛṣṭaṃ vaihāyasaṃ vādhānamavalavyatikīrṇaṃ(?) kalaviṅkā iva sahitaṃ nāma nīcairgataṃ mārgamadarśayan |

anye vaihāyasoraskaṃ susaṃrambhavilambitamubhayataḥ suvispaṣṭodāha(?)pādāntaramaviratāyataraśmipramuktamāyataṃ nāmānutiṣṭhan |

apare kedāraviṣamakardamāśmadhānādiṣu vāhyamānapratipannapāṇayo natavaṃkhanaśrame′pyatiṣṭhantaḥ sannaṃ nāma samabhipedire(?) |

tathāpare mattalīlayā pranṛtyanta iva gacchantastathā ca vakrataraṃ vaṃkhanto bāhyānuvṛttaṃ nāmābhyavartanta |

kecittu nīcairgateṣu śobhanataraṃ kiñcit kiñcit pūrvārdhopaveśanamalpasaṃkrāntivikampitaśiraskaṃ prakīrṇagātraṃ prakīrṇakaṃ nāma prāyojayan |

anye′nalparatyupaviṣā(?) parārdhadarśitakrīḍākāravaṃkhitaprakīrṇagātraṃ prakīrṇataraṃ nāma, keciddarpitapūrvagātrā vellitajānukūrcakūṇitāḥ suniveśitaśarīrā dhenudañcitodyatamalpe saṃkrānte(?) vahantaḥ saṃvṛtasamaśirasa iva vellitaṃ nāma, kecidāśu gṛhītapāṇayo vibhaktapārśvasaṅkāntayo′parārdhaniṣaṇṇakhelagāminaḥ(?) siṃhāgataṃ nāma, kecidacirabhāsa iva pūrvagātrāsthitākāśāścaraṇairañcitodvellitaiḥ samavibhaktapārśvavaṃkhitāḥ svastiṣṭhāhitaṃ nāma, kecidañcitavāmacaraṇā dakṣiṇa bulukhitabhūtalāḥ śikhāsābhividhito′lpe saṃkrānte vahanto niṣaṇṇācalitāḥ(?) śārabhaṃ nāma, kecidaparacaraṇanamitabhūmayo vaihāyasapūrvakāyā bahuprakārapralaṅghanā vyaktavimardagātradarśitakrīḍāḥ śarabhakrīḍaṃ nāma, kecitpiṇḍitavibhaktagātraṃ darśinābhiniṣaṇṇa(?)samasaṃskāramūrmigataṃ nāma, kecidañcitavidhutaśiraskaṃ darśitanābhi susamāhitapari.....ḍyastāja.....ḥvamatigurukharadhoṣamākāśapracurayānamasṛṣṭaprāyabhūtalamasamāyatadarśitapakṣaṃ tvaritavyatikīrṇapūrṇavāritaṃ trītālaṃ nāma, kecillabdhadakṣiṇapadaṃ samañci(ta)vāmagātraṃ gātraviṣamaṃ samāsanaṃ vibhaktapāṇisaṃkrāntaṃ sasauṣṭhavaṃ pañcapāṇiratāḥ pañcavānnāma,(?) kecidvellitasūpaviṣṭodyatasamāhitaṃ nikṣiptaprathamagātraṃ punaḥpunargṛhītapāṇayaḥ pakṣapayadarśitastvaritagāmino(?) drāghitaṃ nāma, kecidutpanyastavadaniṣaṇṇāstryañcitāḥ(?) samyagucchritā vaihāyasasthiradhurā vālaspṛṣṭabhūmayo bhūmiśāyitamusalavartanakṣamābhyāṃ svalpe′pyadhvani subahu.....ṃantariṃ nāma saptayaḥ samādarśayan |

atha kecana dhuritamārgapakṣapravartitamutkṣiptāñcitaśirodharaṃ māyūraṃ nāmakecana saṃvartitamadhuratvaritagātraṃ suba......, kecana samāyatastabdhakāyamatikharamṛdutvaritagātraṃ prasmāritadhuritatvaritavīkṣitaṃ sthitavāmaṃ nāma, (kecana) tvaritapakṣapūrvaṃ vimuktapaścimama(na ? va)natapūrvagātraṃ.....ṇākulaṃ nāma, kecana tvaritavīkṣitamabhīkṣṇa, pallavaṃ pracurapūrvapṛṣṭhavikampini(?) spṛṣṭagātraṃ bhadrapaścimāsanaṃ velagātraṃ nāma, kecanāñcitamadhurakampa.....ġanta upagaganaṃ spṛśanta iva bhuvanamatikharakhuraghoṣatulitameghanisvanaṃ ruddhagātraṃ muktavalāhakaṃ nāma, kecana pracalitaphalajaghanarandhrakaṭikarṇakaṅkaṇasodarakaṭākṣakeśa....r̤aśroṇikarmapṛṣṭhamekanāḷikayārdhayojanakṣamaṃ sāmudrasvasthapātānuyātapotānukāriṇamutkṣubhitaplavamārgaṃ nāma, samabhipatya sādimanonugāmino jagmuḥ |

naikalīlādarśitavīrataruṇā bhadravāhaiśca vāhaiḥ kuñcitākuñcitāsanamṛddhasaṃpu(?)kṣiptākṣiptakṣiprākṣubhitagātrāvarairupakaṇṭhapramāṇena dhainavīṃ gatimanusaradbhirnihaṃ ca (?) nātimanoharāṇi vāmadakṣiṇamadhyamāni cāmbūkṛtāni pārśvaplutāni ca darśayadbhiryathāvakāśaṃ yauvanotsekena kiñcidantaramatikramya punaḥślathasvedamapariharantaḥ sammardena ca nirudhyamānāḥ śanaiḥ śanaiḥ prajagmuḥ |

ādhoraṇāśca prakīrṇena samāhitocchritapūrvakāyena śṛṅgāreṇa ca ramaṇīyena paṇavikāreṇa nīcairgataṃ sthūloccayaṃ madhyaṃ ca mataṅgajān gamayanto līlayānagatamardhanakhagataṃ padagatamardhanakhagatamadhyardhapadagataṃ ca yathāvasaramu(tpa ? pa)pā(ta ? da)yantaḥ paśyatātmanāṃ savismayamanāḥ (?) kṣaṇaṃ vilambya punaranusukhaṃ pra(ta)sthire |

śanaiḥ śanaiśca janapadādhiṣṭhānajanitabhūtiraviralapracaritakarituragarathānīkaśatasahasrasaṃbhṛtopacayo bahukṣamopādānatayā bibhrāṇo varṇaviśeṣānuddāmadarpabhaṭasahasrahelollāsitāsipañjaramadhyapāti gṛhṇan diśāṃ daśānāmapi cakravālamālambitacchatracāmaradhvajapatākaḥ pramadamanādareṇa sakalasyaiva rājakasya sarabhasātikramaṇamalinitamukharāgasya kṛpaṇacūḍāmaṇeḥ śirasi kurvanna(?)vaṣṭabdhasakalaśailāṭavīsamudradvīpakacchaḥ svecchāvaruddhapiṇḍitasamagravāhinīpravāhaḥ prāvartatātivṛddhikaluṣo nahuṣa iva divamapyākramituṃ pārthivo rajaḥsamūhaḥ |

sa ca tuhinanivaha iva śibirābalānanakamalāni dhūsarīcakāra | tatkamalanihita(?)grahāmarṣādivoṣmāyamāṇānyarkatejāṃsi jagrase | tadantardāhoddāmatṛṣṇa iva madajalāni yathākāmaṃ papau | dānasurāpānamatta iva khaḍgadhārātaleṣu caskhāla | khaḍgakṣatavihvala iva karikumbhasthalīpu mūrcchitaḥ papāta | tataśca samuddhūtakumbhasindūrapṛkto rasasikta iva karṇatālatālavṛntavījitaḥ śanaiḥ śanairutpapāta | utpatya ca vraṇapaṭṭikāgrahūṇahetoriva dhvajadukūlacārāṇyupasasarpa | dhvajapaṭapavanaparāhataśca bhūyaḥ sukṛtīva svarevāruroha reṇusañcayaḥ |

sañcitena ca sakalarājalokamakuṭaratnarāgacchuraṇapāṭalapataṅgamaṇḍalamullasaddhvajapaṭānilākoṭitāmarāpahaṃsakamaṃsamṛṇālikāvalayamiva(?) kamalinīpalāśamanekaphenahiraṇmaṇiharitamagbaratalamāceme | bhramarapuñjanīlenaṃ bahulaparāgeṇa paṭurayabharitasahasrakhurakhuravikaṭapāṇḍarāḥ phaṇābhittayaḥ(?) | tadā ca bāḍava iva dhūlijaladherullalāsa kvacidavanipālabhūṣaṇānāmālokapravāhaḥ | kaluṣarajaḥparābhavapiśunamutpātatārakāvarṣamiva kvacidutsasṛjuḥ | karaśīkarabindujālakuñjaraghaṭāghaṭitakarapracārāśca manye tamāṃsīti rajāṃsīti kvacidapāharan paripatantaścāmarendavaḥ(?) | jala.....ṇandhūli....r̤abhanta kuñcitāloladukūlajihvādhvajabhujaṅgamāstriviṣṭapāviṣṭambhagarvitapātālajigīṣayeva punarapāre pārāvārapayasi balaparāgaḥ | ....l̤aśailakṣodarāśinikāśena tādṛśenāhavareṇusambhāreṇāyamanāvaṣṭabadhā nopayayuḥ sthalabhāvaṃ jalanidhayaḥ | tataśca karikaraśīkarāsāravāriveṇivāhi.....ẏāsitabalavilāsinīkapolagharmajalavarṣiṇā kharakhalīnakhaṇukhaṇāyamānaturagamukhavikṣepavismṛta(?)phenalālālavastabakaśabalitena valadalidalitamahī....l̤avāsāradhūsareṇa kaṭakasaṃkaṭamivāpahartumitastataḥ paribhramya yathāśakti śamitamunirājaścaturacāracārucārabhasasāṭopadalitadhautāsilatāvacanapreritena pṛtanāmārutena(?) |

praśānte ca rajasi pracalakadalikādukūlaciramṛṣṭa iva spaṣṭatāmagādākāśamaṇidarpaṇaḥ | caṭulataraturaṅgabṛndavegavikṣiptānīva dūrībabhūvurdiṅmukhāni | nṛpaśatamakuṭamakaramukhapralīnanirgata iva rarāja ratnālokalohitākavo divasaḥ | sāgarasalilonmagnā ivādṛśyanta ratnadīdhitikhacitacalacāmaracaṭulapakṣāḥ kuñjarakulagirayaḥ | karikulacaraṇasahasrasaṅghaṭṭaghanīkṛtā vajramayīva prabale′pi balakṣobhe vidhuratāṃ punarnāvikṣadeva medinī | nirdhautaprasavolbamivolbaṇarajomuktaṃ nirmalībabhūva tribhuvanam | aniṣiddhapracārā hariṇya iva svairamārebhire hi recayitumabhinavadūrvāśyāmalāsu dikṣu dṛṣṭayaḥ | tāvatā ca mada(ga ? ka)lamātaṅgaṃgaṇḍaśailakṣaritadānanirjjharajalapravāhaciklilladurgamaṃ gavyūtimātramiva balabharoparodhādasulabhapadaniveśasthānamadhvānaṃ laṅghayitvā viracitanibaddhakaṇṭakapratiparikṣepamativiśālābhyantaravibhaktavallabhaturaṅgamanduramaupavāhyasthānasthāpitavikaṭapaṭamaṇḍapāgradūṣyasañjavanamiha......ṭānāṃ tṛṇakuḍyaḥ santu, guptirevaṃ bhaviṣyati | atra goṇyaḥ śreṇīkriyantām, atra phelādavasthāpyatām(?) | iha mahānasameva dīrghaḥ khaṇḍapaṭaḥ kṛtsnametatparikṣipati tṛṇamadūrecchodiṣeyamāharata kumārāḥ purā pareha haranti saṃharatāśu pānīyaṃ bhṛṅgāradṛṣṭi tiṣu purā dohāntikaṃ kaluṣayati(?) ko′yaṃ darpo yadanyāvāsamadhyenācakitaṃ gamyate | nanviyaṃ ratnaracitā vṛtiḥ kimiti bhajyate, praguṇo′yaṃ deśaḥ, kinnu bhayānako′yaṃ valmīkaḥ, kaccho′yaṃ sacchāyaḥ, saritpunaraniyatāmaragarājyamidaṃ(?) gulmamaṇḍalamāsanaṃ tu mattahastisnigdho′yaṃ nyagrodhaḥ paryantāstu nātiśuddhāḥ śuddho′yaṃ naktamālaparidhiḥ | adūre tu suradasūnāpaṇādhikṣāmūkhayastvamagraprahitasvarge′pi na kamagrahīḥ(?) agrahīṣurmadgṛhītāni sthānāni bahūni balino rājavallabhāḥ | kiṃkṛte′sya prathamaṃ preṣito′si | nanu viśadāḥ paryantabhū(ma)yaḥ kṛṣṇeyaṃ bhūmiravaravarṇārhā, na me brāhmaṇasya maṅgalyā maḷayopapādhyāyaśuklaiva ciramanviṣṭā(?) kayaṃ me kṣatrabandhoḥ pīteyaṃ vaiśyayogyā bhūmiḥ sthānāyopakalpitā | rakteva ca kṣīrapakṣiṇī ca nātra bhūriyaṃ tu sāriṇyutkhāte raktavālukā nātyambhovacūṣaṇī svapāṃsupraticchannāpaṭāpratipathamapagacchata lambante vaiva kathikāḥ praviṣṭa eva sarvaḥ kaṭakajano muktvāsmatpuruṣo vaśadānativīramatra bhrāmyatāṃ no naiko′pi kamabhigantā nādyāpi dṛśyate(?).....ḍuṣṭadāsye | dhruvaṃ dhūrtālāpaiḥ śṛṅkhalitāḥ kasya vā labhyā gatiriha prabandhasaṅkaṭā kaṇṭhadaghnamadakardamā mārgāḥ, rajondhakāradurgamā turagapaddhatiḥ, balīyān balīvardasammardo la.....ṭālāpasamucitaḥ sāmantaniveśabhedaśaṃsinīnāṃ saṃjñādundubhīnāmabhinavaghanaghaṭonnāmedureṇa(?) tārataraśaṅkhaśabdamiśreṇa śabdamaya......bhavadbhavajaṭābhārabhraṣṭabhāgīrathīpātahimācalavipulagahvarahrādabahaḷo balakolāhalaḥ | sādaropagrāhaprayatnopara......iva prayāṇe vikramasamāhitasakalakriyākalāpo divasamadhyavāhayatvaninnaḥ(?) |

tataśca bahalabalaparāgaparipītatejāsteja ivaurvāgneyyā....l̤ībhūpālaśatātapatramaṇḍalagrastamuktasauṣṭhava(ka ? ta)yā kṛtasaṃnyāsa iva pratasthe′stagirivanāni gairikarasaraktāmbaro divasaḥ | nṛpaśatamakuṭakaṭhorakoṭipāṭitapataṅgaparada(?)pallavakṣaritā kṣatajasrutirivālakṣyata lohitāyamānā sandhyā | sainyadhvajakadalikākaśāghātamārgajavaśyāmāyamānā dikṣu pasnurustimirarekhopalalayakarṇatālābhighātabhayapalāyitasya(?) śramajapulakodbheda ivollalāsa taralatarastārakodgamastārāpathasya | ghanamapi timirasaṅghātaṃ gajaghaṭeti matvā kṣaṇaṃ na vyaghaṭanta cakravākamithunāni | balarajaḥpunarudbhavabhayalīnataraṇigopanāyeva baddhamukhāni jajñire jalajāni | kaṭukaṭaprakaṭakolāhalodvejitānāmullasaddantapatrāṇi śravaṇānīva sphuṭitumārebhire sarasīnāmālagnā(lā?)ḷinīlālakāni kumudāni | prabalabalotthīyā(?)pīḍitabhujavanakṣubhitakṣobho garbha iva nirluloṭhalohitapādaḥ prācīkukṣeḥ kṣapākṣaraḥ(?) | kūṭayaudha iva rātrisatrāpāśrayaḥ śaravarṣeṇāvisrabdhaniviṣṭaṃ śibiramākulīkurvan babhrāma kusumadhanvā | mitreṇa makaraketunābhiyuktamaminavakulavadhu-virahavihvalaṃ kāmukabalamubhayasampīḍitamiva darśayatā bhṛśamavidhyatānubadhya kumudabāndhavena | manmathānīkinīnābhivādarśitaprahārapā(ṭa)vānāṃ rāgahetuḥ śuśruve kaḷakaḷaravaḥ sajjitānāṃ vallakīnām | vīrapānamiva kāminīsainyaṃ mudhu papau ratiraṇāya | raverastamayādanāthaḥ śraśrīya(?) iva sandhyātapasphuritamandarāgāṇi sundarīmukhendubimbāni | tejastomāḥ kāmānalamivānalāmadharapallavaṃ(?) papuḥ pravīrāḥ | makaradhvajadigvijayaprayāṇatūryāṇīva śroṇītaṭe(dhā ? śi) śiñjire mañjuvā(cā)mañcitāni kāñcīdāmāni | uddāmarāgāntaritaśītanakharaprahārānuvedanamādiśyamānadaśanacchadamacchasvedabindujarjarakapolamavalepaviśṛṅkhalādhikṣepavacanajanitasaṃrambhamantarāntaropanatānyonyakriyāpraśaṃsamaṃsanakantaḷa(?)karātāḍitorastaṭaṃ kṛtapratikṛtapratigrahāpasārasaṅkulamālohitakuṭiladṛṣṭilakṣitaparasparāvasthā(na)māsthākaramanekaduṣkarakaraṇayona(?)makṣatābhimānānāṃ yūnāṃ prāvartata krīḍārūpadvandvayuddham |

anenaiva ca krameṇa pariṇāmaṃ jagāma yāminī | tataśca surataklāntakamindudvandvamandamandasaṃvāhīno(?) vandivṛndamaṅgalagītigrāhiṇastadanu tuhinakaṇāsāradhūsaritaharisaṭā(gā ? bhā)radhūnanoddhūtaraṃhaso haṃsamithunakāntipītakamalamadhumadābaddhāṃ rohanidrāhaṭhāpahāranirdayāḥ(?)śayyotthitamattamātaṅgacaraṇaraṇaraṇāyamānaśṛṅkhalāravākarṣiṇaḥ karṣitaḥ(?) iva kaṭakamārebhire carituṃ prābhātikā mātariśvānaḥ |

naranāthastu hṛdayahāriṇyā ramaṇyā samaracintayaivātinīya rajanīmahani jāyamāne chanita(?)sainyasannāhaḥ samutthito dinakara ivātisṛjya kapilānasahasramusraṇāḥ(?) pratyaṅmukhaḥ pratasthe | katipayaprayāṇakāntāvasthitasya tu pārthivasya kaścicchatrukaṭakādāgatya rahasi vijñāpayāmāsa | de(va) daivataprabhāvadṛpto devasya jayāyā(ga)ta eva rājā mālavānāmitastriyojanamantaraṃ vartate | tasya kilānukūlāni bho(dā ? gā)ni di.....ṭadāhaveṣu devena purā vijitya svacaraṇanakhacandrikākalpitoṣṇīṣamuṣṇaśvāsaśoṣitādharapuṭakṛcchraniścāritālokaśabdaṃ ca ka.....ṣaṅgatamatihṛṣṭaṃ ca vartate | paurastyāstu rājānaḥ prabhaṅjanā iva pārñjana(?)surabhayo ghanasamayaṃ bhavantamanuvartante | sāra......va kuliśam | īśo′si (ka ? kha)lu kartumantamantakasyāpi | (kutaḥ?) kuru gograhaṇodyatasya sarvakṣatrasyānuttaraṃ kadanam | evaṃ sati vijayo′pi jito......visṛjya sadasi dattāsthānaḥ samastasāmantasannidhau sadhīramidamuvāca——purā kila manumādirājamānāthya dīnāḥ pālanā(sa ? ya) prajā bhejire | tena guptā nirvṛtya mātsyanyāyena trivargaṃ nirviviśuḥ(?) | tataḥ prabhṛtyudbabhūva svabhujāpāśrayaḥ śastrabandhuḥ pṛthvīkalatraḥ kīrtisāraḥ samaramṛtyupratīkṣaḥ kṣatramityudīrṇapuṇyaśabdo varṇaḥ | sa ca suvarṇa(tayeva ? miva) yathā (yathā) tapyate tathā tathotkarṣeṇa dīpyate | tasya cāsāvaprāptasthānīyo yo′prāptaḥ samaraśauṇḍa(kā ? tā)m | iha khalvapratibhaḥ kaviḥ, apragalbho vivadiṣuḥ, a(ti ? ni)rūpako vyācikhyāsuḥ, acikitsurbhiṣag, atitikṣuravivikto vijā....r̤iranudyukto vaṇig, anṛtavāgamātyo, nātharvā purohito′samañjasaḥ karaṇasthorupacārajñaḥ kālo(?)′ra(bhya ? mya) śīlā yuvatirapīyatopyanyo(?) nāyatno jñātirakaṇṭho gāyano′kṛtāṅgo nartako′kleśakṣamaḥ kṣapaṇo′karuṇaḥ śākyamuniranapatrapaḥ kulaputro′nupakartṛ mitramavikrāntaśca pārthiva ityakiñcitkaro vargaḥ | prāptaścāyamavasaraḥ parākramasya | pratyāsanno hi ripurupasamāhṛtabalasamudayaḥ | tadiha mahatyāhavakratau kramasamiddhasaṃgharṣahutāśane hutaśarīrāhutayaḥ puruhūtaviṣayamārurukṣavo yathāsukhamṛjunānena vartmanādhirohantu | yasyaivaṃ prayojane na buddhiḥ priyaṃ(cā ? vā)jīvita(vya?)m, ṛṇaṃ vā(na ? ni)staraṇīyam, arapavanā(?) vā santatiraparipūrṇā vā manorathāḥ, atṛptaṃ vā cittamacirāhṛte kaḷatre, yo vā pitrore(ka)putraḥ, yasmin vāpyasau viparyate(?) guru kuṭumbaṃ, yasya vā tapasi śraddhā, yo vā lokānamūnupāyāntareṇa jigīṣati sa itaḥ prati(ni)vartatām, ityevameva ghoṣaṇāṃ vyādideśa |

tathā ca patyau kṛtavacasi maryādopa(si ? sṛ)ṣṭastaptahemāvadāto vṛttalambabāhuḥ pṛthuloraḥsthalo vṛkṣaprāṃśuraṅgarājaḥ siṃhavarmā nāma rājakasya hṛdayamuddharpayannuddhruradhvanidhārā(dharā?)vadhīrita(dhīra ? dhārādhara)dhvanirbaddhabhrukuṭirabhyadhatta——satyamidaṃ yadāha devaḥ kṣatraṃ nāma vikrāntamatitaraṃ niṣprayojanaṃ tilaṃ hi mānuṣyamānaśūnyaḥ puruṣo na ca māna(?) parāvalepānupekṣate | sa ca varākaḥ śriyamabhimukhāgatāṃ bhraṃśayati, śarajjyotsnāmantarayati, amṛtakulyāmullaṅghayati, malayamārutaṃ vyavadadhāti, pārijātaparimalaprasaṅge nāsāpuṭaṃ pidadhāti, vasantopavanapraveśe cakṣuḥ saṃmīlayati, candanacarcāpātane kañcukaṃ paridhatte, yo mano(gra?)rathaśataprārthitopasthitaṃ raṇamahotsavamananubhūya pratinivartate | kastādṛśaḥ khalu puruṣaḥ kutsitaḥ | na tathaite bhūpatayaḥ | jāsipratibaddhameṣāṃ harīṇāmiva bhinnamadavāraṇaṃ śauryam | naisargikamabhrāṇāmiva sarvāśoparodhi garjitam | autpattikamāśīviṣāṇāmivānyaduḥsahaṃ mahāpratāpānimanam (?) | svābhāvikaṃ kalpāntanabha(va?)svatām (iva) kṣitibhṛtkulacūrṇanakṣamaṃ balam | ālmādhīnamudadhīnāmivodāravārigrāsaghasmaraṃ tejaḥ | tathā caiṣāṃ bhrūbhaṅgo na śatrubhaṅgaṃ vyabhicarati | ghanādharasphuraṇamarivadhūdakṣiṇekṣaṇasphuraṇaṃ na lalāṭasvedodgatiḥ pratijaḍaṃ jīvitodgatirnarasaṃrambhadṛṣṭidīptirna ca maulikampo vipakṣa......ṭīṃ bhrukuṭirārohatyatra karoti keḷikāḷarātrividhūrdavāṅkuraprakara iva vikramarasakādudyate kapolasthalīṣu romodgamo′tra krīḍati labdhvā......kharāṇi lohitāyantyo garvadṛṣṭayo′tra cāsau racayanti caraṇarāgaṃ lakṣmīśabarī(?) | na caite bāṇāsaneṣviva ratnāsaneṣu niṣa......va rājyaphaleṣu bhūrispṛhāḥ | na khaṅgadhārātoyeṣvi(ha?)va bhṛṅgāradhārātoyeṣu pipāsavaḥ | na lohitacarcāpātaneṣviva kuṅkumacarcā.....ṇodaśravaṇeṣu paryutsukāḥ | na mṛtyudarśena iva mṛtyudarśanabaddharāgāḥ(?) | na vraṇapaṭṭabandheṣviva sāmantapaṭṭabandheṣavabhimāninaḥ | na kadalikāvaneṣviva pramadavaneṣu......śramai......ṇo na śa(rī?)ratalpeṣviva śerate′ṅga talpeṣu sukhasvapnakāḥ sujanomānakesarivāṃsapañjara(?)jarāsandhavṛkodarānusāriṇo dharāpatayaḥ | sa tu tvadādeśe nāstyamīṣāṃ duṣkaraṃ nāma | śīthunivāsaraktotpalānudadhīnapyudaurvahutabhujaḥ(?) satṛṣṇamāpibeyuḥ | latā iva sakusumā diśo′pi sphuritagrahatārakāḥ salīlamāvarjayeyuḥ | cakramiva hṛdayamudayaraktaṃ pataṅga(ma)ṅgulyā bhrāmayeyuḥ | puṇḍarīkamiva samṛṇālaṃ sitamayūkhaṃ mṛgāṅkamuttaṃsakaṃ racayeyuḥ | mahīsamuddharaṇamapi mahāvarāhabhuktojjhitamiti nādriyante | kulagirisamutsāraṇamapi cānyena dhanurbalocchiṣṭamiti na bahumanyante | sakalabhuvanabhasmīkaraṇamapi kalpānalaprahatamiti sukurupakṣe(?) sthāpayanti | kā punareṣāṃ puruṣasiṃhānāmatsalarikulagrahaṇe(?) gaṇanā | yattu nivṛttikāraṇatvenopa yastaṃ devena, tatraitaccintyam | samara(ṇa?)maraṇe saṃśayitaḥ svarga iti, śāstrasyātiśaṅkāyāṃ yāgādiṣvapi tat samānam | priyaṃ jīvitamiti, tatpūrvameva tvatvasukṛtaiḥ(?) kṛtam | ṛṇaṃ nistara(ma?)ṇīyamiti, balavad bhartṛpiṇḍasyānṛṇyam | anutpannā santatiriti, sulabhaiva sthāsnuratra riktā santatiḥ(?) | apūrṇāḥ kāmā iti, naitattvayyavanikalpatarau | na tṛptā dāre (dvī ? ṣvi)ti, raṇatyāgānnivṛttapuṃstvasya kiṃ dāraiḥ | pitrorekaputra iti, tena pitarau jīvaputrau yaḥ soṣmā | kuṭumbama(hā ? nā)thamiti kaḥ sacetā bāhyasya kṛte svamātmānamupahanti | tapaścarāmīti, taccirakleśaṃ kṛśaphalaṃ ca | śakyamupāyāntareṇāpi paro loko jetumiti, ko′sau jayaprakāro yo nāgūkarṇananiśitanistriṃśamanādhānamanākṛṣṭavikaṭacāpacakraṃ preritaprāsarpaṇakaṇayaśaktitomaramanu(?) mriyate | tade(hi ? bhi)rāplāvaya praḷayakālaiva mahāvalāhakairunmattagarjitāśanibhiruccakrāpacakrakoṭibhiḥ kakubhāṃ cakravālam | adya śvo vā bhavatu bhayaṅkaramarinarapatikulaśikha(ro ? ra)makuṭabhārabharitabhūtalamudbhinnavipulavidrumalatāvitānacchannama(dyā ? dhyā)bhogamekodabhūtamiva caturambhorāśivalayamityupararāma | itare′pi tarasvino yathāyathaṃ rājalakṣmīlīlāsaṅgītamṛdaṅgaghoṣagambhīramabhirayorajava(?)janitajagajjvaraṃ jagarjuḥ |

ta(ko ? tho)parateṣu ghanagarjiteṣu, praśānteṣu puraḥśvasaneṣu, galitendragopataralarāgāsu prasannāsu gaṇḍasthalīṣu śucimukhakamalavilāsalakṣmīnū purakhānukāriṇā svareṇa balādhikṛte nidhāya cakṣurvyājahāra rājahaṃsaḥ——kaccidvicitā samarabhūmiriti | sa tu praṇamya vyajñāpayat——deva! vicitaiveyam ito gorutamātrā mivātikramya samāsāravatyabhimatarasavarṇagandhasaṃsthānānuddhātinyabhaṅgurā bhayarathānamākhucatra(?)grāhiṇyasthāṇuśvabhrakardamā samāhṛtasyāpi sarvajagatprāṇisamudayasya svairaparivartanakṣamā yā.....ẏuddhāyeva buddhipūrvamiva nirmitā bhūmiriti |

atha mahīpatiḥ kasyacidvacoharasya mukhe vayamidānīṃ (bhavat?) bhavatprārthi(nā ? tā)nāmaprahatā araṇye′sminnābhogavati sa.....ṭa iti mālaveśvarāyasandiśya śvaḥ prakṛṣṭaṃ hastyaśvaṃ darśayetyādiśya balādhikṛtaṃ kṛtasadovisarjano biveśāntaḥpuram | anuṣṭhitadiva.....ṣare vāsarakamale varuṇadigvadhūmukhāruṇādharalekhāṃ bha(ga)vatīmupāsya sandhyāmuddāmatamasi bhannatejali saṅkupitanabhasi(?) vikāsikābhi.....ḍhasi nīḍanilīnapatatriṇi dattakauśikamudi kumudabhāsini tanumaruti rativaraprajātanaiśajyotiṣi pradoṣasamaye kṛtayathocitakṛtyaḥ śayā.....ẏāmeti yamayitumudayamāne timiramaruṇatejasi, tarukimalayamāsini kusumalavaprabhāsini(?) prāleyakaṇamuci mṛdu carati prabhātamārute, rutamukharamukhe diśo daśa prayātumuddhūyoddhūya sajjayati patrāṇi patrarathamaṇḍale, smayamānāsu kamalinīṣu, mandāyamāne kumudavane, vandimaṅgalagītibhiḥ pratibuddho dinamukhocitamavasāyya niyamavidhimanuṣṭhitapratikarmā nirgatya vividhasāradārughaṭitaniyogamupari racitaślakṣṇamṛttikātalamupahārakusumapuñjakañcukitaṃ mañcamāruhya sāpāśrayaparistomopaviṣṭo niṣṭaptakanakadaṇḍavikaṭamāyūrātapatramaṇḍalanivāritātapaḥ katipayāptasāmantaparivṛto vāravilāsinībhujalatoddhūyamānacāmarapavananartyamānakuṭilakuntalāgraḥ svarga iva sureśvaro nareśvaraḥ sukhamavātiṣṭhata | yasya svatejasā dedīpyamānasya pratibimbamivāmbarasamudrasaṃkrāntaṃ bālā (rtha ? rka) bimbamālakṣyate |

tataḥ kṣaṇāt puraḥ pravṛttapattikalakalāpijalajhaṅkāra(?)ghoracaṇḍaravonnīyamānāgamano vainateya iva svargavārtātrāsavidrutāśeṣanāgalokaśca svaprabhū bhuna(?) bhujakampanairbhañjanabhayavihvalairivāsannānokahairanumīyamānabahalabalakarṣo bahalasindūrarāgasandhyopāttamastako′staśailabala(?)sakalatejasvirājamaṇḍalāstamayāya sthiranibaddhaiḥ pādairupasthitaḥ sphuṭaprahārayogyadīrdhapīnakarāṅgulikalitacāru(su ? pu)ṣkaraḥ pramāṇayuktamadhuravaṃśapaṇavako ramaṇī(ya)śravaṇatālaśabda unmattamadhupakāminīgītanādaśobhiśubhavitānaviśeṣakāntidarśitaśṛṅgāraloko jaṅgama iva saṅgītamaṇḍapaścitra(pa)danyāsavibhramāyā rājalakṣmyāḥ, naisargikavairasaṃbhavamṛditamṛgapatisita(paṭṭā ? saṭā)tantusantā(na)saṃveṣṭitayoriva raśmijālajaṭilayorīṣādaṇḍakāntajorutsaṅganiṣaṇṇalakṣmīviṣṭarakamaladuktamadhudhārāsikayorivātisnigdhayorālokasarasi kaṭakaṭalaṅkhanīkarṇatālamaruttaraṅgiteṣu muhurmuhuḥ pipāsayeva lohāñcitaṃ(?) gamanamullāsayan madhumaṇicaṣakayugaḷamiva madavṛddhaye kenāpyabhimukhāvasthāpitabhāpiṅgalaṃ locanayugaḷaṃ dadhānaḥ pratikuñjarapratāpānalapānaḥdiva lohitoṣṭhatālujihvo muhurmuhurjayeṣu di(kṣya ? kca)krabhramārūḍhatayā ullikhitamiva rūpadehamudvahan vaṃsakriyārthivālambinīṃ bālapallavamañjarīṃ bhartṛbhaktyā sparśayan mahīṃ vigrahaḥ kuṭakena saha(?) bhramannantarāntarā samāghrāyānyāṃ gajapadavīmagaṇitādhoraṇamasūyayā sācīkṛtya (ma ? pa)daṃ tatra cikuritākṣaṃ mukhamīṣa(ti ? di)va sitvā(?) punarapi svecchayā pratiṣṭhamānaḥ, śrīparvata iveśvarasambhāvitaḥ, kailāsa iva rājatātmā, (ma)ndara iva suvarṇaśṛṅgo, maināka iva svapakṣarakṣākṣamo, malaya iva dakṣiṇodyataḥ, sahya ivāparāntayogī, vindhya iva śirastaṭānumeyakumbhasambhavagauravaḥ, pavanaja(nma i ? nme)vopādānakṣamo, himaśaila ivodagrakāntaikaprakṛtiḥ, udaya parva(ta) iva purastāducchritaḥ, sarvabhūdharasamā(na)sāraścara ivāparaḥ parvatendro nirmitaḥ prajāpatinā, adya durnivāro′pi svavagrahaḥ, kāmavānapyanaṅgahīnaḥ sākṣikūṭo′pi sādhuvṛttakaraḥ kapolalambiṣaṭcaraṇo′pyaviṣaya......ṣāpi svabhāvabhavo limpanniva tejasā taṃ pradveśamāsasāda dviredendro hemakūṭaḥ |

sphuritapakṣaṃ pakṣarājayo rājakānanakamalakānana(?).....ṭaṃ ca nandanamivānimiṣaprekṣyaṃ prekṣamāṇaḥ kṣoṇīpatiḥ paraṃ parabaladurjayamevājīgaṇat | sāranaitṛsāntvalālitaśca kāni kānyapyamṛtamayānīvā.....ṇaḥ tena pāti cīyamāṇaṃ(?) pṛthvīpatimanuvartamānaḥ prāptarūpaṃ vacanamitthaṃ vyājahāra prāñjalirbalādhikṛtaḥ——paśya deva! divi divākarajighṛkṣayeva kuliśa......vyādadāti nāgarājo mukham | asya cāsau salilaparyastakadāma(?)vaktracchadasyāyāmavān vikramasamayajṛmbhamāṇanārāyaṇacaraṇānukārī surasindhudhavalaśīkarābhiṣiktaḥ sarvāneva dānavān bhīṣayate janaṃ (?)jayadhvajāyamāno hastadaṇḍaḥ | komalakālu (?)rāgavarṣiṇī ca padyarāgamaṇiguheva hemakūṭasya dṛśyate mukhamahādarī | (nā ? na)rdano′yaṃ bṛhaduromaṇirmadaguṇadurdhareṇa guruṇā balena (gu ? yu)kto guptamaṇḍalaḥ kharaturagaśakaṭanāgamardano mahāghoṣamātiṣṭhati | kāmīvāyaṃ kāntā(ra?)pīnastanāntaryavyasto guṇairna rañjayati pārśvayorivāyamubhayapakṣavartinormainākavainateyayorapi labdhasāmyasoyamaṃsa iva pratāpe′pyupacitaskandha iva sthiratare yaśasyapi prathīyānasyacetumindrāśanipātaghorastanayitnukriyāsahasya valāhakasyeva mūrtirullasadaviralabindujālakāsvāyatavyāyatāyatacchavirakṛśamṛju suvṛttaṃ cāsya gātraṃ paraṃ satkalatramiva gurutaramapi bhāraṃ laghuvadudvahati(?) | śaradambha ivānāvilaṃ, devayānīyauvanamiva kacavivarjitaṃ, maṇitalamiva vānupadigdhaślakṣṇaṃ vilahantaprohapali(?)pādamasya lakṣyate | snehamārdavopapannamapi śilīmukhā(bā ? pā)tadāruṇaṃ dvitvasaṃkhyāvacchinnamapyanantabhedamanyonyasamaṃ digvadhūcumbikarṇapallavayugalamapi khuravipulapalakṣiptāntarasnigdhacaraṇaruhāpadeśādityabhītyā svapādāśritaṃ viṃśakarikṛtve vaiṣapatte candramanyāṅganirākṛtasyākaruyeva kāśyasyāvakāśaṃ dadātyasodaramatikaṭhorāhaṅkāranirvāsitā bhayena sūkṣmībhūya snigdharomacchadādekaikanirgatā iva mṛduvartayaḥ(?) | sa cāyaṃ bhayasthāneṣvabhīrustejasāṃ nidhirityarthavedī vaśyakrodhaḥ śūro medhāvī śīlavānakarkaśo yuddharatirasantāpī kṣitimivāvatīrṇastvatprabhāvādairāvato vāraṇapatiḥ | apyevāsya dikkuñjarakulapratipakṣaṃ kṣapayedayaṃ, apināmudayakūṭaṃ(?) śatruhastināmiti |

atha tasminnaradevena svahastopahṛtapuṇḍrekṣukāṇḍasambhāvite prayāte punarapare′pi karipatayaḥ krameṇopatasthuḥ | kecidalikulakalitadānapaṭṭikāśyāmagaṇḍadeśāḥ, taruṇatamālapallavasvastarustīrṇamaṇiśilāpaṭṭikā iva raṇaratikṣamāḥ kīpalāḥ(?) kecidani......krībhūtamāpidāho suyamāna(?)pāṭalamukhapaṭāṃśukāḥ sphuritāśanipallavā iva lokasaṃharaṇadāruṇāḥ pralayakālajaladharāḥ, kecidālambitamahāvarāhalīlā iva bhuvamavāṅmukhaṃ nityadaśanakoṭyā dārayantaḥ, kecidāhvayamānā iva harīnākulīkṛtamahāmahībhṛtkaṭakamabhi(ga)rjantaḥ, kecidāya(ta)hastapādasaṃveṣṭamānajanapa(ṭāṃ ? dāḥ) kāladūtā iva paribhramantaḥ, kecidupāyanabhūtapraviṣṭalokālābhāṃ(?) duḥkhāddīrghaśūtkāranibhena niṣprayojanaṃ javamivodgirantaḥ, kecidalasānekaparuṣabāhyaparighabhañjanasarabhasā daśanabhaṅgaśaṅkayā niryāṇabhāginīpāka(?)niṣṭhurāṅkuśakeḷibhiravanatapūrvakāyaiḥ saprayāsamādhoraṇairnivāryamāṇāḥ, kecidabhihatabhāgīrathītīrabhittibhāgoddhūtadhūlipaṭalama(nna ? gna)mūrtayaḥ krodhānaladhūmadhūmrā ivo......bhasadattavistīrṇamastakāghātapātyamānacaityānokahāḥ pratikuñjarasannipātayogyamivācarantaḥ sa(ka?)śaṃkhāḥ saghaṇṭāpuṭāḥ saḍiṇḍimāḥ sahema.....ẏā iva lāvaṇyamayā iva rāgamayā ivāhaṅkāramayā ivāvaṣṭambhamayā iva bhadraprāyā mandamadadharmānvayā durmṛgasvabhāvāḥ kīrtimahauṣadhihima......pi kṣitipālaṃ nayanahāri cakruścakravālamiva diśāmātmotsedhena saṃkṣipanto mātaṅgapatayaḥ

tāṃśca darśayan balādhyakṣaḥ kṣitipatipa......vanaprajātāḥ prakāmāvagāḍhaṃ bhīradī.....ḍīrikāṃbhasaṅkaluṣetarakālatoyayāyinaḥ kauśikītīrakaśakāśavanavilocanāḥ kālamahīvihāriṇaḥ kamramā......vitatalauhityatīrāgarutayarutvacaḥ(?)kambukasarasarāgāḥ sarabhasavaprakrīḍayoddhūtasaikatavisaradhūsaritapūrvasāgarāḥ vidhuritavāripatrarathasthā(?) jalasthalāsphālavyasaninaḥ kapikapilakapimatitaṭotsaṅgapratiśṛṅgabhaṅgasaṅginaḥ(?) paṅkaja(rṣa?)kumudaṣaṇḍopagūhagomatījalātivāhitanidāghamadhyandināḥ dinavidāhadrāvitahimaśilārasaughapūraśiśirabhāgīrathīparāyaṇā radanakhaṇḍitabāndhavādrisānavo navaghanabhāracāruvaivāhitabhūbhṛtprāgbhāgacarā guṇitacaraṇalaṅghitatuṅgaśṛṅgotsaṅgadhūta(thā ? dhā)tudhūlisthagitagorathagirayaḥ kālidakākālakīṭakāśikosalakirātapuṇḍramallamaladamagadhāṅgavaṅgaparyantagocarā vanaha(?)svabhāvādanatibahula(dānā?) dānavegā manāgavāgrā rabhasonnādino nātipraśastapārṣṇinakhadantotsaṅgodaraśikharoṣṭhīkya(?)śravaṇā manīhantarabṛhadvamanto(?) (mahā?)mahāvaṃśāḥ pṛthuhastāḥ pecakino vyāyāmaviluptaśaithilyadoṣā vijayakarmajanitaśauryāśca tadvanajamataṅgajottamāḥ samāhṛtāḥ |

ete cedikarūśakānanodbhavā revāśoṇaprasavasevinaḥ pūrvāparasamudrevalāvihāriṇaḥ kolāhalakaṭakabandhayuddhakolāhalā radanollikhitamālyagiriśikharabhūmayo gandhakṣaṇabhagnadhuṇḍuśailaṣaṇḍadrumā madavikaṭamayūranṛttācāryamandragarjitā nirjjharajalaśīkarāṅkitanitambaśaivālajātaśītaśaivālaśailasāmavanapīpita(?)gharmatāpāḥ priyanāgapriyaprasthakarāścaitidihaparvatadeśānandinakaśikarśyamūkavanasamṛddhayo(?) bha(ṅga ? gna)bhāgīrathītaṭāstaṃsāmūlapanasabhañjanāstamasātāmarasavisarasāsvādalampaṭāḥ prabhlagātīravanamṛgātakavāhino(?) lājagaurabījakairavakabalalālitā lasadaudumbarīkaṭodumbarakadambakampanāḥ pampāpānadohalino muktābhaṅgaśubhraśuktimatījalavihārā muktasaktayaḥ kālaśyāmapriyāyāḥ(?) kṣodravarṇadantāstūrṇagāminastuṅgānanāścaṇḍāścārucaraṇā nātyāyatāśca nāgavarāḥ |

ta ime dāśārṇakāraṇyayonayaḥ sūnava iva yamunāyāḥ samā(va?)navarṇāḥ, bhartāra iva vetravatyāstadbhogāvitṛṣṇāḥ suhṛda iva sukaracchāyā(?)svarasāvarjitāḥ, bhṛtyā iva citramālyavanyā nityāsevanābhiyuktāḥ, vaiṇā iva veṇuvatyā veṇuśabdābhisāriṇaḥ, vatsabhūmivatsalāḥ sthūlavaktrahastāḥ sūkṣmaviralabindavo vipulaśiraḥśirodharāḥ viśālotsaṅgadantāḥ dīrghapuṣkarāṅgulayo dṛḍhaprahāraśīlā madhupiṅgalanayanā madagaṇḍavārijātārdramodāḥ(?) prakāmavṛddhapaścārdhāḥ prāyaṇyāma(?)padmavarṇā mattakariṇaḥ |

(e)te yudhyamānatridaśāsuragātrabhaṅgabhagnaśikharimaṇḍalakhacitabhūmau tadasṛksahapatitasattvasārā tanvayadi......vardhanadrumalatātṛṇodgamagatyāṅkareyake(?) vane samutpannā nālikātīrakarṇikāranāgavṛkṣaplakṣapravālakulakabaḷabhakṣiṇo viśālarūpaśalmalīśalma.....ṣindhurodhodhavaladhanvamadhūkanyagrodhagṛdhravaḥ parātīratibukatini(?) ekamedamodakīkṣīritāparuṣaśirīṣāśvatthaśvetava......valāgnibahukrāntanuvṛndārakekṣupālikākāṇḍeṣu śṛṅgāṭakarasanālanāḷikānalanaitālanalapotikaratāḥ sika.....ṇakaṭamanu......kāmuktāḥ kuñjākuñjagarbhavrīhiśālūkalopataḥ kabalitohākacchapābāṇabhedikādalitakākaṇḍupatikāgrahanāgrahastahastiśyāmākārā(?).....ḍhvastajambuvanāśchinnaśīrṇaśreṣṭhavatītaṭaśleṣmātakadrumā mathitalū(la ? na)vasumatītīravānīravañjulā dantadattasṛprāvapraṃvātarīyataya(?).....ṇīrodhasaṅkarabhatārabhavomuyaitamālāmalonmūlinaḥ(?) piñchāsaikatakarabhañjanāḥ kāntāvantikāmāḥ bhramānandālolasāmandanandathayo(?) vyāghrīnavoghāghrā......ṇaścullakapikallolalīlolla sinaḥ śatabhāgābhogabhājaḥ bhuñjārodhorajaḥpriyātaptaparāpālilabdhasvairasuptayaḥ svairaśvikapāriyātrakambakāsu sūpakūṭaparvatapātapraṣṭhavaiṣadhūryavāsantapuṣpagirisitagiriṇāmrakṣavantaśca(?)kakṣeṣvakṣayasya bhogasyāsmadupārairvismitāni rūpadehamṛtatvacaḥ kalālāpilakṣayabhāgāṃ svakṣāyuddhādhvabhāradakṣiṇā(?) pramāṇabalaśarīrasattvasampannā lohitoṣṭhatālujihvā mahāvarāhakariprāyāḥ śīghradīrghakramādhenukānamīkā snigdharomāṇonnatādhanyabhogyā tu(?) gandhakariṇaḥ |

ta ime kāliṅgavanajanmānaḥ kaliṅgotkalamahiṣakāndhakacchakakuḍumbapunnādhaprāṅkaṇakeralacolapāṇḍyānnarapāṇḍya(?)paryantacāri(ṇa)stailāmikṣumatīṃ laṅkāṃ vaitaraṇīṃ mahoṣāmaṣavatīṃ nakranavāṃ śuṣkanadīṃ śvasenāṃ veṇāṃ kṛṣṇaveṇāṃ suprayogāṃ godāvarīṃ cūrṇīṃ sūkarikāṃ sannīrāṃ praveṇīṃ vaisyāṃ tāmraparṇīṃ kuñjāṃ kumārīṃ dakṣiṇodadhimagastyatīrthaṃ mānasaṃ saraḥ(?) sūkṣmaromocchvāsāḥ supratiṣṭhitaśiraso parā jaghanāvarā mahāśarīropaskāvaṣṭhavantaḥ(?) kalaviṅganayanā nīcairvṛttasusthitacaraṇanakhamṛdvāyatahastadaṇḍā dīrghakeśavā(lamā ? lā) dīrghādhvakṣamāḥ ślikṣa(?) kṣutpipāsāsahiṣṇavo jahāḥ(?) saṃhatā balino′nvarthavedinaḥ skandadarā(?)stāmratālujihvoṣṭhā ma(su ? dhu)sannibhaviṣāṇā dhanuḥsavarṇasuvaṃśāḥ pīnāyatapṛthu(ca ? la)grīvāḥ svalpaniṣkośāḥ supecakāḥ kriyāsvalpadoṣā niṣparihāṇayaḥ padmaprāyāḥ parabalāvamardinaḥ prakṛtyudagrāḥ prekṣaṇī(ya)vigrahāśca vāraṇapatayaḥ |

te′mī punaraparāntakavanabhuvaḥ preharāmurarayo (bho ? go)dāvarīdāruvarṇayorbāṇāmūṇayornirābhaimarathyoḥ parāmadhukrandayordamanatāpinaitambayoḥ karirilāṅgalaghātakayoranyāsu ca mahānadīṣu labdharatayaḥ mandarakumudakṛṣṇagirisahyatuṅgavaramatyamarthaṃ(?) parvatānāṃ prasthāṭavikapratibaddheṣu jāṅgaloddeśeṣu ghṛtamadhulājatailapūrvāpaṇikāścāraṃ cāraṃ jātadarpāḥ cakrāṭakeṣu vālikeṣu darbheṣūmābhakṣiṇo markaṭakamuta(?)yavagodhūmaśyāmākapriyaṅguvratādhikabalitotkālānalapalāśikākaṃdalīvīraṇamarucelavotsarṇavāke pārṣṇīkākalā ca duṣṭavānīkāśatraputragrāsaḥ(?) śataparvācarviṇo pitrā śrīrāḥ saptapratiṣṭhitāḥ(?) sthirodagradīrghoṣṭhabālapīnanda.....ṭāmahotsaṅkamṛktvasamatvacaḥ(?) kamalagandhiprabhedā hrasvagrīvāḥ parāścāpavaracāruvaṃśāḥ śyāmadṛṣāpadāḥ(?) śūramāninaḥ sunayanāḥ svavanarānniṇaśca......vrataḥ(?) sarasvatyantardhānoddeśaṃ cāśritāḥ sarasvatīṃ kaśerumatīṃ nyaṅgrumatīṃ nīlaguhāṃ vṛtraghnīṃ pārṣṇimatīṃ pūrimaha....r̤evatakaṃ dāśārṇamāṇicaraṃ koñjamarbudamūrjayantaḥ anyāśca marubhiraniviṣṭhapatasyabhāvāṃ tanuromacaraṇanakhaśravaṇatvacastanusthiparuṣa(?)......pi duṣparājayāḥ suvibhaktāḥ (svaple ? supe)cakāścaṇḍā mṛda(dho ? vo) madhyamāyāmāḥ śikṣāvipaktikāriṇaḥ karmaniṣpattiśobhinaḥ prāyeṇātidīrghāyuṣo mṛ......ñcanadāraṇyasañcāriṇo ramyahradāmirāvatīṃ vi(vi ? pā)śāṃ vitastāṃ śatadruṃ candrabhāgāṃ sindhudevikasarasvatīṃ ca bhavatīṃ(?) himavataśca pādāṅkurakṣetropakaṇṭhāt kālakāvanaṃ cādhyuṣitavantastadanu daśadagātrāparabindavaḥ sthiracaraṇanakhāḥ prāṇavatā(?) bṛhatprohāḥ pra(du ? kṛ)ṣṭapecakā vipulāṃsā bahalatvaco valītatāḥ sthūlaromotkṛṣṭā durmedhaso durādhārakarmāṇaḥ śūrāḥ śūkalaprāyāḥ svalpādhikā bahuśramāḥ sotkaṇṭhadhyānaśīlāḥ nigrahevakaladviṣastaddhanaprakṛṣṭāstvatprabhāvotkṛṣṭā(?) dvirada(na?)gaṇāḥ |

tatraike pittavātakaphasamīrasaṃsargajanmāno madaṃ(ka?) śaradi nidāghe hemante prāvṛṣi vasante ca sarvadā visṛjanti | adya tvanalatrāsādanyagajanirbhayādāyudhābhighātāt parātyabhidhruvā(?)datigurubhārāvadhādgaṇḍagajamadagaṇḍābhyardanāvasnehena karmaṇā vātipīḍanādvaśāsu rāgābhisaraṇahariṇatād (?)madaprakṛtimavabudhya pra(to)dena prayogādanyato vāraṇādaṣṭabhūtyahaste svakṛtamādabhṛdbhakṣiṇaśca pañcamayā(?) samakṣepadakṣairyoktṛbhirupacaritāḥ kabalīkṛtaiḥ pūtikārakhusīvirgotyariṣṭa(?)sinduvāratairakasphotāja(ti ? ṭi)gṛdhrakarṇikāravīraiḥ rasavañjulanīpasaubhāñjanāṅkolanaktamālaiḥ saubhāñjanamūlapūrikā(ka?)kaṇṭālikāpaṭolatva(ji ? gbhiḥ)nimbabilvaraṇapūti(kā ? ka)rṇamūlasaptaparṇatva(ji ? gbhi)rvaraṇatthagaraḷanaktamā(lāḥ ? la)kroṣṭuvañculaśalakai(?)rnimbairaṇḍapūtikaiḥ ślakṣṇacūrṇitaiścāśvagandhāvigandha(ga ? ka)ṭumatsyakairlavaṇamiśrairnirūhaṇaiśca kaṭutumbiloṇikādantyakṣipīlannai(?)rnaktamārlākakandajātarū(ṣa ? pa)kamadanaphalaiḥ pañcalavaṇasamāṃśairdatiramyapratinubhuṇḍī(?)bṛhatikāphalaiśca kṣuṇṇaiḥ pippakīśṛṅgiveraharidrāvacāhiṅgubhiśca lavaṇaiḥ pūtikapicumandaśigrudīrdhavṛntakairloṇikālava(la ? lī)dantyarkataruṇakaiśca piṇḍamodakaiḥ śodhiteṣu kāyeṣu punaḥ saṃvartanayakabalairjambūniculāragvathatvagbhirjambūkisalayaiśca samūlalābhābdakaiḥ(?) kṛtasaṃvartena tato bṛṃhaṇīyakabalaiḥ kākolīkṣīrakākolījīvakarṣa(vikā ? bhaka)śṛṅgividārikairaṇḍakaṇṭakārikāmadhuśi(grāḥ ? gru)samūlasahāsahadevākacchurimūlasāribāgalocīmadhukaśaśabindukopairjayantīśukanasākākajaṅkhīcitrakakṣīrakāśubhragandhāndhakabandhujīvakakaśorukavisamṛṇātikṣapaṃ(?) citrakabalahulāni dhānyayasānītyebhiḥ(?) kṣīṇopaghātakaiḥ kramapravecite prāyāṃ ca śobhāvaṃ caturthyāṃ vyāptyā(?) ramaṇīyakabalaiśca daṃṣṭrāśvetapuṣpavarṣābhūtaṇḍulīyakapiṇḍāla(laka ? lakā)madhukamārkavakākamācīprapacīvalaṅgalocīsapta( ? )māṣaparṇīmudgaparṇī (bhu ? mu)ñjā.....ṃallibhallātakapatrākamalekakarika(?)vṛścikālītyevamādibhirupatamyopapasthite made prāpaṇīpakabalanāsphotottamakarṇikāgirikarṇamuñjāvallīmamūlapallavo(?) madhu......piṇḍālukīgalocīsaptaparṇikātvacaḥ soñjaṭaka(?)mūlamātaluṃgamātmaguptāki.....ṭatṛṇaśūlyalāṅgalakīkirāsī(?) kandamarkaśvavarṣaniṣpāvā.....ṃāmalakaṃ gūkadambamorupāṭalīvāparyā(?)mūlamityetānanyāṃśca dattvā....r̤ṇapuṣpikape......kaiḥ kadalīmūlaśattaparvāsabhāsasahasadovādiḥ(?) pratidinaprapīyamānaiśca lāṅgalīmūlaśukanasāso.....ṇopitāsarṣapaiśca prasthaśaḥ prattaiḥ pattūrakuṭajasaptaparṇapracīvalaiśca madhusammitaiḥ saptaparṇagave(thu ? dhu)kakuṭamatsyadārdura......pūrṇaka.....ṇnalakadalīnaktamāla mūlabhū(ta?)kadambakaśeruśṛṅkāṭakaiḥ ketakamūla(ku ? gu)ñjāprasthavṛścikālībhiśca madhuraktābhiruśīramallikāmūlotpalagulaiśca surā.....ṭeryaśaḥ vratairyathoktābhiśca kā(?) śodhanagulikābhiścitrābhiśca kaṭakavastrībhiḥ kṛtaprabhedanāḥ punaragnikāśmimarnthākacitrakailāhastiparkapatīmūlatirāsīkandaramarīcipaṇirjakakapotapaṅkāsaubhañjanakavalairañjanaiśca(?) nānāvidhaiḥ pradīpitāḥ salokapālasakalabhuvanasārasandohasaṃbhṛtena pitāmahānugrahāt pavitra....l̤ena pañcāśatsirāpathāntaravirahiṇā guṇodrekeṇa doṣāṇāṃ rasamaṇḍalena mahābhūtānāṃ prasādotkarṣeṇa dhātūnāṃ viṣyandena vṛkṣasya svarūpeṇaujasāṃ bāhulyena balasya pramāṇena mansthitāyāḥ prakarṣeṇa.....ṣya saṃśrayeṇa somasya janmabhuvā javasya sthānena ratyā lakṣaṇena vyañjanena vīryasya darpaṇena darpasya tejanena tejasaḥ protsāhanenotsāhasya sādhanena saumyatāyāḥ kāraṇena kānteḥ saṃsthena....r̤yasyākāreṇābhirūpatāyāssaṃbhavena sahiṣṇubhāvasya samudayena saundaryasya sarvasvena lakṣmyā gandhaguṇaiścandanāgarujāticūtake......priyaṅgucampakośīrasaptaparṇadramilapadmakuvalayotpalahīratālīhaṅgulukīsaktabhūmiparimalabharitaṃ saktumayamiva samāpādayatā ma(dane ? dena) tridhā niba.....ṇa dehīpyamānā mṛtyorapi ka....r̤aru trāsaparavaśaṃ palāyanaśakti(m, ki)mutasapatnapakṣasya |

ete punarambukāmā vaprapāṃsu(bhi)rā(girṇo ? kīrṇā) lakṣyamāṇacchavimasādāḥ phenāyamānaraktalocanāḥ surabhiniśvāsinaḥ susamunnaddhakaṭi(ṭo ? taṭāḥ) ghrāṇapragṛhyamāṇahastā vijṛmbhaṇavyasaninaḥ paryāptapūrṇadīptavaktrā ratiṣu staṃbhakrīḍinaḥ śabdādiṣu baddhabhāvā liṅgamupasthitānāmudvahanti dantinaḥ |

ete sajānikalakāyā(?) pramada eva prathamayā madāvasthayā pravartitaprasa(ca?)nnacakṣūrāgāḥ prasannasaumanasyāḥ karavivaragaladaviralasurabhiniśvāsaśreṇayo gaṇḍadeśaparāmarśinaḥ kāntabṛṃhitāśca pravilasantyanekapāḥ |

punarime dvitīyāyāmārudrakalevālikānāmāvasthāmatyarthavijṛmbhamāṇādhikāmāḥ pūrvaṇa(?)vadanaśobhāṃ vāśitāmivātihetumanupatanti |

ete tu taruṇamadākrāntasamagadāḥ pareṣvavisraṃbhiṇo′dhonibandhayāvasthayā garvitavijṛṃbhitaiḥ prabhramanti himarūpāḥ kiraṇatathāte tatprabhṛtyā(?) iva sarvakarmasu mūḍhatvavijñānatayā niḥśaṅkādeśyāḥ kramatvādiva sarāgajṛṣṭayo bhadrataye(?) krodhe′pi śāsanamanativartamānā balayogādiva madapāṭavasuratayo mānabhānāgata(?) |

e(vaṃ ? te) tejo′jasramudvamanto meghā iva sagarjitavijṛṃbhamāṇāḥ mārutā iva vegenottamena lāghavaṃ prathayante | bhṛṅgamālāmiva gaṇḍacāriṇīṃ madāvasthāmudvahanti |

ete punarasurā iva prāṇidarśaṃ jighāṃsanto madamūḍhāḥ krodhanadaśāṃ darśayanti |

amī punarāviṣṭā ivonmādena yatra tatra śabdāra.....ḍarpadhārāmiva kṣarantaḥ krodhavarṣamivossṛjanto vṛkṣairapi yudhyamāṃnā vṛthaiva naktaṃdinaṃ bhraṃmanto vihāyatyatra(?) vartinīmavasthām |

ete punarabhijā......kuśā gaṇayanti, na saṃjñāmādriyante, nātmānamamijānanti kevalamaviralavisṛtañjitā(?) jagaduttrāsayantaḥ saṃbhinnamaryādānāṃ saptamīmiva...... |

vibhajya sandarśite yathāsvaṃ sthānāni rājājñayā gajanikāye rājyasaraḥpuṇḍarīkamārjuneyo(?) haravṛṣa ivātivarṣmā samasaṃsthānastvakesararomasthala......phenadhavalena dhavalimnā kṣīrodenoccaiḥśravaśaṅkayānubaddhyamānaḥ kaṭakalagnābhyāṃ kailāsa iva yakṣābhyāmabhyadhikabalapramāṇābhyāṃ pāṇibhyāmubhayatoṣṭhitvo vegarodharoṣadaṃśyamānada(rśa ? śa)nakhaṇakhaṇāyitamāparadiva(?) raṃhovegākṛṣṭamiva ca dīrghīkṛtadīrghaviśālasnigdhayorudbāndhavabandhavaiṣamyadoṣamuktayornetrayorutkavacakarṇikāraprabheṇa piṅgalanimnā jātarūpadraveṇeva lipyamānamarkapādasparśaruṣeva santatasphuritavṛttamadhyonnataprauḍhapallavamuttānaghaṭanakarālasuvyañjanānāṃ sthiramūlatayeva paripūrṇānāṃ murūrārjunābhyantarānatānāṃ(?) tadvarṇānāṃ ca daṃṣṭrāṇāṃ phenapāṇḍareṇa prabhāpravāheṇa gaganalaṅghanasamayalagnaṃ śaradabhrakulamivodgiraduttānāyatapṛthulasamatalena śauryacaṅkamaṇākkaṇeneva lalāṭataṭeneva tāruṇyamiva vālīnatarābhyāṃ kṣudratayeva tīkṣṇavṛttābhyāṃ romaśābhyāṃ darpa......kubhyāmiva karṇābhyāṃ, vikramadrumapravālamañjaryeva dīrghakomalatāmrayā jihvayā, raktānupadigdhaḥ śuddhatvādapūrvayā dhūnayā(?) sametamāyatānuvṛttayuktopacitahanucakraśmaśrucibukamālohitatanulekhaṃ vipulatālu samacaturaśravṛttapravānamavalīnatalamba(?)pīnadaśanacchadamacchidravimuktaślakṣṇasṛkvasaṃvṛtāsyamatisurabhimukhaṃ dadhānaḥ śubharāśitayeva darśitamū(rdhvo ? rdho)nnati kṛtodbandhanamapya pīḍitasamāhitaṃ śiro bibhradekajamṛduviśadānuvālakośakesaramālayā hariśabdenaiva sahakesariṇā gṛhītayā vijayacihnacāmarikayeva rājamāno vṛttayāpi daukhandhayā gaḷannigāle nirmāsayā śirasyabhipiṇḍitādhamāhritākuñcitaiyāṣāṇyevāhitavimānakārigrīvayopapannaḥ(?) śliṣṭadṛḍhapratipūrṇamāṃsaḷāṃsāṃsaphalaskandhasthirabahaḷottānapūrṇavistīrṇavakṣā vimuktānupūrvaśiṣṭapīnabāhunnīmāsesamāhitapraticchannajānumāṃsaḷāsirājārajjughanaśliṣṭajaṅgho(?) mṛdupratistabdhavṛttakūrcaśca jātyantaritaścārambhada upātyena calitalīlākaraṇaśca(?) valgaddhūrjaṭijaṭācandra iva dīrghatīkṣṇakacaśliṣṭakūṣikopurogasaṃsargigambhīrābhyantaratalai(?)ravalīnaghanabahalatuṅgavṛttairvārtrārinīlanirmitairiva lakṣmīvāsadhūlisamudgaissarogānapūrvamaṇḍūkān vahadbhirantaḥkṣīrikampādivātisnigdhavarṇaiḥ pratisāmantamakuṭamaṇikaraṇḍanocitaiḥ khuramaṇḍalairupetaḥ, śivākaratvādiva vṛttordhvaghanapīnau merauruha(?)krodhavṛttirahīnatvādiva vaṃśonatāvakṣyavinatāpūrṇapṛṣṭhaśliṣṭo lalitavalgitalāsyasthānatvādimṛdaṅgārūpapraticchannācchidrapārśvo jāṭharāgnirjagdhautrajālajālajālatvādivātyudbandhodaraścaturaśravṛttayā samatvenācchidratayā jaghanamajaghanyaṃ dadhānaḥ(?) saṃyatatvādivoccairvardhitadīrghavālamagrāvṛttikaṃ ca pucchamudvahan trivādiṣu javeṣu cādhikapramāṇaḥ prauḍhādiṣvāmayeṣu ca hīno jaṅghādiṣu dhṛmatve cātisanmaṇḍalo(?) balaripuriva gurunirdiṣṭakārī nṛpa iva yatnopacāryo bhārasahaśca munivanniṣkrodhaḥ suprasādī ca pāramiva sattvasya jīvitamiva.....ṣo vibhrama iva samaralakṣmyāḥ sāhasa iva darpasya sambhava iva tejasaḥ sampattiriva rājyasya javopadeśagururiva mārutasya cārutāmūlamiva candramasaḥ śucirudagrahā......jananaḥ priyadarśanaḥ pradakṣiṇasamācārasturaṅgaratnaṃ bhadravāhano nāma jāhnavīpravāha iva puṇyāvartaḥ, vaśyato′pi vācayan bhagīrathānubhāvaṃ(?) bhūpāla.....ḥane vismayagariṣṭhā sudhādṛṣṭiriva dhavalayantī diśaḥ sabahumānaṃ papāta patyuḥ |

sa ca turagapatiramānuṣānubhāvo bhā(va i ? vami)vāvabudhya bhartuḥ pari.....ṇana varatakhuravalayavilikhitadharāpṛṣṭhamādhūyamānakeśakesa(ka ? ra)saṭamavasthitasphuritarandhrodaramāmandrasnigdhagambhīrānunādamadhurama(bha ? he)ṣata | yena sakalameva bhuvana (ma)mbhaseva harivibhraṣṭena kucavivara(?)māpu(pū)re |

haryadhyakṣastvabhyadhatta——paśya deva tavānurūpaṃ yuddhasahāyaṃ bhadravāhanam | atibalo′yama(na?)tiśūro′tibhīmo′tyarattarañca tiraścī turaṅgujāti jātasya sā bhūmīti(?) | aho tu citramayamasāvanekamaṅgalyanirmalapradakṣiṇāvartaśuktimukulasaṅghātaśomī dugdharāśiriva sarvaratnasārasañcayasammato vināpi nirmathanaśramādiha devaṃ puruṣottamaṃ lakṣmyā sahopasthitaḥ | śakyamanenārūḍhena manye mahendro′pi jetum | avajito hi purāsāvārūḍhoccaiḥśravā (a)pi balidānavendreṇa | nahyamuṣya mandarakṣubhitasindhugarbhakleśitasya jalaprakṛterīdṛśāstejovarṇa(tva ? ba)lajavā bhavitumarhanti | javaprastāve cāsya khañjajavaḥ prabhañjano bhagnapakṣa iva pakṣiṇāṃ patirnirudhyamānā iva harito mandacāramiva ca mānasaṃ pratibhāti | vayasthāścāyaṃ vāsudevasabāṇabaliśatrubhakṣabhañjanakṣama iti (?) |

tasmiṃśca rājñānumate lokalocanānugate krameṇāpare′pi samuttasthurambaramiva raṃhasā taraṅgayantasturaṅgamāḥ | tāṃśca savinayoddhṛtāgratarjanīkaṃ ni(bhi ? rdi)śatā balādhikṛtenopa(cakrame) krameṇa vaktum | ito dṛṣṭidānenānugrahaḥ kriyatām | ete hi bhavadbhujaśikharasamagramatrastamindhuvogadū(?)......bhimānena tvaccaraṇāmbujareṇucumbicūḍena kāmbojeśvareṇa viśrāṇitā vidrumadrumotkīrṇā iva tāmrakesaralomavāladhitvacaḥ śoṇāḥ | 

ta ime bāṇā(va ? sa)nasamānakālanāmitena vāyunāthena(?) bhayopanītāḥ kāḷāñjanadhātuguhāniṣkṛṣitā iva kṛṣṇavāladhitvacaḥ sarvaṃ rāmāṃ kālāḥ(?) |

tānimānalīkāhaṅkāragarvadurvidagdhān gāndhārapateḥ prāṇatulyamākṛṣṭā(n) niṣṭaptasuvarṇanirmitānivāvagaccha pītakauśeyasannibhavalāmerāmatvaco haritetvaiddaṇḍa(?)dviradabṛndada(tta ? nta)kuliśoddhāṭyamānanagaragopurārgaḷaikapraghaṭaghaṭitotsekenādhvarājenopāyanīkṛtā harinmaṇiśilāprasūtā iva śukapatraharitaromakeśavālatvacaḥ pītāḥ |

ta ete tvadbhujadaṇḍamandaramathanasaṃ(bhūta)jveraṣṭasarvasvadānasandhinā sindhurājenopahṛtāḥ kroḍāṅgārarāśaya ivācchācchahasitacchannā dhautatāmratamatvacaḥ śvetāḥ śvetaromavālake(va ? sa)rāḥ karkāḥ | tamitāḥ tādṛśā eva darpadaḷitoddāmatailoraḥkavāṭā vighaṭanāprāvṛtena vikramadvāreṇa niṣkṛṣṭāḥ kṛṣṇabindujālakanasambādhajaṭharasakthivaktrāsaktabhṛṅgakalaṅgitotphullaśephālivanamahorāḥ kukkuṭāḥ(?) |

ta ete tvaddaṇḍābhipātacakitamecakopamecakapratipreṣitāḥ tuṣāravārigarbhoṣitagaganābhogabhāso bhāsvanmuktāphaladhavalavālakeśaromāṇo balabhinnīlatvacaḥ krauñcatrastānetān bhavadgajakulākulitakūlopakūlakālitānākalitānekavarṇakeśakesaravāladhīnālohitāhmasaṃbādhatvaco vikramākārānuraktasiṃhavarṇān | ete tvatpratāpataptāttamunmuktā dantaśarakaṃsakumudavarṇā śrīnadīpulinahārā gaurāḥ(?) |

tāni......prakāśanakeśavālanīlimopapannānālakṣayānukṛtaghanamaghitamahimācalaśilāpuñjānañjamūrdhajān (?) |

ta ime bhavatprabhāva......śociṣo vikacamocapuṣparociṣaḥ pākaraktakarkandhūphalarucaḥ pravālātāmravālā balārigopalohitāśvaṇo(?) varṇānuvarṇinaḥ kālava......kārā kalpāntānalaśikhākalāpakalpāḥ kālavālāḥ |

te′mī tvadyaudhavīravitatāyodhanāvadhūtayaudheyādhipojhitāḥ mṛṣṭabhālakaśāliśūkacakravākapadmakesarakuṇḍanacchavayo harivarṇānuvarṇāḥ(?) saṃvartapavanabhagnakanakaśailaśikharavibhramā babhravaḥ |

ta ime tvadaśvabalarajovaśyāyaruddhākāśajanitayuddhanairāśyayavaneśvaraprābhṛtīkṛtā mahendracāpacāravaḥ śirīṣakusumadāmaśyāmaḷā haritāḷarajorājirociṣṇavaḥ suvarṇayūthikāsavarṇāḥ kṛphalākāntayo hāritavanahāriṇaśca bālanaḷinavarṇanirmitavedivasamāpādayantaḥ(?) pītava(rgāḥ ? rṇāḥ) |

ta ime tumulasamprahārakātarataraḷahāraharitānilaromanihita(?)lohitatvaco mayūragaḷavarṇāḥ |

te′mī tvatpratā(pa)viṣāviṣahyavegabheṣajabhāvabhītābhiṣahaviṣaśca(?)nāthapreṣitāḥ sphuṭitapāṭalikusumagarbhaśubhraśoṇaromāṇaḥ pāṭalāḥ |

tānimānamalakhaḍgadāritāmandaroṣoddāmakandareśarudatparigrahānugṛhītā(i ? na)vadhāraya puṇyābhiṣekalagnaprayāgavārikaṇakarālitāniva kṛṣṇaśvetatanutanūruhaṃ dṛśyamā(nā)n |

ete bhavadanīkasaṃveṣṭanoparuddhāpayānapārvateyāgativikīrṇacitrakṛṣṇaromāṇo nīlapadatalāḥ(?) |

ta ete tvatsainyacāpakūspaṣṭaniṣṭhyūtānuccheṣagucchācchāditāvācyorcitāḥ sitālpānalparomāṇo(?) raktapāṭalāḥ |

tathaite tvatpādanakharatnādarśadṛśyākāroraśyakopadīkṛtā viralaśoṇabahuladhavalaromāṇaḥ sumanāpāṭalāḥ |

tānamūnatitigmaraśmitejastaikṣṇyadagdhadrutakaśmiribhirutoddhoṣiṇaḥ śvetagauraromṇo nirmāṇāya darpapañjarāda guñjapāṭalāna(?) |

ete śaraśataśalyajālaśakalitaśa(vyu ? ktyu)tsiktaśatānīkena tvayā svīkṛtāḥ sitabahulakatipayababhruromāṇastimiśapāṭalāḥ |

ta ime tvatkopānalaprasaranirvāṇapārvateyavargadīrghaprayāṇavarjitā haridhavaḷatanutanūruhā haripāṭalāḥ sakalabhāratavarṣamadhyavarti(kṣo ? kṣa)travarganirvyājanirjayārjitāśca | 

ete nijavarṇopāyajanitanānānāmāno vividhavarṇasāramiśrakesarāścāṅgarītayaśca siddhārthakāścāgravarṇāśca puṣpacitrāśca puṇḍrāśca maṇḍalacitrāśca vāraṇamayūramaṇḍūkatittirikrauñcahaṃsaṭiṭṭibhakalaviṅkakukkuṭakṛṣṇaḍiraṇmayarṣabhamallikabhairaraidhera(?)mūṣikopamairanubandhāpabandhavaiṣamyavairūpyacāpalyapiṅgalimabhirāyāmaprasādasnehavistāropapannairmaṇiprakāśaiśca locanairvīryasravantīriva sravanto guṇasādṛśyānupatantaścāturvarṇya(?)mṛjutanutuṅgadīrghanirmāṃmamukhāstīkṣṇāstrimaṇḍalāstrigammīrāḥ pañca mṛdavaḥ saptagaganadahanapavanalāghavātirekajanitataikṣṇyāśva(?) kṣititalagauravāyattaṃ mandimānamana......vayanto guṇasāmāsamānītabhadrabhāvāśca(?) sāttvikaprāyā alparajasonirastāma(ya)tvāt samarasabahuḷā viṣamarasaviraḷāḥ khararasavihitāśca kasatasṛkvaṇo(?) dvābhyāṃ tribhiścaturbhiḥ śreṇyāñca lalāṭe stuvadānenenaikena nigra(?) devamaṇināmnā kaṇṭhe caikena rocamānākhyena bāhvordvābhyāmaṅgada....r̤andhrayoḥ, mekhalāsamākhyābhyāṃ caturbhiśca vakṣasi pradakṣiṇe snigdhavarṇena nomairamahadbhi(?)rdhruvaiścāparaiḥ prapānādisambhavai.....ġaśatapadīvībhi(?)ścānanditābhirānanditasthānajanmabhiścālaṅkṛtāḥ sthirasubahaḷabahuvarṇayā cāpārthivyā snigdhastayā codakyā......kāśyāñca rūkṣatvitanvī(?)maspṛśantaḥ śarīrasattvagativarṇagandhasvaraprabhopapannāḥ pañcaṣaṭsaptāṣṭanavavarṣābhyantarāścaturaśrā dikṣu karmasvanekabheda.....ṇiyuktā vanābhogā iva śrīvṛkṣakābhilāṣitāḥ(?), suraprāsādā iva svastikavardhamānanandyāvarta(mānāḥ?) saṅgatāḥ, varṇā iva svaravyañjanalakṣyāḥ, varṣādivasā iva dṛśyakāḷikāḥ, sarattīrabhābhāpītivāruṇīcārusandarśabhājo ca(?) bahuḷapakṣā ivāśuklāḥ, sunimittodayā iva kalyāṇavedinaḥ, kalyāṇavāsā iva darśanīyāṣṭamaṅgaḷāḥ, sindhupramukhadeśyā apyadṛśyamukhāḥ, śuktyāvartā laṅghanocitā apyakṛśavigrahāḥ, sarandhrā apyapetasakaladoṣāḥ pralayapavanavegābhiṣyandavama(ni ? na)nirmitā iva sarvabhogabhājo vājina iti |

atha rājā yathānurūpamūrjitābhiḥ sahārthapūjikābhiḥ stamberamān turaṅgāṃśca kulaputrebhyaḥ saṃvibheje | tataśca svāmiprasādasvīkṛtaprītiṣu pratipālayatsu samaramutsavaṃ divasamiva pravīreṣu, dṛtamukhaśrutārthena dviṣatābhyupetayoddhavyasaṅghāmāddigdeśakālayo(?)rumayabalakulaputrakā(pā ? pa)dānaghoṣaṇapareṣvitastataḥ pracariteṣu svāmaragrahaṇeṣvarcyamāneṣvāyudheṣu pūjyamāneṣu vāhaneṣu dīyamāneṣu draviṇarāśiṣu saviśeṣamābadhyamāneṣu vīrapānagoṣṭhīmaṇḍaleṣu priyaprotsāhanadviguṇamaṇḍitāsvanumaraṇakṛtavyavasāyāsu vīrapatnīṣu svayaṃ rājā pūtapurohito mantrasaṃskṛtaiḥ (sa?)tīrthapradhānabhūtairgaṅgāyamunayoḥ saṅgamāmbubhiḥ pañcaratnagarbhaistriṣavaṇāplutaḥ samabhi(hutya ? hūya) samitsamiddhaṃ jātavedasaṃ sahātmanātisṛjya sarvasvaṃ dvijebhyo yathāvidhi kṛtaupavastraḥ śastravāhanamarcitamanudiśyaitadāvasasaṃrambhaṃ saṃsthitasya samasya(?) mukhe kuṇḍalayugaḷamiva grahanakṣatradīptaratnataraḷaṃ tadahorātraṃ viparivṛttamāsīt | udayakūṭamullilaṅghayiṣurapara iva hemakūṭo lākṣārasaraktamūrtirutkṣipya triyāmāmayaṃ nīlāṃśukapaṭamudajihīta bhagavānudaṃśuraṃśumālī | sakalarājakṣayacintayeva sañcukucuḥ kumudāni | samitisandidṛkṣayevonmi(mīṣe ? meṣa) kamalākarekṣaṇaiḥ kṣoṇī | tigmatejaḥkāmukānāṃ samīhitānīva sadbhaṭānāṃ sañjaghaṭire rathāṅkanāmnāṃ mithunāni | raṇarasādiva paṭutaramāra(da ? ṭa)ntaḥ svayamitastataḥ patitumārebhire sajjapatrāḥ | prāpte ca prabhātasamaye sūryakālāsphāla(na)bodhitamivotthāya sarvameva sainyaṃ (sā ? sannā)hamakarot | tathāhi——dinakaraharihanyamānatimirakuñjarānīka(phi ? pī)naphīṭkārānukāriṇāṃ jajṛmbhe bhairavo ravaḥ | paṭupaṭahānāñca pāṭayatāmiva śravaṇahṛt sāṭopadarpanirbharaḥ subhaṭapaṭuhuṅkārapūrādhmātabhuvanāṇḍakośasphuṭanāraṭitavibhramo babhrāma triviṣṭape pradeśān vicikīṣamāṇa iva vīrasainyasanniveśabhūmimanugataśaṅkhakāṃsyakāhalaviṣāṇavaṃśamaddalānako madakalamātaṅgaroṣarabhasasandhukṣaṇakṣaṇenaiva yugamivopasaṃharannatimahān ninādaḥ(?) |

dantinaśca mukhasannihitāntakaprasāritobhayabhujadaṇḍakalpaiḥ kalpitapratimuktasutīkṣṇakārṣṇāyasakośamuktairdantamukhaiḥ pratijighṛkṣanta iva sarvajagajjīvasaṅkhātamatibahaḷavikaṭakohakaṅgaṭa(sva ? su)ghaṭanāprakaṭakaṭhinamūrtayo bhayabhaṅgurabhujaṅgarā(ga ? ja)bhogamaṇḍalanibi.....ṭthitapracalitavejayantīpatākāprakṣīṇayā kecidapare vikaṭayā itare jālinyā anye ahaṃsya tathā cāpare krauñcapaṭyā(?) punarapare guli......korakārmukadharairba(ddha)godhāṅgulitrairāmuktaśirastrāṇakavacakañcukairatrasnubhirāgamajñairajñātapṛṣṭha(dānai ? bhāgai)ranekāyudhavyavahārakuśa.....ṃṛtyuhastanikṣiptajīvitairyodhapuruṣairadhiṣṭhitāḥ karṇaśaṅkhakarṇaśaṅkukaḍiṇḍimaghaṇṭācāmarāyānahemakakṣyāgraiveyapaṭuparyāṇarvaḥ(?) sarvapraharaṇapaṇyapaṭṭanāyabhānā (pa ? vaṃ)dibhiriva mukhapātibhirmadalolairmadhukarakulairgīyamānā dhīrakhelaṃ praceruḥ |

vājina(śyāki ? ścāti)javanatayā kroḍīkṛtagaganataleṣu rabhasalaṅghaneṣu sahaśvāsaiḥ prāṇā (na ? nāma)pyavapatanabhayeneva pātitakhalīna(saṃvandi?)saṃyatamukhāḥ, pṛṣṭhadattamradiṣṭhadvigucarmapratiṣṭhāpitamarasāracitrasārapīṭhā darpanirbharabharitadehadaḷanaśaṃ(ka)yevoraḥpucchavārdhracarmapaṭṭagāḍhakakṣyāvannadvārapālikā(?) calākṣikasupakṣacarmacchannā gupta......kalamaṣeṇā nirmalakārtasvarapulakapaṅktibhūṣitena javadhutaghanaghaṭācchataśatasrādā śakalaśāritenaiva(?) cchāditāṅgāḥ, pañcāśatā śarāṇāṃ bhedacchedayogyarūpasaṃsthitamukhānāmāpūrṇaiścatuṣkena cakratomarakaṇayaka....r̤asaprāsānāmubhayapakṣayopikena(?) dvikena kuntaśarāsanānāṃ catasṛbhirjyotirbhiśca khaṅgābhyāṃ ca kāṣṭhāpā......vartabhiragadoṣadhai(ra)ñjanadhūmavartikābhirmātravrīhimukhānāmāpūrṇairvṛddhipatrasūcipotrasūtratantrīrajjuśaṅkhakoṭarapālibhiścādhyāsitāḥ(?) śastrapūrṇatayā ca samitiśateṣu kālapramukhapraviṣṭanirgatakāyakārkaśyabhagnābhiriva taddaṃṣṭrāmiḥ karālitāḥ śālihotranikṛttapakṣapratini(dhvā ? dhī)niva preṅkhayantaścāmarakalāpānāyojitohayakrā(?)maṇikāñcanarajataprāyamaṇḍanāḥ saktasaktuhastā dhṛtajalabhṛtayo vadhrambiśararāvaṇaṃ madhurasarpiṣākā(?) kṛtakarmabhirapinaddhalohajālaiḥ sarvāyudhakuśalairaśithilabhartṛbhaktibhirabhivaraṇāpasaraṇonmathanādīnāṃ deśakālābhijñairjitaśramairabhīrubhiḥ sādibhiradhiṣṭhitāḥ prātiṣṭhanta |

rathāśca raṇitakiṅkiṇīkā ratnakhaṇḍa......vividhavyāḷarūparuciraparyantaphalakabhittayaścitrakūbarāḥ, susvāmina iva sukhāpāśrayāḥ, prabhava iva praghaṭitākṣepaṇāḥ, balavanta iva pravṛttacakrāḥ, pralayamārutā iva sānukarṣāḥ, kesariṇa iva saheṣāḥ, sadāravaissurabhikhyātapauruṣaiḥ kṛtavedibhiradṛṣṭapṛṣṭhairiṣṭakīrtibhirvīravratānuvartibhiḥ sanāthīkṛtāḥ, sarvasampatsamagradhāribhirgṛhītaraśmayaḥ pranṛttā iva(?) prollasatpatākāḥ prāvartanta |

pattayaśca pinaddhaparikarāḥ kecidaruṇā gamavamana(vāsa?)vāsinaḥ krodhānalādi(va) vinirgatāḥ, kecinmecakāṃśukaparihitā meghodarādivollasanto mahāśanayaḥ, kecit pītāmbaraparigrahā grahoparaktādityamaṇḍalapaviṣṭā(nvā?) iva dedīpyamānāḥ, kecidabhinavarambhāgarbhapatrapāṇḍaradukūlamājo mūrtairiva yaśobhirupaguhyamānāḥ, keciccitravastrasaṃvastrikāstejorāgādindrāpudhebhya iva putarjāyamānāḥ sarve ca nibiḍanibaddhavikaṭakuṭilakuntalāḥ, kṛtahastā, hastavalayadeṣṭitaprakoṣṭhāḥ, kha(gī ? ga)vanto niṣaṅgananto dhanuṣmantaḥ saśaktayaḥ satomarāḥ samudgarāḥ sagadāḥ sā(ra?)sidhe(na)vaścitrakañcukāścitramālpāścitravājāścitragatayaścotsarpayanta iva darpamuddāmayanta iva mānamu(tpe?tpāda)yanta iva śauryamuddīpayanta iva kopamutthāpayanta iva puruṣakāramutkṛṣṭakṣveḍitakābhitaviśvam+abhiyamitrīṇās(?)tṛṇāyāpi manyamānāḥ prāṇān samantataḥ samudatiṣṭhan |

viśāmpatiśca niśāṃ tāmaśāntanidra evātinīyanijoṣṇatāpāsahiṣṇutayevoṣasyevābhiṣicya puṇyābhira(bhīrya?dbhirja)pyāni parivartayannupasthāya ca pūrvasandhyāmu(dvi?tthi)tāya ca bhagava... sthaṇḍiye(?) raktapaṅkajablimabhivanditānāṃ ca hariharahiraṇyagarbhavaruṇavāsava(ma?)yamadhaneśvarāṇāṃ gurumantrasamudyatāḥ pratigṛhyāśiṣaḥ śeṣebhyo 'pi dai... nāmaṣabhayaharanirasanavyasanavyasanimadhukulanidhanadhūmaketulekhācandralekhāmudagrākṛtiṃ kṛtasaparyāmāryā(?)manuṣṭhitāgnikāryaḥ svasti vācayitvā ... rehi sūtrasyūtarakṣāmaṇirāmuktamaratakakaṭakaraśmijālaśādvalaparkoṣṭhaḥ śuklamālyāmbarāṅgarāgo jāmbūnadakośagūḍhaśṛṅgakoṭikhurāstaruṇava(rṇa?tsa)kāḥ kalaśadogdhrīḥ kapilāḥ sparśayitvā śatasahasraśo nṛpā(nā?)nādāya kavacamāyudhāni cābhimantritāni jīmūtīyenātharvabhiśca jaitrairabhiparihitavarṇava... pāṇyo(?) hārakirīṭakeyūrakuṇḍalaprālambabhogabhūṣaṇamaṇimarīcisaṃchuritadehatayoddhūyamānavāhanamayūrabarhabhārācchāditāṅka iva hotaśanirapratirathaṃ sauparṇaṃ śarāsanaṃ(?) śakunasūktakamanyāni ca vaijayikāni ca paṭhadbhirbrahmakalpairbrahmabhiranuṣṭhīyamānasakalaprāsthāniko nirgatya kāñcanaghaṭasahasragalitatīrthāmbhaḥkṛtābhiṣekamagnamālyasanāthamastakamagravilepanapraliptagātramanusaṃcārasurabhidhūpamārdavānurāgayuktena vaṃśatrāṇakāriṇā sapūruṣeṇa(?) mahatā śoṇacarmatva(ye?ce)nādhyāsitamājitasāgaramathanamandaramāyatena dviguṇavāsukibhogasannibhena savyadakṣiṇavartikena kakṣyāpathenāvanaddhamuparidattakuthāstaraṇakambalasthagitarajjugranthigranthamavatadhāturāgavyatikīrṇapṛṣṭhamacalarājamiva rājānubhāvādvāhanībhūtamatidṛḍhena guṇavata suhṛdeva kaṇṭhagrahocitena mānihatirgalasamagradarpavidhāraṇayantrabandhavibhrameṇa graiveyenopapannamumeṣa(?)taralaratnacāmīkaraparikṛtāvaraṇayugalayoginīmāścaryavāhinīmivoddhatacitrapakṣāṃ bṛsīṃ bibhrāṇamāmuktahaimavarmasambhatayāṅgatayā(?) piñjataḍitpuñjopagūhamiva meghamālaṃ kālameghaśyāmalābhyāmaśanipātadāruṇābhyāṃ nabhonabhasyābhyāmivāsībhyām(?)akhilabhuvanamaryādārakṣaṇodyatairamburāśibhiriva patmabhirāśīviṣavibhīṣaṇadhanurbhiriva pravīrakarākṛṣṭiyogyābhiraṣṭābhirjyābhiḥ kākutsthaśaranikṛttadaśamukhabhujadaṇḍairivātimānuṣasamprahārasāmarthyādāyudhīkṛtairviṃśatyā tomaraistretāgnirivājasrajvalitaistribhirayomayairapi vāraṇātmakairaṅkuśairariśiraḥkamalavanavanadārulekhayā kacagrahaṇyā nicitaniryūhayāpaprasāritamithunarasanayeva śaurasenakanyayā vaijayantyā pāśaprāsabhiṇḍipālahalaparaśvathakṣurikākundālavāsyādibhiścopetaṃ bhedacchedasamarthānāṃ saṃsthānānāṃ pañcāśatā pañcāśatā niśitānāmayomukhānāṃ pūrṇaiḥ kālakesarinakharapañjarānukāribhistūṇīrairdvātriṃśatā+alaṃkṛtakarṇaguhāṃ saphalakṣakukṣiniṣṇeṣakulābhāgaṃ śṛṅgārita iva gṛhītadhūpāñjanamacalarūpatayevānekānekadoṣadhisamadhiṣṭhitamadriśṛṅgāvatīrṇādbhutajaladharamiva śuciśītalasurabhiritasunāthakajvalajāṃ naṭapālikodgīrṇacārucāmarakalācchannamacchasenapaṭalavidhuritavidrumalatāstambamamburāśimiva dṛśyamānāhitapādukāyogāddvādaśaguṇenonupaniṣādinādhiṣṭhitamiṣṭavāhanamantrasābhipūjya kariṇasaṃkramiṇa(?)hemakūṭamāruroha|

samastapārśvacāriniṣādasampadā samagramātmānamākalayannabhiniṣadya ... tasthau|
