aikṣiṣṭa ca pratibhavanamanuprayāgatiramāgṛhītubhūmi samadākagandhagajaghaṭābaddhāntakāratayā......varṣādhvaramiva jaladharātibhāreṇa pāti(?)manekasāmantasahasrātapatramaṇḍalāntaratayā velātaṭapulinamaṇḍalābhogadhavala......kaṭabhāṇḍamaṇḍitānāmanavaratanabhastalotpatanavyasanādatīka(?)sparśanābhijñakhurapuṭānāmivānekasahasrairājāneyavājināṃ sthū.....ṣaṅghātaghūrjitogradaśanabhiva kalpāpāyabhuvanamākalparaśmirājirājitalokanirantaratayā pārijātavanamiva sāgareṇa mathanabhayāt prāgevopāviṣkṛtamullasitānekarathaśatamitapatrakāvrātaprītātamāpatataghanatuhinapaṭaladhavalitāgramiva(?).....ṃya......bhūrāraṇyaṃ bhuvanakośamiva nī(la)śvetāruṇaśabalaharitabhaṭāśvaketumālopapannam, antakanagarodyānamiva sphuradasipatrapātabhīṣaṇaṃ, nandagopālagokulamiva haribalaracitacārunāgaṃ vṛndāvananiveśamivoccāvacaghanāndhakārībhūtaṃ rāmāyaṇamiva kṛtapaṅkirathakṣobhamantharaṃ kuruṇaṇḍavasamaramivottrāsitagajaghaṭotkacasubhaṭasiṃhanādakārita(sū ? ka)rṇaśaktivyayaṃ dhyātamiva(?) kṛtaśamāntaraṃ nānāpaṅktisumthitaṃ surasrotasvinīsrota iva suracitacārupakṣapakṣaṃ kucataṭamiva krāntora(syaṃ ? skaṃ) gaṇakamiva pratigrahavibhaktabalavicāraṃ sāmra jyamiva sarvatovṛtisampāditaprakṛ....l̤aṃ duṣkarakāvyamiva rāvitajana(?)padaniveśaracitasarvatobhadraṃ kośāgāramiva sāraphalguvibhāgānurūpakalpitamthānaṃ kālindīhradamiva.....ṭācyuta.....ḍagopālaruddhanirgatanāgasya navāgamanihitavamanapyabhitavanasamartham(?) anulomasamīraṇama(pya ? pi) pratilomaprabhañjanaṃ (svāṃśca ? svaba)loddharṣitamapi parabaloddharṣitamāyastasenāpatiprotsāhyamānamapyanāyastasvāmisamadhiṣṭhitaṃ japyahomaparapurohitapuruṣoddhuṣyamāṇakṛtyābhicāraṃ mauhūrtikaprabhṛtivarṇyamānasvaparakarma siddhyasiddhimatighoradarśanamarātisainyam |

aribaladarśanoddhūtaroṣarāgonmuktaghoradhoṣabhīṣitabhuvanatrayaṃ ca nṛtyataḥ svasaīnikānatyāyāsānupaśamayya haryakṣa......cāni saṃjñācihnāni sarvavyūhabhidā durja(yo ? ya)nāmavyūhena prativyūhya samprahārāyābhyacodayat |

athobhayorapi senayorabhramālā iva marudbhirādhūyamānāḥ subha.....ṇuryaṣṭayo niṣṭaptakanakarasalikhitalalitacatāpatrabhaṅgabhāsurāciraprabhā bhairavaṃ rasantyaḥ prārebhire pramoktumitastato ruddhakāmavijṛmbhamāṇāḥ prabhūtāni śagvarṣāṇi(?) | muktasaṅgamari(pa ? ba)lānyavagāhituṃ sphura(na ? da)rkatejasaḥ prakā(ra ? śa)durnirīkṣyā vīrā iva tyaktakośā virāsayaśca cāmaradhavalapakṣa(?)macalarandhraprasṛtā haṃsā iva bahalaraṃhaso hayāḥ parasparaṃ samāpetuḥ | itaretaraṃ darśanarabhasamuktadviguṇoṣṇamadāmbudhārāḥ karaṭasthalanipati(ta)nīlanārācayaṣṭaya iva rāgoddhūyamānalohitamukhacchadāṃśukā dhūpāñjanadānasandhukṣitena roṣavahninā prajvalanta iva samamipeturaśanipātavarṣasaṃrambhaṃ samantato mataṅgajapatayaḥ | patayaśca bhuvaḥ parānīkadarśanaviśṛṅkhalāmarṣavegāvegapreritavividhavāhanā(nāḥ?) hantumanyonyamāgūryamāṇa(na?)hetayo hatahateti sainikānādiśantaḥ kṛtāntādiṣṭā ivāparamakhilabhuvanasaṃ(ka ? ha)raṇakṣamaṃ kalpāntapataṅgadunirīkṣaṃ rūpamudvahanto haraya iva haribhiḥ (pa ? pra)tibalapravīraiḥ (su ? sa)maṃ sama(ñja ? sajja)nta |

tasmiṃścāntare jhaṭiti jagatsāmagrīgrāsagrahaṇayogyaṃ vapurupādadāno...... ruddhālokamākāśamāvṛtya vyajambhatomavabalasannipātakṣobhajanmā mahāvarāhakesaranikarakaburaḥ parāgasaṅghātaḥ | yatra saptamiva likhitamiva......badharami(vaśa ? vāca) tanībhūtamiva ca niṣprātamūḍha patākinādvaya (iva?) kṣaṇāmavāvatastha |

punaratisattvatayā nigṛhya tāṃ tāmasīṃ vikṛtimā...... ndhakāre sau(sti ? pti)kavimardakalpaḥ kṣaṇamavartatātighoraḥ samprahāraḥ | tadā ca dārayateva rodavidhuvarṇakoṇanirdayapraha.....ṇa bhindateva....r̤āṇi pracaṇḍadaṇḍānighātamukharitānāṃ bherīṇā bhairaveṇa (raveṇa) pāṭayateva śrotrapuṭānāṃ madatādhikānāṃ(?) dhū(rjini ? rjaṭi)tāṇḍavāṭṭahāsapaṭīyasā.....ṇāmāraṭitena darpādhmātatvaraprādhmāyamānānāṃ prastasamastabrahmastambenāmbujānāmambunābhacaṇḍacchicadā(?)pātabhītākulakuvalayāpīḍaphīṭakā(ra ? rāna)kāreṇāraṇitena, vādyamānanānāvāditranādamedureṇa mṛtyudevatārādhanodgītena, nṛtyataḥ (sphu ? bha)ṭavargamya vardhamānasurāṅganājanāṅgajotkaṇṭhena kaṇṭharaveṇa kharakhalīnakhaṇakhaṇāraṇitakalitena khurapuṭapatanavācāṭitavikaṭadharaṇipṛṣṭhavāhānāṃ ghurughurumālikānirdhoṣagharghareṇa helāheṣitena pratikuñjarasaṅghaṭṭajhaṭajhaṭāyamānadaśanakośānāmaśanipātabhīṣaṇenānekaśastrapātavyatikaratrastabhṛṅgavṛndonmucyamānagaṇḍamaṇḍalānāṃ ḍiṇḍimasvarasyūtena mātaṅgānāṃ garīyasā garjitānusvareṇa, parasparāsphālaśakalitakoṇakūbarāṇāṃ rathānāmapratiyātamāṃsalena saṅkrīḍitena, subhaṭoddaṇḍapīḍitānāṃ karṇajvarakāriṇā kārmukāṇāṃ ṭaṅkrṛtenākarṇavikṛṣṭamuktānāmuktena janavardhitena(?) luptanabhastalāntaraṃ patatāṃ patatriṇāmatikhareṇa huṅkāreṇa, karikaracaraṇanirbhajyamānakalevarāsthisaṅghā(ṭa ? ta)paṭapaṭāśabdamiśreṇa (va?)śyenagudhrabalakaṅkakahvakāka(hā ? bhā)sādīnāmugrāṇḍajānāmugratamena virutenābaddhyamānakolāhalamatibahaḷarajassambhā(rama ? rā)ndhakāritamanavarataviparivartamānavividhaśastrajālasaṅkulamiva divyavarāharabhasapotrābhighātavāritādhārāṇḍakapālapṛṣṭhasya tapasvirno′pi veveṣṭamānamahoragaparamparāṇāṃ gaṇatalamanukarotisma mūlarasātalasya(?) |

tataśca visrabdhasamprahārakriyāvighātaroṣiteneva soṣmaṇā vīravigrahapravṛttena raktasrotasā bhinnamūlaḥ śanaiśśanairupaśa(śā)ma reṇurāśiḥ | virajasi manasīva manasvināṃ śastrālokaprakāmanirmalaprakāśitaśitaśastraparamparāhatahatāḥ śataguṇamādidīpire śūrā iva saurā marīcayaḥ | te yānyapi pradhīyāṃsyapi makāśānyapi prayataguṇānyapyarandhrāṇyapyaṅgabhūtānyapi guptamarmāṇyapi varmākīrṇajapapralāpa iva saṃhatānthasaṅgapātanobhindati tīkṣṇā mahāsayaḥ(?) | prajvalatsu jvalaneṣu āvaprapītāsu pratīyamānāḥ pralayāya petuḥ pralaghupātaṃ pataṅgāḥ | satomarāpyabhīravavarānaśakamabhyadravad bhagavān(?) | bhaṭajanakarānuvartino nakharāḥ kisalavamiva ripuhṛdayamayaḥkaṭhoramapi dāruṇā dārayāmbabhūvuḥ | bhūmāspadamivāmarṣaṃ bahuguṇādhiṣṭhitamanyonyadhiṣaye janayāmāsuḥ siddhimahīnarūpāḥ śaktayaḥ | spṛhāvanto′pi prasādiṣu na vimānamīdhuḥ satpuruṣāḥ | prajanapravṛttasyandanāsu bhramaḥ kabandhāsu bahiśliṣṭaplāva ivāśu tānabhirarakṣuḥ vaṃśasampannāḥ manasaḥ sumanasāmupari(pa)tadbhiḥ paruṣapakṣaśabdaiḥ śilīmukhairmadhūnīva mukhanibandhanānyapi yatnajīvitānyavikacāni bālakamalānīva nirdayamalūyanta | lokasyāpi pīnakrarṇikāniśirāṃsi bādhajvalanajvālābhirivāmattsupānasaṃbhṛtadyutibhiḥ(?) kṣayakālavijṛmbhitābhiḥ samārambhitapraharaṇāvalībhirjīvalokaṃ saṃhartumasaṃha.....ṭaiḥ kalpāpāyavāyubhiriva kulagirayo mahāyudhairapavarjitāḥ paritaḥ patantaḥ sphuritaratnakaṭakā bhuvamakampayan bhūbhujāṃ bhujāḥ | chinneṣvapi caraṇeṣu paṣkalāgatirabhi.....ṇāmakliṣṭarukprapañcānyaṅgāni dhūsarībabhūvurna yaśāṃsi | marmadṛḍhaprahāravihvalānāṃ mahaujasāmunnatimatyaḥ prāpyadhattantamūrta(?)...... |

......vinayenānuttānenāpālitenākubjenāsarvadikyenākuñcitakarṇālabdhodareṇa bhugnenāprakampitenārucakāravasthā......pralepanākhyaiḥ pañcabhiḥ kakṣadoṣairakaṭākṣatā na purastānna pṛṣṭhato vā praviṣṭena vikreṇavācīkṛtenānudyatenātyanudyatena ca mattavāraṇā......śaṅkuvadudyatenonmeṣanimeṣabhrameṇa muktanetreṇa kākṣakūṇanimīlitenātivivṛtasaṃvṛtoṣṭhena, jihvālehanenādantadarśanenāgukṣiptabhruvā, nāsāsaṅghrāyiṇānatihāsaspandanenāsanābhadarśinā darśanamanassamādhānaśobhinā mukhenāpibanta iva lakṣamanatyuccātinīcamaṅguḷībhistribhāgataḥ saṃsrutābhiḥ kālikābhirivātiśliṣṭābhiragṛhītacāpamadhyā nātyuccātinīcamabhūmikaṭugmararūrassthalodaranīvikeṣu karāḷena puṅkhinā talakṛtapuṅkhasāmyeṣūddhūtādidoṣamukteṣu hatāveveṣūn kṣiptamapravepitamacchāvaghaṭṭanamanatyuttānakalapuṣamanyābhicāmaramekaikadīyamānasāyakāḥ sandhāne ca na parilolayantaḥ puṅkhena parvaṇā sandadhānamuṣṭibhyāṃ ghaṭṭayantvena sajyamānasandihyamānā na pravepamānā na kārmukāmajinotkṣipanto nāvakṣipanta nāmṛṣṭapramṛṣṭamapyucchinnamakhaṇḍitañca sandadhānā gharmārtā iva ghanakarakodbhāsino varuṇagaṇā ivāvṛttapaścimopasthānāḥ suvaṃśā iva dvarjitākatuṇḍasparśadoṣāḥ dharmaparāsa iva durgatipatanaparihāriṇaḥ paramparācakramiva khaḍgabhramato′pyaṣṭādaśasu khaḍgacāriṣu caturaśrāḥ prasphuṭaprakīrṇapakṣāścandrayogā iva darśitavaiśākhagatayaḥ subhāṣitaprakārā iva sādhvālīḍhagatayo, lābhotkaṭā iva bahubhṛṅgitapratyagatojvalāḥ(?),malayamārutā iva lalitavallīnartanāḥ, saritpravāhā iva bāhyāvarta(na?)śobhinaḥ śuddhikāmā iva gomūtrotsekinaḥ, śrutivādā iva bhadragatidarśinaḥ, pralayavāyava iva sānukṣaṇāḥ, muravā iva madhurāhatayaḥ, svāvayavā ivākṛṣṭapṛṣṭhāhatayo bhrāntavidhāvapyaprāntayaḥ(?) kurvanto′pi korparaskandhabāhucchedyakānyacchedyarā(ra?)gā racayanto′pi parotsaṅgamasaktakaṃ prahāriṇaḥ kālakalpā api saṃrambhoddhṛtapādākṣiptayamapāśāśanipātanā agoghnā api gośīrṣamaviprā api yajñopavītamu(pa ? dva)hanto nartakā iva bahupānanivartanabāhūpavartanāḥ, takṣāṇa iva svastikakriyānipuṇāḥ siṃhanakhā iva tigmamukhollekhyavāraṇā dṛpta......iva tīkṣṇapādāvaliptavāhanāḥ mṛgayā iva vyāghrānivartanodyatāḥ mṛgākārā iva śyānapātayarucayo mṛgā iva cagvaparicchādikā(?) velormaya ivāviratāsphālanābhyantarāpavartanā mṛtyumiva darpayantaḥ prāvartanta |

tugṅgiṇaśca veṇuvetrapaṭārohadevatārukālacandanaspandanāpanakhadiraśiṃśapāmayāḥ pañcaṣaṭsaptahastamātrātuṇḍaṃ halāni ca pauṣkalāni prokṣalāyatakamrajāyasāniṣīnajāyasatīkṣṇadhārāṇiṣaviṣamadalacetasāśokāśvakarṇakaravīrakharjūratālopaleṣupannagojihvānanāsaṃsthānāni dvicatuṣkadhuttaradaśāṅgulārdhadvyaṅgulatryaṅgulabahalāni vyāghranakhasyantuktairmaṣimṛttikayośca samena cūrṇena nirdhautanirmalāni vyaktavividhalakṣaṇāni vaiḍūryamayūrakaṇṭhanīlotpalāsitapuṣpakāntibhiḥ prabhābhirdvitīyākāmiva nirmamāṇāni madhvādichāyopakaraṇādivakṣasaruci bandhayanti vinicarmacotpala.....ṇa gandhitayā sannihitasamaralakṣmīparimalamivodgiranti surāsātivodvahadbhiranulbaṇamaṇirajatarūpavalākṣikaiḥ patrāyamānanālikairū......pitthāmalakakalaśādyanekabandhakaiḥ pañcāśatṣaṣṭipālikaiḥ(?) svapramāṇānurūpaiśchedanamedanabandhanapaṭṭanalekhanakṛntanaveṣṭana....r̤aśuṃ tale parigatamalātacakramaśaniṃ vidyutkṣiptaṃ nāgākrāntaṃ lātāvartaṃ kṣobhayamatho bhaṭamusalaṃ vidyuddaṇḍamaṃsā......kuraṅgaṃ bhujabandhucākrāntāt(?) parikṣiptavāraṇamullekhyamalekhyaṃ kṛntanamavakṛntanaṃ yamadaṇḍaṃ bhiṇḍipālaṃ varāṅgikṣepakārmukaśroṇiparigatamāspholaṃ vāṇo.....ṣpṛhaṃ jā......citrakriyāḥkramāda darśayantaḥ, kāraṇātiśayāṃśca vṛścikaṃ pakṣāvartaṃ devadaṇḍaṃ cakradaṇḍāvartaṃ kāladaṇḍaṃ nāgākrāntaṃ devākrāntaṃ bhṛtabherīṃ gūḍhameṇḍaṃ bhujākrāntaṃ svastikaṃ siṃhākrāntaṃ gavyāviddhamalātacakraṃ ca viracayanto, māraṇanicamūlāghātā......ñcedyabharaṇaṃ kuraṅgavāraṇaṃ svastikavāraṇaṃ vikṣiptavāraṇaṃ dhvajākrāntavāraṇaṃ rasaravartavāraṇamacalacakravāraṇaṃ vālaṅgavāraṇaṃ vāraṇavāraṇaṃ yamadattavāraṇamasikarmavāraṇaṃ pātanavāraṇamatipranartā iva prāvartayat prakṛtāsrakṛtāñjaśvavartino(?) valgāmekahastenāvalambya syenaṃ dardīgrahaṇaṃ jaṭharāvartanaṃ bāṇotkaṣaṇaṃ mūlottaraṃ nivartanamūrdhvāvartanaṃ skandhāvartanamullekhyaṃ valgupīḍitaṃ gūḍhāgraṃ pakṣapīḍitaṃ svastikaṃ lakṣotkṣiptaṃ latāvartanaṃ vikṣiptamiti ṣoḍaśāpi va(lgu ? lgā)paryāyān yathāvadācarantaḥ karkaṭakāsaktavargāḥ caturaśrameniṣṭheṣvaśrepūdgagatānyagatānaparigatānālohitavīcīkṛśodānandyāvartaḥ pakṣāśroṇimaṇibandhāsanagaṇḍamastakastinābhihṛdayastananalanetravipayāṇividyāni tāvantyeva ca pratibhedyāni sannipātāṃścādhikarmasampakṣiṇaṣṣerūpāḥ poḍaśaiva svañcītaprakṛtavicchandatakṣabhrāntapīnodvartanaṃ trikalpasiṃhaniṣpoḍitādhomukhaśārdūlaparisarpaṇākrāntakṛntanaparākrāntābhimukhapārśvakarmaparāvartanakhedagrahaṇāhvayānā yojayataścāpyabhāgāṃścākarmamiśrāṃ sāyakayaudhabhūṣaṇaṃ śastravikramamayaṃ(?) mantroddharaṇaṃ vajrāvartanaṃ vidyunmaṇḍalaṃ sūcigamanamindravajraṃ vṛndabhīṣaṇaṃ bhūtakendraṃ śatrughātanamiti paṭayantrahastiyantrāṇi pratiṣṭhitaṃ prasāryaṃ khaḍgapātaṃ kuntapātaṃ.....ṃasikheṭamiti citraduṣkarāṇi kurvāṇāḥ, trisaṃyogavidhīnapyudgantaṃ pṛṣṭhānuvartanaṃ hastodvartanaṃ skandhāvasaktamakamadhaḥpṛṣṭhamūrdhvapṛṣṭhalāvartanaṃ śrīkaṇṭhaṃ saṃkṣiptakaṃ vyavacchedanañca prayuñjānā vañcanāśca nānāvidhāḥ parasparamupapādayantastaṭinmayā iva samantataśceruḥ(?) |

dviradayodhinaśca smṛtidhṛtiśaktiśaucayuktāḥprati(ma?)pattimantaḥ priyadarśanāḥ praṃ.....ġoḥ samīkṣyakāriṇo dakṣāṃcakṣusamastatīrthoṣitā(?) jitaśramāḥ śīlavantaḥ sthūlākṣāḥ (i)bhahitaiṣiṇo (bhū ? bha)yānabhijñāḥ bhadramandramṛgasaṅkīrṇānāṃ hrasvadīrghatanugrīvāṇāmudagrāvāgraśirasāṃ sa(māsata ? māṃsa)viṣamāṃsādhikāṃsānāṃ ca mataṅgajānāṃ yathānurūpamāsaneṣūpanativinatinirnatikuṇḍatāpāśrayagrīvāstambhaparyavasānāni ullokamāṃsānātmaprokṣaṇādimuktamuktāṃsamaviṣamopapannābhivihaṅgamaghaṭājānukarṇita(?).....ṣanamapiñchalamanudgatāṃkuśamakuṭilamaprakampaṃ samāhitaśliṣṭorujaṅghānuvṛttajānavaḥ sthāṇubhūtā iva samutkīrṇā iva ca niṣaṇṇāḥ pañcavi......pādasaṃsthasyaṃ catuṣṣaṣṭipravibhāgasya yatasya yathāvasaraṃ prayoktāraḥ sarvaireva praharaṇaiḥ pratibhaṭaprāṇānācāmanto′nupūrva.....ṭhālakṣamamandaśata...... |

.....ṇyonyasyopapāda(nto ? yantau) roṣaśātkāramuktiṣu saṃvartasamīramivānyonyaśṛṅgabhaṅgahetorutsṛjantau saṃrambhadṛṣṭidahanajāte....l̤āsāniletarasyaṃ racayantau raktadṛṣṭivisarjaneṣūtpātavalāhakāniva cāpahasantau roṣapāvakapākajarūpapā(ta?)ṭalamadātirekamiva ru(kha?)dhiracchalāditastataḥ kṣatamukhaiḥ kṣarantau pranetābhinataniṣaṇṇānatohnatādibhirbahuvidhaiśca kāpirājamārgai(?)ruccāvacaiścaraṇavikramaprakārairāvalitakarapuṭotkṣepavibhramaiśca matanṛttamiva samīkavīthyāmācarantau vairamayāvivāticiramayudhyetām |

na tathā puruṣakesarikaracapeṭābhipātā bhayāvahāḥ, (na tathā) mahāvarāhapotraprahārāḥ, na tathā niṣṭhurāṇi yamamahiṣaviṣāṇakoṭitāḍanāni, na tathā mahāmahāvarāhāḥ pralayānilahatakulaśṛṅgabhaṅgāḥ, yathā tayormahāgajayorairāvataradanakarmakadarthanakṣamā darśanaprakārāḥ(?) | tau ca tayorabhiniṣādināvudyatāsi vidyutvantāvivāmaragiriprathamadhāmā(nā)varājiṣātāmakṛṣatāṃ ca |

itaretarasya śaraśataśalyaśakalaśalkasañcayātigcitakavacakārkaśyeṣu sthairyavatsu gātreṣvatrāsadṛḍhātigāḍhakarakaṭhoradhāriṇi(?) sphuritasphuliṅgajālatayā śīrṇakapilakesarāṇāṃ kupitalakṣmīkarṇakuvalayaprahārāṇāmivānukārakāṇi khaḍgalatātāḍanāni ca tadanalamahākṛpāṇadhāroccalitarudhiraśakaranivahalohitāyamānaṃ ca tayoḥ śarīramānīlamahoragābhighātajvalitacalaśikhākalāpakavacitasya janamejayasatrajātavedaso′nvakārṣīt |

avanamayya tu pratidviradavadanamudvisaradaśanakoṭirekhollikhitamastakapiṇḍamātmānekānekamadanāturavaravadhūdattakaṇṭhagrahasya kaṇṭhagrahaṃ magadharājasya kartumabhilalāṣa mālavendraḥ |

tāvacca gaḷatāpātidūra(?)praviṣṭadakṣiṇadaśamakośakuliśamīṣatkarāḷitānanena hemakūṭena pratigajamukhamutpīḍanipīḍitodvṛttaraktapūrṇākṣapuṭamākṣipya tatprāṇāḥ punarākṣipyanta | kṣiprañca pipatiṣopapattayova(?)ghūrṇamā(ne ? na)vigrahād grahapatiriva paścimādreḥ samudramiva sandhyāruṇaṃ raṇadharaṇitalamasupaṭalavapuravapupluve nirāja(?) |

rājā ca prāṇaveganunnanānārājopya′sau(?) saṃvartapavanapatau patitatūlādri kalpaḥ papāta | prativāraṇāvaliptaśca harṣavegadviguṇamadapravāho hemakūṭastripadīlāsyalīlāndo(ṣi ? li)taḥ pratimallaparājitapravṛtta iva jyeṣṭha(ma?)mallo mandramandrāṇi magadharājasiṃhanādamiśrāṇi māgadhānīkavīrakaṇṭhīravopabṛṃhitāni dhīradhīraṃ cakāra |

tasmiṃśca kṣaṇe kṣapita......vaṃ mānasāramākalayyācalabhaktipreritaṃ sakalameva rathaturagamataṅgajānīkamekaṃ rājahaṃse jighāṃsabhyavārayat(?) | avāhanañca savāhano hantumanabhi(kṣāṃ ? kāṅ)kṣan ‘āroha tāvadabhimatamanukūlamaṅga visrabdhaṃ kimapi vāhanam’ iti dviṣantamābhāṣya bhramayannihabhavatimatirabhasani.....ṭikātarāṇi tadasugrāsahāni varmakaraṃ ca lokāntaramuparatapiśitāśinānyaddhṛgṛdhrānīcagṛdhrāmaṇḍalāni hotikhaṇḍanapātanavihāñce svabāhudaṇḍaṃ manmathitaturagaśatasahasraṃ sakalameva saṃgṛhṇāma dharaṇimaṇḍalamaśekṣaṇadrutāśeṣaṃ babhrāma(?) |

tasya ca na śareṇa na tomareṇa na mudgareṇa na cakreṇa na kuṃ......ṇenana kaṇayena, na daṇḍena na bhiṇḍipālena na mutsṛjyā(?) na musalena na śataghnyā na śaktyā na śūlena na pāśena na parigheṇa na paraśunā na paṭṭasena na patreṇa na prāsena nāsinā nānyena vā kenacidāyudhe......bhūtanarmakanikaradurāpātatṛptināpyatṛptenāhūyata(?) |

sa ca kaṇibhinirdiśyairnagnadīpitairnānyena vā kūṭāyudhenārātibhirabhasāvasaṃjaghāna | na ca tena śilīmukhāsthalātirū......ñjaligha(?) na muktā muktakeśeṣu, na kīrṇāḥ klībeṣu, na (nā?) āstā āsīneṣu, na visṛṣṭā vipannāheṣu, na nunnā na (ne ? te)ṣu na yojitā nirāyudheṣu na nikṣiptāḥ supteṣu na dattā nivṛttayuddheṣu na preritā para.....ṇa na preritā bhūmaparikṣateṣu na prahitā bhīteṣu na prahatāḥ prāptāpattiṣu na damitā viguṇāyudheṣu na pātitāḥ parāvṛtteṣu na kalitā bāleṣu na nītā niṣkaleṣu nānyeṣvadhanyeṣu syāpi spṛṣṭā(?) |

tathā ca tasmin dharmayodhini kṣayaṃ nayati vipakṣānīkanītamataṅgaje pañcamārutivahamiva tathāvivṛttamuttamāśvamugravalāhakaṃ nāma samāruhya rājan jāmadagnyamarjuna iva kārtavīryo vīryavānābhavatināhvayamāno′dhipatirujjayinyā(?) | (nagare ? magadhe)śvaro′pi samasamarasamāhito haste hastibhiṣajāṃ dattvā hastināgamaṅgagrastasamastaśatruśastragrāmaṃ hemakūṭam, adhiruhya yathoktakalpitamuktakarṇajapyavājinaṃ bhadravāhanamupaca(kri ? krame) yoddhum | uddharaṇe darpeṇa nivartikānuvartanapariśobhādhiṣṭhānaiḥ praśevibhāgagatimārgavinirgamasaṃsthānapramāṇacāraiścakrāmaricaritaiścaturacārupāruṃ caturaśrakarmaniṣṭhamaśvadvayaṃ cārayantau yathāvakāśamaṣṭādaśāpiścāraṇaḥ gaṇaparamparā lavanasañcāryamāṇāryacaritau ciraṃ ceratuḥ(?) |

tathāhi——sadoveṇikāvagāhanau gandharvairgāhitau śrīmṛtavajrajñānavalambinau haribhadrāṣṭāpadakaraṇacaturau caturagābhyantarau kṛtavinivartanajālavaryeṇa kramavinītau gotrāriṇau sukṛtāyastikottarau sudhāmātiśayo darśitapakṣanakathyāpatanāva kilāṃ vilālevasyavalalitodvellanamālākārau vilāsināviva samarotsavasyaikakṣaṇadṛśyamānavakamaṇḍatrimaṇḍalamaṇḍalārdhacandrāvindrajālikāviva manāsadājasya dvicakrasyandanajigīṣayeva pañcamaṇḍalacakrasampatsamāhitau trivikramaspardhayeva svacaraṇadarśitagaṅgāvartodgrāntatārau bhadravāhanogravalāhakāvareciṣātām(?) | 

taduttarāyudhīyau ca ko yathā paraṃ visṛtaparisāditrayodaśavidhamavidhuramarandhraprakṣipati suvarṇaprekṣitamajīvitaprekṣyamanavahitamavanigovarānītamātiṣṭhatāmaśvayuddham | tayorgatilāghavadarśibhiralātacakrāṇyatiguruprapārāṇyābhaṇyanta rūpāṇa bāṇādirāyudhagrāmaṃ prayogasaṃhārayoralabhyāntaratvāt sakṛtpravṛtta iva samabhāvyata | nāśitanikṛṣṇaprakṛtānīkṛtahastayorāsa nūnamambaraikadeśasāmabhyupadeśavaśyatāmaśrāntavīryātvavantināthaprāsaprahāramurasidattaṃ careṇa sphureṇāvadhūtanvata nṛpasya chettumaicchidita paricchobhanivartito′śvanyasta iva drutamapasasāra(?) |

tasya ca tathāpasāreṇābhinavena mānasāraḥ paraṃ jaharṣa | cukrośa ca——kva gatāni tāni vikramavidāhaviṣpūrjitāni | kva pralīnaḥ kulābhimānaḥ | kva tadanivartanavratam | itaḥ kuru mukham | iṣava ime kiñcidācikhyāsava iva hyavaśāgataharṣabāṣpaviplutekṣaṇasya śatroratisattvatayā svasthasvāntavṛttaṃ nipuṇaṃ nirālokalabdharandhro vidyunmaya ivābhisṛtya svarakṣāmātravyākulo mālaveśvarasya puraścaraṇavikala iva durnarendro nirnarendraḥ prabhūkopaghāntaḥ papāta(?) | āruroha ca prathamavikalpitopanataṃ manorathamiva sarvatrāpratihatagatirmahāratho ratham | itaro′pi śibirameva bahugurubhārabhadravāhanaṃ pre(kṣya ? ṣya)prepaṇānantaro(ṣasthāprati ? pasthāpita)ratho rathamudārasārathimupatasthe |

raṇotsavāyobhayorapi rathavarau kālapadanyāsaśalyānukāribhiḥ kala(śā?) dhautakiṅkiṇīravaiḥ kālāmbhodanādasa(ndo ? nde)hadāyimiḥ snigdhanemighoṣāhūtayā vidyunmālayeva labdhamānayā jāmbūnadamālayā pranṛttakālakālarātribhujalatāyamānayā pracalantyā vaijayantyā digdāhalagnadahanairiva hatāvāsagnasandarśanāvatī(rṇeḥ ? rṇaiḥ) suvarṇasūryacandratāgṛhaiḥ kāmapi darśanīyatāṃ.....ṭrosuśca rathacaryāsvatyāhitalāghavatvāt sarvāṃ sarvāṅgamabhirameyatvācca bahuprakāraṃ pracakāśāte(?) | tathābhyuccaraduccaśīkarāracakraśabdamiṣṭaka.....ḍahanasāvamānaharaśarānukāriṇo saurabheyaniṣyandasalilapātākāreṣu kuṭicāreṣu khāṇḍavadahanābhimānagrasta(naya?)nāgāṅganābhogabhīṣaṇo bahvavāntaramaṇḍaleṣu.....ṭadalakomale bhedabhāsuramiva samarasāgaraṃ darśayantau parasparāmisaraṇeṣūtpātarudhiravṛṣṭipāṭalo yudhyamānamivārkāṅgārakaṃ vāsareṣu dvidhābhayaṃ tāviva kanakāndhakapālau rathāṅgordhvatara.....ḍdhābhyantareṣu parasparaparisṛteṣvadharabhavanodbhidyamānagajadantamaulicampakamuṇḍamālāvibhramāvatisṛteṣu parasparodārādiva garbhaśoṇitarāgapāṭalāṅganiṣpatantau rudhirabindusantaraṇeṣu harikhuradalitajalanidhipravāladhūliravapaṭalapāṭalaṃ ravirathamiva prakāśayantau kṣatajalohitahatamaṅgalāṅgocchrayātikrameṣu vindhyāgrakūṭalagne vaimānikavimānalīlāmiva laṃghayantau dīpadhvajena bhuvanaṃ rathāṅgena diśaḥ śaraiḥ śravaṇādi ca nemiśabdena dārayantau guruvismayavismitapra(tha ? dha)(na)karmaṇāvekṣamāṇasya kṣatriyasamājasyotphullapracalatārakairakṣi(pra?)vrajairakṣairivāmyā bhrāmyatāmabhrairiva rugmarathaśramodbhūtavidyudbhrāntimabhrāntimandhakāracakrairiva kṣatajapāṭalacakravākapravṛttamārtāṇḍapatanabuddhibhiruddhūtamatibhūtaṃ bhramarasantānairiva tataccharamukhaśatakṛtaśatadalakānanāgairullāsitasāgassalilairiva sakalalokakṣayotpannakalpāpāyakalpanairutpatitamadhvasṛksrotobhiriva pravahanmahāpuruṣakīrtipravāhajanitajāhvavīsalilasandeharosāpītamāśīviṣairiva dhavalacchatramaṇḍape sambhūtāmṛtavṛṣṭivṛṣṭimiruccalitamapi cintakavacasa(ha)srairiva suralokagatapravīrānugāmibhiḥ gaganatalasthagitamutpalavanairivāpsaraścāṭukāraśūropanīyamānairācchāditā diśastamālakānanairiva paryasakalabhasaṃrambhakṣubhitaśoṇitapurau mādhavanidāghāviva sitātimuktapāṭalau mahādhvajadhūlikaraṇapakvavigrahāvbhyamalīmasapaṭukaraṇau maṇḍalitamahādhanvānāvapi pītāmbulatagāviva videhamāturāgodbhāvitamandau(?) rudrajanārdanāvivāniruddhakṛtabāṇakalahakṣumitaśoṇitapurau parasparaśakticchedanāvapyacchinnavijṛmbhamāṇaśaktī nṛtyantāviva yuddharaṅge ciraṃ cikrīḍatuḥ |

rathapadakamalamādhavīkucakalaśagalitakālāgarupaṅkapatrabhaṅgasaṅkrānticitre citrakarmā magadharājo mālaveśvarasyoraṃsi aśanima(heri ? drāvi)vākhaṇḍaśaktiṃ śaktiṃ pareṇa raṃhasā cikṣepa | jagrāha ca manasi mānasāraṃ vallabhevātiraktahṛda(ya ? yā) |mūrcchāpagamopacāreṇa ca paryaśrusvajanasampāditena candana(jva?)tālavṛntādinā pratyāśvastaḥ sarvaprakāramātma(ja ? ba)lena mānuṣeṇājayyameva rājahaṃsamākalayya hrīta iva kiñcidatyabhi(vā ? mā)nādananyagatirāmardakaprasā(dā?)dalabdhamānagarbhaṃ śrīgarbhaṃ sasmāra sapatnanibarhaṇāya |

anantaraṃ ca tamātapantam agniśikhāvalībhiḥ, prasārayantamiva jihvāsahasrāṇi, raktacandanacarcābhiścarcayantamiva nabhastalaṃ, (va ? bā)lātaparājibhiśca ra(ra ? ñja)yantamiva diṅmukhāni, sandhyārāgamṛjābhibhāvayantamiva meghapaṭalāni, rudhirasrotobhiḥ pūrayantamivāṇḍakapālodaram, udīrṇaraṇoṣmadhūmavisaravidrāṇavidyādharamarciraṅgāritagrahagaṇamanvagaṇaḥkṛpāṇamantaḥkaraṇe kṛtanamaskāramānītamahākāḷamanārataṃ parameṇa samādhinātisato yathāpuramapalitaprayogayāstramālayālavaśaścakarta(?) |

sa tu śakalaiḥ kuliśairiva sakalakulaśailagirimarmāṇi gātrāṇyasya bhittvā hatvā ca sāra(thi)māmarddevoṣmaṇa(?) paśyata eva bhayavismayabharabharitasphuritacetasastribhuvanasya devānubhāvapratighaṭitayathāpurākṛtiḥ pratyagacchat | mūrcchayā kīrtyeva ruddhasakalāśayā (ri ? rī)to rathatalpaśayyāṃ yāti (samaḥ ? sma) sa mānaveśaḥ | tadā ca kvacittūryamiśrāḥ ka(rṇī ? ṇṭha)ravāḥ, kvacidaśrugadgadahāhākārāḥ, kvacidatyuddhatāni pramodanṛttāni, kvacidatikṛpaṇānyavanīpṛṣṭhaveṣṭanāni, kvacidvividhadaivānuvarṇanāni, kvacidvicitrāṇi kṛtāntopalambhanāni, harṣaviṣā(da)vyatikarādubhayānurūpamivāhavāṅgaṇatalamabhavat | amuṣmiṃśca saṃyuge na bhāratasamara(ya?) ivaiko bhīmagadāhatasuyodhane......putrāṇāmiyattā, na gurūṇāmapi kula.....ṇto, na bhīṣmāṇāmapi śaraśayanaśāyināṃ saṅkhyā, na śakalitānāṃ śalyānāmavadhi(rni ? rna)cchinnānāṃ vīravāhanā......parimāṇaḥ, na nihatānāṃ....l̤ānāṃ gaṇā(ni ? na) nibarhitānāṃ bṛhatkṣatrāṇāṃ pramāṇaṃ, na mathitānāṃ jayadrathānāṃ paryantaḥ | tathā ca na duśśāsanānāṃ saṅkhyā.....ṇa citrasenānāṃ purumitrāṇāṃ na nandakānāṃ na senāpatīnāṃ nālocanānāṃ na lolupānāṃ nogrāṇāṃ na bhīmānāṃ na bhīmarathānāṃ na bhīmabāhūnāṃ na samānānāṃ na vikaṭānāṃ na durjayānāṃ na jayasenānāṃ na durmukhānāṃ na durdarśānāṃ na suśarmaṇāṃ na cārucitrāṇāṃ na vikarṇānāṃ na paṇḍitānāṃ pātitānāmadṛśyata pāram |

api ca naiko′pi kṛtavarmā sakṛpastataupayāyotāśrūyatadaśikhāmaṇigrahaṇabhagnavīramadhye gauramupalakṣayāmaḥ | bahavaśca sutasomāḥ sudakṣiṇāḥ ketumantaḥ suśarmāṇa uttamaujasaśca kṣatriyāstatra kṣayaṃ gatā gīrvāṇānām (?) |

kiṃ bahunā, devāsuratārakāmayayostṛtīya iva sa mahāhavo vṛttaḥ | patikadambaroddhūtaraktāsārasiktamiva tāvadambaratalamālohitāyatānyonyadhvajabharaṇavisṛvīrāstrayādṛṣṭikacchedahṛta ivāhavadhvajaḥ papāta bhānumān(?) | abhinavabandhūkarucirasandhyāraktajaladharāntarasthagitaradanagrahānīkamadhomukhaprapīyamānalokajīvitamadhumadoñcalasya kapolādarśasaṅkrāntarudhirasindhurakulakīrṇaśaṅkhaprakīrṇakanikarakṣālitasya kāḷarātrimukhasya kālarātrimukhamanukartuḥ śaśāka śaśāṅkatāniva śūramukhāravindamukuḷanāya lulitalohitapredemalīnamahībhṛtāṃ sitātapatrāṇikṣatriyasiṃhamūrcchāndhakāradattasāhāyyamiva santatāna santamasantarāṇi nirviśaṅkaṃ diśāndhakārakavacikāsvanīnimivāvibhāvyan vihaṅgarūpāsu di......kṣatamajjavasāmāṃsapaṅkapatitā gāḍhamūlodhvastitānāṃ dhvajavanānāmāśrayati śikharadeśādastagālepapicchilapakṣapuṭavikṣepakhedakuñjitorastenulaṃ cucūṣitarudhirapūrṇalamboda......kadambakesaraśiraḥkuṇḍaleṣu sāndrāṅgavalayahāramekhaleṣu(?) kālakarmāntikeṣviva saṅgrāmapraśaṃsāvācāṭeṣu bhramatsu yātudhāneṣu prasuptarājahaṃse mūrcchādhvāntamuṣitakuvalayavibhāge sarasīva niravatāre śyāmībhavati māgadhānīke, duṣkarakarmapāradṛśvānaṃ mālaveśvaramabhibhūya jayatyuddāmaharṣavegamukharita(vinda ? bandi)varga iva bandhuvarge, jhaṭiti jātāvegāḥ kleśino′pi balavadāviṣṭā iva hṛṣṭavāladhayaḥ stabdhavarṇā rathamasārathiṃ yathāsvamākarṣanto dṛśyamānapavanavegayāthātathyā rathyā rājahaṃsaṃ ra(thāṅge ? ṇāṅga)ṇādapohuḥ |

aspṛṣṭajanapado cādhvānā gahanād gahanaṃ sari.....ṣandheracalasandhimāpa(panta ? ta)nto naktandivamapavāhyāparedyu(dā ? rā)rdradravadacchacandrakāntaśikharavāridhārāvate pātāḷatalānukāriṇi paṭṭacadrakacagrahapralīnapiṇḍita iva tamasi naiśe kasmiṃścidabhraṃlihalikucaśākavakuḷavañculaniculasālamālāṣaṇḍe divyauṣadhibhiravandhye kandare madavaśakuṭinīḍagalitakalakaṇṭhapulindadvandvayuvatiprayāme yāmavatyāḥ prathame pramathitavanalatāvanasandānajāla(ja ? ga)litajaṅghāja(vaṃ ? vāḥ) vanakuñjarabhagnavṛkṣaviṭapotsaṅgalaṅghanaglānagātrāḥ netrapuṭahanamṛditaniśitaśaṅkukaṇṭakalikhitacchūnakakṣayolīnibiḍavagurasandhrirandhrolbaṇāsthipañjarāveditograkṣudhaḥ kṣaradāsra(gu ? ga)ṇakaṇānuviddhalālavasrā vilambaśithilakomalavalitābhrajihvā jahurasūn (?) |

a(śo ? śe)ta ca patiravaśo viśām, aśāntasattvatayā punarāhādibhiracalakandarānilairavaśyāyavarṣavāhibhirupohyamāno māsaṃ kila kiyadivopalabdhipāṭavam(?) | āruroha cāsyāḥ śrotramārgamabhyarṇe gulmavyavadhānaḥ suma(ntri ? te)riva suśrutādibhiḥ sahālāpaḥ | śānto′yaṃ giricarakarivaracaraṇapātitānāmaśmanāṃ syandananeminirghoṣānukārisampātaravaḥ | tadāpyāśrūyatām(?)——atra khalu sumitrasuśrutasumantrāṃstrī......cakṣuṣmato yuṣmānamahamābabhāṣe | bahada....r̤āspadam | ete khalu vayamavanipālādiṣṭādiṣṭaścalaphalitamalabhyaviśramanidānamadīnanirvahaṇīyamarthamabhyupetya(?) vana.....ṃanatibahuśvāpadamanyajānapadānālīḍhaprati......vatyavibhāgamābhoga(pade ? vada)nekasānuvapramaprakaṭapraveśamārgamabhyupagatāḥ smaḥ | prasūtavatī ca devī dīrghāyuṣa.....ẏā sānugrahādi.....ḍhavijananā locanotsavaṃ cāmīkarakamalakomalaṃ kumāram | asya cāyamekādaśo divasaḥ | prayatapurohitabalimantrahomakṛtarakṣāvidhānaṃ cai.....ṃidamanardhaprāyam | api tu bhartṛvyavadhinaścintāhṛtāhṛtāvakāśāpi bhartṛdārakarakṣājāgarasudūrotsāritāpyanucitā cāsyāṃ velāla......pṛṣṭavatyanuparata....r̤āsutāprakaro′gniḥ sukhāḥ suravivaragāhanadvāramaprastutavirasarasātalapraveśābhyuvāyā satyohapulindasarvendriyagrāmapadīgrāhā.....ẏagaṇakalatrasthānamakhilalokalocanā vimiṣato.....ṃanekājālamantaḥkaraṇakamalamukulanālīkatamisrāsattvatejostamavāstagirikandara......bhidhānadvārā vivithānamudrāniṣprā spṛṣṭa eva (pa ? ca) tathā pṛṣṭhamāropya kenāpi nīpamānaṃ dṛṣṭavān nabhasi naḥ kumāram(?) | tiṣṭhati cotpatantaṃ pṛṣṭhato′sya putraharaṇo kṛt......bhūpatiṃ bhujadaṇḍavigalitāṃ ca bhuvastalamavalepābhiṣyandāśva iva gandhatailabindavaḥ patanto maghopalakṣitā lakṣmīcocanajanakarāñjanakledamārabhatamālīna......vasanaṃ ca nīlamaṃśukamīdṛśo′yamaripākasvādasvamasampadasammukhāni cāmūni nānāvidhāni durnimittāni(?) tathā(pya ? hya)nigrāhyavigrahagrāhagrahagrāmavāmatonmādavāraṇau paurāṇāmagresarodbhadhanānakatamaṃściralākhaṇḍamaṇḍalohite grahayuvā va viddha ivātidhoraparighonadīpanīlalohitadhavaḷo bhūtadbhūyaso′pi halatipatyaṅgasvargalokadigdāhadahanadhūnanāyeva bhītabhītayātisatyārundhatyā pṛṣṭhataḥ kṛto bhagavān vasiṣṭhaścatuśśaṅkarabhisarati dvijendradārāṃ rohiṇīṃ dṛṣṭamiva jagadabhāvamakṣamapraviṣṭā eva puṣyo dhūmaketudhūpaprajvalito′pasavyakramādudbhramayati bhuvanamayasamāsāvaseno moghaṃ maghavāṃ svaṅgāraka kareti vācamaśubhāgiraḥ śamanī nāma śuśrūṣuvāpratagravaṇo dhiṣaṇaḥ prayāti vakraṃ śaśinā gṛhītamiti śaṅke hāmṛyukṣaṃ bhāskaravyabhagṛhṇātipracaṇḍa iva pratadhno′pi jvalavyavaṣṭabhya proṣṭhapade pūrvapūrvavadeva purohitastirohitabrahmarāśi bhramati vakrenuvakrakriyācakrakāghirabūḍho gūḍhajālāhirālohinībhirlohitāṅgo gṛhaṅgābhṛṅgā surasammitā iva muṣitabhāsaḥ saptarṣayaḥ sorassurapurodhasorahasamupaviśākhamiva nirdantāvardayantaḥ kṛttikāḥ parvacaturdaśapratipaṭṭānabhedacihnamagnāyedamindravajrahatamiva paśya bhajyate vindhyaśikharamasmādāpaḥ vedāyante gotrāṇāmusrā iva ca vatsotsukā muhuramandaṃ śabdāyante(?) | jvalantyulka....r̤antyaśanayaḥ, patanti rudhiramāṃsavarṣāṇi, rudantyaśivāḥ śivāḥ, bhramanti bhīmā vāyavaḥ, vahanti pratīpamāpagāḥ, hasanti devatāpratimāḥ, vāti saumyo hemātrala......paśyāmītyabhidadhatyeva tasminnāryāḥ paritrāyadhvam ayamasau haṃ(sa)rūpaḥ praviśya ko′pi kumāramākṣipya pāpakārī niranukrośaṃ krośantīnāmevāsma.....ṃabhyutthitāḥ | hā kaṣṭamativṛtta eva dhṛṣṭo dṛṣṭiviṣayam | muṣitāḥ smaḥ kva devo rājādhirājo rājahaṃsaḥ | kathamamuṃ durātmānamanyāyakāriṇa.....ṇakti(tva ? kva) cāmātyāḥ sumatyādayaḥ | kathama(yaṃ ? muṃ) sukumā(raḥ ? raṃ) krūrakarmaṇāmunāpi nīyamānaṃ nābhidhāvantīti trāsakātaraṃ kurarakāminīnikarumbavirāḍa......vopabṛṃhitadhvanirudajihīta straiṇasyātikaruṇo mahānākrandaḥ | tena cānekaduṣṭadiṣṭiliṅgasaṃsiddhacihnatūryaka.....ṭhitodvṛtavihvalahṛdayātikṣiprotkṣipyamāṇamūrtayaḥ sāhahastamutthitāḥ(?) samabhipatya parṇabhavanamarbhakaśa......ṣkaḷaṅkamapi stenami(va) (śrū ? bhrū)ṇahanamiva hataviśvāsamiva svāmidruhamiva gurukalāvaruddhamiva dharmāpavādinamiva......ṇamiva nikṣepahāriṇamiva guṇatiraskāriṇamiva kūṭasākṣiṇamiva kulapāṃsanamiva kutsanīyakarmaṇāmagragaṇyamātmānaṃ manyamānāḥ, manasā vilīyamāne.....'śanipāta ivānaukahāśchinnapātaṃ peturapratipattiyogādamātyāḥ | dharmajñatayārtaśabdānāṃ saṃsāradharmāṇāmanūtanatvādadharmāṇāmanityatopakramāṇāmanyā(yato ? yo)palakṣitatvādalakṣaṇānāṃ niyatavibhramāṇām abhyāsābhīkṣṇabhāvitatvādabhāṇḍabhaṅgurāṇāmabhāgyabhaṅgināmāsvādasuguṇitatvācca nisargadāruṇānāṃ daṇḍadaivaduśceṣṭitānāmaniṣṭaśśokāvaṣṭambhaścetaṣa kapraveko pravivekena nītvā manasā kaśmalamaśmanevadṛtkapālamālokasa hararayantaṃ cakṣurasahyaśokākṣiptāścitrasaṃskāratayā putrānveṣaṇāya praviṣṭāmiva varaguhām(?) āku(ṇḍi ? ñci)tavāmahastena dattagaṇḍopadhānāmṛjuprasāritetarakarapratipīḍitaikahastamābhagnajñā....r̤arucamukhamākīrṇamalinapāśāmāvalitadṛṣṭikavivṛttapṛthunitambabhāgamanujānu(jānu?)janitajaṅghāsvastikamavyavadhānaṃ śayānāṃ daśāntarāntaritasapatnīmatsaramatsū sisṛkṣayā kṣamāmivāliṅgya mabhrapadmānā(?)mātmasutāpahāriṇo′nudhāvanatayāntarikṣe gamanayogyaṃ prāṇādipavanapañcakamiva mūrcchayoccarantīṃ śarīrādavanipṛṣṭhapīḍanātikṣarat kṣīreṇa kṣitipativirahadagdhadahanabhasmabhāvitasutasrehapravāhavāhineva stanayugena paśyatāmapi hṛdayamārdrayantīṃ kucakapolasaṅkrāntadīpālokanatayā śokapāvavamiva hṛdyamantarmukhenodgirantīṃ vṛddhaparijanāśrumiśrairmūrcchāpanodacandanajalabindubhiḥ santāpavilīyamānalāvaṇyabudbudānukārādiva karāḷitāṅgīṃ lalita(la?)veṇīparimalābhisāribhiḥ kṣaradbhiralikadambakairanyakarmajanitairmalinakarmabhiḥ kaceṣbiva gṛhītvā nijaphalānubhūti(ru ? sa)maye prabodhāyotthāpyamānāṃ tanayāna(na)nalinakāvalo(ko)tsavāsta(mā ? mayā)daprayojanamiva cakṣuḥ pakṣmamālayācchāditavatīmativirasaṃskṛtāṅgasaṅgatyāgāsahiṣṇutayā nirgamakṣamavilambinā kāyoṣmaṇeva sāpārvānadhiṣṭhitamadhikataropaśuṣkamadharapuṭaṃ dadhānāṃ(?) vanalatāmiva chinnaviprakīrṇā kusumamañjarīmiva kapikaralūnāpagangha.....ṣaudāminīmiva jaladotsaṅgād bhraṣṭāṃ śaśāṅkalekhāmiva dvapāṅgarāśinipatitā(?)matikaruṇadarśanāṃ magadharājamahiṣīṃ dadṛśuḥ |

dṛṣṭā ca tāṃ tadavasthāmāsrāya.....ḍṛṣṭayaścintayānvabhūvuḥ | tato bala vidherasāmpratācaraṇadohaḷamābhyāṃ pariṇāme bhavitavyaṃ caraṇābhyāmiśrate kila jalaṃ te līlāravindakalanā......parimlāniśaṅke manyante | nirmālyā dānanī iva yatra kvacana vikṣipte kṣame śayitum | etau kila kucakalaśau kalaśaṣvajā.....ḍuṣkuḍumbāmbukumbhāviva nirapekṣapraviddhaprastarito luṭhitu muṣṭyā nyāyau | eṣa kila cikurakalāpaḥ sakalātīyakusumamaura.....ṭakṛttacamarīkalāpabhāra iva yatheṣṭaviprakīrṇavyākulo niṣṭhāyā draṣṭavyaḥ kaṣṭaṃ bata etānyeva kila gātrāṇyāpacayabahaḷahaṃsatūla.....ġamapratīkāravastubhirupaceruḥ(?) |

pratipannasaṃjñā tu sā kṣaṇamandhakāranirgateva prasuptotthiteva mṛtapratyāgateva lokāntaro.....ṃanyamivopalabhamānā kitavi(?)tūṣṇamiśeta | śītakriyāprabandhādhirūḍhasaṃskārapāṭavā punarunmathiteva saṃjvaritevonmāda......candrābhi(ru)ttiṣṭhantī bhrāntau vṛttārtatārakṣuttādapi pratipakṣapaṅkti(?)sphāraya(nti ? ntī) locanadvayaṃ prasaratpariśoṣapīyamānakṣānti.....ṣavicchinnadurupalavā ca vācā (kṣa ? kva)me putrakaḥ kva me putraka ityāvegavivartamānā vihvalaṃ vilapamānā(?) bahuḷakhedodbhidya.....ḍhāvadakṛtārthalocanā (u ? ta)tkālaviśṛṅkhalībhavatparijanākrandasūcitasutāpahārā hṛtavatse(va) gṛṣṭiḥ hā kaṣṭaparamparā.....ṭanirjharaprativisargāya(bā ? mā)ṇabāṣpamukti muktakaṇṭhaṃ virarāsa | tasyāñca kalāyāmupadattamastakāmighātakṣaratkṣatajābhyutthitekṣaṇāndhavikala.....ṇiviṣṭakṛṣṭatīkṣṇakaukṣeyakakṣepakṣaritakukṣidravyasarvasva......bhīṣaṇa bhrūlatāpatanapradhāvamānabhrāntabhṛṅgāradhāriṇīkanirdayakaraṇa.....ṃudbandhanarajjuracanasarūpaṃ dikṣu jvarajalajatāsrutau majja.....ṃanīkamajayyaduḥkhānilaniścayacchatradhārikāpṛcchyamānācchanirjhariṇī......ṇa praharaṇācakitacāmaragrāhiṇīsamanviṣyamāṇadāvapradeśamaṃśukapaṭaparyantopadhānavihatavepanarasanonmūlanarabhasakaraniruddha......ktalo(?) krandyamānabandhunāmadheyamupālabhyamānanānādaivatamanuvarṇyamānadārakākāramupakṣipyamāṇarājavikrama......vargamudghuṣyamāṇātharvamantravaiphalyamākruśyamānadaivatacaritamapāvidhyamānasakalagātramukṣipyamāṇabhujala.....ḍharaṇipṛṣṭhamunmattarāṣṭramiva kṣaṇamanabhirāmakṣobhamaraṇyābhogamaṇḍalaṃ tadabhavat |

tasya ca tadavasthasya tata ivo......canadyutibhirbhidyamāna iva vyākulabāṣpapallavairnṛtyanniva gātravikṣepairgāyanniva ruditakākubhirvādayanniva sta.....ḍarśanaraśmibhirbahuprakāramādhibandhuredhāñcakre | niśśūkaśokaparavaśā tu devī yākādiva nārikā(?) tathā ciraṃ vi......praśāntā triśaṅkumiva kutsitātmānamadhomukhañca sthitamanantare mantrivargamavyucchinnasalīladhārāyavyatula(?) śoka.....ṇyuvegā gadgadikāvagṛhyamāṇakaṇṭhī sakaruṇamavādīt | āryāḥ paśyata mahānī(?)mātmajamukhakamalāvalokanāma....r̤apyandhakārayati dharaṇirapyanārādhanayate gaganamapi ghanatvamāpadyate marudapi tyajati ceṣṭānuguṇyam agnirapi tano......jyāmudadhe....r̤iktībhavati sarvo′pi gatimuparuṇaddhi sādhavo′pi nirdayāyante yuṣmādṛśāñca vacanamanyathā bhavati asmatkarmaṇāmanavadātānā.....ṣāhāyyaprasareṇa prabhāveṇa manye cā(nyanma ? smad)duṣkṛtānām | avasitāni sarvakāryāṇi | anyatkṛtikṛtādyabhayaṃ bhagnamasmadbhāgyabhīro bhavitavyatāyāḥ(?) | tadevamalakṣaṇā na śakṣyāmi kṣapārutaiḥ patyuḥ kṣapitasarvasvākalpā tatpādamūle kṣeptuṃ kṣīṇapuṇyamātmānam | a(stva ? stu)khalvatimalīmasānāmadhikaniṣṭhurasvabhāvānāṃ lohajātīnāṃ tadatiśāyinīnāñca madvidhānāmanyanārīṇāṃ malaśodhanāya devo hutāśa eva me śaraṇam | upanayata madañjaliṃ ciramamarapatisadṛśatejaso devasya rājahaṃsasya pādamūlam | vijñā(pa)yata ca vidhivisaṃvādaveditā varākī vā mṛgīpadapatanūnapātatanumadhanyāmavākīryāṇaṃ gateti(?) | bhavatāmapi cāyamuparacitaścitāgniyācanāyāñjalirityavaśīryamāṇalocanajalabindusantānatārakaklinnastanataṭamapratisaṃhāryamanuvegasphuritādharakapolamanyonyaghanakugmalāyamānakaṃpra(ka?)karapuṭamādīnadṛṣṭiparidevitakaruṇamālapantīm avanitalanihitamastakā nipatyāmātyāḥ sumatyādayo bahuvidhamanunayārthasambaddhamāsrakaṇṭhāḥ samācacakṣire |

teṣāṃ tu mandamandajanitavākyāvakāśo nirjitalokatantraṃ sucedīḥ(?) | dṛṣṭāni śrutāni ca bahutarāṇi santyāścaryāṇi saṃsāravilasitāni | tathāpyevamevedaṃ patāsthānaṃ hatakṛtāntadu(śce)ṣṭitākasyānya evāyaṃ saṅkrāntiprakārodbhavabhaṅgivilālāsyāṃ pūrvamevedaṃ chedanapratāraṇānāmanyadevedanirvacanamatibodhāgamagahanaṃ duḥkhābhiṣaṅgapātānām, abhinaveyamudgrāhaṇāt sarvānarthasannipātaprabandhākrandadaṇḍakānām(?) | asya khalu rasati saṃsāre dṛṣṭapūrvasya śrutapūrvasya vāśubhāgresarasya śokātiśayarāśeḥ śakyame ruditāni vākrandāni vā parihevitāni vā stanorastāḍanāni vā mastakavighaṭṭanāni vā mahīpṛṣṭhaveṣṭanāni vā gotravikartanāni vā dai(vaṃ)garhaṇāni vā śakunapratyākhyānāni vā pravrajyāgrahaṇāni vā yogyarūpāṇyadveṣṭu sarvaṃ hi na prāvṛṣeṣvapi prāyeṇa śokasthānaheyāni prāṇidharmacintāpathyāni vairāgyanidarśane niyamyāni jñānāpekṣayā palitavyāni kṣutpipāsābhyāmupekṣyāṇi kālagatyā nirvartyāṃni sukhapravyukṣepāntaraiḥ lokayātrāmātrānuvartanīyāni tāni nibiḍanirgamayitumalamanekapratyanīkatayā loke′smin na santāpasāgare na vālatāratīrthaṃ labhate(?) | tathā hi——haṃ.....ḥṛtāṃ samādhiriti sa edau bhagnaṃ katha(ma)valambate(?) | kimapratisamā(dhā ? dhe)ye vastunyaphalameva locanajalānyutpa(ta)ntīti | inulābha kumārarūpāmṛtarasajñānāṃ tadanumārgasṛṣṭādhiṣṭhānānāmevānupādāso′haṃparihāryārthaḥ kāryākāryavivekahāryamāryo vaiḍhūryakāryatvaṃ.....ṭvasyamārye vāryatāmiti kimaparaṃ dhairyamādhairyeṇāsave punaranādṛta.....ṃānarthaṃ mūlamasyāṃ dṛśāyāṃ ta eva yadi hāryate dū......kāryatyāga iti kiṃ tadāptyākaṃ tadanusmṛtiduḥkhasannipātajvaramahāvadhena maraṇena(?) | sādhīya eva vyavasitamiddhe jātavedasi dagdha......pāvakasya | punariha kiñcidasti sañcintanīyaṃ pratibhāti | smṛtibalopanītamanikṛṣṭanidarśane svayameva tāvadālocaraḥjapu......vāraṇādicihnamahnāyaiva tribhuvananāthe ninīṣa eva vijṛmbhamāṇarāgaṃ caraṇāravindayugaḷam, ājānuvilambināvaruṇatalasapari......śailaśikharamālāsālāyā va(ṣa ? rṣa)parvatamahāprāsādamāli(la?)nyā mahīnaganagaryā(sto?)storaṇahiraṇmayadrumāṅkurāvi(lo ? vo)pajātau bhujau rājakesarikiśorakasyevātimāṃsakomalāṃsadeśaḥ, sakalalokapravīravyajanīyaśobījavāpīkedārikāyugaḷamiva dhavalāyātaviśālamakṣiyugalam, amṛtajyotiṣveva bhagavantokākiraṇanāḷī svamaṇḍalāllāvaṇyanivahavāhinīvadanacandrāpyāryamāṇā nikṣiptabhāyatyaṣṭāpadaramaṇīyaṃ lalāṭam, ūrṇājananyeva kenāpyalakṣyarūpyeṇa paridhāryamāṇamātapatramiva lakṣyate śi(raḥ), tadevamākṛtayaḥ puruṣā na spṛśanti jagadabhayayā tvāsthayatikebhāvam(?) | ato′sau niyatamamaraiśvarya.....ġatvādabhājanatvānmānuṣyakamalinakṣudraduviṃvāsādīnāṃ vidyādhareṇa kenāpi vidyābalaparigṛhītarūpāntareṇa vidyādharalokaṃ nītaḥ | anyathā haṃso bālamavagṛhya gacchatīti kiṃ ghaṭate | na ca tathāvidhā mahātmānaḥ svamohakalānubaddhena vā sukharā.....ṣaṅgena vā vismṛtya duḥkhamagnabandhuvargamitarajanavartmanā (na?) vartante | śrūyate khalu udayanatanayo naravāhanadattanāmāsurabalātkṛtamānasaveganī(tayā ? tāyā) mañju vā madanama(ñjūkayā ? ñjukāyāḥ) kṛte′nutapyamānastadākāraṃcantakṛpayā durnivāramadana(yā) vegavatyā saṅgtya tadupakramaṃ krameṇa khacaranāyakaḥ prāptavān(?) | yogatya punaḥ punarabhyanandayitvā tato bhagavataśca bharyābhārāvatāṇaścakrapāṇeḥ(?) prāṇasa(mayā ? māyāṃ) rukmiṇyāmutpannamātraḥ putraiṣiṇā tribhuvanamahitamāyena māyāśambareṇāpahṛto nihatya ta(da ? ma)ntaḥpuraniruddhayā pūrvadehadayitayā sahaiva ratyāgataḥ pradyumnaḥ | tadasāvapi kumāraḥ samāhlādayiṣyatyavaśyamavatate tābhiryoṣitaṃ ekaśoṣitahṛdayanirvāṇopayogi vacanamidaṃ pralobhanatvenāvagantuṃ bhavati yāsāmaśanavyathanasvapanakopanamātrasaṃjñāvatīnāmastavatīrṇanipuṇalokayātrātīrthānāmanātharṇakarṇāvasyarandhrābhāsānāṃ nātibhidā tiraścityo na tathāsihānupe prathamavaryasyadhiprayatnenāpi spṛhaṇīyāsu vidyāsu vyutpāditā kalāsu patyuśca viditavedyasya pādamūle.....ṣakhī vā saptnī vā samaraṃ sarasvatormitāsi tadyadadyakaduktiṃ maduktamadīyamuktame viramyād virāmaniścayād vṛttikṣasyastha kaścit kālāṃśamāśopanibane hi satyaṇīyasyapyanaṇīyaso′pyanarthopanipātā na dattadattavaitanyāvatārastaratyaprakṛto lokaḥ kāruṇyasthavikramātiśayamapratyayānityāsannavyasanarāśau rakṣogṛheṇa dūṣitamanutsṛjatyaivāsūn sītāyānāntarastāsāmabalānāṃ yāsāmuttīrṇaduḥkhārṇavānāṃ punarupāvartanta sampattayaḥ(?) | prasīda devi! pratinivartitumasmadvijñaptimityudañjaliragamaduttamāṅgena gām |

atha sā niścayavaniścayāpi(?) tadanurodhānmandībhūtamaraṇārambhā tasthau |

mantriṇo′pi tajjanamavitānaṃ pratisamādhāya pṛthagāsāñcakrire(?) | vyā(ja)hāra ca sumatiḥ——evaṅgate kānanaṃ pra......śrutaḥ suśrutaḥ | nanu samāpta eva naḥ sarvārambho bhartṛbhītyātmanā tataḥ praviṣṭaṃ daivāvaṣṭambhadustaraṃ śatrukṛcchramitaṃ kimapyāsaṅgavastuṣṭamā......kāya nisṛjya toyāñjalimāmutrikaṃ hitamupāsitam | api tu bahuvicitratayārthagatīnāmavanipālodayaṃta yāthātmyaparigamāvasānikaṃ yuktamekāntagra.....ṭasminnutpannā pratyavamarga svayamanyena vā kenacidanarvā nṛgopaviṣṭodarkāṇyeva kulavairāṇyākalayya sandhānāya kuryānmatiṃ pratikṣaṇasulabha......vartamānaḥ prapeyena kvacidapūrṇakāma eva kālapāleḷamanargaḷapuruṣādhikārādhitavā daivataṃ satvakapakṣarāgi samagravīrāgresaragāminīṃ pānaṃ kayācadanugrahakalayā yojayet | anumaścaiṣāṃ sambhaviṣayatyasmadbhāgyaśeṣāṣekṣāpakṣeṇa idaṃ nipeddhatyo niyutya carmabhīṣīmakṣigakṣitāñcentvidevakakṣaṃ tapaḥkṣamaṃ samāpayiṣyāmaḥ | anyathā tamevāvartamānāmasyāmo yathāpuraṃ vārtā ca bharturnnacirādeva vyaktībhaviṣyatīti(?) |

asminnantare duḥkhaniprākhedabhāradīpiteṣu parijaneṣu pramādaśaṅkāhṛtamūkeṣvekāntasthiteṣvantarvaṃśikapuruṣeṣu svasthānamadhvāpayatvā dhīraśāpairāptamūlāṃ dhātrīṃ pramuñcajaratījamapadeśena vañcayitvā suptaśeṣamekākinī nirgatyāntakābhisārikeva parihṛtacandrālokā gulmajālavyatiṣaṅgiṇā viviktameduradhvāntenāraṇyarandhravartmanā nidhanārthinī tadeva tarujalamājagāma yatrā′sau kṣatarujātiśāyinā manorathasahasra(vārthi ? prārtha)noditapriya(syā ? su)tāpahāravyatirekeṇāyasyamānamānaso mandāyamānakāyavākceṣṭitaḥ prakṛṣṭatamayā śucā prāṇavṛttayokṣaṇavilambinābhyasūyadbhūpatiḥ pratipattiśūnyaḥ śiśye(?) |

devyapi svasamīhitasamarthakṣamāyāṃ kvacidamuṣya e(va) vi(ṭapi)naśśākhāyāṃ pāśamuttarīyeṇāracayya kañcidiva kṣaṇaṃ strīsvabhāvakātarā snehapara(va)śā vilalāpa | deva! rājahaṃsa! kiṃ na paśyasi tavāpi nāma nābhāgabharatarāghavasamānubhāvasya bhāryāpadamadhigamya punaranāthā(ma)smin nātha māṃ samavasannāṃ vipadi vyāpadyamānāmevalavibhāvanaikātapattrasāra! puṇḍrapate! mithyāsi (ṣu ? du)hitṛvatsalo vivatsāmiva gāmutsṛjantī matsutāṃ yāto′bhidhāvasyamba bhāgīrathi! vṛthā tava manorathaḥ avirataḥ, yadāśaniṃ śokaśūlamāropitaṃ pitṛvane jano na svajanamānasannayat putrapautreṇa vardhate(?) | vatsa matsariṇā kṛtāntena matsakāśādutsāritaḥ kimiti nābhyavapatsyase pravatsya(nti ? ntīṃ) savitrīmiha bhagavantaṃ vanaspatiṃ vanadetāṃ bhagavatīñca vindhyavāsinīmayamanātho hi nātha(ne ? te) kṛtapraṇāmāñjaliḥ | praṇāvahaśārijano(?) jananāntareṣvapi janārdanādanyūnatejasaḥ pādarajasāṃ rājahaṃsasyānugrāhyā bhūyāsam | īdṛśyaścaturdaśādaśānanāṅgulaya iva maithilīṃ tasyaiva sadguṇasukumārāmasya rāmābhirāmasyānubhāvānmāmātrāvimāpibhūvantīnyudāsajyamānakaṇṭhapāśāyāmaśrukaṇṭhyāṃ mandagamāyāmupakaṇṭhyo yatnagayyāstasyāñca vartamānapriyatamāprāṇatrāṇahetorahitahetikṣataśatakṣaritaśeṣayā nātisthūṇayā varṇaśreṇyā sarvayatnasamuddhṛ(te ? ta)dhvaniragaṇitavraṇavidāravedano mā sāhasamityavocat(?) | ākarṇya ca sā kimākasmikamidamityavaśameva sphuritavismayā sāntvayanti (a)raṇyāni śāntā ce(yaṃ)(nī ? niśī)thaveleti niścitamaraṇāpi strīsvabhā(vā)dullasattrāsā.....ṭrāpi kimutthito dusthitatvā......chānacchandamicchatyanavasāne sadayitumiti sucirābhyantayā prabhūtayopanītataraḷatārakāṃ tāmeva dṛśaṃ diśamabhisasarja(?) | dadarśa vikarṣatalā......khadyotānāmivālam abhimukhadattakatipayakadāśvamaṇimayamiva kimapi manvākāramalakṣayat | āsesuṣivāsradigyayā nātiprasphuṭamaṇiprakāśaṃ mandamandavyati.....ṃāsa(?) | tadupalambhanārambhakāriṇa ca stambhitagati ka(pi ? mpi)toru gurutarāyamāṇottamāṅgarekhodīraṇāviralapulakapaṅkti bhrāntalocanamupasarantī ka......bhayagadgadayā girā parijanamājuhāva | sambhrāntaparijanopanītapradīpālokalupyamānākārasaṃśayaṃ śayānamāsrasrotasarvāṅgīṇena yamapuragamanagāmukukandarājasparśaparihāraraktaṃ kañcukeneva chāditāṅgamaṅgavidāravihvalairasubhiriva siktaiḥ prasphurantīkādaramaṇibhiraṅgalagnaharakopānalasphuliṅgapiṅgalamiva saṅkalpajanmānamālohitakṣitivivirasahasrasampannatayā padmarāgavimānamivānekavātāyanaṃ patitamasadāśāmukharodhimūrcchāndhakārasparśamukulāyamā(na)locanakamaladīrghikaṃ kāḷarātrimukhavartinamaparamiva pārthivaṃ sandhyāsamayaṃ sadarasasavairivīrajīvitamarīcirātivānavṛttabānātyayadvikāradamiva raktāktaśastraśalyaratnotpalakamalapatraprastaravivartitamantarlīnāyudhaśakalaśakarilaśarīrābhyantaradoṣāt kvāpi pratiṣṭhāsūnasūniva viṣamavikṣiptapāṇipādairnisahanivartanairnirundhānam, asirasalilabhāvitavedanāsasyeṣu pacyamāneṣu kṣatreṣu lāvakāniva kāladūtamūrcchanāntamuktairdīrghaśūtkārairāhvayantamālīnaśalyagarbhāṇi bahuḷakarṇakāniva praṇavatmānāniva pariharadbhiḥ pañcavāyubhiḥ kathaṃ kathamapyariśūnyukṣyakaṃ śarahataśarīrakīlitairiva spandamānairiva gantumindriyairayogādammātmānamātmana eva jīviteśvaraṃ tadavasthaṃ dadarśa(?) | 

dṛṣṭvaiva ca muktabandhamiva tadavarudhyāgrahastena hṛdayamutkampinā kañcit sa evā(vā?)si mandabhāgadheyāyā mamāryaputra ityasakalapadagadgadaṃ vadantī duḥkhāśani(ta?)pātakātare iva taralitamalinātāmre mukuḷayantī dṛśau daśāpi kimasyāḥ pāpīyasyā darśanapathaṃ gateti jugupsayeva tirobhavantīmanupalambhamānā kimevaṃ duṣkṛtakāriṇyā yādyāpyagarvitayeti nirviṇṇayetyadya jīvitāśayā kathaṃ kathamiti dāruṇā dāruṇadaśābhipanne′pi prāṇasame prāṇityeveti kopādiva konvomathyamānasarvāvayavā maduccena durviceṣṭitasya vyasanadurlaḷita paśya bhāryāṃ bhavatsamakṣamevābhibhūyamānāṃ mayeti nṛpamivāvadhūya dharmeṇa(?) vairaniryātanā(yā)kṛṣyamāṇā patihṛdayanivāsasañjātābhirvraṇavedanābhiriva sarvātmanā paridūyamānā dharaṇyāṃ papāta |

patantyeva ca parāśriyamaparāyaṇeti(?) karuṇayeva mūrcchayā pīḍitataramāla(la)(mba ? mbe) | jajṛmbhe ca hā hatāḥ smaḥ | devaḥ kila rājādhirājaḥ parameśvaro rājahaṃsaḥ śaraśayanaṃ śāntanava ivānugṛhṇāti | kiñca yā kṛtāntahavyavatsitāmanāśāsitavasumatikālapalvalakṣaṇāyā rājalakṣmyā gatiḥ(?) | idānīmavasitāni hanta no jīvitaprayojanāni | prasavati parijanapakṣapāti deva kasyedānīṃ priyāṇi dāsavāllabhyāni kaṃ kṣamate garīyāṃsyapi karmāṇi bahu prasīdati(?) | deva kimidānīmājñonmukhaṃ bhṛtyajanamanājñāpayan kupita iva śeṣe | viśeṣeṇa dāsīm | dūṣa(yi ? yanti) mukhāravindaṃ devasyāvaśyā(ye ? ya) bindava(da? :) | dhāraya dhavaḷamātapatram | patralekhe khinno′yaṃ dīrghādhvagamanena devaḥ kiṃ......pādaśaucaḥ | śakitapūrvo devo drutamupahara (nī)hāraśītalaṃ maṇibhṛṅgārasalilaṃ salile sulabhanidrāvinodo devaḥ supta iti na visrabdhaṃ śayita.....ṭa lambaya kusu(ma)dāmāni dāruśākhāsu yāvadunmīlayati (devo?) devaḥ | dāridrikedārasīkrimaṅgāmupalakoṭibhirutthāya (gu ? ku)ru śivamagarudhūpavāsaṃ vāsagṛhaṃ......vivikṣatakṣudrān kṛtāntadūtānāyakālaṃ kālapañjari kathaya kālarātre durbhagāgarisārikāyāḥ(?), supta eva devo′pi vismṛtma tvadabhisārasaṅketam | atibhadrike vidrāvaya rudhiracandanadigdhadeha.....ṇāmṛtyukandākṣidurmadabhramarān, bhramarike vikira viṣamadīrghavartika kayaśvirananthakāre parameśvareṇa śayitavyam, anucitā hīyaṃ devasya, daśāṇike karṇajvarakrarāni kiṃ karopi kranditāni sapadi devakidevaṃ purā virahitapūrvam, pūrṇamukhi pūrṇāḥ kāmāḥ purākṛtānāṃ no duṣkṛtānā(m)(?) | ehi tāvaddahanadattade(he ? hā), devasya prāgupetya paratra sambhā(vya ? va)yā(māsa ? maḥ) paricaryām | ārya! kāñcukīya kṣarallalāṭakṣatajāḷīkṛta dhanyo′si na paśyasi devate davasthaṃ mahādevacāmari karkahā kolāhaladharmanirghṛṇahāsaṃrāramehaya bhāvyatavyāhanā niyati niśācari lokavināśalokapālāpaśada hālika darśayamayātudhāna kena doṣeṇaivamārūpyeke deva! kimātmika(?) iti kimanavadāta iti kimaśukla iti kimalokajñā iti kima(rū?)kṛpāluriti kimanāśritavatsala iti kimasatyasandha iti kimanudāra iti kimaviśārada iti kimakṛtabuddhiriti kimakṛtahasta iti kimajitendriya iti kimalabdhavarṇa iti kimbahunā bhuvanamadyaivānvakārībhūtam agatayo bata vigatabhāgadheyā(t?) bhītibhājaḥ prajāḥ | hatā magadhāḥ, hataṃ kusumapuraṃ, hatā devī vasumatī, hatā vayaṃ hā tāta hā mātariti mṛgapatihatayūthapavihvalīkṛtakareṇukāvṛndasaṅkrāntā (sa?)krandasandehakṛtmahānākrośaravo babhūva |

yonadhikṛtabhartṛnāmagrahaṇoddhātena nirghātaravanirbhedasambhramotthānasaṅghaṭṭitamiridarīmṛhagrīvāgra......vilikhitāṃsagaḷasṛkcalādayilatāhatavaiphalyanirvedādivakṣāyagrahaṇamivāvasādajuṣāṃ doṣaṃ darśayantaḥ kṣupaviṭapaviṣaktavikṣiptottarīyaṃ pariskhalantastamuddeśamabhyadhāvan(?) | anavadhyā.....ḍhyuśca dhyāyantamiva dhyeyavastu dhīratayā (vi ? ci)ttāyattamiveṣṭadaivatama(nyo ? ntyo)cchvāse smarantamiva dviṣannirākārāmarṣeṇa svapantamiva vela(vā ? yā) mādyantamiva raṇa(ra)sena mūrcchayā manasikṣatarujā śarīre rūkṣatayā cchāyāyāmudbhūtayā darśane mukuḷatayā locanayugaḷena yugapadeva spṛśyamānaṃ, paralokaprayāṇe suhṛdeva raktenopagūḍhaṃ tasyairiva(?) dhvanadbhirākandairanugatadhvajayaṣṭibhirivotthitābhirduḥkhaparamparābhiḥ parigataṃ, balairiva prasaradbhirariṣṭaliṅgai(rvalla ? rvila)kṣitaṃ, śibikayevadhirūḍhayā duravasthayohyamānaṃ, mandamindriyeṣu, paṭuṃ paritāpe(kṣamūṣma ? ṣu) vṛddhamāthiṣu prayatnapratyabhijñeyākāraṃ pṛthvīpatim | acetanasya tadavasthasya sandarśanena svapnamayena nevācāsambhāvyena kimidamiti viṣedivāṃsaḥ kṣaṇamātmānamapi nābhi(ñcūjujñaḥ ? jajñuḥ) prajābalavihitavidhvanatasatvapratyāpattayestu samarthayāmbabhūvuḥ(?) | 

idaṃ tadalaṅghyavidhānarūpam | ayamasāvanu(pa)diṣṭapratikriyo niyatyāmayaḥ | seyaṃ yadṛcchayā viguṇānabhisāriṇīśvarecchā | sa eṣa doṣabalaprasthāpano duṣṭadiṣṭaḥ sannāhaḥ | saiṣā kālayogasiddhā kalinītiḥ | idaṃ tadekāntavirasamadharmajijñāyā(?) grahaṇaṃ yadayamekaparameśvaro daśāmīdṛśīmaśaṅkitamaśubharūpairbhuvanakarmabhirgami...... | sa evāyamavyājajayārjitorjitaprabhāvaḥ prabhāvāvadhūtavaivasvatavaruṇavajrahastarājarājo rājā rājasiṃhaḥ | yasya snigdhadṛṣṭivattariṇā nṛpāṇāṃ caṇḍikābhiradha......ṣu jvalitapādapaṅkajadyutiḥ yasya ca sarasvatī mukhasarojasaroruhopamogadarśanerṣyāroṣitāyā rājalakṣmyā līlākamalaprahāragamitakiñjalkapuñjari.....ṃapi ca yasya bhaṅgibhaṅgo(?)...... |

.....ṃiha vihāya kṣupannivā jaṭilāyāṃ jaṭāṭavyāṃ priyāsya santī kitāṅga miti yatsatyaṃ paśyantyapi na śraddadhe yadapi madaraktamanatenārībhā......pāṃsukrīḍanasarvaśāstrapāradarśinaḥ svapnebhyatīnatikrāntapūrvānayukteva yotretyudaśravaṇaśravaṇabhedinā smareṇa caraṇalagnāḥ krandanti | kimetānapyabhikrudhya.....ṃamaiva mandapuṇyāyāstadalīkamalīkahaṃsakena hi vilobhyamānamugdhalocanako dagdhayā mayā manāgupekṣitaḥ sthātavyatāṃ gato′sau prasīda nātha pratinivartya ślakṣṇayā(?).....ṣuhṛda ityutthāya punaraparispandamavasitaprāyaṃ priyamupaśocya cara(ma)saṃskārasādhanopasaṃhāravyāpṛteṣu sā(śva ? śru)gadgadavyā(ghṛ ? hṛ)teṣūhāmaprayuktā(nā?)krandeṣu ca paribarhajaneṣu kṣīṇaśākṣiṃ nikṣima pradakṣaṇīkṛtya prāgeva (ga)tā priyamamutra pratīkṣyā ityāśuśukṣaṇimanutama gatyantarantaravāramātyairākrandadājñākarakarānītasāradārusandhukṣitamapi viṣṇurāndṛtāviṣṭambhamuccalopālanalaśatācālalāpaparijanamālimalinasrapayamāvayasi paścimaṃniśīthaśītale nirjharasya nirdagdhārāmaśaśirānniraśrudhārābhiḥ(?), dvāravati dhāraya dhautamaṃśukayugalaṃ galito ruditakālaḥ, kāleyike kalaya karṇe tamālapallavam alaṅkṛtā hi dayitamagrato gatā pratipālayāmi, komalike kuru caraṇamaruṇatalamacalagairikālaktakarasena praharāṇi punaranena khalamurasi yadi kayācidapsarasā saha samāsāda(yāmi ? yati), saumi(no ? ni) dehi me kusumadāmottarīyam eṣā khalu dahanadhūmadurdinābhisārikā prayāmi priyasakāśam, kāśisundari sindūrareṇubhiścāra(ca)ya ramaṇacumbanarāgalālanīyāṃ kapolapālīm, utpalike dhūpaya keśapāśam athavāyamevaitadācarati kṛṣṇāgarusārabhitticitraścitāgniṃ citravati (ku)rupatrabhaṅgaiḥ payodharakalaśāpidantanudayitakāmitaṃ raktacandanaṃ ca pranine candrakāntanitambaniṣyandadhārājamānasā priyo′nena nirvāpye tapyamānaścitrabhānunā bhānudevi bhāvīyacītadevadoṣe devatārcanakusumāni(?) | yadi kaściditaḥ pratinivarteta nagaraṃ tamālapāmi madvacanādāmantraṇīyā niryantraṇopacāryā deśātithayaḥ tithidinapakṣamāsakāritotsavāḥ śālayaśālinaḥ śālīnavāmalocanā magadhā magadhadeśamauliratnapracchannīyamacchāśayaduṣṭapuruṣaṃ puṣpapuṃpuṣpapurāvataṃsakaṃ sarvadirgasārasambhārasambhavanabhūmibhūpālamandiramudañjalinottamāṅgena sambhāvanīyaṃ, bhagavatī ca bhāgīrathī pāṭalīputrameghavanadevakhātadīrghikāharanipūrvaṃ vandanīyā(?) | vaktavyañca nagaropavanadevatānāṃ na puṇḍreśvaraduhitā vasumatī vasumatīva samudramekhalā khaleva ca kamalavāsinyūrdhvaṃ rājño rājahaṃsādāsī(bhi ? di)tyavasitaparidevitavacasi puṅgavamaraṇatvaritacetasīvyapasāraya visāritakṣatratejasi dīptatejasaṃ hiraṇyaretasaṃ ratnamandiramiva rājamānaṃ mānayitvā devaṃ devyāmabhipraveṣṭumabhyudyatāyāmāturasya ca mahājanasya krandataścandanamaya iva candrātapamaya iva candrakāntamaya iva santāpahāritayā harati cetorohidaśvairogatyāga iva bhogatyāge mohanāśa iva dehanāśe sutaprāptāviva kṣitaprāptāvaiśvaryamukha iva nāścaryasukhe mūladaśana iva kāladaśane rājyalābha iva rajjulābhe nidhānādhigama iva nijanidhanasvadhanasādhanādhigame vartamāne vārtabhūtakṣatavyatho rājalakṣmīvāsamandirāravindatayā tatsantāpanissahāṅgavikṣepakṣubhitamiva raktaparyantaṃ cakṣurunmīlya karmasiddhividravit kāladūtapṛṣṭhadarśanāyeva kiñcidu(tsavi ? nnami)tapūrvakāyo′jitāgamanamaṅgalotsavadhvajamiva bhujamudāralakṣaṇaṃ samutkṣipya dakṣiṇamarudivirahayanyamāśāmāśvāsayan asahyasantāpavartinaṃ janamavārayadavanipālaḥ(?) | maraṇake......bhūtasya lokasya (a)mṛ tāvitamityasampūrṇa, rasāyanāyitamiti lāṣayāropaṇaṃ mṛtasañjīvanāyitamiti na yāsi tāyatīṃ bhūmiṃ, nākārohaṇā(ya ? yi)tamiti (na?) ki(ñci)detat, mokṣasu......jyamāralāmāyitamiti tṛṇīkaraṇaṃ mokṣalakṣmīpratyakṣadarśanāyitamiti sutarā mapakṣepaprakāro, mahotsavāyitamiti mahadvacanīyam, indumaṇḍalāpa.....ṃānandamanubhūtapūrvamudbhutatamaṃ babhūva |

devī punarāśaṅki(ta)svamāgadheyatayāntadapitākṛtamāśvaryarūpamaśraddadhatī bala.....ṇnanāda ca dadarśa ca jaharṣa ca visiṣmiye′pica vilalāpi(?) | paryutsukaiśca mantribhirdhairyadhāritaharṣavegaiḥ yathā.....ṣāñcakre pracakrame ca vaktum | evaṃgatasyāpi me nātimuṣitayā śe(ṣa?)muṣyā puṣpapuranirgamādikuyārodantadutsā......vyatikaraṃ kṣāreṇeva punaranena kṣateṣu dagdhasyādigdhaśaraja(ṭa ? ḍa)jīvitasyeva kesariṇo ya.....ṃiva pārāvārakukṣimivāyasāṇḍakapālasampuṭamivaurva(va?)vahnidhūmalasambhārakośamiva nija....r̤akarodbhagavān bhaktavatsalo bhairavākṛtirāmardakaḥ | sa tu pra(mā?)ṇantumapyapārayantamasvātantryāda......ṣṭo′smi tavāmunā matprabhāvābhibhāvinā sattvāvaṣṭambhena | kastvadanyastamarcimālinamāścaryakṛpaṇa......vidhiviśāradena śūreṇa śamitastvamasi | tuṣya(tāṃ ? to)vidviṣaste prathagadattaṃ varamavitathīkurvatā mayā yatpuna.....ṇugra(ha)rūpameva tanmanyasva | (dya ? anya)thā naktadīpamātreṇa naikama(śvi ? dhvā)namaśvāḥ kathaṃ vaheyuḥ | bahudhunītaṭaviśaṅkaṭa.....ġurākṣacakraḥ krametāyaṃ rathaḥ | kathaṃ vaivaṃ vairiśataśarani....r̤bhanivaharomaśāyāstena ta.....ṣyaiva jambūdvīpasya jāmbūnadakirīṭaputra......patrikāpratimādharanakharādarśadattacaraṇa.....ḥano nā(ma nandina ? mānanda)vardhanaste bhavitā | tenaiva cāyaṃ ja(rju ? la)carāpahṛtaḥ kumāro haṃsavāhanastvastvassamaryā......ḍaśatharvahava ca putrakaḥ pṛthvībhramaṇāya muktasaṅgaṃ niyoktasya hasyevāntardhānamamamat | utthitaścāhamuparatāni ca praṇa.....ḥākāḷavāsī | samagrā nī manorathāḥ | manorathānāmapyabhūmayo bhavantamatyatinā prāptā na......kā nikāmacañcalāpi niścalā jātedānīṃ lakṣmīḥ | (dṛśyāsma ? draṣṭāsmi) devaṃ putrapautriṇamityapi | tathāhi——.....ṭyārthantu sarvāśiṣaḥ | prasannā me bhagavatī | avatyava(ndho ? ndhyo)pāsyā vindhyavāsinī | paramānugṛhītaṃ va.....ḥushaṃ nivāritāsmi sāhasodyā | dagdhaśokaśamitasarvendriyapāṭavāyāstu me nāmurū......ṣṇetasyāṣpagadgadamutkaṇṭhasakalagātramutkaṇṭhabhārabhaṅgaviśadamutphullakapolarekhamullasitavile....r̤ṣakoṭiryasyāma(sā?)vartata | parijanasya cāsīdatyuddāmapramodakīlāṃdho ravaḥ | tā(va)cca sā vibhāva.....ṇa paṭīyasā prakāśena lokamudbodhayantī babhau | bhūbhuja iva mohastamorāśiraśīryata | .....ṭo sukhā babhūtuḥ prabhātavāyavaḥ | parijanāśrusalilamiva śaśāmāvaśyāyavarṣaḥ | savakṛtāni pratikūlabhīta iva bhūpa....l̤agnalakṣmīpratyāpattiharṣādiva muktasaṅkocamullalāsa kamalavanam | dīnajanokrāntakāruṇyādiva sarvāmeva śarvarīṃ jāgaritātmā punarādrakṣayituṃ kumudini i.....ḥāriṇaḥ karāthajānaṅgalakṣmīnāndīrajigamamantībhirupasthīyamāno(?) yathāvidhi janādhināthaḥ | tathāhi te rājyatantra iva niḥśalyatantre′pi kṛtaparicayāḥ pratilomānulomavibhāge dāntarālavartiṣvanyeṣvapi bahumukheṣvajihmageṣu sadvarṇeṣu palāni bandhinikaroddhārakriyāmanvatiṣṭhan na karagrahaṇayogyāṃ vastuśro śyāmiva (śu ? sū)cimukhāndayamānāstaistairupāyairudaharan, unmārgagāminaścātiduḥkhakarānnānāmukhantabandhanāṣmīlāśmamudgalaprahārādibhirasādayan (?) | nighātyāṃśca nirjaghnuḥ chedanīyaśirasaśca cicchiduḥ | sarvameva (ba ? ca) rājāṅgaṃ niśśalyamakurvan | santaptāste bhītānāñca raktaśuddhānāṃ sāmantānāmiva samrāḍavayavānāmādadhuranekasādhanopakaraṇaṃ sthānānurū(pāt ? paṃ) paṭṭabandham | ninyuśca tamanatipīḍitaṃ pragṛhya praśasta iva vastusanniveśaṃ dai(śya ? tya)rājyamiva gurubalamantraśastramantraguptaṃ gurutāmapyalaṅghyaṃ prāgeva harakulaverakumārānucāriṇāṃ piśitaśoṇitapriyāṇāṃ satkārakāmānāṃ ca bhūtānāṃ(?) viviktaramaṇīyamagāram |

tatra ca godāpravāhamiva sahyopadhānaṃ prāṅmukhamanaṅgasambādhamanukū(lāca ? la) puraḥsthā(yī ? yi) janasamāsevyamānamanatidūraviśālamāśliṣṭakuntalāntahaṃsa(ve ? phe)nadhavalottaracchadamatimanoharaṃ śayanīyamabhajata | padmākara iva ca pāṇḍudhārtarāṣṭrapramukhasambandhinīhariranvāsyamāno madhukarakāminīsamājamupasarpopakaṇṭhaḥ(?) sakalamaharanupajātanidra eva nyavāhayat |

prāpte ca sandhyāsamaye purohito′sya bhuvanagururivāvalambitacchādhisacchatro hara iva karagṛhītaguho girivātiguhāsaṅgrāhī kaṃsāririva salāṅgaliko rāma iva salakṣmaṇo mātṛ(iva?)varga iva brāhmīyukto jitakāśibhaṭa iva svasiddhārthaka iva corakṣitā kṣatanaraśatasahasravīryotpannaśca praviśya rakṣāvidhā yathāvadanvatiṣṭhat(?) | svapne cainaṃ śuklamālyavāsasaḥ svāduphala(papa?pā)ṇayaḥ sukṛtodakā (diprā ? viprāḥ)siṣevire | nṛpatayaśca svayaṃto rāśiṣviva sudhāprakāśeṣu prāsādeṣu, svasaṅkalpeṣviva svargabhāvocchriteṣu śiloccayeṣu, svavikrameṣviva parandoddhureṣu mataṅgajendreṣu niṣaṇṇamañjalimukuḷanīrandhranirgatābhiścūḍāmaṇimarīcimañjarībhirullasitanakhamayūkhajā(lā ? lāma)lajalaudhanirmaramutphullakamalakānanamiva gaganasaro darśayantaṃ praṇemuḥ(?) |

prājyājyadhārāvarjanapravṛttapradakṣiṇārciṣaṃ cārciṣmantaṃ dahantamivānudrutya dhūmacchalād drutāni duritāni tañcābhito dvitīyamiva devaṃ jātavedasaṃ japāruṇanijāṭṭahāsapuñja iva ailibiliśailakuñja iva darpaśāliniśākare sthitamantavikatacchedamiva bhūtānandino dikṣu vidikṣu vatātalapaharapallavānasuratripuradoṣaśamanasuśamitāsādhyatriviṣṭapātaṅkena pāṇinā dakṣiṇena (ko ? kā)mapi kalpadrumaratnavallarīṃ vāmārdhaṃ śravaṇamūle lalitāṅgaṃ śapharalāñchitāmarpayantaminduśekharaṃ dadarśa(?) | kṣubhitavīranakrañca yuddhārṇavamiva dugdhārṇavaṃ bhujābhyāmuttaratā svapnasya caivambhūtasyānukathanādamātyavargamagramahiṣī(ṇā?)ñcānujagrāha |

tasmiṃśca dṛḍhasaṃhanane mahābale svasthe sattvavati sarvākāramupakramāḥ sukhenāvartanta | śauryānalasaṃbhṛtājilakṣmīvihārāñjaliparimukheneva ca pradāgandhrena cāpātamantriṇo nananduḥ(?) | ā(śvā)sayaṃstu devīṃ strīsvabhāvakātarāṃ sammukhīnaniścaladṛśaṃ parijanamityuvāca——suśruta! śrutāni nanvamūni śubhatarāṇi svapnadarśanāni | vraṇāścaitena dhvajagavājino vṛṣarathaka.....ṣādyavahāsanamanyasya na sarpiṣo na puṣkarasya na malayajasya sumanaso vā sauramyamudgirantī na divyagandhā na bhūmigandhayo tonduravalūrādīdūrabhayaṃ kevalamatasītaila......vānti no kṣvelanti na purupuṃrāyanti na sakhanapavanavāhinastvaṅmāṃsahatā nāntammāhino bahiḥ śī(tāla ? talā) nāvacūrṇitāvabhāsā nātisaṃvṛtā nā.....ṭsannā nāvasannā nonmārgiṇo notsaṅgino na durdarśanā na duṣṭaraktapūtipūyāsrāviṇo nābhiṣekaprayatnavāhinaśca ye cātra śyāmakāṃ koṣṭakuṅkuma......vaye ca snigdhasthirapāṇḍukaṇḍūrāṃkapodrekiṇo na te dante ye tu kārṣṇyenāsravāruṇimnā ca vātajā vijitāste vidhuktāndrajat kurvantyeva tadeva......kṣayāma(?) |

kiṃ bahunā, devatānugrahādeva sarvaśarīrapātinaḥ sarva evāyatacaturaśratryaśrārdhārdhacandraviśālakuṭilamaṇḍalino yavaśarāvamadhyāścete vraṇā niścayataḥ (keci ? kaiści)deva kaṣāyakapaṭimi(?) ṣaṣṭyupakramāntaḥpātibhiḥ śobhanaropaṇā(ddhe ? dyai)rupakrāntāḥ kālenālpīyasaiva rokṣyantītyabhyavahāryāśvāsya snigdhamuṣṇamagnisandhukṣaṇaṃ laghumātraṃ ca vyadhatta | tathopakrāntaśca kaiścidevāhobhiḥ prakṛtisthaśarīraḥ saśibiramutthāya tasmāt pradeśāt tapovanamadhivivi(tsu ? kṣu)stadabhijñavanacaropa(vi ? di)ṣṭena janavartmanā parikramya somagrahaṇe pale ca kopitamunibhagnarāhudaṃṣṭrāṅkurairiva niyamavadanakomukalikāmapramukhaduṣṭabhīṣikayeva pratilomānulomacaritapaṅktibhiḥ patrapālivaśe smāpite(?) sthaviṣṭhaniṣṭhuraiḥ kaṇṭakajanaiḥ karālitena tapaḥprabhāvaprakārasaṅgīrṇavighnavināyakadaśanacūrṇairiva kusumareṇubhirmarududdhūtaiḥ palitapāṇḍaraśiraseva mahatā jīrṇaketakivanena parivṛtam, utkṣipadbhiriva śikharalambijaladharakulamambarasaritpāyanāya darśayadbhiriva nandanavanoddeśaṃ śākhānilaśakuniśāśvakānumadabhramarasamara.....ḥīruhaṇaparibhūtaviṭapāntarāḷamārgaistapasyāvāsaprāsādairiva kusumapāṇḍubhirvanaspati(bhiḥkṣu ? bhiru)paśobhitaṃ, yajitajanadhyānāsanaba(ndhu ? ndha)pū(va?)tavedikāsanāthatalairdāruśilābhaṅgabandhacaturaśrālavālakairagnihotrahavirdhūmasaṅgasandehadāyiyogavighātabhītidūtena kusumarajaḥkambukānanibhrāntapakṣapālinā madhulihāṃ kulena sadayaparilīyamānamakaradevyānajaiḥ prasaramiva muniśarīrātiraktakisalayacchalādudgiradbhirlatāmaṇṭa(pairu)petam(?) añjalipuṭasambhṛtopajātabījataṇḍulairlolakapilakākapakṣairvaikhānasakumārakaiḥ saṃjñāhūyamānaśābakānusaraṇalagnahaṃsīparityaktapaṅkajāsvādarāgayā muñjakuśadarbhaba(la ? lva)jaśarapuñjajaṭilakūlayā bilvapalāśakhā(va?)dirarṣalūdambamastambandhaparyantatayā mattakāraṇḍavatuṇḍakhaṇḍitadalasampuṭakaraktakuvalayavanamadharamiva lajjayā taraḷa(ta)raṅgahastacnnandamṛṣṭigaṇād gāhanadūtadehaniṣaktatīrthayātrikapuratarāśimiva(?) darśayantyā śāntaśarmadayā narmadayopagūḍhaikapārśvam, u(bhaya ? ṭa)jājirasuptaha(ra ? ri)kiśoramaśakavāraṇaniratavanavāraṇīkara(ṇa?)vidhūyamānāntevāsivargadurgrahāgraviṭapakaprasūnam u(da ? ṭa)jīyasaralasāradārubhaṅgopahāreṇārādhitasthaviratāpasārabdhasāmagānopalabhyamānavanagajakalabhakam, ādṛtavanavarāhavetrāvabadhyamānabālavṛkṣakālavālakam, upaśāntaśikhaṇḍimaṇḍalabarhamājanīkalālasandhajyamānasaikatājiramācārañcuñcuśuklacchadana cañcusampuṭaprakīryamāṇapadmotpaladalopahāram, atinibhūtapārāvatadattadāvāgara unmukhabahaḷadhūpodgārasurabhīkriyamāṇadeva(?).....ṃāraṇyakamahiṣaviṣāṇakhātavimṛditaviṣamakaṇṭaka(kṣa ? kṣu)paṃ viśodhyamānatīrthayātramāraṇyakatāmramūlasaṃjñārutāhūyamānapuṣpagnātrāvalambamuniśiṣyamutpuccha.....ġnihotravināpīnakautsaṃjitadugdhavañcyamānastananghayamindhacūḍāpīḍahārādhirūḍhadhīraśārikādhyāpyamānavaṭujanopasṛtya......puruhūtāhvayaprabhopaliptābhirivāraṇyadevatācaṅkramaṇamaratakavedikābhiranirvadūrvāpallavapracayakomalānirvanasthalīśyāmalīkṛtopaśalyaku.....ḍāśramavanamadarśayat(?) |

yatra kecidutpalitāstaṭākā iva taraṅgiṇaḥ sumanasassantanajanitadvikuḍumbadhṛtayāssubandhasetavaḥ kṛtavanovārādhā grāmyahalakṛṣṭavā......janaślādhyaśoṣāścayaḥ(?) | tathāpare sunṛpā iva saparicchadāḥ sabhāryāḥ svabhujasambhṛtāgrāmyasādhanānuṣṭhitasakalapuṇyakriyākalāpāḥ svaśaktikṛtabaliharaṇā maitradāntāḥ sadbhūtānukampino dātāraḥ svayamanādātāraḥ kutaścidanavasīritāścīrikāpaṭāḥ saphalamūlavṛttayaśca vānaprasthāḥ |

yatra ca śāntaśarīrajāmātrāmāmāścelāsthitayaśca sthāvarakāḥ śubhagatyarthino′pi tuṣacārā sāśritājamārgā mūlarucayaḥ somatarāhastadāyisvastāsukṛtapākaphalabhujo madhuvratāḥ kusumaśāyino dravyavekṣāḥ śākapakṣā anayaspṛśa unmardakāḥ svasvayaṃpatitāhārā hārāparihṛtayaḥ pravṛttāśā na darśanaśrutapavanā no kalpāntajvalanavṛttayocchakā sadyaḥprakṣālitāstīrthabhūtā gurvarthasādhanāḥ kāṣṭhāhāriṇo devakulabhāvino′śmakuṭṭāḥ samṛddhavālā danto(mūla ? lūkha)likā daṇḍāsanāgravartinaḥ sandaṃśakaramukhoccikarṇajīvinaḥ kopokāvakalpakāsārthasikā vanaukapto govartino niḥsnehā mṛgavṛtta(sa?)yaḥ suparicchedāḥ pariṇaminaḥ puṇyajanāḥ śaibālikaiṣiṇo bhavaparāgā śrīmātrānurodhinaḥ pāvakāḥ palāśabhakṣāḥ kvatāntapītarucayo dhūmakapākṛtapariṇatayaḥ kālāntaritā bhāryecchāsujñāta ekasthālikākṣamālāvagāḍhā vṛkṣamūlagatayo līnadhātaḥ śilāśayāḥ pṛthuromāṇo jaleśayāḥ śamitatṛṣā jalakandikā vanajālayāḥ sūryonmukhā nyagrodhajaṭāprarohāḥ adhomukhāḥ śreṇyavalambino′vā(ñchi ? kśi)raso gārgaṇayo′ndhabhūmayo vīrāsanikā viṣadahanāḥ pañcāgnikaṭā bhūmiśāyino′dhvanyādariṇo vācaṃyamāḥ samastāvākrośanā ūrdhvabāhavaḥ śākhobhūta ekapādasthitā ya puradviṣaśca parvatālayā mahāmunayaḥ(?) |

tacca bahirniveśitaśibiraṃ praviśan hṛṣṭenāntarātmanā samacintayat | aho viviktaramaṇīyatvamāścaryarūpatvaṃ cāsya | bhagavannārāyaṇakarakamaṇḍalusalilasekasaṃvardhitabadarīyakopadāryāśramo′pi nāsya manye sadṛśaḥ | tathāhyatra śakunayo′pi darśitādarā madhuravyāhṛtayo (vi?)viśadalocanavikāsasūcitaprītayaḥ pratyutthānamācaranto munisaṃvāsalagnāḥ prathaya(ti ? nti) prathīyasīmātitheyatām | ete′pi viṭapinaḥ sadyaḥ prahvaśākhābhujapallavāñjalipuṭapuṣpavarṣāḥ pre(ā?)kṣāpūrvamiva sabahumā(nasthān ? naṃ) bhramaradṛṣṭibhiraticañcalābhiḥ prarū(pā ? pa)yanti | jā(ti ? ta)sambhramaścāyamupaharati tarukumārakaḥ pu(ṣpa ? ṣka)radaḷapuṭena pādodam | iyaṃ ca pracaṇḍatarutalabhramaṇakhinnamṛṣidārakamupahṛtamṛduromakomalakroḍāpāśrayā svāpaya(nti ? ntī) prītiviśadayā dṛśaiva naḥ pratyudeti, tannidrābhaṅga(ma)yāttu nābhyuttiṣṭhatyāmrabhāvāśāmūlavadhūḥ(?) | ayaṃ muniputrakadattadevaśeṣośīrapaṅkapañcāṅgalaśāritāṅgaḥ sāraṅgaśābakaḥ prasnavotpīḍapīḍitastanamapāsya māturū(ḍhaḥ ? dhaḥ) phenāyamānasṛ(kṣā ? kvā)pakrāntamanoharānekacāśakriyaḥ(?) puro′smākaṃ pradhāva(yati ? n) nūnamupadiśati mūlapaterdharmasthānā(na?)sthānavartma | sarvathā kaliratra praveśamalabhamāno bahireva śabarapuḷindakacchalāt paribhramatyaraṇyam | atra maharṣīṇāṃ dṛṣṭitejasā dagdhaḥ sabhastīto bhuvanabhrāntiyatra ḍolākarmavardhaki makaraketuḥ svasambhūtihetubhiḥ sahaiva dussaṅkalparāśibhinnarūpākṣacakṣuṣīva jvalitavigraho dviguṇodbhūtadāśahaśaktirāsīdatra nirmāsitāni tānyalīkamāpātasahasrāṇi yeṣāmāgṛhīta rājapuruṣakāraṇāmubhayalokabhraṃśamūlopadeśaṃ dānapiṇḍitānāmadyāpi ca yamamiyogabhūmayo madhuravimadanadāhodvejitastapasyati pātrasannihitaḥ kusumapādapeṣu(?) kākadviṣo′pi caite.....ṭvaṃ dvijatvaṃ cārthayuktaṃ darśayantīti prīyamāṇamānasastameva pūrvasaraṃ sāraṅgapotakamanusaran kiñcidanta(ra)manupasṛtyātimahati mahīśikhaṇḍarava iva kusumacandrakasya.....ḍeśamṛtalavakalikaḷavaśavasyandavisṛtalagnā vikirati madhuśīkaravarṣabindusantatiruciradhautavalkamadambhapṛṣitagarbhaparyantapallabapuṭe munivṛndārakavṛndasandarśita.....ṇikaradarpaṃ turāñjalāvivollasatyudagratapaḥspṛhayeva pītasakalavāsaroṣṭhamaṇimuṣkaravījākṣavalaya iva ṣaṭcaraṇacakraṃ japaśraddhayā sābhilāṣaṃ parivartayati(?)pa.....ṃādhavīlatāmaṇṭape tadupastabhmasādhāraṇādhikārasya nātimahato nāgapotasya skandhopāśrayeṇa ślakṣṇavedikāpratiṣṭhāpite pratiṣṭhita(ṣṇo ? kṛṣṇā)jināstaravetraviṇetraviṣṭare samupaviṣṭamahnāya vasāyavi tādhyātmavidyā(dhyā ? vyā)khyānavirataghoṣaṃ (?) pīyūṣadānāvasānaviśrāntadhīradhvanimiva dugdhajaladhimālokātiśayalābhakṛṣṭairanavamarasabhāvitairutkaṇṭakamūrtibhirupajātaprabodhaiḥ puṇḍarīkairi(va) savitāramunmukhairmunibhirabhi(hanya ? vandya)mānami(ndra ? ndu)mṛgamivācirapītaprākṛtāmṛtamandatṛṣṇaṃ vidyāmṛtamandatṛṣṇaṃ vidyāmṛtapā(lanavā ? nalā)lasāgatamativiśvāsādaśaṃkāśliṣṭaśarīramāśramakuraṅga(śakha ? śāva)kamārdrakarābhimarśanena vī(ja ? ta)rā(ja ? ga)tayā sadayamanugṛhṇantaṃ tapasa iva caraṇalagnasya dugdhakāmasya kasyāpi haṃsapotasya nakhaprabhāprasarapānavyasanaḥ visabhaṅgarasāntisantarjanādavanayannatāpasakumārakāmanāpraśnodgrāhaṇaṃ jitakāśine śuka potakāya protsāhārhaṇaṃ svakareṇaiva ka(śo ? ṭho)ra(sā ? ḍā)ḍimīphalasphuṭitagarmanikṛṣita(?)sphaṭikajātiprakāśairbījaśakalairāsannatarupalāśapuṭapātrīsaṃhṛtairupaharantaṃ, praṇativiśīrṇavarṇivrajaśikhāpiśaṅgimānamivāśramāṅkaṇabalikusumapuṭadhūliṃ caraṇapṛṣṭhalagnamanubadhnantyādarśanadohaḷīkasakalatīrthapreṣitayā yamu(na ? naye)va bhramaramālayopāsyamānam ālohitadhautavalkalanivasanottarīyam, upasthitaprasannamitrāliṅganalagnena bālātapeneva tirohitāṅgaṃ, tīrthajalāvasekalobhāt tvacamivāvakṛṣya niṣpatadbhirasthibhistapasā kṛśeṣvayaveṣu viṣamīkṛtamantaśśucimā(se ? nasa)praveśamārgānveṣi(ṇā ? ṇyā) kṛtaparikṣepa(rikṣepa?)yā haṃsamālaye(d?)va brahmasūtralekhayā pavitrīkṛtaśarīraṃ niśita(ta?)kuśapūlapālilekhanaki(ra?)ṇaśyāmalatalatalodareṇa rudrākṣavalayaparivartanakarkaśāṅguḷiparvakāṇḍenāhutirāgasannihitakrāntahutāśadhūmodgāradurdineneva sarvabhūtābhayadānodakamiva nakhamaṇimarīcidhārānibhenāvarjayatā sarvadevatāmadavikāramanojñāpanagoṣṭhīdhanamadhudaṇḍena dakṣiṇakareṇa ca nirmalajalakusumabhīkākaṇṭhagrahaṇakāmukena bhrājamānaṃ, sarvasminnevamārdamaye maharṣīṇāṃ saṃśayān su(ni)ścitārthatayā na no vā visargeṇa(cha ? chi)ndantaṃ, dīdhitibhiśca tadvisarpiṇībhiḥ parvataprahatamārgavamārgaṇamārganirgamapracalajālamālānukāriṇībhiratiśītalacandanadravanadīmiva(?) sarvendriyavalayavelodvelāpūrvakṣīrodalekhāmivotphullasarasvatīvihārasinduvāravīthīmiva dharmisomābhivṛddhiśuklaśarva(du?)rīmiva svacchamānasarasabharapūritoḍḍīnaśāradābhramālāmiva darśayantaṃ, daśanajyotsrāpayaḥpūteneva palitapāṇḍunā sarvaśāstrāmṛtamathanodbhūtaphenapiṇḍakalpena kūrcaka(pola ? lāpe)na śiraḥparyantavāntagaṅgāsrotasaṃ śarvamivānukurvantaṃ, japagatakalālapravāhātarāvartamiva gaṇḍagartamabhramive....r̤ugradhyamānadṛṣṭidyutipralopopacanīmivonnatināsikāṃ divasakaratejaḥprasarapānādivātidivayorapyupoḍhakāraṇyatayā tapovanatara.....ṣomasambhūtāṃ sudhādṛṣṭimivābhivarṣato dhyānānandāsamiva tapovanānāṃ saṃvibhajato mānasātiriktamaitrīrasaparivāhapraṇāḷayo sa.....ṭaragnihotrāvasānadattabhasmatryāyuṣarekhamṛṣicakravarti catnorṇalāñchitamiva samādhānasādhitabhrūdvayā(na?)ntaraniścalasthitiṃ nāmane saiva svaccha.....ṣarasvatīlīlāṣṭapadāyamānamupahataṃ sarvavidyākośanidhikalaśena lapanenopetamapyarthabhaṅgurābhiḥ sobhāminībhiriva ghanāgamamadhukapilaśālikā......plutidūtamūrtibhirasamuraṃ vīrāgaḥ vardhanībhiriva sakalakalikābhirivāśokamanīyamagāḍhāśleṣaśravaṇamūlacitrābhisandhyābhralekhābhiriva doṣāmukhamāyāminībhiḥ....r̤udbhāsamānasurābhavakaruṇakaliśamapyāsutī balamasakṛdācaritamekadāparitakedāravānamapyakṛṣīvalamakhilabhuvanabhāvenonmukhapradhānamapyarajasvalama(sā ? saṃ)sthānamapi(?) pariṣadvalaṃ sarvapathīnamapi kṛṣṇavartmaikaśaraṇamanavaratabhrāmitākṣavalayamapi praśāntendriyaṃ guṇaśatasantānatatparamapyātaptatantumiṣṭavarapradamapi sarasvatyekavallabhaṃ tapasyādinamapi samahimodayamaticirāyuṣaṃ dṛṣṭāneka(ma?)paricchandānuvartinamātmabhāvāvalambanaikarasamatyucchritamuccairmukhaṃ brahmalokapratīkṣyamādimunimabhyastapuṣkaravāsamanaṅgīkṛtamakaraketanaṃ vāmadeva iti prakāśapuṇyaśa(bdaḥ ? bdaṃ) taporāśiṃ dadarśa |

dṛṣṭvaiva tapaḥprabhāvābhibhūtaprāgalbhyo bhī(i)ta iva kiñcidābaddhahṛdayasādhvaso manasā vapuṣā ca samaṃ saṅkucitaḥ prayatnāpasarpaṇīyāḥ puṇyabhūmaya ityādarādivāñjalijalajapuṭāvarjitābhirnakhāṃśujālaveṇikābhirabhiṣicyamānamauliradṛṣṭapūrvātithitākārāntaritakutūhala tirekāyāstasyāntā(tva ? pa)sapariṣado yugapadāvalitaharṣalolalocanasahasrādhirūḍhastadatibhareṇeva dūrāvanatamūrtirmajjanniva mahati puṇyahnade prahṛṣṭaromā dharmanimnamanaskārānnanamaskāramācacāra |

ācaritamaharṣicaraṇavandanaṃ ca śiraścaritārthamiva sakalatribhuvanādhipatyacihnacūḍālāñchitamiva bahu(ṣu?)manyamāne mahīpatau sa munirākapilatārakeṇāṃśumantamiva sandhyākāśe tamanurañjayannaruṇakarāgrasaṃhā(ra)mukulitakamalakomalāñjalipuṭamadhomukhaṃ nipatanta(mi ? ma)tiprasāritena cakṣuṣā punaḥpunarabhinirūpya samutpannābhijñaḥ saṃpṛṣṭāva(?) samastameva hastatalāmalakamiva tadgatamupajananāt prabhṛtyudantam | ullasadānandajalalavagrathitapakṣmālaḥ su(ndhi ? dhī)ro′pi sudūrotsṛṣṭalokayātrāraso′pi suptasnehavṛttirapi sutaptatapaḥpiṇḍavītasaṃbhramasaṃsārasaṅgabhaṅgo nijābhyo′pi kimapi sa(mpra ? mbhra)maspṛṣṭa iva muktaviṣṭaraḥ katipayāni padānyasaṅgaḷandaruṇavallarīrottarīyo(?) gatvā nirmokalavānubaddhajaraduraganibhau jarādhavaḷaro(ma)jālau bhujau prasārya su(pta ? ta)vada(la ? va)nipālamatidurbharasaṃbhāvanānipīḍitakaramāliṅgya krameṇa cānāmayaparipraśnādikamādiṣṭakriyātikramaṇabhīrubhūpalabdhāvakāśamāśṛṅkhalapraharṣo maharṣirmadhumanmatrasādhitamadhuparkadānāvasānaṃ (ri ? vi)dhimahitamanvatiṣṭhat |

upaviṣṭe ca tadupadiṣṭe sthāne tadanugrahātibhūmigamanayantraṇāparatantramansi pārthive tamadṛṣṭapūrvamādarātiśayamāścaryabhūtaṃ mahāmunerupalabhya savesasā(?) munisabhā ko′nvayaḥ kimabhijanaḥ kinnāma kilāyaṃ, (ki)manena janmāntare tapaścaritaṃ, kena vā prayojanenā(pa ? ya)menāṃ bhuvamapi saṅkrāntaḥ, kathaṃ vāsya mahānubhāvasya parimitaparivāratā | tathā cedamaparamatyāścaryam, asya kila mahātmanastilamātramapi nopalakṣyate śarīrāvayaveṣu yadanāmuktamagrāmyairvīravraṇakiṇābharaṇaiḥ | kathamadevāsuramatārakāmayaṃ vā raṇamupeta(ma ? syai)tādṛśaḥ prahāravimardasambhavaḥ | sambhave vā kathamivaivamanekaśataśastramārgajarjariteṣu gātreṣvakṣaritavatāmasūnāmavasthānamāsīt | atyutpa.....ḥalabalātkṛtāpi guruyantraṇayā garīyasyānuyo(tta ? ktu)mapārayantyatiṣṭhat |

tathā sthitāṃ ca ṛṣipariṣa(du ? damu)panidhyāya sa munirīṣatsmitaḥ somānvayaśravaṇakautukājye.....ḍaśanabhāsā snapayanniva pañcatapastāpadattatapanātapapralepapāṭala(la)lāṭapa(ṭṭana ? ṭṭā)ni mukhāni hanta! vo (ve ? vi)ditākṛtayaḥ kautukinyo manovṛttayaḥ | sthāna......kutūhalamākarṇyatāmasya kalyāṇarāśerāśāmukhalalāmabhūtaṃ caritamanvayārambhādārabhyādbhutarasamākṣiptacetasā ma(yo ? yā) gīyamānamityupacakrame krameṇa.....ṇubhāvaratirekodavahā mahān sarovihāraśīlo hiraṇmayāṇḍayorātāyamānadevadānavobhayakarṣapo mukhapaṭakṣadakṣaramadhuratrayīrutirājohaṃsaḥ(?) | tasmād vismāpitatriviṣṭapasya......bhuvanakilbiṣo......vanadātriratrine(trera ? trāda)nanyajasya nityamitramamba(rā ? ra)preyānambujānāmarātirambaraukasāṃ jīvitamambaraśriyaḥ sthitata(?)smitamambikāpateścūḍāmaṇiḥ kaustubhasya sahodaraḥ kṣatravaṃśamya pūrvī devatānāṃ patiroṣadhīnāmīśvaramaja....r̤avadavadhe prasādhanaṃ śasmaryavalakaḥ kumudakugmaladalanadurlalitakarakāmayamayānakāminīkapolādarśatārastārāpatiḥ(?) | tasya tantumtārāyāmāṅgirasavallabhāyāmabhūdbodhādharitadhiṣaṇo medhānidhiḥ pradhānavibudho budhaḥ | budhādilā pūrūravasamaṃśe mitrāvaruṇayoradhvare manorutpanno(rū ? da)pādayat | iḷāvṛtaṃ nāma yaddharaṇabhūmiṃ parito hiraṇyagarbhopamayamadrīmadyāpi vartate jāmbūnadajanmajāmbavarasavāhijambunadīpānavarvitajānapadavarṣavarṣam(?) | ailādāyurajani janārdanorunmandāramañjaryāṃ mahendradādakīyānāṃ vedikānā(?)magrimāyāṃ gandharvyāmurvaśyām | āyuṣo′ṣṭaguṇaiśvaryajitatriviṣṭapeśvaro nahuṣaḥ svarbhānuduhitari sphuratprabhāyāṃ prabhāyāmudbabhūva | nahuṣanandano nandanavanavibhrājapramukhaviśvadivyavanabhuktiviśvācīmaravindagaṇḍūṣamadhumaṇḍakhaṇḍaparaśuviśrāṇi(ta)rathavaraṣaṭsahasramātrabhramaṇasādhitadānavamaṇḍalastāni nirvedakāmopadeśāyamānagītiḥ kāmadevo yayātiḥ(?) | yayāterajāyata rājanyavṛṣabho vṛṣaparvaduhitari śarmiṣṭhāyāṃ mitrasurataśāpadānaniṣṭhurajanakajarājālakañcukacchannayauvano′pi rucirācāru(pūruḥ)(?) | (purū ? puroḥ) pavirivāripa rvatānāṃ paurajānapadarañjano janamejayaḥ | tasya su(to) naya(śca ? ca)kṣuḥ prācījayacihnitākaḥ prācinvān | prācinvataḥ pṛpujātataprathanakrataśakālabadhaprathitakaravīraḥ(?) pra(va ? vī)raḥ | vikramadamitadharmalopanirmaryādo dāmadandharaṃ(?) namasyurnāma | asya ca divaukasāmabhayado′bhū(da)bhayadaḥ | tadāyanirātmatejovadhūtaśuddhyāṃ(?) śundhyuḥ | kasya tanu(?) bahuvidhanayāvadhāno bahuvidhaḥ | bāhuvidhiradhibāhunihitabhūmibhāro bhīmahetiḥ saṃśayātiḥ | tasya mahad(?) a(bhaḥpa ? haṃpā)tistadapatyamatyādityatejāstadanantaraṃ pratyapadyata | tatpurastāt putriṇāmatṛṇamasthāpayat(?) prasthāpitasatpathaḥ pratipakṣaraudro rudrāśvaḥ | sa ghṛtācyāṃ sthālyāmiva kulapradīpa(du ? muda)pādayadugrateja(sā?)saṃ daśānāmagram | (sa) raṇe ripubhaṭabhrukuṭibandhāndhakāra dhūnanajvala(ya?)nāyāṃ takṣakātmajāyāmajījanadanantasāramantināram | antinārādarikulakānanakadanadāvā(na)lamili(lā ? laṃ le)bhe yamasutā sutam | trastavānantrastavānādastamānamādare makuṭapāṭaloṣṇīṣāyamānapadmadyutiravitathaprasādanakopitastattattanayastatte bhujaśaṃbhogagabhūriṇā bhujena japamanyubhuvaṃ bhujeḥ(?) | tadudbhavānāṃ mahārṇavānāmiva caturṇāṃ pūrvo bṛhatkṣatra ityanuttarasthitimapaścimānamavācīnavṛtti(?)ranukūlasthitirmahendraśriyamānaśe | tasya bharamuvāha svavagraho harerivairāvataḥ kalyāṇasambhaṭekaraḥ kalitapuṣkarā(na)no ha(stinaṃ ? stī) nāma, yannāmalāñchitaṃ śūrāṇāṃ rājadhānī dharālalāma nagaram | ajamīḍha iti dvi(ja)mīḍhapuramīḍhayoragrajanmā jaganmalamalayajasamālahalavibhramayaśā(?) diśāmpatirabhavat | amuṣya patī dyauriva taralatārakābhrarāmāṃ dhūlinī janayāmāsa rājamaṇḍalayogahṛdyam ṛkṣam | ṛkṣā(da)kṣatapratāpastapanakanyakayā (sa ? ta, ptatapasā punaranaṅgataptayā tapatyā kṛtasaṃvaraṇaḥ saṃvara(ṇāt ? ṇaḥ) saṃvaraṇāt prakṛṣṭasattvaḥ sattvarakṣaṇadīrghasarī.....ġuṇagurukurukulāṅkurakulagirikuñjakesaritrāsakaraghoraghorahuṅkāracārudhanvā(?) sudhanvanaḥ | (sutastu ? tatsu)to mahadbhirahitamahīpālavigrahāvipra.....ṣakalajagatkaṇṭakaviṣamaśalyoddharaṇavaidyaścaidyaḥ | tataścaturanta(ra?)dharaṇidāraḥ santuṣṭakṛtī kṛtakaḥ | tasmādapara iva surapatirapi.....ḍhivelaṃ puñjita......śuktijālajarjarajharjharāyitapativahadṛśo(?) vṛhadrathaḥ | tattejaḥpariṇāmaḥ parimāṇamiva bāhuśālitāyāḥ kuśāgradhīḥ kuśāgraḥ.....ḍṛṣabhaḥ | tasmādaśeṣadigvadhūtatāsitasvakīrtipuṣpaḥ puṣpavān | (pauṣpavatā ? puṣpavato) bāṣpagarbhavipakṣanārīkṣaṇasarastaradurupratāpa(sa ? sta)ptatapanīyapatracitradhanvā sudhanvā......jāgarūkaḥ prakāśagarvo darvaḥ | (ga ? da)rvasutaḥ sadāmodaradarpasammadadohaḷīhayadharataladharṣaṇakiṇitakaṇṭhaḥ karāgranagaragabhyatantrikakulakuṭumbīkṛtacaraṇajhaṇajhaṇāyamānalohaśṛṅkhalaḥ(?) sakalakṣatra.....ṇacaturajaro pacāraputraḥ satyasandho (rāja ? jarā)sandhaḥ | tasya sutaḥ pituraparihīṇaprabhāvo bhārataraṇārṇavāvagāhanasahaḥ sa(ha)devaḥ | sahadevāt sahasurasapapītasomasomādhī(?) somāpī | tatsutaḥ svāpadānaviśrutaḥ śrutaśravāḥ | śrotraśravasaścakṣuṣaśravā kāyakarkaśā(?)(yatoya ? ′yutāyuḥ) | tataḥ śivasatkriyāpravartanapraviṣṭamitrahṛdayo niramitraḥ | tasmāt svabhujabhuktasamastacakravartikṣetraḥ (sukṣetraḥ) | sukṣetrāt saukṣetrirmakṣātrapathapraguṇitagurujagatkarmā(?) (bṛhatkarmā) | tasmādbhavādivāmṛtakalāvato mahāsenaḥ senajinnāmājani | sa putrī dhvastasamastaśatruṇā śatruñjayena ja(ya?)jñe | śatruṃjayādajāyata yathārthanāmā vibhu(ḥ) | vaibhavo bhava iva bhūtabhāvanopāṅgagamanaḥ śuciḥ | śuceranvagabhrakāla iva ghanāvalambano bhuvanamāhrādayannakhiladigaṅganottarāsaṅgībhūtakīrtikṣemaḥ kṣemyaḥ | tasya putraḥ pūtajanatā(ca?)japyavṛttaḥ suvṛttaḥ | suvṛttādarkamaṇḍalādivālokaḥ prāvartata prajānetrabhūto netraḥ | netrajanmā trinetrakopānalakadarthitakāmarūpasadṛśaḥ sunṛpaḥ | sunṛpāt surāpannajanadayanapalitaśrutaḥ(?) suśrutaḥ | sauśrutirāśritaśrutikāśyapīśvaraparidṛḍho dṛḍhasenaḥ | tattanayastāmarasanayano nayanaḥ | nayanānnayaviśadamatiḥ sumatiḥ | sumateḥ svabhujabalatulitabalaḥ subalaḥ | saubalirabalādhararāgaraktanetraḥ sunetraḥ | tasya putro lapanalālitakalikālakālanatrastasatyaḥ satyajit | satyajitojināmā viśvajitaviśvo(?) viśvajit | viśvajitaḥ kratoriva sarvadakṣiṇāt sākṣādiva bhagavān dharmaḥ svamātmānamalabhata mahātmā caritādharitasañjayo ripuñjayaḥ | tena cakṣu(ṣmā ? ṣmatā) (na) kaścirdāpanmukhamapaśyat | tena nāyakena (na) kaścidapathamanupdasulabhaskhalitamavagāhata | tena bhartrā na kaścidasubhareṇa kuṭumbabhāreṇāpīḍyata | tena (ka ? gu)ruṇā na (kiñci ? kaści)davinayasya sarvāpāyapāramaiśvaryasādhanopāyasya khapne′pyavakāśamadiśat | tena khalu balamadaḥ kulamado vidyāmadaḥ śrīmado rūpamada ityanekamukhānatikaṭupravāhānmadā(n) muñcatātisrotomadamucaḥ kadarthitā iva gandhakariṇaḥ |

sa kadācidālocitapurāṇasaṃhito bṛhadrathakulāvasānamātmānaṃ samupalabhya dagdha iva manasi dhvasta iva yaśasi grasta iva vaivarṇyena lupta iva daurmanasyena lipta iva lāghavena vyāpta iva viṣādena supta iva śūnya(yo ? tayā)muktaśokaśūtkṛtiḥ kiṃkartavyatāmūḍho rūpaviśvāsatayā madupakaṇṭhamāgatya ta(ma ? pa)si vithamadhṛtihetuṃ vyamṛrata(?) | vivṛtaviśvatantrāṇāmakṛtrimāṇāṃ vācāmāptagītānāṃ cā(ṅgamaṅgi ? gamagi)rāmanugrahādādarāgatapratibhena mayaiva so′nuprabodhito′bhūt |

bhagavati khalu tapaścaryā bhāvinamatyarthamanyathālaṃ parivartayitum | iyaṃ hi puṃsāmaprasavajarāyujālajalamālājanani bahvāyāsagrathitagrāmyabhogakṣaṇamukhābhāsā svādadānaduślāghojitā jāyā vaitatenapekṣyakāryakaraparijanaśilānupratyanāyattaṃ viśvāsabhūmimitramabhirādhyahṛdayo hitakārī gururāste′nādirakṣaṃ kleśamabhipretasādhanaṃ dhanamamūlakarma karmalatāvijitasarvasattvavaśīkaraṇamavairasyajanitama.....ṭāraṃ sarvarogaharaṃ mahauṣadhaṃ ṣāḍguṇyacitāpāpajāgaramasādhāraṇagauravādhirohaṇamādhipatyamasyāścaryasādhanaṃ na duradhigamadurupacāramihaturagaratha......phalamūlatṛṇolapādisādhanaṃ tapasyāyāḥ(?) | tasyāmupahitabahuprakāropapralobhanāḥ parasparopaghātino niṣiddhāmatikākṛta......cārāḥ sacivadhū(rtāṃ ? rtāḥ) kartavyānāmupa(ve ? de)ṣṭāraḥ | kintu nisargasaraḷā nirabhilāṣakāluṣyā nirmatsarā nirastanāstikyavā(dī ? dā) nirvyājaśucayaḥ śrotramāpū.....ṣādhanayā | paśya phalasampadaṃ tapaścaryāyāḥ | yadimau sūryācandramasāvindrayamavaruṇadravi(gu?)ṇapā(na?)lava(sukho ? savo)′śvinau śvasanaḥ śociṣkeśa.....ṇādbhutena divi mahimnā mahīyante | yacca saptarṣipramu(khayo ? khā) maharṣayo daivatānyapi prabhāveṇābhibhūya vartante tarvā(?) ca | yadapi siddhagandharvavidyādharasurapannagendrādayo yathā......cyante sukhāni tadapi kiñcittapasyābhaṅgivilasitameva | mātāpi tāvattapyamānā mānavāya kupyati prasīda(ti) nitarāṃ tapasyā | kiṃ bahunā | naivaṃvidhamaparamasti sarvakarmīṇam, athavāsyāma.....ṃalamasmadudgīrṇayārāropya(?) | nanu bhagavanta eva mukundacandrāpīḍāravindajā jagadaṅkurabījamuṣṭayo′pi nāpyavāpyenāvāpyajījanakataṭākamaṇḍalūdvahāḥ sabahumānamenāmupāsīnāḥ prathayanti prabhāvamasyā nā......kila kleśabhayādavatarannimānamānamānajavā nanu mantavyamagrāmavāsine vanakāmasya yādṛgāyāsaparispandastasya śatatamīmapi kalāmaraṇyavāsinaḥ tapasyāmasyaparivedā bhavanti neti kṛṣṭavantaḥ kṛṣimiva gṛhe gṛhiṇo yādṛśā hṛdayasañcāronmāyāstāṃśca kṛcchracaryāduḥkhāni ca dhārayitulavālaśyāma kiṃ garīya iti(?) | rājasadasyasatpralāpanibaddhairāyasyamānasya manasvino yathopapadyate sarvāṅgīṇaḥ santāpacintayanasyaśo′pi yadi bhavati pañcāgnimadhyasthāyinaḥ svajanāśrujalādinā nātaṅkasthānajāni yathā na tathā śaṅke śiśiraniravakāśāgamaśītalaniśā(ti ? śi)lāśakalaśayanaśāyinaṃ śarīriṇamāsāravarṣabandhinī mahimajalāni kledayantīti(?) |

nanu cedameva paryāptamānāraṇyavāse yadiha bhujyate svacchāśayā śucipayodharābhiranudyona sarvaṃ......kṣakaluṣabhāvāstadanyastadyoṣitasukhacchāyā svāduphaladānaśīlāḥ surabhayaśca bhūruhāḥ sevyante na santāpadāyitānoyāsaparamparābhyarthanīyakaraphalabhalinavṛttā mahībhujaḥ(?) | niṣkapaṭaparicayāḥ sulabhavisrambhaśīlasvabhāvāsino mṛgā na svārtharāganigīrṇasnehāvakīrṇaparicitayo durviśvāsaniṣṭhuraprakṛtayo ghnā bandhugandhinaḥ tadidamamṛtamauṣadhaṃ ca tava caraṇamāsthāyedamyahṛtyabhidūreṇa sādhinā sādhayatā tatsādhanīyamartham(?) | amuṣmiṃśca somasutātaṭoddeśe vanyāyatanavāsī dhanyairmunibhiranvāsyamānaḥ pulinalagnaśaṅkhaśakracihnitapadaḥ parameṣṭhī sannihitavainyavāhino bhagavānamumāpannaśaraṇamasuravarakaraṇakadanaparamamaramunimanuje marududalagnivanahanagaganamayatanumatanutanumaladhumaladhumacaramacaramaparaṃ paramahīśayanamanuprapannasya katahyasādatthitānāmavāntirityabhihite(?) mayāsau bhavyatvādātmanaśca bahuśrutyātmapratyayā(gha ? cca)tadahareva vihāya rājacihvāni municihvāni jagrāha |

tathāhi——muktaveṣṭane mūrdhni tapaḥprathamāṅkurāniva rāgamucaḥ kapardānābabandha | mandīkṛ(te ? ta)khaḍgakārmukasparśarasena pāṇinā praśama(ma?)sambhavāṇḍamiva kamaṇḍalu (pa)sparśa | pravarāṃśukaparidhānavyasanaviratiprakṛtisthe madhyabhāge rājyamaladahanalagnamagnimiva tāravamālohitaṃ valkalamāsasa(rja ? ñja) | munyaiśca(?) vanyairanyāśananirāśastanuṃ tanūca(kruḥ ? kāra) |

tathāhi——kiñcitkālamanatikālalabdhairalubdhidoṣo′pi tuṣaireva sa tutoṣa(?) | (kā ? ki)ñcit kālaṃ kālakālāntaritavṛttirmūlaphalapatrapuṣpaśākaśaivalamukhairalagnapakvairavarta(nta ? ta) | punarāmānyevācacāma | tatrāpyagravālī prativikuḍāntaruṇaṃ cāgrāṇyevāgraṇīṇirugratapasā magnabhīta aśnakuṭṭapravetavatiṣṭhannamasārādikaraṇaścacārāvānmu.....ṃṛditamevākiñcitkālāṃśanamāśanisargadāntaśca(?) dantaireva dantolūkha(li ? lī) kevalamulūkhalasya karma nirmame | nirmamaścardihābhārīṃ diśamekā kṛtāgnihotra.....ṇa cedupovāsadṛgacārī praticavrato mṛgatvacā mṛgaiḥ samaṃ mṛgasamapātaścacāra(?) | kiyantamiva ca samayaṃ pravṛttaḥ pravṛttāni pa......varṇe pāraṇāmakalpayat | apa evālpīyasīḥ papau | pavanameva pāvanaṃ papau | vanakaribhagnaśuṣkaśākhaṃ kūṭasandhukṣaṇānāmāśuśu......śikhāśatottaptakṛśaśarīrāsphālagrathitaśūkarāphenilaśīkaraḥ śiśye śiśihimahañjalalavapuñjasamatīkṛmupalaśādvalabhaja.....ġaḷadamalahimajalalavaluḷitamastakastasthau(?) | sūcīpalakaśca sūcitaśalalīkṛtapalakāpāśrayaḥ śarvarīrvarasamādhirādhiśūnyamāsāñcakre kurusakaraṇadhūmapallavānākśirāḥ śreṇiva......bhugnā(?) yadyadāgameṣu dṛṣṭāmiṣṭasantati tadvratamahīnamanvatiṣṭhat | sarvamiva sarvamidaṃ kṛtapṛthupṛthivīpradakṣiṇaḥ dakṣiṇadattanmanoduritaśca parisamāpitatīrthayātrākṛtyo narana.....ṣapuṇye badaryāśrame varṣapūgānuṣitvā punarimāṃ tapovanabhuvamabhyāpanno munija(na)mukhādaśṛṇavam (?) |

amuṣminneva samaye tasya rājarṣerava(ti ? ni)majja(ja?)nagaganagāhanajala......kramaṇādayo bhuvanavismayanīyā abhimānāḥ prādurāsan | bhagavānapyanantaśāyī niratiśayabharitabhakti(bhū ? pū)tābhirbhūyasībhiḥ saparyābhirabhirādhitaḥ prādurbhūyābhraśyāmalena karatalakamalakalitakambucakreṇāmbujekṣaṇena tribhuvanavisargasaṃhārapratihārikeṇa vapuṣā viṣṇurenama(nva)grahīt svapne | vatsa! ripuñjaya! jitaṃ tvayā | parājaiṣṭa niyatiḥ | ayamasmi kṛṣṭastvaṣṭrasantaṣṭa(?)sūryavarca(sacca ? saṃ cā)bhyarcyamurvībhujāmāmardakanirdayavimardavardhitaprabhāvaṃ bhuvo′syāḥ kuṇṭhīkṛtaku(śa?)laśailacakrāyāḥ parigrahītāraṃ tanayamekaṃ rājahaṃsaṃ matprasādādavāpnopi | yataḥ svayaṃ prabhūya pradyumnasāmbau manniyogāvalambinau khalakalikakṣasambhavamasuravargagaraśarastambamambupānaparuṣayāsidhārayāvalūya vilasiṣyato niṣeviṣyate divyāśrayaḥ(?) śithilaya tapasi nirbandhamityantardhānamakarot | upasthitaṃ ca māmanayā manorathasamṛddhyā sakhā (śma ? mama)ripuñjayaḥ samabhyanandayat | upagamya ca magadhānutpādya cainaṃ dīrghāyuṣamasmiṃśca vaśe dhaureye dhurandharāya punarapyamuṣminneva tannāmnā ripuñjayāśrama iti kṛtalakṣaṇe kṛśamiśammaṇi(?) dharmāraṇye dha(rmacā ? rmāca)raṇenācaritaṃmanoratho rathacaraṇāyudhasya caraṇamūle vāsamala(ga ? bha)ta | so′pyayaṃ sujanmā rājahaṃso rājayu(ddho ? dhvā) rājakṛtvā covanatrāṇāmastutyaśca(?) satyodyānavadyaiḥ sadbhirādṛtyamadyādhyāropayat pratāpanṛpalakṣmīm | amuṣya yonijadoṣoranītidoṣaṃ sunīti jagadanaiṣī adyāpyanekamṛga iva dakṣiṇeddharmādharmaṃ kalikaṭākṣitaḥ kṣato rakṣito(?) | rakṣitaryamuṣminna(lo ? leśo)pi lobhasya lavo′pi lāghavasya ka(rṇi ? ṇi)kāpi kā(varṇya ? rpaṇya)sya kha(ṇḍya ? ṇḍa)mapi daṇḍakāyāḥ kṣodo′pi kṣudrabhāvasya śakalama(pya)kuśalasya rajo′pi rā(jai ? jya)dāhasya (dra ? sva)pno′pi matsarasya pṛ(ṣita ? ṣada)pyamarṣasya bindurapi nindyatāyāḥ prajābhirajñāyata |

so′yamujjayinyāḥ patyuruttamakṣatriyasya kṣetriyaparibhavāmayasya mānasārāsārayitvā saśasareṇa(?) śaila(sau ? sā)rau bhujau bhujagarājaviḍambanasa(ho ? hau)sahayuddhvā punaryudhi mahāsirūpeṇa bhagavatā mahākāḷavāsinā tamapi tāvat pareṇa pauruṣeṇa vismāpya labdhaprasādaḥ prasāda iva jaṅgamaḥ kṣatrasahasrarapākṣitaḥ kīrtilakṣmīsarasvatīnāmudārasattvaḥ prāpta enāṃ bhuvamāvasaśca sakalatraḥ sāmātyaḥ sa pitaḥ prabhāvāt sarvartyakamadastapovanamadhigantā mahāntamānandakalpamabhyudayaprapañcam (?) | ato′yamaṃśāvatāro narasakhasyeti priyasakhasya me dharmasantatiriti puṇyaśloko rājarṣiriti sarvathā mayā.....ṇīyaścetyavasi(te ? ta)vacasi mahāmunau tāpasapariṣat praharṣotphullalocanā bhagavan bhavatprasādādākarṇitaḥ purāṇagītaḥ puṇyo rājavaṃśaḥ | śrutama.....ṇdriyamanuvidhatte mahātmano′sya darśanācciraṃ draṣṭavyatṛptasya cakṣurindriya(ma?)syeti hṛṣṭatanūruhā muhurmuhuḥ śraddhālāpānujjagāla | rājā ca saha sacivaiḥ kṛtapa......brahmarṣiṇā pramūrddhāñjalirjānusthito jagāda | bhagavan paramanugṛhīto′smi | vibhātādyācārānubandhinyavidyāvibhāvarī | unmīlitaṃ cakṣu...... |

....l̤maṣāḥ prāgavāgūrdhvaṃ dakṣiṇāgrāḥ surakiṃrasaddhidahanāthadruhiṇadevatyā nadyādipralambāśca sarvadevatyāḥ sambharaṇīyā darbhāḥ khadirakara.....ṃavāmalūporabaghnānedhiśityanaspādhātuyonirakrimikrāntiranatisrigdharaktakṛṣṇāśucirakarkaśakāryāvartmalagnālagnavālukātribhāgavālukā......kriyeti lambā na rarvo(?) pitṛvelāyāmakṛtabalikusumadīpadhūpairaciṃtāśramadevato′paredyurunmīladuṣaḥprabhāyāmṛṣivelāyāṃ mṛṣṭasikte.....ṭaṃsakāmarkavelāyāmatikramya samagrayā ca guruvelayā ca sajjīkṛtasakalasādhano nabhonārāyaṇanābhipuṇḍarīkāyamāṇabhānubhāmaṇḍalāya.....ṃahendravelāyāmupasthitāṃ dakṣi......ñcamudañjalinottamāṅgena jānusthitaḥ praṇāmapūrvakaṃ prasādyāvāhanāsanadānasvāgatānumānanapādyācamanīyapuṣpagandhadhūpadīpārghyahavirbhira(bhya)rcyācyutacandraśekharau skandavighnanāyakau devaṃ ca sagrahanakṣatratārakācakraṃ candramasamuttarato′rcayitvā prācyāmacchinnāgrāṃ hari(da ? ta)cchadāṃ dvātriṃśadaṅgulāyā(ma?)mapramāṇāṃ veṇuyaṣṭiṃ nikhāya taddhvajasannidhāpitaṃ samarudgaṇamamararājamārādhya hutvā citrabhānumaindraistrayodaśabhirmantrairarcitasarvadivyasthānadevatāyatanakramasamprokṣitāvasathamātrāparigrahaḥ śucau deśe vrīhitilasarṣapamāṣalāñchitamacchinnāgradarbhapūtaṃ puṇyagandhasurabhiviṣṭaramadhiṣṭhitaḥ prāṅmukhāya pavitrapāṇaye gurave gandhapraliptāntarābhyāṃ pātrābhyāṃ pādyamardhyañca dattvā dattapuṣpagandhamudīcīnaṃ bhuvastalāt pavitramādāya dhūpadarśitamabhimukhapraṇāmapūrvamupaharati, hṛtvā tu guruḥ svamūrdhni kṣiptvākṣatasparśita bāhuḥ parityajati dattadakṣiṇaśca yathāśakti śiṣyo marṣayatu bhagavānityabhivādyāparānapi yatīnabhivādayate | so′yamevābhivādanavarjaṃ śiṣyādapi gurorvratabandhe vidhiḥ | evaṃ ca baddhavrato viṃśamahaśśataṃ niyatadeśavidheyaśayyāsanādikriyākalāpo vasatītyāmantrya kṣitīśaṃ prātiṣṭhata |

uttaredyurunmiṣatyeva karṇagurukarṇike dinakamale kamalavanaparimalini militavanalatotkesarakusumakomalodare viracitavibhātamārute kṛtapratikarmā samaṃ jāyayā sānuyātrastatraiva magadharājo jagāma | kṛtocitārhaṇau ca dampatī tamindrapūjotsavamanubabhūvatuḥ | indrasamaṃ ca sūnumātmanaḥ samakalpayatām |

vṛtte ca vikhanasavidhānavihite vidhau sthānasthāpiteṣu prajvalatsu pradīpeṣu balavatsu devagṛhe dhūpeṣu lasadbalikusumeṣu dvijagaṇapariveṣaṇavyā(hṛ ? pṛ)tāsu bhramantīṣu pativatnīṣu balipiṇḍalolupeṣu cāpatatsu vanamṛgeṣu maharṣerniyogāt kimapi sampannāpatyasādhanaṃ vidhṛtakalpaṃ mantramadvitī(ye ? yaṃ) pratipitsamāne patyau, tapasvinyāḥ kutaścidupalabhya sannihitapitāputrakaṃ kiñcidāsannaṃ vanyāyatanaṃ tāmevāgrataḥkāramapatyaśra(ddhā ? ddhyā)vanipālapatnī parimitaparijanā jagāma |

gatvā ca yathopapannavanakusumāñjalipra(dā?)dātrī mukhaprakaṭitopayācanā svayañca saṃ.....ṃālinī prāñjaliḥ praṇipapāta | paramayā ca bhaktyā punaḥpunaḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ bhramantī tadāyatanabhitticitre mātrādeśāt sandhyāñjalimurasi dattacaraṇatāḍane vighaṭayati pañca.....ṭryambakāpāṅgalakṣitāmuddhāsaparavatīmumāmupaniśāmya samupajātaspṛhā nabhasicarahṛtanijatanayavayovasthānusmṛtividīryamāṇa.....ṇī pralambaśākhācakre nyagrodhe sikatile (ti ? ta)le nissahā niṣasāda | parijanotsaṅgapātinīvāntadhvani ciraṃ ruroda | tasminneva cāntare...... |

.....ḥasānāṃ saha pitrā vyāghradamano vyāghrājinadantagandhadravyakandamūlaphalādinā prabhūtena sagaṇaḥ samupasṛtya bhūmipālaṃ......bhūbhujottiṣṭhetyabhihitaḥ sādhvasavinayapraṇayaprītimitramutthāya tasthau | pārthivastu taṃ sthaviraṃ tāta! kimasau (ma ? tva)dbhrātetyana......kamanotyatripra.....ḍaḥ sa evāyaṃ devasya vanavihāropakaraṇakolaḥ kauleya(?) iti samaṃ sutena punarapyanaṃsīt | devī ca prakāśaṃ lajjamānā janāntikamivāryaputra sadṛśo vindhyasenāyāḥ (pa)tiriti śanairavādīt | rājā tu samyahīta(?)manyonyasaṃvādi mithuna(di?)metadityanumato′mātyānāṃ tāmbūladānena janayitrā samaṃ tamanvagrahīt | asakṛcca jñātipadāropaṇairvindhyavanavārtānuyogairnijagurucaritākarṇanaiśca suciradattakṣaṇastaṃ janamanvarañjayat | nibandhakāritakapaṃ bhūṣaṇāvayavadānatoṣitatvapyasajjayat (?) | rājñī tu nānurūpā tavākṛterasāvasārā mekhaleti svaśakvarīpreṣaṇātiprasādena vindhyasenā(ma)bhyānandayat | tau vanacaradampatī narapatimithunaṃ tadaharahaḥ kautukajananairanyaiśca pādyairanvavartyetām (?) |

evaṃ ca gacchati kāle kadācidaparayāme′patyaravirathovāntabādhāparihārārthamivotsāryamāṇaviṣamoḍusphaṭikapāṣāṇarāśau(?) jaranmayūrāpāṅgaromadhūsare jarjharāyamāṇatama(svi ? si) svapne saptasāgaraparidhimantamantargatavarṣaparvatadrumamakhilagrahacandrataraṇitārāgucchalācchitama(pyu ? cyu)tamanumiva lakṣmī puṇyalakṣaṇā devī jagadgolaṃ jagrase | pratibuddhā ca svapnenāmunā bhartāraṃ toṣayāñcakāra | svamaphalañca pārthivaḥ kṛtapratimaṅgaḷaḥ prage saha sametya mantribhistribhuvanabhavanatantrapraṇayigṛhamedhinaḥ saudheṣu tayaśastiroskāriṇaḥ(?) kumārasyāsannamāvirbhāvaṃ samarthayāmbabhūva | teṣveva divaseṣvamāvāsyāvasānikamamṛtamayaṃ bhuvanabhūtaye raverivendulekhā tejasāṃ nidherbharturadbhutaṃ garbhamājagrāha | vandyapādo devī yavataruṇarāhapāṇḍarā(?) ca paripūryamāṇā śanaiśśanairvyaktalakṣaṇāsīt | pāriplavahariṇacārudarśanā ca muktāhāraruciradṛśyata | pratidinañca pravardhamānagarbhagauravā mandamandamudayamālalambe | bhūbhṛt pratimuñca śanaiśśanairghaṭamānakarapallavapuṭā niyamitamuttiṣṭhantī rājakādanena teno′guhyata tatkṣaṇamavāryata (?) gurujanasambhāvanārthaṃ cotthitā karagṛhītagāḍhamekhalollasannitambataṭā śvasitapaddhatimanupatantī kṣaṇamivācaṇḍasthi(ki ? ti)rabhavat | ānīlapayodharamukhaprasarpiṇaṃ candrikāsitāṃśukapaṭaṃ bharamivotsasarja | haṃsakulapracayasukumāracandrātapadhavaḷāmbaratalaviviktinī ca pūritasakalāśanaganotsaṅgalagnapādapallavā ca kathaṃ kathamakṣāmakṣapayadapi ca garbhabharālasāyā nakhamayūkhacalayo′pi caraṇalagnaḥ sadānakaṭaka ivāpanetuṃ cito manasā taraḷamṛjāmanoharasurabhigātrasaṅkrāntamapi pratibimbacakravāḷamindranīlābha(ra)ṇamivonmumukṣuḥ paryaspadatāntaḥkaramamṛtakiraṇaveṇimapyantalagnāṃ kusumadāmayaṣṭimiva nirasitumasakṛdaihata karakisalayamarikulabhaṅgayogyābhivaracaracayannārambhaṇa eva balitrayaṃ babhañja(?) |

garbho garbhasthitacakravartyādiṣṭamivojihīṣitamapi tamumocaiva caraṇayugaḷamātmādhiṣṭhitāṃ bhuvamatyarthadhavalite mantharāyamāṇe cakṣuṣī svapnanigīrṇacandramaṇḍalāmṛta....l̤avadṛptagarbhātipānabhayaparivinṛṣṭe sutarāṃ paryaplavetām(?) | adbhutagarbhamāhātmyaparivartitasvabhāvā (va ? ca)hīnasvarāṇīti guhāsiṃhabṛṃhitāni jahāsa | kha.....ṭadyota iti ma.....ṇa dinakaramabamene | atikha(rvo ? rvā)ṇīti vindhyaparvatāgreṣu garvāt paribhavaṃ babandha | devāsuravikrameṣvapi prastute......śaknuvatī lamba.....ṃāniva yādasāmpatiṃ (na ? nā)cintavat | parijanādeśāvapyapārayantī sasiddhagandharvavidyādharaṃ bhuvanamādeṣu tva......camānaikākinyeva khaḍgadhārānirvirīkṛtāśeṣavarṣāvarṣaparvateṣu bhramitumāśaśaṃse(?) | tathā ca khaḍga iti mṛgaviśeṣe......vicakra iti maṇḍa......vipi nakhara iti kararuhe′pi śaktiri(tta?)ti sāmarthye′pi prayujyamānamutsavagarvitāyāṃ śravaṇamājagāma triyāmā ca prasuptā madolitabāla.....ṭāvikasitasitaśatapatrātapatradhāriṇīparicāravarmā carmakṛpāṇabāṇacāpacakraśaṅkhatomaraśūlibhiraṣṭābhirbhujalatābhirbhagavatī rarakṣa sākṣād vindhyavāsinī(?) |

tadevaṃ devatānuvṛttidarśitoda(rbha ? gra)garbhānubhāvāyā devyā daivavaśāccaturṇāma(pyārabhya ? pyamātyā)nāṃ purodhasaśca brahmadattasya bhāryāḥ pañcāpi yugapadāpannasattvā babhūvuḥ | vindhyasenā ca garbhaṃ babhāra | suṣuve sūnuṃ siṃhadamanaṃ nāma | anayā ca vārtayorvyāḥpatiḥ patnī cābhyanandatām | adattāṃ ca pradeśakaṃ prabhūtam | atha katipayeṣvatīteṣu vāsareṣvasūta sutaṃ sutrāmāṇamivāditirdevī ca vasumatī | tasya janmani tattejaḥprasaraproṣabhayādivoccaiḥsthāna(bhāva?)bhājaḥ sarva eva grahā jajñire | tasmiṃśca samaye tatsaṃbhavaṃ kalaye kalinidhanakaraṃ nivedayitukāmā(pya ? hya)tivātādayo doṣā dudruvuḥ | tasyāpi tribhuvanavijigīṣordevasyeva viṣṭaraśravaṇameva janmadinamudayañcāsya prathamameva tadanurūpāparaśrīnirmāṇakāmāmanu(?) pratirnirmathyamānasindhunāthahrādanānīva diṅmukhān vyāpādayanto devasyāvedayan devadundubhayaḥ |

parijanastu rabhasavyākulaṃ kevalaṃ jahāra pūrṇapātram | prasarati ca pratibhāriṣṭamavanapradīpacakravāḷe svayameva kāle tribhuvanadīpamālikollāsini maṅgaḷapradīpatāmālambamāne garbharāgānubandhini sandhyāyitarodhasi tasya tejasi tryambakajaṭākadambabhrāntyā patantīvāmarasari(dda ? da)bhrājiṣṭa divyā puṣpavṛṣṭirūpā | jagāma ca prabhāvajñātavṛttānto drutagaticaṭulajaṭākalāpaḥ praharṣakriyamāṇakilikilāraveṇa svagaṇenānuyāto′vadātavṛṣādhiṣṭhāyī kārayitukāmaḥ kumā(ro ? ra)janmotsavamurutamapramodo bhagavān vāmadevaḥ | sahomaścāsāvacīkarat svayamadhiṣṭhāya kṛtsnāṃ purodhasāṃ vidhim | anantarañca maharṣiṇābhyanujñātastenaiva samantrajātaiḥ putramapyālambitabahuputrakaṃ sahalamusaladharamapyavanamālāvāraṇamurukramamapyariṣṭasaṅgataṃ śaktiyuktamapyapādhiṣṭhitaṃ bhūpatiparihṛtoddeśamapi lakṣmīsamadhyasitadapyamānakhamaṣāvayavakañcukitvamapyavitṛptikakāñcukīyaharṣanṛttaśobhitaṃ(?) bahuvidharakṣādhūpaṃ durdināndhakāramapyavikalapuṇḍarīkacchavisanāthaṃ sthānasthānaṃ nikhātacāruviṭapamabhyarcyamānaṣaṇmukhapramukhadevataṃ haritapatrapallavakusumadūrvāmiśrasarvauṣadhīsarṣapāṅkamapāsulolobhajayānalasparśapūrvamapraviśya(?) sūtikāgṛhaṃ kṣāmakṣāmāyā mātuḥ sannidhāvudayarāgalohitāyamānamūrtimaṃśumālinamiva bālamānandajananaṃ janayitā kumāramadrākṣīt |

īkṣamāṇasya cāsyākarṇasetudīrghayorakṣidīrghikayoḥ kamalotpalakumudakāntiśālinyoḥ śītale′mbhasi taraḷatārake tārataraṃ tatāreva tanayānanadarśanānandam | anena ca tārayitrā dustaramapūrvapotakena tīrṇameva varṇātrayatrikhaṇḍaṃ(?) saṃsārasāgarasya mene | mantriṇo′pi mahadi(nadanmā ? damā)virbhūtamabhūtaṃ bhūtānāṃ bhū(ta ? ti)heturityavirata(bā ? ha)rṣabāṣpapūraplutekṣaṇāḥ kṣaṇe kṣaṇe kamalayā iva kaṇṭaki(ta)tanavaḥ sasmitamācacakṣire | kulapatistu tapaḥprabhāvādhyakṣeṇādhyakṣa(ya)nnamu(hya ? ṣya) mahātmanaḥ paramādbhutaṃ bhāvicaritamīṣatsmito harṣagadgadikāgrathitakaṇṭhamabravīt | 

(vat)sa! rājahaṃsa! paśya tāvadayaṃ sa kaṃsaśatroraṃśaḥ | vaṃśastava cāpi kānto yasya rājakuñjarasyātibhūtaṃ catmidamasya karakamalatale cakrameva kathaya cakravāḷaparikaradharādharāyāṃ samagrasya puruṣasiṃhaśasyāśitaṃbhavamātramāviṣamaṣṭādaśakṣetravartidvipajātaṃ ṣaṇmukhenāmunā putriṇaikena spṛhayet prāyaḥ pitāpi ṣaṇmukhasya(?) | dhanyeyaṃ vatsā vasumatī yasyāḥ kukṣernidhirayamadbhutaḥ samudbhūtaḥ sadguṇaratnānām | bhāgyavatya i......pāparaparanirvṛtidvāramutthita iti bruvāṇa eva tasmin bhagavataḥ pākaśāsanasya śāsanāt tasya ca sarvacakravartināmagrataḥsarasyopībha......prasarpiṇīsvapava......prabhāprasare padmarāgaraṅgapīṭha iva naṭantyaścaṭulatulākoṭimaṇiraṇitānupātinīṣu mandākinīhaṃsamaṇḍalīpuṇḍarīkamālāsviva lakṣmīvila......iva svabhāvabaddhānekarāgavṛttibhirudvāhitanitambabhaṇḍalānupalitaiḥ kalpadrumakulapallavairullasitakucataṭataraḷapuratakumukuḷamuktāphalayarṣayo(?) irṣanṛtta......śikharakaṇakarālitakumārayogyaśakraprābhṛtāmṛtakalaśavāhinya iva lakṣyamāṇānanā maṇibhūṣaṇāṃśumālinyo hrādinya iva rājasūnurupidhvānajanitameghagarjitāśāḥ śakradhanusmahasrānukarṣiṇyo′pakīrṇāścamayimivānanaiścaturahāsacandrātapa(va)rṣibhirabhramayamiva dhammillapallavaiścalākāmalapralambamālollāsibhirdīpyamānakāmadhūmarekhāmayamiva(?) bhrūlatābhirūrddhvapalitavellitacaṭulakoṭibhirvijṛmbhamāṇakulayasarassahasramayamiva līlāpāṅgalāsyairunmadabhramaramāloddāmavibhramaiḥ pracalarāgapatākāmayamiva bhujalatābhiḥ kamalakomalatalaprabhāsambhārakausumbhāṁśukapaṭapāṭalāgrābhirākulākularatipravāḷamayamiva lolapārihāryaravairatanurāgajanmabhirbālātapacchedamiva taraḷakarṇapārijātakisalayairbhāsvanmukhavilāsinībhiḥ kāmarājyamayamivādharadyutivitānairanurañjitasakaladigbhistamaraṇyoddeśamādarśayantyo varṣantya iva lāvaṇyaṃ samudgirantya iva rasasaritpravāhaṃ bhramayantya iva vibhramaṃ vikṣipantya iva vilāsaṃ divyavīṇāveṇutālamuravamaddalapaṇavādibhistumburunāradaprabhṛtibhiranavamairgandharvarājairabhyetya surastriyo nṛttagītarāsakalāsyabhallīsakalāpramodaikatānamutsarpaṃ pracakruḥ | prodbhidyanta iva bhuvastalād mahotsāhadarśinīnāmānanā(ni ? nī)va nāgasundarīṇāṃ hiraṇmayāni tāmarasāni kumāradarśanarāgiṇyā dharaṇyā svayamapāvṛtāni bhavanadvārāṇīva ratnacāmīkaramayānyāvirāsan mahānidhānāni | kalyāṇakarmakarṇadhāra iva vikīryamāṇavividhapuṣpareṇupiṣṭātakaprakaro babhrāma surabhiritastato mandamārutaḥ | prasannojjvalamukhībhirdigaṅganābhiḥ pramodagī(ti ? ta)mivo(dgā ? dagā)yi pragītiḥ | cāraṇagaṇagītarāgapratiraveṇa divyagāndharvatūryadhvanitapūritairguhāmukhairvindhyo′pi prahṛṣṭa iva pratatamunnanāda |

kiṃ bahunā, tanmuhūrtamakalpata svargabhūyāya taddharmakānanaṃ, yanniśāmya vyasmeṣata smayā(da ? na)bhijñamanaso′pi te taponidhayaḥ | sa ca samagro devatāgaṇaḥ praṇipātena svāgatena madhuravyāhṛtenāsanadānena ca yathānurūpaṃ bhūpālena sambhāvitastamāmantryāntarikṣaṃ jagāhe | maharṣirapi vāmadevaḥ kumārānubhāvasaṃbaddhayaiva saṅkathayā suciraṃ sthitvā pratyāsannaniyamavelaḥ kartavyānyupadiśya saha tapodhanaiḥ svamevāśramaṃ jagāma | tāvacca kāṃsyatālakāhaḷagoviṣāṇaśaṅkha(ma?)maddaḷāna(ta ? ka)timilāśabdaistadaraṇyamāpūraya(n ? tā) pratipadaskhalitavihvalaṃ pranṛtyatā vṛddhena vyāladamanena, madhumadaharṣopaviṣṭenāpareṇaiva nṛttamārgeṇādhikacaturaśracāritākṣibhruvamaviralacaraṇanikuñjanakvaṇitanūparamāviddhākulakusumadāmadhammillabaddhabandhamasakṛdākuñcitaprasāritāñcitotkṣiptabhujalatāvalambitottarīyamārecitanitambaphalakācālamekhalamāndolitakarṇapāśalolakuṇḍalāvaghaṭṭitāṃsamanavadhānaskhalitapādaviṣamitalayamāyāsastvāsabhinnagītarāgamāvarjitapṛthupayodharahāramārabdhānandanṛttayā pranṛttaśabarīsahasramadhyavartinyā vindhyasenayā, ninartiṣāvārataralitanitambabhāgamātāmahīpatiparigṛhītena(?) ca trimāsajātena kimapi mugdhamukhamudgarjatā siṃhadamanena, nṛtya(taṃ ? tā) gāyatā kṣveḷatonnadatā samāsphoṭayatā saṅghaṭṭayatā ca sumadoddhatenāślīlapadaprabandhohāriṇā(?) tumburutumurupurmukhakirātabarbarapuḷindanillamālamātaṅgaprāyeṇa mahatā vanacarasamūhena puraskriyamāṇabahuḷaharṣakolāhalaḥ svayañca nṛtya(n) vyāghradamanaḥ samadṛśya(ti ? ta) | cirādiva ca praśāntakalakale kānanaukasāmanīke siṃhadamanapraṇipātaprīṇiteḥ pṛthivīpatirayamapi kumārasyānurūpameva mitramāvayorivāsmatpitrorivānayo....r̤yodāhāryamastvityasulabhaprasādahāragauravānamraśirasaṃ vyāghrada(mana)manugṛhya saha pitrā vyasarjayat | vindhyasenā tu gate′pi bhartaryapāraya(ti ? ntī) kumārā(dā?)nanānanda......pi siṃhadamanamapaśyan pitāsya kathaṃ saheta yāhi punarapyāgamiṣyasīti devyā nirbadhyamānā kathaṃkathamapyavitṛṣṇa......paryaṇaṃsīt | sañcāyañca(?) mantriṇāṃ caturṇāṃ bhāryāḥ patnī ca purodhasaḥ pañcāpi tāḥ pañcārthāniva pañcendriyapravṛttayaḥ pañcadārakān manonukūlānalabhanta | pañcabhiśca taiḥ pañcaparvā vidrumāṅkura iva kumāraḥ sujātaḥ svavaṃśalakṣmyāḥ paryāptaṃ bhūṣaṇamagaṇyata | prahṛṣṭatamena pitrā teṣāṃ ca gṛheṣu svajanavat svayamadhiṣṭhāyorvīpatiḥ sarvāḥ kriyāḥ kārayāmāsa | tathā samṛddhamanora(tha)śca ma(ntrī ? ntri)pariṣadi svayamidaṃ babhāṣe | citraḥ khalu jīvalokaḥ | bahurūpāṇīva bhavitavyasya vimphūrjitāni | ko nvimāmasya daśāṃ paśyannapi śraddadhīta | tiṣṭhatu vā(va ? pa)raḥ | svasyaiva me svacaritamatyantaparokṣamibālakṣyate | sa kilaivāyaṃ saṃyugeṣu bhramitabaddhenābabhrāmādbhutabhramaya ivāsṛgdhārāścākṣamaskara iva madhukṛdbhirāścaryāsikṣodaiścitritāṅgaḥ papānāthatalataprasuptaśca jane sujanaduḥkhasāgaramanabhisarassudustaraṃ tārānujagrahe cāhnāya svapnasannihitena bhasi(navanā ? tavatā)mahākālanivāsinā nṛtyamidamanubhūyamānavyasambhāvyasambhāvyatayā nābhipraṇayatiśca yaṃ(?) | kva cāyamaṣṭādaśagaṇābhyarcyamānajanmanaścakrapāṇerivātmajaja(na)notsa(vama ? vā)nubhavaḥ | kaścāyaṃ prakāro yadasyaivamātmanaḥ śarīrāntaritādasyaiva pu(na)rime′pi pañcavikalpāḥ pañcabālakāḥ samaṃ samabhūvanniti harṣabhareṇātimātraṃ pīḍyamāna iva tasthau | su(gu ? ma)tistva(ma?)bravīt | na(tu ? nu) deva prahatamevedaṃ yathā sāravatsyośavāśmasviva tuhinatejasī sukhaduḥkheti prīhrībhavano netareṣamahatsu ca prapatitānyageṣviva mṛgaśṛgāṇi vyasanānyeva vyasanamāpadyante(?) | vyāpadyataśca virasāmnāno′pi vyavasāvavatā vilaṅghyamānā niyataṃ pārāvārormaya ivānte mahāntaṃ lābhamābahanti bhabādṛśaśca tejasvinastigmagorivāvasargādarśanamātramapramattasya jagato na tu sthāsnukṣiptarvānubhāvaṃ bhājanameva bhavānīdṛśasya kalyāṇapra(pa)ñcasya(?) | na(nu) vasanta eva svabhāvasurabhau nipatanti jagadānandabhūmayaḥ kusumātiśayāḥ | kva cāyamanyatra cakravartī janmagrahaṇaṃ kartumarhati | tamantareṇa kṣīrasindhumasti ka(ñca?)śvidudbhavaḥ kaustubhamaṇeḥ | tribhuvanasukṛtamayānāṃ ca pārthivānāmutpattau nāticitrīyate nānuniṣpādināmupakaraṇānāṃ sāmagrī nanuvakasantavosaramanu vikasanti paṅkajākarāḥ(?) | tadete′pi pañca (balakāṃ ? bālakāḥ) kusumakomalamūrtayaḥ śarā iva śarīrajanmanastavotpatata iva svārthasādhanāya hastekṛtā iti | api ca mantriṇo hṛdyasambhavaṃ tamānandadhuramivodgirantastatkālocitābhiḥ suciramāsāñcakrire | prauḍhe ca pradoṣasamaye rājñājñaptā jujuṣustoṣavanto ya(dā svā ? thāsva)māspadam | nṛpendro′pi nije parṇabhavane śayanīyamabhajata | prītyā copagūḍhastaṃ niśāṃśamapyanīnayat |

atha guṇini nakṣatre praśastāyāṃ tithau sampanne muhūrte saha maharṣiṇā saṃmantrya trilokyāmasyāṃ sarvata eva rājanempatyenadhiṣṭhitā(?) yathāsvaṃ bhārameteṣāñca vāhayiteti yathoditena vidhinā rājavāhanaṃ nāma rājasūnuṃ rājakīyo garuścakāra |

svaṃ ca tanayaṃ somadatta iti svajātisamucitena nāmnā samayojayat | sumateḥ sūnuḥ pramatirāsīt | suśrutasya viśrutaḥ suguptasya mitraguptaḥ | teṣu caivaṃ kṛtanāmasu mātṛstanyāśaneṣu vardhamāneṣvarbhakeṣu kadācicchayarasenā nāma jananī vindhyasenāyāḥ palitagau(ra)śirasamanatinṛśaṃsākṛtimāryaveṣaṃ kamapyāraṇyakaṃ puraskṛtya parivārajane svayamevādarādarpitaśroṇīpārśvā varṣajātamapi dvivarṣamivopalakṣyaṃ lakṣaṇairdayārdrairivānahadaśāpannaparigṛhītaṃ(?) siṃhaśābakamiva kañcidyadṛcchādhigataṃ pṛthukaṃ pṛthupallavagucchapratiṣiddhoṣṇamudvahantī samupasṛtya sabhartṛkāṃ devīmavandata | abhyadhatta ca sadāsī vindhyasenā vijñāpayati——bālo′yaṃ bālasevake (′nu)rūpa iva kumārasyāsyāgamamāgamayyāsmadājñāka......paraṃ bhartṛpādāḥ pramāṇamiti |

prīyamāṇastu pṛthivīpatiḥ aṅga! ācakṣva | kuta ihāsya sambhavaḥ kaccidiha kānane kañcidṛṣimapi lobhayantyāḥ kasyāścidapsarasaḥ kṛtārthateyamanyathāsmi dugdhaśirīṣakorakumāre......vedavaṣṭhambho′yamīda ityudbhinnakutūhalaḥ svayameva taṃ śabaramaprākṣīt (?) | sa tu praṇamya vijñāpayāmāsa——deva! śrūyatām | i......janmāntare′spāmeva vindhyāṭavyāṃ.....ẏā mātṛṣvasuḥ patirapara ivai(ku ? ka)lavyaḥ kalerivāṃśāvatāraḥ kartā kolāhalānāṃ praharṣa......pragṛhītā pallīpatīnāṃ loptā janapadānāṃ goptā malimlucānāmanabhijñaḥ kṣutpipāsayoravasarajñaḥ samprahārāṇāmityabhi......plavaṅga iva prāṃśuvṛkṣārohaṇeṣu kauśika iva kṣaṇadājāgaryāsu mattagaja iva pratisaṃveṣṭano mṛgapatiriva sarvasandohapātī pralapannirannu......śītoṣṇavarṣavātopadraveṣvavikārī vimṛśyakārī śakyārambhaśīlaḥ mṛgavirutivibhāgavidavisamvāditanimittajaṭākaḥ kartavyeṣvadīrghasūtraḥ kṛcchreṣvapratipattiḥ prathaneṣvaniva(tti ? rtī) sarvāyudheṣu niṣṇāto vapuṣāpi bhayaṅkaraḥ kirātapatiryathārthanāmā sārthamardano nāmāsti | tasya māmavaitu mātulamalātacakranāmānam | (davaste ? te va)yamapasarpamukhādupalabhya maithilamavalepavaśādaśaṅkita(ve ? meva) tarantamaraṇyavarānāyuṃgmāṃ ptadāpāptastambhanirbhayapravṛttaśca bahutamāmiṣatvādāśāpūraṇasamarthaṃ sārthaṃ hastavartinameva tamavasyantaḥ pranardantaḥ pranṛtyantaśca harṣāt puruṣamupahṛtya devyai vindhyavāsinyai sindho patiraśśatadeyamityavasthāpya suniśitāsidhenusyūtasvaprakoṣṭhasrāvi(kā ? tā)sravacayassarasattvavisārasāratajyāsajyakodaṇḍayaṣṭayaḥ sadyaḥ pratimuktantanabarhabāsasāmāśyānaśoṇitapralepapracalitakuṇṭhayāraṇyaśmasumukhaniśāyayitvā śaraṇāṃ sambhṛtaśūlyamāṃsavallūravallaripramukhakṣemāśanāḥ paśupuritadvṛtīdhūtā viśvāsotpā(ta ? da)nāya katipayadivasāpratiruddhādhvanī(nāṃ ? nāḥ) suśakunaprapañcavardhitotsāhāḥ kṛtasa(ṅgīyo ? ṅketā) yathāyathaṃ senāpatipradiṣṭeṣu pratirodhanasthāneṣu vipinasattvāpāśrayā nibhṛtamivātiṣṭhāmahi(?) | prāvartata ca pramattarūpo rūpājīvānurāgadṛṣṭivāguritavidhuravīrataruṇastāravaratālaśuṅgabhaṅgalobhalambamānāṅganājanaḥ sāsicarmaikahastastrijitabhaṭagṛhītapākapākasvāduphalāpacāyaprasṛtaprakṛto mārgotthitamṛgānudhāvanacchidurasaṃhatirihaviyasaurabheyakarabharābhasasardādikāryaddhoddhurapraharatapṛthagjano nimmivimlu......śaṅkinībhayamalimlucāmalāyogavatpūryamānamānyavelañcelapaṭo kāṇḍadaṇḍapaṭṭanaruṣṭagoṇigoṇikṣepakṣubhitakṣudrasvāmiduśśrāvyakrośavardhano smerapigarbhagaḥ paravṛddhavaiṣamyavāryamāṇalokapraṇodo naimittikadurnimittodgrāhaṇapratisamādhīyamānaśastrivargo mārgajñajanakathyamānacihvitabhayasthānaḥ sāvadhānaprasthitaḥ sa rājasainya(ā?)sambhṛtasārtho mahāsārthaḥ(?) | prāpte ca svagocaramāhatapaṭupaṭahagomukhāna(na?)kā mukhapama(no ? nā)dhmānaśabdāyamānaśaṅkhapi(ñchāva ? ñcholā)kāhaḷāḥ kṣveḷotsṛṣṭakarṇīsvakṣubhitakakṣamaṇḍalā, maṇḍalitapracaṇḍalodaṇḍaghanaghaṭotsṛṣṭakāṇḍa(dva ? vṛ)ṣṭayo hatahateti grathitamabhivyāharantaścalitaprabhūrbhāraghalaṣudarśanaparivṛttayo(?) vyāghrā iva vijṛmbhitakṣudhaḥ kṣubhitā iva pralayanirghātaghoravegamete vayamugrākṣibhruvā bhakṣayanta iva tadbalaṃ rabhasamabhyapatāma | tanuśibiragarbhatayā prasthāna(para?)paratayā bahusaṅkaṭatayā visrabdhatayāndhatayā ca tasyoddeśasyonmuktabahaḷahāhākāramudbhrāntabhīruśibiracārābalā(bā ? pā)lanāhīnasannaddhaṃ nadatsadbhaṭamudbhaṭakarighaṭābhramaṇabhinnāśāṭitaśakaṭakoṭisaṅkaṭamutkaṭaśarakhaṇḍakaṇṭakitavikaṭakaṅkaṭikadaṇḍakacakitaṃ ciṭitapaṭurabhayaharaṇaparapuruṣakirātakṛtakapaṭā(ba ? pa)sāramutsekaprasṛtanāsīracārubhagabhaṅgabhagrapṛṣṭhyabalayajapajaṅghāravajhaṭajhaṭāyamānagulmadvarmakamardanamarditabalīvardavṛndanirdayavimardakardamitarudhiraruddhamārgājñavatkāndiśīkadeśikāyamānaśaṭhaśabaradarśitātmavalīpathamapahatadrumaviluptavidhvastaṃ samarthameva sārthākramasmatpriyāṃ kāmittaśocyadarśanaṃ tatkṣaṇādajāyata(?) |

sa tu narapatiramaratulyaprabhāvaḥ prabha(ne ? gne)′pi sarvasainye suyodhana ivākṣatābhimānaḥ svayamasaktasārakāsāravarṣavārivāhāyamānabāṇāsano dāruṇakrodhatāmreṇa cakṣuṣā nirdahanniva......kṣipa(t) | darpitātmā ca sārthamardano mahānubhāve tasminnaśabarārhaṃ bahu parākramata | sa ca mahā(n) sarvaireva sajjadhanvabhirasmābhirabhrairiva girirabhyava.....ṣārthavāhairūrdhvadohīrākrandyamāno duṣkarapratisamādhānaṃ tadbalamavagatya durgamatvaṃ cātmano vidhuratāṃ ca kṣemasthāsyaga......bhūyiṣṭha(?)......kṛtaḥ pārśvavartino′nvayuṅkta | saṅkule kenāpyagraprasthitaṃ devīvāhyamityabhihito gṛhītahamāraṃ vaidehikajanamabhayagatañca sastrībālavṛddhaṃ ca.....ḍhyadhyādhadarśamānugairāśukāri śanaiśśanaiḥ prātiṣṭhata(?) | sārthamardanastu māmamuṣmin pātarathāne mahataḥ sārasañcayasya rakṣāvidhau niyujya rājānamanvabadhnāt | āhlāmayannataśca mātaṅgapuḷindadurmukhānāṃ sārthalakṣma(?)samūlakāpaṃ kaṣantaḥ kāṃścidasighātaṃ ghnantaḥ kāṃścid jīvagrāhaṃ gṛhṇantaḥ kāṃścit paśumāraṃ mārayantaḥ kāṃścid daṇḍena kālayantaḥ kāṃścijjīvanāśaṃ naśyato′bhigṛhya pūṣavāhaṃ vāhayanto(ptrā ? strā)ṇi kāṃścid gulmānupraveśaṃ līnānveṣamanassu cakrabandhaṃ baddhvā pārśvopapīḍaṃ śāyayantaḥ kāṃścidasahiṣṇutayoraspeṣaṃ yuddhyamānā(n) ddhajeṣugrahamākṛṣya helayākṣinikāṇaṃ prahasantaḥ kāṃścit paśūniva yaṣṭyupadhātaṃ kālayitvā vrajāvarodhaṃ sthāpayantaḥ kāṃścidajakanāśaṃ naṣṭān guhān guhānaṃśena praviveśamākarṣantaḥ kāṃścinnīcaiḥkāramālapantaḥ (ba?)kṣupalīnānupalabhya harṣā′nyonyaṃ nāmagrāhamāhvayantaḥ tathāca kecit guhyakajanakathakāni kautukarāvarṣamāmuñcantaḥ svāduṅkāramāsavasurāriṣṭasauvīrakatuṣodakāni yāvadvedaṃ śulyamāṃsopadaṃśaṃ pibantaḥ karpūrasphaṭikaṃ pāṣāṇaśuṣkapeṣaṃ piṣṭvā narāsravisreṇa vakṣasi kṣipanto bandījanaṃ ca nāgākāraṃ kāraṇābhiguptamaraṇyaṃ paribhramantaḥ paramahṛṣyatyajikān kṣutānye mṛgā iva śayyotthāyamayamaharaharāmiṣānveṣiṇopanānvayaṃ paridhāvanti te tathā dhanapoṣaṃ puṣṭā hṛṣṭā iva ca(?) | luptāṃso′pyahamupaliptamiva (ku ? gu)rucandanairupahṛta(miva) śiraḥpaṅkajairuptamiva bahumukhastnabhūṣaṇairudgandhakamiva bhāṇḍakūṭaiḥ sthagitamiva tāraromakumbhaiḥ puṣpitamiva prakīrṇakapra(va?)karaiḥ pallavitamiva ratnatālavṛndaistārakitamivārvapadapulakajālairata(na ? nu)vanadantibhagnavāryargaḷābhiriva chinnābhirvīrabāhābhiḥ kīrṇaṃ kāḷarātrisvayaṃvaramañcairiva kāñcanadaṃsamaiḥ(?)vājigajakalebarairācitaṃ madhurāpulinamiva kaṃsamaṇḍalākīrṇaṃ vamamiva jātarūpaghaṭākulaṃ bārhadrathamiva bhagnadrāvitamadhudaṇḍaṃ rājakulamivodbhrāntāvanipalokaṃ valmīkamiva bahumukhakṣaradraktastrīgaṇanicitaṃ gaṇikākulamiva ratnaraktamuktāphalakā(ntodā ? ntamā)yodhanasthānaṃ sthāpitarakṣaḥ parihṛtya raktacikvillalīnaśalyaṃ hṛllekhanamitastato′nupacaran (?) bahumarmakṣatarujābhirnimīlya cakṣuṣī dīrghamantaḥ stanantīmantakakharakarakaṣaṇadhāvajjīvitāmiva kṣaratkṣatajaṃ kṣitau viveṣṭamānāṃ rudhirapeṣaṃ piṣyamāṇāmivāṅgarāgīkartuṃ kālarātryā gharmavanalatāmivāmbhasāmalābhādūrdhvaśoṣaṃ śuṣyantīmaṣṭādaśavarṣadeśīyāṃ yuvatimadrāśram | abhyarṇe ca tasyāḥ kima(pya)rbhakasyeva ruditaśabda(mācakarṇaṃ ? karṇayaṃ) na tvajñāsiṣam (i ? ku)to′sya sambhūtiriti | atha (tātā ? jāta)dayaḥ kiñcijjīvasītyaprākṣam | akṣamā tu sā vaktumakṣiṇī manāgunmīlya dayamānaṃ māmavekṣamāṇā yatnādabhāṣata | ārya! kiṃ mayā mandabhāgayā mṛtayā dhṛtayā vā | (ya)stvasau kariśava(rṇata ? ka)rṇapallavāntarito bha(dra ? rtṛ)dārakaḥ sambhāvaya tāvat sa kiṃ jīviṣya(tī?)ti naveti tasyāḥ śrutvā jātakautūhalaḥ sahasopasṛtya patitasya parāsoḥ svapata iva mataṅgañsyāṅgamaṅgārakitamiva śī(naśa?)nairasṛgbhirabhyākramya grīvāntare tomareṇādhaḥkīlitaṃ paritaḥ paṅktisthitairiṣubhiravagāḍhatribhāgaiḥ parikṣiptaṃ drakṣuparītiruddhaparyantamiva paryaśeṣaṃ dharmapalvalakamūrdhvadṛṣṭi bhulitakṣepairucchvāsyamānaṃ saprāṇavṛttimiva tadviradamādarśayantaṃ śravaṇapallavamasyopalakṣayam (?) | uddhṛtya praharaṇānyutkṣipya ca gajakarṇapañjaraspṛṣṭameva śalyai.....ṭomaraśarīrārūḍhitāmrolūnasevanītāṃ(?) vikaṭakaṇṭharajjūkarṣakliṣṭapṛṣṭhakamibharudhirakuṅkumarasacchaṭācchuritobhayabhujamāścaryāyuṣaṃ rājasūnumenaṃ......kṣiptacakṣurakṣataśarīratāmasyopalakṣya karmaṇa eva vaicitryaṃ cintayan tāmupetya varavarṇinīmavādiṣam | bhadre! samāśvasihi.....ḍevānāṃ priyaḥ ko′sya duṣkṛtinau pitarau yayorayamīdṛśo′pi śokāpanudaḥ śokā.....ṃṛgapatikumārakasyeva karikumbhasthaladaḷanapātino bālyādasphuṭavaḥ niveśaskhalitabhraṣṭasya(?) yadṛcchayā śravaṇapañjararo.....ṭyakhila.....ṭe mayāsau yoṣiduṣṇaṃ dīrghañca niḥśvasyodaśruṇā mukhena danyamiva kṣarantī prāṇadāyinamiha bhagavantaṃ muktvā ko′nyaḥ śrotumarhatīti bahumāna(tigṛhi ? nigṛhī)......vedanā śanairavādīt | ārya!......śravaṇapathamāntā eva nūnamṛddhimantaḥ prayatāṃ drohadehino(?) videhāḥ | teṣāmadhipatiravataṃna iva janakavaṃśasya devaḥ prahāravarmā nāma | so′yamāsāgaravasundharaikavallabhasya magadhānāṃ parivṛḍhamya devasya rājahaṃsasya dṛḍhamasādhāraṇapremapātraṃ mitramāsīt | tadantaḥpuralalāmabhūtā ca janmabhūmirguṇānāṃ devī vasumatī nāmāsya priyāyāṃ(t?) priyaṃvadāyāmatimātraprāyajīviteva dvitīye(?) snehavatyabhūt | āpannasattvāṃ ca tāṃ sakhīsnehāt didṛkṣurdevī priyaṃvadā bhartrā saha magadhānayāsīt | asminneva cāntare mānasāreṇa nāma rājñā(ḷarvo ? māḷavena) devasya magadharājasya gaṅgāyamunayossaṅgame tārakāmayasamāna(nda?)matimahadamarāṇāmapi romaharṣasañjananaṃ janyamajani | tatrāyaṃ janakarājaḥ prahāravarmā raśmiriva mahasāmasahyapratā(paṃ ? paḥ) kṛtvā sahasraśaḥ kṣatriyāṇāmantamanantaraṃ priyasasvena siṃhavarmanāmnā (va ? a)ṅgeśvareṇa sākamekarathe(nevā ? naiva)mṛta ivāstratalpamadhiśayānastena rājñā ma(ā)ga(dhamā ? dhenā)havāda(vā ? pau)hyata | sa tu devaḥ kṣatrajīvitadhvāntaśastrapaśukukṣirvipakṣahṛtprayuktena kenāpi divyakṛpāṇena svabāṇaśreṇicūrṇitena raṇalakṣmīdṛṣṭivṛddhipiṣṭātakareṇunikareṇa (vāpa ? cāva)cūrṇitāṅga(stva ? sta)thāsīdyathā sadakṣiṇasthalasya rathyasya janakasya gātrāṇāṃ lagopikānāṃ devapratyabhijñānavartinīm (?) | imāñca vārtāmapāstamakuṭakuṇḍalapralambahārādibhūṣaṇaḥ svayamupetya mālavendraḥ sahāṅgarājāya ṣaṭmvāmine svajanavadaśrūṇi vimuñcannaśrāvayadastambhayacca kathaṃ kathamapyanekavidhairvīradharmākhyānaiḥ | aharniśaṃ ca svayamadhiṣṭhāya nijabhiṣakprayuktairbheṣajaiḥ kṣatānyaropayat | ātmanā ca sa devaḥ sa eva nirvyājapauruṣo jitavān, ahaṃ tu daivataśaraṇaḥ parājita eva kiṃ mamānena klībasyeti sarvakṣatramadhye śastraṃ parityaktavān | īdṛśyā tu tatra sādhau pratirūpayā pratipattyā prakṛtaḥ prahāravarmā priyasuhṛt pravāse′pi prāṇān na paryatyajat | pravrajyodantastu prabuddhairnāputrāṇāmayajvanāṃ ca pānapapsya(?)mastīti santānotpādane prayatnama(gṛ ? grā)hyata | prāptopasnāmekasminneva garbho(?) mādreyasamau devyāṃ priyaṃvadāyām | prīyamāṇastu mālavendro viśvajitaṃ nāma sarvavedasaṃ yajñāmāhṛtya tasmin samāpte magadhendravi(ma)rdalabdhaṃ bhadravāhanaṃ nāma raterdattottamābhiḥ sakriyābhiḥ parigṛhma(?) sahaiva siṃhavarmaṇā svadeśagamanāya janakarājamanvajānāt | ayaṃ ca rājā nagaryā nirgatakrameṇāṅgānāgatya suhṛtpremṇā katipayānyahānyuṣitvā camppāyāmuccalito′dhvanyevāptamukhād dṛptairjyeṣṭhabhrātuḥ saṃhāravarmaṇaḥ putrairvikaṭavarmaprabhṛtibhiravaṣṭabdhān videhānupalabhya(māna?)māgadhamāḷavasamitiśāntasarvabalo′pi roṣādabhiṣeṇayannamātyairnyaṣidhyata |

svasrīyantu suṃhanāthaṃ pratyantadamanāyādaśā(?) vindhyapārśvasannikṛṣṭaṃ śrutvā tato balaikadeśenātmānamāvārya pratyamitraṃ jigamiṣuravakra ityadhvanānenāgaṇitakirātacakraḥ parikrāntavān | na ca jñāyate kasyāmavasthāyāṃ vartata iti | mama tu mandabhāgyāyā mātā (mo ? mā)teva (śarma ? samma)tā mahiṣyā rājasūnorvardhane niyuktā......ka(ma?)nīyāṃsamapyagrahīt | athāhamanatikṣobhasukhāyā śibirakayaiva na mūhyamānamullāyantrthagrapāviśaṃ yastvayamabacūlacāmara.....ḍhāraṇayuvā mamātrimākramimamanena ca maddarśanasphuritarāgeṇa vegopaśleṣitadvīpena kimapi kama(?)...... | 

......jvarāyānivoccaritaḥ kvacidacche nirjhaspayasi kānanasulabhaṃ kandamūlaṃ prāśya pariṇamati pataṅgamaṇḍale noṇaveṣviva niṣpatatsu niśīthinīnihāra.....ṣnuhidalāraripuṭaka(?)māryāgṛhā(yāṃ ni ? nni)rgatāyāṃ devalikāyāṃ taskaravada(na ? nu)padamalakṣyamāṇaḥ kenāpyanupraviśya bahu cintayannupāviśam | athainamaruṇamālyānulepanamuraṇapotakamiva pītapayasamāyasaparighaniṣṭhureṇa bāhunaikenopagṛhyāpareṇa tadanuddhautāndhāryāṃ racayanna(ya?)sidhenukāṃ vikośāmā(śā?)kāśadeśamucchrimāṣakāśiśyāmatame tamasi mahiṣaskandhakāṣaḥ(?) karatalasphurita(śā ? śa)strikāprakāśitaḥ khareṇa me sujñātaḥ sa eva jīrṇavyādhaḥ sarvagrāmābhyanujñāto nirbhayaviśaṅkamabhyāgataḥ pradakṣiṇaṃ bhramitvā praṇipatya bhagavatīṃ nipātya nirdayamamuṣya dīrghāyuṣo (dehaṃ?) deha(ra ? ma)vanyāmayamasau tava tindhyavāsini! vanacarakuladevate devi te navana(pani ? vanī)takomalo bālabaliriti vāsanāvaśād vicakarniṣuḥ kṣullakāmudayacchat | ahaṃ tu divyānu(rvā ? bhā)va(da?)darśanāya sāvaṣṭambhagambhīrīkṛtastrīsvarānuviddhāṃ ca kākuṃ bhāvayan gaccha gatamayaḥ hataṃ pāpamiti bruvannevainamakṣatāṅgamākṣipam | asāvapyavasitaprayojanaḥ pṛṣṭhamanavalokayamānaḥ prahṛṣṭarūpaḥ prādhāvat |

ahamapyātmanastadgrāmīṇairdarśanaṃ parijihīrpurasya hetoḥ (tva ? stu)tvā sambhamadi(ni ? nīṃ) niṣkrāntamtayaiva yāmavatyā manātimadhvānamatyalaṅghayam | arpavituṃ ca te prajāpālāya prajāmimāṃ kṛtamatirupamthitaḥ | yathāyaṃ vardhate vinayamabhyupaiti pitrośca pramadamante sampādayiṣyati sarvamidaṃ sarvabhṛtaikabāndhavo mavāneva jñāsyasīti virarāma |

tata(s)mṛ(ṣṭi ? ṣi)madhvaddhiṣṭaṃ lasrotasī(vi ? va) cakṣupevikāsini prabhāja jjayan jātanītiḥ pṛthivīpatiḥ jagāda | bhagavan! paśyāmyāduṣa sati śeṣe mṛvapikṣe.....ṭramājamapi paśya durghaṭavaṭanakrāḍāṭo kṛ nu vama yayotkṛṣṭaviyaḥ piyasakhamya na pranattavata(na ? ṭa)votaraṇabhāraṇyakairatyāsādanaṃ tatraitāmya rājadā.....ṇastrānādamunā vyādhavṛddhenoddharaṇam, upāyanīkaraṇaṃ, nindhyasenayā cāmmadarpa(ṇa)nitaramya hetikṛcchrādutthitamya vyāghra.....ṃṛtyu......karuṇākulagṛheṇa śemuṣībalādākarṣaṇam, ubhābhyāñca dārakābhyāṃ tathā dūraviśliṣṭābhyāṃ punarihaikatra pitrorevaṃ nau hastāgamanamiti svapne′pi ka (umāṃ sapattīṃsamabhāva ? imāṃ sampattiṃ saṃbhāva).....ṇubhūyamāneśvaryavṛttāntena sakhyurme ratnodbhavasya guruputrayorapi satyaśarmakālapālayoḥ pravṛttimāśaṃsa iti prasaṅgena pravṛttavācaṃ bhartāramantikasthā jananī rājavāhanasyāpṛcchat | āryaputra! ka ime′dyāpi nāmnā viditāstavaivamāśaṃsanīyadarśanāḥ | nūnamatyāsannabandhavo guṇavantaśca bhavitumarha(ntī)ti |

āha(sra ? sma) ca mahīpatiḥ | āma vāsu prasannaste tarkaḥ | priyāśca guṇinaśca te na cāsīt sambhavasta(la ? va) jñātumanūḍhāyāmeva khalvatrabhavatyāṃ vṛtto yaścitrarūpo vṛttāntaḥ | kau(tikīti ? tukinī) cedākarṇyatām | asya khalu me janayiturakhilabhūtabhāvanasya madanajito nayanabhūtā(syā ? stra)yo babhūvurmatiśarmā dharmapālaḥ padmodbhava ityamātyā(di?) dīptatejasaḥ | teṣāmādyaḥ śuciranūcānaḥ prathitakīrtirāhartā (tatra ? kratū)nāmasaṅgraharuciḥ prajānāṃ piteva suśāsitāṅgirasaśca gotreṇāsīt | itarastu vaiśvāmitro maitrinidhiranuddhato ghṛṇāvān dhīradhiṣaṇaḥ kriyāsu dakṣo lakṣmīṃ pratyanutsuko yaśasi gṛdhnuryathārthanāmā dharmapālo nāma | aparasya vistāriṇī kathā | yassa vi(smita ? va)svatassutaḥ sthāṇaveyo manuḥ tasya kṣavathoḥ kṣatramūlamikṣvākurāsīt | anujastasya nābhā(de ? nedi)ṣṭhaḥ sa diṣṭabalāt kāmacāraḥ kacaraṃśamaṃśave māṇibhadrasya bhadrabhāvamadrisamudradvīpāṭalī puṭabhedādiṣvabhinavā sarāgamatyudāravyavahāramagre prāvartaya tasya bahuṃ mahātmā mayārjuneṣu mandratandro bhalandano bhālandanāyaneṣu pravṛtteṣu pivītiṣu svaryāvārtopajīvināṃ kīrtisthitiḥ potapo nāmāsīt (?) | sa kadācidanugaṅgaracitapaṭṭanasthito matpitari tapobalaprā(pto ? ptā)′nekaśatajīvite asyāmaraṇyabhūmau....r̤ateṣu.....ṇandarājyamanubhava(n ? ntaṃ) candraguptamudbhāvayitāraṃ mauryavaṃśasyopasthitavān | upāyanāni copanīya kṛtopacāraḥ sthitaḥ paraṃ prītena hṛṣṭaḥ svabhāṇḍarāśau.....ḍekāvalīṃ ca kāñcicchatasahasramūlyetyadarśayat | mūlyanirdeśe paribhūtāyā bāṣpadhārābhiriva yasyā gabhastimālābhirāplāvyata bhavanāntaram | ratnātiśayavismito′pi dārā guroḥ kauṭalyasyānujña......kālyamāgamyatāmiti vaṇijaṃ vyasarjayat | sa tu rājaprasādalabdhaṃ surabhitāmbūlaṃ nirgatya nṛpālayādupayuñjāno vasubhirapyasukareṇa padenāgṛhyata(?) | apatacca pathi pataṅgavātairivāhataḥ | kṛtyaklībeṣu ca parijaneṣu kāpi rūpājīvā rājakulāya prasthitā kṛpālure(vamenaṃgatiṃ ? namevaṃgataṃ) svagṛhamāsannaṃ nināya | svakarapallavāvakīrṇaiśca sāndraiścandanaja(na?)labindubhirmandamandasparśinā ca maṇitālavṛndamārutena parihṛtaiśca bhavanadīrghikākamalakalhāradalapuṭaiḥ prāṇānasya pratyājahāra | mṛduni ca śayane samucchvasitaṃ śāyayāmbabhūva | potapastu prāṇopakāriṇyai tasyai pratyupakriyāmaparāmapaśyannapatrapiṣṇuḥ prakāśadāne śayanaparyanta eva tāmekāvalīṃ nidhāya viśrānto gṛhāṇyagād | vismṛteti tu mattakāśinyā tayā tāṃ preṣyāhaste preṣitāṃ tadanurūpairaparaipyalaṅkārairanugatāṃ śapathapūrvaṃ pratiprāhiṇot | āmuktavatī ca tāmaviśadaṃ(śa ? ga)nā rājabhavanam | utpannapratyabhijño rājā tadāgamaṃ tasyāḥ samupalabhya (mā ? ma)nyuspṛṣṭaḥ (tā ? ta)māhūya yavanayātrikaṃ darśayaikāvalīmityavādīt |

deva! kṛto′sau prītidāyaḥ | prasīda, (sa)nti me ratnāntarāṇi, (vi ? ya)tteṣu jighṛkṣitaṃ ta(tta?)d gṛhāṇeti bruvāṇaṃ vaṇijamavadhūta iva jāta(go ? ko)paścandragupto yad māma(na)numānya maryādānuvartinā tvayā (prī)tidāyo dhana(ma)dena dattastadasi (vi ? va)ndhya ityabhartsayat | asambhrānta eva potapo′tisattvatayā smayamāna iva pratyuvāca | rājannalpamidaṃ prāṇadāya(pra ? prī)tidāyamasya varo mamaivātidāho(?) yastatpunardattāsaṅkīrtanaṃ satāṃ dharmastato(nu ? na) kīrtayāmīti | vi(smṛ ? smi)tanṛpatinirbaddhastvabhyadhatta | deva! śrūyatām | ekadāhaṃ mahodadhau daye......patyandhakacchottīrṇaḥ kanakaśṛṅkhalāniyamitakakṣyāvargavastraṃ kaṭīghaṭitamahāratnakokṣeya(ko ? kaṃ) gāḍhotsa(ṅgī ? ṅgi)tahastasā(ro ? raṃ) mahendramahvare......ṣamādhikliṣṭamaṣṭadaṃṣṭramudbandhamukta......śvasitāvaśeṣamadrākṣam | drāgivainaṃ jātakṛpaḥ kṛpāṇena vipā(ṭya ? śya) (mi ? vi)śramayya codvegahetumaprākṣam | uktañca mahātmanā tena mannirbandhānmaraṇamutsavo dāridcajvaragrastānāmiti | jñā(to)dantena ca mayā nijotsaṅgānnikṛṣya vajramuktāpadmarāgamarakatānāmane(ka)śatasahasravasūnā(ma)rdhenāsau śapathapūrvaṃ samaṃ vibhakto (bhaladana ? bhālandana)kulasambhūtaṃ potapanā(ma ? mānaṃ) māṃ matta evopalabhya sa(jjū i ? jūriva) sampariṣvajya yathepsitaṃ deśamagamat | ahaṃ punardramilapattanaṃ gatvā tataḥprabhṛtyanekayātrāsiddhisambhṛtārtharāśi(kaṃ ha ? kaḥ) tvāmupātiṣṭham | idaṃ tu saṅkīrtanamahāpātakaṃ tvadbhayāt samācaritaṃ na tu ślāghayeti | śruvaivātihṛṣṭo jātalajjaścandraguptaḥ potapaṃ pariṣvajya sa(tpu ? pu)ruṣo′(ya ? ha)mityakathayat | ātmanirviśeṣayā ca pratipattyā tatsaṅgataṃ kṛtavadanuvartata | sarvasyāmeva (vo ? co)rvyāṃ sarva(pā va)ṇigbhyastadarthamaṣṭādaśavarānā(mi ? di)deśa | tadyathā gṛhītarvā sarvasārthasāmyamāhni rātrau cālpasyetarasya vā dattasya vā siddhirdeśāntagatārthāsvāmyaṃ sarvatra svayaṃ svārthadarśaneṣvadaṇḍyatā kālākālayoḥ karaṇasiddhiḥ svayamāgataṃ gatābhogeṣvanabhigrahaḥ paragṛhapravaśo′pi vā divā krayavikrayārthapāradārikacoramāmanuriktāyāmapi sarvasvaṃ svadeśābhyāmiva virahonatisurabhiravayavairvātīyāmapyārtau hastaśīrṣavikārasaṃjñāmātreṇāpyantataḥ preṣyāsu bāhyābalāsvapi cāvatīrṇasya saukṛtyaṃ tathā preṣṭhāparādhe vā sarvāparādheṣu ca rājapuruṣairdehadravyānantilaṅghanaputrasya gopyāputrasya vā putravadupamānamarudhyate ca putravadvisarjanamaśvayānaṃ pattaneṣu.....ṭyaṅgavadhavarjaṃ ca dhūrtakarmakānīgrahaprakārārājanivedanottarakāladuṣṭavāraṇākānuśiṣṭiḥ pravarābharaṇabhāñnādiparivarhajātaṃ pītaśvetamaṅgāraśaṅkhadundumi....r̤ājacihnāni maṅgalyāsu kriyāsu parokṣāparokṣayoḥ pathiṣu pattaneṣu vā preṣyabhṛtakānāmiṣṭito′nujīvya kriyāmṛtadhanasya śreṇīprāṇyenadāyādapratipa.....ṣarvasāṃyātrikopakriyāślāghyajanmā potapastapasi matiṃ sasantatirutkaṇṭhamānaścakāra(?) | sarvasvañca dātumārebhe |

tadavasthaṃ ca tamekadā ko′pi vipracchadmā guhyaka......cetasā devena draviṇeśvareṇa preṣito′smi | śrūyatāmidam | adya khalu kālaparyayādapāstarājyayaśā bṛhadrathā(ntarā?)tma(no ? jo) ripuñjayaḥ patirasya kusumapurasya vidhimapi tapasā jigīṣuḥ......kṛṣṇājinī jalapavitrī kalikandarpadarpama(ndī ? nthī) ca bhūtvā tapovane tapasyati | tasmiṃśca tadavasthe viśālāyāḥ patirvītihotraṃ hatvā (ma ? bha)rtāramarthalobhāt putramātmanaḥ prahyotamabhyaṣecayat(?) | yaḥ sa ṣoḍaśasahasrāntaḥpuraḥ puṣpārāmavibhramabhramaracaṇḍa iti daṇḍaraukṣyādarakṣyata prajābhiḥ | yasya ca sā duhitā sakalalokasundarīsargasambhā(ga ? ra)yogyasau(mya ? bhā)gyā vatsarājavakṣaḥsthalakamalavāsalakṣmīrvāsavadattā | tasmiṃśca trayoviṃśateḥ śaradāmante saṃtyaktavati martyalokamabdānaṣṭāviṃśatikaṃ tadātmajaṃ prajā pālakamalañcakāra | tataḥ pañcāśataṃ viśākhayūpaḥ | paścādekaviṃśatiṃ mālyakaḥ | punastriṃśatamantivardhanaḥ | taṃ ca punaḥ pūtikānvayaṃ nirasya sūnuṃ vāraṇasyāmadhyāsya svayaṃ girivraja(mā ? ma)rivrajā(sahya?)sahyamattvaścatvāriṃśatisamāḥ kṣamāmimāṃ samānasevī śiśunābhaḥ, ṣaṭtriṃśataṃ śaiśunābhiḥ kākavarṇaḥ, kṣemavarmā ṣaḍviṃśatiṃ, catvāriṃśataṃ kṣa(trojātaḥ ? taujāḥ), bimbasāro′ṣṭatriṃśataṃ, saptatriṃśatamajātaśatruḥ, pañcaviṃśatiṃ da(rśa)kaḥ, trayastriṃśatamudāyī, tricatvāriṃśataṃ nandivardhanaḥ, tāvadeva nāndivardhano mahānandistadanvayaśriyaṃ bubhuje |

bhuñjāne ca tasminniha nagare rasabhāvasamṛddhamṛddhiramyaṃ mahānāṭakanṛttaṃ prāvartata | praikṣetāṃ ca tad yadṛcchāgatau rasānmanu(ṣyakṛtyayo ? ṣyākṛtī) dattasannidhī nidhī śaṅkhapadmau | padmastayorabadhyata viditvā mahāprabhāveṇa kenāpi mantravādinā mantrapāśaiḥ | amucyata pratijñātayā pratidiśaṃ purādāyojanājjasubandhayābhyāṃ candrāvṛṣṭyā praṣṭā ca(?) | tathā ca tapyamānastanuśeṣaṃ pratisañjihīrṣuramuṣmādeva naradevānnando mahāpadma ityavaravarṇinyāṃ varavarṇinyāmajāyatāsau nidhiḥ | sa ca sarvakṣatriyāṇāmāyuṣaiva saha sañjahāra hemajātam |

tasminneva ca kāle kalāpinā(mā) dvijātirutkaleṣvanapatyaḥ kātyāyanīprasādāt kātyāyanīṃ nāma kāmyākārāṃ kanyakāmavāpyāgnihotraparicaryāyāṃ nyayuṅkta | kṛ(tvā ? tā) cāsau de(vāna ? venā)sitavartmanaivāntarva(rti ? tnī) | (vici ? pi)trā tu muhyatā tya(ktvā ? ktā) vindhyāṭavyāṃ daivāmaṣeṇa dāvaṃ (vi)vikṣuḥ sākṣādbhūyāgnidevena godāvarīnivāsāyādiśyata | jagāma cāsau tamagrahāraṃ mahāgrakārikāśvapurassara iva praviśya vaiśvānarāntavartītvamātmavratyādvijanmasamānabhāginīha(?) bhuvanabhūṣaṇaṃ vararuciṃ nāma sutamasūta |

pamcavarṣadeśīye ca vararucau tadgṛhamupajagmaturubhau parivrājakau | ekastayormyālirita(ro rudrattaḥ ? ra indradattaḥ) | tayostu kātyāyanām | bhagavati! sāvadhānamākarṇyatām | ahaṃ parāntakasya bhārgavasya bhānubhartasya nā(mna ? ma) putraḥ | māmekaputra iti mātrā lā(bhya ? lya)mānaṃ nigṛ(hyā ? hya nā)dhyāpitavān pitā | pariṇīya ca brāhmaṇīṃ brahmadāṃ nāma kāmonmādinīṃ pādarañjanena (bā ? lā)layati maskarī ko′pi bhikṣārthaṃ praviṣṭo manāgasma(pa ? ya)ta | smayamānayaiva tayotthāya praṇamya tasmai bhikṣā dattā | sā tu kautukānmayā smitahetuṃ pṛṣṭā praṣṭavyapakṣe tameva munima(dhi ?)tiṣṭhipat | tattu hrīvaśādaśakyamiti saiva nirva(ndhā ? ddhā) kṛcchrādabhyadhatta | mū(ṣṭitā ? ṣikā)haṃ munināmunā (bandhi ? vardhi)tā tīrthayātronmukhasyāsya mātrā bhāṇḍaṃ vāritāpi virahavihalatvādajñātaṃ praviṣṭā dṛṣṭvā ca tī......śiṣya srānāyārabdhe tiryaktvāpalodiriti śiraśśyenamukhe nipatya punarasampalvane payasi bhāgīrathyāḥ (?) | tena ca tīrthamaraṇena tayā ca bhagavadbhaktyā jātamuttamaṃ....r̤thyañca bhartṛvāllabhyamasyāmevamanupaśyato muneḥ smitamajaniṣṭa | mamāpi janmāntaraṃ smarantyāḥ ityevaṃ dhruvaṃ satyaṃ tasyā niryāṇakramo yadasau jātamūrchayā madaya.....ṣtu me saṃmohaṃ bhagavānatha ninīṣuḥ ta(tkā ? tka)levaramanupraviśya dharmopadeśai(rva ? rvi)rañjayanmāṃ pravrajyāṃ cāgrāhayat | anirgamāt punarakṣarāṇāmāsyādapāsya śāstravistara.....ṭe ca tasminnunmanāḥ kvacit parivrājakasamāje naikaśāstrāṇāṃ savyasaninī(?) mūḍhayogītyupahāsyamānaḥ svāmigṛhamudvegādupetya dhārāmadhārayam | ādiṣṭañca svāminā śrutadharamādāyopava(rve) bhaja(sve)ti | so′yamasundaikasandhya(?)ścireṇādya dṛṣṭaḥ | yathā cāsyā(di ? bhi)gamastadita eva śrūyatāmiti dvitīyanniradikṣata |

so′pyācacakṣe | kāmpilyanāmni nagare gurorgopālakasyendradatto nāmāhamāsaṃ śiṣyaḥ | tasya virūpeti viparītanāmadheyā kanyā | tāṃ ca guruścaturbhirvedairaṅgaiśca ṣaḍbhirvinānupalabhyāmakalpayat | sā tu (ta ? ma)drūpotpannamadanarāgā madanyena kila pariṇaye maraṇāya sthitā | a(syo ? syā)ścāsitākṣyā yauvanamayātayā(mi ? maṃ) nirvi(va ? vi)kṣuḥ svāmigṛhe subrahmaṇyaṃ brahmavidyāhetorabhyadhārayam | ājñaptaṃ ca devenainametatsakhaṃ puraskṛtya bodhāyanapārśvamagamat anambhāvī cāyamarthaḥ(?) | bhājanaṃ ca divyādhyayanasyaiṣa dīrghāyuḥ | ato visṛjyetarapramadāsulabhaṃ snehakātaratvamidamasmāsu puruṣaratnaṃ nikṣipyatām | kṛte cārthe hasta eva te pratyarpayiṣyāma iti | sā tu prāgevai(va ? na)marthaṃ bhagavatāgninā pratibodhya sthāpitā priyatanayavirahavihvalatvāt paraṃ viṣaṇṇā muniprayatnenātmanā cotpāditasamādhiḥ kathaṃkathama(pya)bhyupāgamat | kṛtopanayanaṃ ca taṃ skandhenādāya tāvubhau vidarbheṣu kuṭumbinaṃ pra(ti sthāne ? tasthāte) | pṛ(ṣṭhe ? ṣṭe) copavarṣagṛhe prahasatā mahājanena tvasau bhadavarṣabhagnabhavanabahirbhittibhāvadattapaṭalakaḥ pratiśrayo yathodgatagurorupavarṣasya(?) | citramidaṃ tenāpi kaścidarthīti nirdiṣṭena vartmanopetya tat tṛṇaśaraṇamupādhyāyaḥ kveti pṛṣṭayācāryā(ṇyā ? nyā) ca saruditamupahāsa ityupakruśyamāne soṃ′sāsaktahalayugayoktraḥ kṣetrādupāvartatopavarṣaḥ | pratyabhivādenānugṛhyābhivāditavatastān sa vidvān vatsāḥ katamo vaḥ śrutadhara iti papraccha | nirdiṣṭe ca vararucau paraṃ tutoṣa | viśrāntaśca sa tairvivikta enānabhāṣata | nagare′smin varṣopava(rṣimmāmi ? rṣāvi)ti dvau bhaṭṭaputrau | varṣastayoḥ kṛtamatiḥ | itaro nātṛṇyākarṇaḥ | kadācidasau jyeṣṭhabhāryayānyajanmanyapi mā bhūvaṃ mūrkhajāyeti mūrkhasya kasyacit kaśipudānapāraṇīye mūrkhavrate nimantrito bhuktvādhvāvanamahatavastramatuṣṭimān (?) svabhāryayā rudatyā bahukadarthito lajjāpahṛtaḥ svāmigṛhe priya(sya ? ṅgnu)ptvā yā(vān ? vat)pākamupāvasan pakveṣu havyaṃ devāya da(mo ? ttvo)payuyukṣamāṇaḥ kenāpi govṛṣabheṇa bhakṣitaṃ ta(t) sasyamadrākṣīt | bhūyaścāyameva kramo dvirāvartata | tāvadasya lupta(sya ? dhṛ)te(stuṣṭā ? staṣṭvā) ṭaṅkena rasanāmudasrasrutāvāsye svāstena kimapi devaḥ prakṣiptavān | ājñaptavāṃśca na tāvadalabdha ekasandhe brahmodgāraḥ kārya iti | so′hamupavarṣaḥ | labdhaścāyaṃ brahmadārabharagaḥ(?) kimanyadārabhyatāmiti | kramāt praṇutya divyamavyayamuñjagnālakṛpaṇaivekena(?) kātyāyano dvābhyāṃ vyālistribhirindada(ttaḥ) kṛtsraṃ vāṅmayamadhyagīṣata | sa taiḥ samājñāpito gurudakṣiṇārthaṃ vijñāpito duhitṛdānahetoraṇīyasīṃ suvarṇamātrāmāhṛtāmiyeṣa | (ti ? niḥ)suvarṇatayā tu sarvasyāḥ pṛthivyāḥ pṛthivīśvaraṃ mahāpadmaṃ sarva eva samupatasthuḥ | apūjayaccainānanyāṃśca śrutamahimno (mahā?)mahāpadmaḥ | teṣvevāha——svaduhitaraṃ sadasyavasthāpya lavamātramapi hemaṃ dadata eṣā datteti | rājñā vyāhṛte ko′pi vaṭurjavena gatvā kayācit kanakamātrayā pratyāgatya kanyāmayācata |

(dṛ ? pṛ)ṣṭaśca tadāga(taṃ ? tiṃ) nṛpāyācaṣṭa kanyālobhānmayā nirba(ndha ? ddha)yā mātrā ciraṃ ruditvābhihitam | unmatta kiṃ na jānāsi nidhidarśī niruddho nṛpeṇa tatraiva te pitā priyān prāṇānatyajat | tannaḥ karaṇamātrasyāpi kāñcanasya kaḥ sambhava iti | prāṇatyāgabhīṣitayā pituścitābhasmāni pragālya labdho′yaṃ hiraṇyaśakala iti śrutvaiva ni(ssapatnīkṛtvā ? ssuvaṇīkṛtā) kṣitirmayeti harṣamūrcchayopakrāntāsurāsī(t) | vyāḷiśikṣitayogastvindradattastaccharīraṃ praviśya sa eva rājā prakṛtise.....ġurvarthaṃ suvarṇakoṭiṃ kātyāyanaṃ pratyagrāhayat | anumitaparamārthakenāryakākhyena prajopakārahetoḥ kalpitasvakāyastenaiva vararucimukhena mantrivargeṇādhiṣṭhita.....ṣthāya teṣveva rājāntaḥpureṣvaramata | virūpayā ca smaratāpakṣapitarūpayā yakṣībhūyopatasthe | tāṃ tu suvarṇakoṭiṃ śarapuṅkhaprarohāśaṅkitasvaśiṣyo.....ṭana śirakapālakana......prayojanaṃ koṭyeti pratyākhyāya kṛtakoṭiśabdamalabhatopavarṣaḥ | sa tathaiva draviṇarāśirjagāma (govara ? kube)ram | upasthitaṃ tu padmaṃ nidhipatiranuvyāhṛta(vān) | ya(t) tvayā brahmarṣeḥ kātyāyanasya kāmo na sampāditā.....ṇyāyenārjitaṃ dhanam | atastvaṃ bhūyo′pyamuṣminneva nagare samāpteṣu sarvopapā(da ? ta)keṣu potapasya vaṇikpateḥ putraḥ padmodbhavo nāma bhūtvā vanānnivṛttasya rājarājarṣe ripuñjayasya kṛtvā dharmasācivyaṃ prativisṛṣṭavasudhāraḥ prākpureṣu bhartraiva saha martyalokaṃ tyaktvāsitatvayā ciramiti ha suralokanispṛheṇa vastavyam (?) | eṣa khalvidānīmaṣṭāśītimabdānatītya niṣṭhite mahāpadme tatputrā(va ? na)ṣṭāvapyalābhirdaśabhirvatsarairekaikamuddhṛtyāryākāpyovāpakopitena manasvinā cāṇakyena mauryacandraguptaḥ pratiṣṭāpitaḥ tasyāsya matse(?) vartsyati caturviṃśativarṣāṇi maurye lakṣmīḥ | paraṃ pañcaviṃśatimacintyabuddhisāro vindusāraḥ kārayitā rājyam | punaraśokaḥ śokamuddhartā ṣaṭtriṃśataṃ śaradaḥ śarīriṇām | (ādeśonaḥ(?)(suyaśāḥ) samāssapta goptā pṛthvī(m) | nava daśarathaḥ | aṣṭau samāḥ (saṃyutaḥ) | śāliśūkastrayodaśa | dve devaśarmā | daśadhanvā ṣaṭ | vṛhadrathastu sapta | punaḥ samuddhṛtya puṣyamitro nāma śuṅgastasyaiva senāpatirbrāhmaṇāyano bhartṛlakṣmīrāgadurmadadurmantrī vītabhayabhañjano jvalitamauryavaṃśañca(?) mūladevaṃ yudhi nihatya ṣaṭtriṃśatiṃ samāḥ sthāsyati kṣitim | athāṣṭāva(ni ? gni)mitraḥ | viśākhaḥ sapta | vasumitro daśa | dve pṛthukaḥ | pulindastisraḥ | tisra eva yoṣavasuḥ | ekāḥ vajramitraḥ | dvātriṃśataṃ mahābhogaḥ | daśa devabhūtiḥ | taṃ tvamātyaḥ kāṇvāyano vasudevaḥ samutsādya vya(sa)ninamavavimabdā(nnā ? nnavā)dhiṣṭhitā | bhūmimitraścaturdaśa | nārāyaṇaḥ sumitro (dvādaśa) | daśa suvarmā | taṃ ca vaṃśaṃ śuṅgaśe(ṣiśco ? vaṃ co)cchidya sumukho nāma prabhaviṣyati varṣāṇi trayodaśa | aṣṭādaśa tadavarajaḥ kṛṣṇaḥ | sātakaṇṭakiḥ | aṣṭāda(śa) lambodaraḥ dvādaśāpi(la)kaḥ | aṣṭādaśaiva meghasvātiḥ | (śāta) svātiśca tāvadeva | skandasvātiḥ sapta | mṛgendrasā(ta)kaṇṭhistrīṇi | kuntalasātakaṇṭhiraṣṭau | (ve ? e)kaṃ svātiptenaḥ | ṣaṭtriṃśataṃ pulomāpiḥ | pañcaviṃśatiṃ garikṛṣṇaḥ, pañca hālaḥ, pañca mā(ntella ? ntala)kaḥ, ekaviṃśatiṃ puḷindasenaḥ | (ekaṃ) sundarasātakaṇṭhiḥ, aṣṭāviṃśatiṃ śivasvātiḥ, ekatriṃśataṃ gautameyaḥ, rujā (?) pulomāpiḥ, aṣṭatriṃśataṃ śivaśrīḥ | cāri(?)śivaskandasātakaṇṭhiḥ, ekānnatriṃśataṃ yajñaśrīḥ sātakaṇṭhiḥ, ṣaṭ vijayaḥ, trīṇi caṇḍaśrīsātakaṇṭhiḥ, pu(ru ? lo)māpiḥ sapta | tadevaṃ ṣaṭsu ṣuṭikeṣu daśasu (śi ? śai)śunā(ge ? bhe)ṣu navasu nandeṣu daśasu mauryeṣu daśasveva śuṅgeṣu caturṣu kāṇvāyaneṣvekānnatriṃśati cāndhreṣu sātavāhanākhyeṣvatikrānteṣu punarutpanneṣvevāpareṣu tadbhṛtyeṣu saptaravāndhreṣvābhīreṣu daśasu garbhiṣu saptasu śakeṣvaṣṭādaśasu ya(va)neṣvaṣṭasu (tahāre ? turuṣke)ṣu caturdaśasu mu(ku?)ṇḍeṣu trayodaśasu (paute ? maune)ṣu caikādaśasu baha(la)kalikalaṅkakṣāḷanāya nārāyaṇaprasādaprāpta(stāno ? santāne) nivṛtyāśramānmagadhānadhitiṣṭhati nṛpe ripuñjaye taṃ tava tanayaṃ mahānidhiṃ nidhāya padmodbhavaṃ bhaviṣyasi bhagavato (varta ? vitta)bhartuḥ ṣāśvavartī | so′yamāyuṣkaro marakatamaṇiraṅgulīyakanibaddho (dhā)ryaḥ | kāryaścāsya vāriṇi visargo visṛsṛkṣuṇā kṣetramiti |

(mati)śarmadharmapālapadmodbhavāstrayaste śvaśurasya mantriṇaḥ | teṣu mā paridāya jātamātraṃ tātaḥ prāvrā(ji ? jīt) | tataśca padmodbhavaḥ kuladharmānupālanāya ratnodbhavaṃ nāma jyeṣṭhamātmajaṃ vāṇijye niyujyāparau sutāvimau suśrutasumantrau sakhitve me samarpya samāpya karmāṇi pāralaukikāni prāyāsaṃnyastabhṛtyagrāmaḥ svadaivataṃ dhyātvā samagrībabhūva(?) | matiśarmā ca sumatimenamanyaṃ ca putraṃ satyaśarmāṇaṃ mama sahāyau sampādya ciropāsanāsamprītena jātavedaseva mahatā dāhajvareṇopaguhya svargamāropsata | aparastu(to?) dharmapālaḥ sutenāmunā sumitreṇānyaiśca ma....r̤akairamaiva mā sambaddhayanna mama mantraśaktyaiva ca kṣubhitaṃ rājamaṇḍalamaśapyutpanneṣu(?) cāsmāsu nyasya bhāramupasannayā jyeṣṭhapatnyā sahojjhitāni ratyartha.....ṭāyāṃ kanīyasyāmantarvatnyāṃ.....ṣā dharmapālapatnī sāpi sutamasūta kāpapālam |

so′sau sundarasubhaṭasthūlalakṣo dakṣiṇaḥ prakṛtyā kṛtavidyo′pi daivāt kāmavidyājaiṣu(?) vyasa.....ṣaṅgavānabhūt | nirbhartsitaścāmunā pitṛvad vartamānena bhrātrā sumitreṇa trapayā tyājitasvadeśo dīrghaduḥkha(bhāvitayā?) bhāgitayā mamādyāpi vārtāto′pi nopalabhyata ityāsrāyamāṇacakṣuṣi bruvatyeva tasmin ko′pi vaikhānasakumārakaḥ kumārame(naṃ ? kaṃ) tāmarasavarṇa bibhrāṇastameva deśamājagāma | pratyutthānapraṇāmādinā sambhāvitaśca dampatibhyāṃ sukhaniṣaṇṇaḥ praṇijagāda——jānātyeva māṃ mahārājo vāmadevasya bhagavato′ntevāsināmanyatamaṃ somaśarmāṇam | ayamahamāsevya dakṣiṇāpathe rāmatīrthaṃ nivartamāno va(rti ? rta)nyāmanukaliṅgaṃ tuṅgadāruṇi mahatyaraṇye ramaṇīyaṃ kimapi śaṅkarāyatanaṃ nivārya taduparyāyāgha(?) puṣpairme puṣpabhājanaṃ pūrayitvā tarutale nidhāya snānāya navaghanatoyadhārāpyāyitaṃ kamapyadrinirjharamuṣasyupaśliṣṭavān | aśrauṣaṃ ca kaccidihā(nimātarde ? gnimān de)śo bhagavatopalabdha ityārasitam | adrākṣaṃ tadanusā(da?)radattadṛṣṭiramunā dārakeṇa hastavartinā kāmapyārtarūpāṃ striyam | tasyāṃ ca dayamāno′hamabravam | samāśvasihi mātaḥ | astyaraṇidravyamutpādyāgniṃ dāsyābhiḥ | eṣāpi tvadanurodhāt saṃhṛtyārthamātramāvedayāmi | kālayavanadvīpavāsinaḥ kālaguptaśreṇīmukhyasyāsmyahaṃ duhitṛvardhanī | tasyāstu kanyakāyāḥ prathamayauvane puruṣadveṣamutpannaṃ praticikīrṣubhirasmābhirudyāne kvacidupāsitāsīdāryā | tatra sā kimapi dinadṛṣṭaṃ dṛṣṭvā muhuramuhyat, utthitā ca (kri ? pri)ya samudradatta kvāsīti | sarvaṃ ca janamapāsya pṛṣṭā mayā kathaṃkathamapyabhāṣata | sāhamatraiva dvīpe kṛṣṇaguptanāmno daridravaṇijaḥ sutā suvratā nāmāsam | atha tāto (bhi)ttya(sta?)ntaritāyāṃ śṛṇvatyāmeva mayi kenā(bhyu ? pyu)pagahvare samābhāṣyata | so′hamujjayinyāṃ (sa?)samudradatto nāma sārthavāhaputraḥ | tasya me dasatkāntakardakāṣṭhāmatena(?) karṇīputreṇa mūladevena sakhyamāsīt | āsīcca vi(vidha ? dhi)vaśādamuṣya saṅgrahe madanasenāyāṃ nāma gaṇikādārikāyāmapratisaṃhāryo manaḥprasaṅgaḥ | siddhaścāyama(rthaiḥ ? rthaḥ) | kruddhenāsmi tenaivamabhihitaḥ pāpasyā(mi ? pi) te mitraśabdaprasādāt kṣemaṃ (me?) jīvitasya | yadi tvāhariṣyasi kulala.....ṇta na syā(dīni ? diti) | tadbhayādakṛtadāraḥ santatimi(cchodbhī ? cchurbhī)ruśca sa gūḍhaṃ nirveṣṭumicchāmi tvaddattāṃ duhitaram | (me ? e)ṣa vo hiraṇyaskandha iti(?) | dattāṃ ca pitrā channameva mañjūṣāyāṃ nikṣipya sārabhāṇḍamityunnīya svagṛhamantaḥ sa(ñjane ? jjite) sarvopakaraṇavatyaprakāśameva nyasya vyavahṛtavān | athaikadāhamanyatrā(nyedaiva ? nya)puruṣeṇa kṛtāñjali(mu ? no)pasthīyamānamātmānamabhyajānām | kimidamityasau (dṛ ? pṛ)ṣṭaḥ prābravīt——bhadre! so′smi karṇīputraḥ | samudra(pa?)datte mamāpa(ka)rtari pratijñātaṃ taddārābhimarśanaṃ mayā | tvāṃ cāpasarpaira(tra)channavartinīṃ parichidya kṛtasuruṅgastvadgṛhamagām | dṛṣṭvā ca tvāmasādhyāṃ sādhvīlakṣaṇaiḥ kayācid vyāmohya mantradevatayā vaśavartinīmakaravam | apahṛtya cātra vaideśikavaṇikcchadmanaḥ sadārasyākṣadhūrtasya kanyāṃ nāma kṛtvā sarvapaurapratyakṣamagrahīṣam | sārthavāhāvasthānaka.....ẏathāsthānamevāsthāpayam | adarśayaṃ ca tasmai suhṛtsamakṣaṃ pratisaṃhṛto nāma bhūtvā paśya te sakhīmiti | śaṅkitaśca sa gatvā svagṛha eva yathāpurasthānamapaśyantamevaṃ vyāmohyātmanaiva punaravaruddhavyavahārāya tenānvayujye jitaścāsau vibhāvyamavivāhamasākṣikodvāho vihitapratidaṇḍaśca bhūyaḥ svagṛhameva gamitā......jātanutmāya....r̤thaṃ pratyā.....ẏastvayi suruṅgāṃ praviśya rājapuruṣebhyo darśitāyāṃ paradāracora iti svatmaharaṇapūrvaṃ deśamatyājya(tā?)ta(?) | tvaṃ tu mayā parāmṛṣṭaṃ jñātvātmānaṃ (na) jīviṣyasītyadharma.....ṭvā martukāmā nipatya gaṅgāmbhasi srotaso(tasyo?)hyamānā kenāpi tīramudatārye | sa me bhartā samudradatto jātaḥ | tasya ca darśanād bhūya eva maraṇamamilaṣantī vrīḷayā nigṛhya tenābhihitā | samāśvasihi bhadre! jānāmi jāli(ko ? ke) na tvā kimapyāveśitām | anyathā kathamātmaśīlamutkramya tathātinṛśaṃsamācareḥ | prāptāsi prāṇamidānīm | purā tu tvadanavāptipīḍayā grīvābaddhavālukā(pa ? gha)ṭo (la?) nipatyāpagāyāṃ ghaṭe kāṣṭhabhagne kathañcit kacchamicchayāpi daivaughenottārito′pi martumeva sthitaḥ(?) | tadehi gacchā(ma ? va) iti | ahaṃ tu satr