ṭāśabdadattadantavīṇācāryāḥ sarvāmeva śarvarīmārdrayantaḥ phūtkāriṇaḥ samīriṇaḥ, atikaruṇahunastambhasusaptavānvṛttiśca(?) | tāmahaṃ tāpayitukāmā tadabhyāśe śvāpada.....ṃananyapratyakṣatvādāśaṅkya (mahatye ? vahantye)vainamarbhakaṃ vahnimanvicchāmīti vacasi pūrṇa e(va) tiryag dīyamānadṛptatāmradṛṣṭiḥ pṛṣṭhato′bhipatya jara(ti ? tī)matighanapītaskandhapīṭhatvādanativṛ......śirodharāṃ vidhāya balinanabalakuliśavartinā paṃmartakabalo′pyavadhānavipinagulmacchedacchiduravegamadādubhayato′sau nāgabadvidhāmaśeṣaroṣa......kaṭako′pi vanyakuñjaraḥ ko′pi kuṇḍalitahastakāṇḍo′bhipatya prahṛtya pārśve bṛhatpuritatpuritadantakoṭistatkaḷebaramavādhṛtānanaku....r̤utkṣiptavān(?) | uddhūtayaiva tu tadā tu tajjara(ntī ? tī)karatalaparibhraṣṭaṃ bālamenaṃ rudantamurvyāṃ pallavakabalamiva sa(li ? lī)lamīṣadvalite......vanagajāya dattvainaṃ mocayāmi mocayitasyāsya ko′pyubhyuvā(?) ha(nti ? sti)nastasya mastakataṭe mastiṣkagrāsagṛdhnurasa(bhya?)hmapātamapata(dugra?) dugrabṛhmitaḥ siṃhaḥ | tadāvegā......kṣiptamūrtirapatanmarutpathāt pa(la?) nasaphalalampaṭena viṭapakoṭivartinā kenāpi mahāpramāṇena vānareṇa prasārya pāṇiṃ sarvaprāṇipuṇyasandohena pratyagṛhyata | tenāpi nipuṇamaṅgapratyaṅgāni calita....l̤adaśrubhramitacapalacakṣuṣā mukhena muhurmuhurabhini(kṣi ? rū)pya niṣphalaprayāsena śithilamuktasaṃsaktaki(sa)layaśayyākomalāsu koṭarāgraparamparāsu lambalubiniśitaśaṅku(ta?)śatāntarāḷavartini puṣpasañcayamṛduni (pu)ṣpabhājana eva me nātipīḍaṃ nigaruḍavo nyapatat(?) | niyativilāsavismitena ca mayopasṛtyāyamādarād gṛhītvā dhātryāḥ sannidhimanāyi | nirūṣmāṇamiva ca tāṃ niṃśāmya punarasya jananīsandarśane suciratāniṣpannayatnenāyamapi nāvatvaramidānīmasubhiraproṣitaḥ kartumitidya(?) matvā pathi paśupālakuleṣu bhikṣitayā kṣīramātrayā nirvartyamānaprāṇayātraḥ krameṇemaṃ vāmadevāśramaṃ samānīyata | bhagavanniyogena ca mahārājopāntikamiti | (śva ? śru)tvā ca januṣāndha iva labdhacakṣurnaṣṭasuhṛttanayadarśanādabhyanandannarendraḥ | saharṣavismayapari(ji?)hitena ca tasminnarbhake dattapuṣpodbhavanā(ma)nyanyo(nya ci ? ′pi) brāhmaṇakumārame(naṃ ? kaṃ) puṇḍarīkavarṇamādāya tamevāmuṃ vāmadevāśrama(pada?)mupasasāda | (ca? sa) cāpi viśramayya pṛcchyamānaḥ pracakrame(ṇa?) krameṇābhidhātum | ahamapyarakārṣṇamṛtīkaḥ(?) kīrtidevo nāma brāhmaṇastīrthayātrāgataḥ kumārīmabhigacchannantarā kāverīkacchavartī kaścidāryaḥ pāṭaliputrakaḥ satyaśarmā nāma sarvātithiranūcānaḥ prativasatītyākarṇya taṃ didṛkṣurgatastamudvignavarṇaṃ malinaveṣayā proṣitasvastyeva brāhmaṇyopāsyamānaṃ jvara ivāgāre vartamānamadrākṣam | tena cāhamatithipadādātitheyennāpaścitopacitākālpakhedaḥ(?) sukhopaviṣṭaḥ sarasaṃ kathāntare tamabravam | bho mahābrāhmaṇa! cirasaṃsṛṣṭādanyadeśyāt kṣaṇadṛṣṭo′pi svadeśajo bhavati bhājanaṃ visrambhasya | yata idamaparicitavibandhayāthākāmyamapyucitamiva(?) hṛdayamiti bhavantamanuyuyukṣate, kṣamaścedvivarītuṃ vyāhariṣyasi | śruto hi pāṭaliputraḥ | śuddhimaddeśamadhyapātino ramyā rājanvantaśca magadhāḥ | tataḥ proṣya vidhivadapi vaidhaveya iva kathamimaṃ diśaṃ koṇamabhivatsyasīdat sitaṃ kamityusayya vayaḥ padaṃ gārhasthye tatrāpi jaṭilīpālaṣṭavāsā(?) naiṣṭhika iva lakṣyase | lakṣyate ceya(mo ? mu)ṣasīva lakha malīmasā kṛpaṇadarśanā cātrabhavato brāhmaṇī | udvejanīyayauvanārambhadoṣa ivāyamasyā rūpalakṣyaḥ praśrayaḥ | prasravena cāsyāḥ pīḍyete stanā | stanandha(ya)śca (sne ? ne)ha dṛṣṭaḥ | tatsarvaṃ hetumadbhavitumarhatīti | 

sa tvavocat | saumya! samarthamidaṃ | samastamapīdamavivekasya vā viṣayopastīrṇacetaso vā na me sambhramāpatitam | eṣa cāsmi gurukuloṣitaḥ | mamāpi caitat pratītameva | yathā sarasvatīdṛṣadvatyorantaraṃ brahmāvartaḥ | pratmanantaraḥ kurukṣetramatsyapāñcālaśūrase(nayo ? nāḥ) brahmarṣideśaḥ | tato himarvādvandhya(vada ? vi)naśanapra(yo ? yā)gamadhyartī madhyadeśaḥ | punaḥ pūrvāparasamudrasenāpatīnāmantarāḷamāryāvartaḥ | kṛṣṇaśāravihā(ya ? ra)bhūmayastu (vijñāya ? yakṣiya) śiṣṭaṃ śi(ṣṭanna ? ṣṭai)rgarhitaṃ mlecchabhogyamayogyamagrajanmanāmiti | ppapuravāstavyasyāṅgirasagotrasya matiśarmanāmno brahmakṣatrapratīkṣasya stu(tyā ? tya)vṛttasya satyaśarmā nāma sūnuḥ | sumatināmajyeṣṭhabhrātayārnau vṛttopanayanayostīrthāvāptavidyayo......prakṛtyāsmi tīrthayātrāsatvaraḥ gasa gandho′pi sannūrdhvaretasāṃ gatau(?) kumārīmuddiśya snātumāgato′smi | malayakandaropāntacā(ru ? ri)ṇā tu maitrāvaruṇinā pra.....ṭsa nāsi pātraṃ naiṣṭhikavratasya | na cānyadasti gārhasthyād gariṣṭham | gṛhāśramo hi śeṣāśramāṇāṃ viśramādvāraiśca kāśyapatīrthaśrīnadīhṛdayasvaba......śvarakoṭitīrthamukhyaiśca maṅgaḷīkatā diśamudīcīṃ tapasyāmātaramatiśete iti śakyate vaktum(?) | mandākinyāṃ dharmanirmitāyā bhagavatyāḥ kaveraduhi......prakṛṣṭaśuddhayaśca taṭa iva tadutsaṅgavāsiṣvagrahāreṣvagrajanmānaḥ ṣaṭtriṃśataṃ varṣāṇyardhapādamāgrahāṇād dhā trayyā dvayorekasya vā vedasyāpi parata.....ġurukulasamāvṛttāḥ snātvā sataḥ savarṇān sabhrātṛkānasagotrān sukarmā nāmā śrotriyapuruṣabhūyiṣṭheṣvṛddhimatsu tulyeṣu kuleṣūtpannānanyūnā(na)dhikamṛdumanohrarāṅgān akapikānapiṅgalākṣān mṛdusvarāṃ.....ṇudarśanake(śa)daśanalomnomnācandravṛkṣapakṣipreṣyajanaviṣadharāpyaviṣayeṇa sumaṅgalena sukhodyena nātidīrgheṇa dīrghāntena lakṣitāḥ trivarṣāprahatyūnavayaso vinayalakṣaṇodārān dārān brāhmadaivārṣaprājāpatyānāmanyatamena vi(ha?)vāhenāhṛtya varmavarjabhṛtyabhṛhyatu savinokliṣṭadharmyasvamārgasañcitārthān(?) pañcayajñān pañcasū(ne ? nā)nodi(to ? no) japahomabhū(ta)balibrāhmaṇārcanapitṛsantarpaṇātmakānāhuta(huta)prahuta(bra ? brā)hmahuta(prakāśikā ? prāśitā)khyān pravartayanto bālāturagarbhiṇībhṛtyabhuktyanantaraṃ svayaṃ bhoktāro vaiśvadevanivṛttyuttarakālaprāptānāṃ cātithīnāṃ balihṛti yathāśaktyāśayitāraḥ svapatitaścapacakarauśikāribhyaśca bhuvi nivaptāraḥ sāyañca mantravarjaṃ patnīpalīnāṃ(?) cāhārayitāro rājñāmṛtvijāṃ snātakānāṃ gurūṇāṃ mātulānāṃ śvaśurāṇāṃ ca saṃvatsarāgatānāṃ madhuparkeṇa tarpayitāraḥ sopādhyāyikā darśapūrṇamāsayoranyāsāñca nityanaimittikīnāṃ kriyāṇāmahāpayitāro nātikāmāḥ kāmyeṣu bahulapakṣe ca varjayitvā caturdaśīṃ da(śyā ? rśā)diṣu tithiṣu kurvantaḥ samaye gurvyā śraddhayā śrāddhaṃ karmaṇi piṇḍānvāhārya paḍktipāvanaiḥ śrotriyānvayabhuvo brahmadeyānusantānāstriṇāciketāstrisauparṇāḥ pañcāgnayaḥ ṣaḍaṅgavido vedārthavedinaḥ pravaktāro jyeṣṭhasāmikā brahmacāriṇaḥ sahasradāḥ śatāyuṣaḥ | itaḥ suparicitairamībhirmātulamātāmahīsrasrīyaśvaśuragurudauhitrādibhirvā jñānavadbhistribhirekena vā daivapūrvaṃ pūjitena yavatilamāṣavrīhimūlaphalairhariṇorabhraśakunacchāgapṛ(kṣa ? ṣa)taiṇaruruvarāhamahiṣaśaśapañcanakhakhaṅgalohavā(nghrā ? dhrī)ṇasāmiṣairmahāśalkairmadhunā kālaśākena mu(dya ? nya)nnaiśca sarvairgavyena payasā pāyasaiśca santarpitena tarpayantaḥ pitṝn prātaḥsnāyinaḥ prayataveṣāḥ priyasatyahitābhidhāyino niṣkutūhalā nṛttagītavāditrādinispṛhā brahmakṣatrasammāninaḥ pāṣaṇḍapathaparāṅmukhāḥ prasaravāritendriyāśca jīva(ntī ? nti) nityanirvṛtā gṛhamedhinaḥ | na ca tatra santi nāstikā, na kitavā, na mitragurubrahmapitrādidviṣo, na sodarasantarasavikrayiṇo(?) na parivittayo (na paravettayo?) na parivettāro, na vīrahaṇo, na pāparāgiṇo, na nirākṛtayo, nāvakīrṇino, na varṇāvṛtakaśiṣyā, na pūgayājino, na pau(bha?)na(bha ? rbha)vā na dāmbhikā, na kuśīlavā, nukarikasīrakarabhapuṅgavaṭayamadakāḥ(?) na pakṣipoṣakā, na srotodeśikā, naraśarasanakārakā(?), nāgredi(dha ? dhiṣa)vo, na kumārīdūṣakā, na puṃścalīpatayo (nu?) na goḷakā, na kuṇḍā, na tailikā, na devalakā, na cikitsakā, na kūṭadāhino, nāgāsdāhino, na garadāyino, na vṛddhivipaṇijīvino, na paiśunyavṛttayo, na vārtājīvā, na vadāravo(?), na vedanindakā, na nakṣatrapākā, na sadoraṇaraṇacāriṇo, na malacakrīḍino(?), na srotorudho, na (yācana?)yācanakā, na hiṃsāvihāriṇaśca paṅktidūṣaṇakā, na brahmabavaṣṇauti(?) | satyameva sarvaśaktyā pratyācaṣṭe | kīrtimeva nirmūlamu(ddha ? dva)rtayati snehaṃ nihanti nopakāraśatairayati tuṣṭiṃ nānuvartinā budairapi rajyatopakārakoṭiśatairapi śakyate svīkartuṃ nopalālanalakṣairapi sambhāvano labhyate(?) | na cāsmi(n) naisargikasarvadurvilāsasarge pratisaṅkhyānāvatīrṇapūrṇā hṛdayanisvakāśā ca mukhavinamana ca.....ṭe lajjā madanacaṇḍālamakareṇa manasi sparśadoṣabhayādiva na praviśyate (na?) sadguṇaiḥ | eṣā kila vāsvobjātiḥ(?) kukarmayoge′pi na jugupsate na hīnajātisaṃsarge′pi nāpatra......kopanā kuṭiladarśanā vā mattakāśinī bhīruḥ pramadā mugdhā māninīti doṣanimittaireva nāmabhiḥ ślāghate yatkiñcanakāriṇī yatoyataḥ pradhāvati prakṛticañcala.....ẏāṇi tadanumārgameva vyavaharanti | na (nu?tu) vicārayati nanu hitamidamahitametadakṛtaṃ kṛtamevamāpādyate mitramidaṃ śātravo′sāvudāsīno′yamatraiva tāvadyukta......karaṇenāmunāmunāyamarthaḥ sādhya ityevamādi manuṣyabuddhikṣuṇṇaṃ vastu kathaṃ vā vicāraye parākriyato vicāramūlamāgamanataścāpatāra eva tasyāstatra sambhāvitadasau......kṣayādirdayena tu bhagavatā kalaśajanmanā(na?)sminnisargasaṅkaṭe karmaṇi niyuktaṃ dūro duḥkhā yenadādiṣṭapratyayanamapunneṣṭaputrarkṣśanāśaṃsinī saṃsārasyaiva kāmapyavahāranispṛho gārhasthyenedamanu(go ? śo)cannavocam(?) | aho dura......pra svabhāvo yadasyāmapi sāmānyabhūmāvuttamāyāṃ jātāvagryādagrajanmano jani(trā ? tvā) bhartrā ca tvayā viśuddhavṛttena dīrghasaṃsṛṣṭā sodaryāḥ sute (śva ? śa)rīrajanirviśiṣṭe (ni ? śi)śāvitthaṃ nṛśaṃsamācarita(pati ? vatī) | tasyāstu kṛtyāyāḥ kṛ(tyā ? tvā) śāntiṃ mantrādinā punarapyapatyāya prayatamāno mahyāṃ kena śocase | duravagamā(haṃ ? hi) daivagatiḥ kimasāveva te nirupasargā santatirutāgāminyāḥ prajāyāḥ pramokṣyase pitṝṇābhityevaṃprāyairālāpaistadaharatinī(pa?)ya pratyuṣasi dakṣi(ṇā ? ṇamā)mantrya prāsthi(ṣī ? ṣi) | prapannādhvā ca prādhvaṃkṛtadehāntariktāmudvartātiriktavṛttanetrāmudbāṇaṃkaṇyarādhananijamālā mullasantī(?) llalā(ṭa)svedāmucchuṣyacchayāvadantacchadāmucchvāsāva(śoṣaṃ ? śeṣāṃ) (kava ? kva)cicchākhini bilvavanasamārūḍhe kāmapi sthavirāmapaśyam | āśu (cā ? pā)śamasidhenvāvalūya dayamānastāṃ samāśvāsayam | labdhasaṃjñā ca mṛtyukāṅ(kṣo ? kṣā)nimittamanvayuñji | sā tu sannakaṇṭhamabravīt | ahama(sya nyāyya ? smyārya)satyaśarmanāmnaḥ kāverītīramāsīnna śrotriyasya gopyā jātāṃ tadarbhakeṇa hastevartinā sa ca (sa)patnīmatsarāt saritpayasi tasyaiva jyeṣṭhabhāryayā pramattā praṇudye(?) | sāhamūrghvīkṛtasyanandhayā moghāraṭitamo(pe ? ghe)nohyamānā yāvadāvarte majjāmi tāvahāgamat ko′pi kumbhaḥ | tadupalambhādanavadyasyadamānāmapyavaśyaṃ tathā daḷantamaghaṭanānmahataḥ kāṣṭhabhārasya tameva punarapi (li)laṃbiṣamāṇā pariṣvajyāpi sarvaśaktyā vegaviprakṛṣṭaṃ tālasamā samālambituṃ jīvituṃ nirāśā cāvamanyamatīcaraṇamāveṣṭayan kimapi yatnenopagṛhṇāt kartu kāṣṭhabhārasya bandhanaṃ latāvalayaṃ tadanusāriṇī ca virahitavegaṃ tamāsādayitumaśakāmāśliṣṭañcainamāgnetorasobhayakaravidhṛtadārakā sudūramanuplavā payasi paryaproṣī praviṣṭaścāsāvasmatplavaḥ phenacchannapūrṇamānajīrṇasañcayamudīrṇavāruṇātapatramiva kañcidāvartanaṃ, tatra ko′pi darvīkaraḥ saraṇasādhanena samajyatāruhyamāṇahastā cāmunā yāvadutkṣipāmi vepamānā kumārakaṃ nāmastatra tejātade......(?) |

......kasuvṛttiranutiṣṭha madanuśiṣyamiti | ahaṃ tu tanmaharṣermatamanuvartamānaḥ kāverītaṭamupāvarte, vṛttadhanasya ca viṣṇudattanāmnaḥ samāmnāyino lomāyanasya kanyakāṃ kalinādhṛtastena vidhivadāmadāyayopāyacchetucchetaracchajīvanaṃ celenāsmi sparśitaḥ sā tu ninyurninyoprayo nijena karmāṇāsīt sīdate tu daśābdātikrame(?) śvaśurastasyā eva sodaryāṃ kanīyasīṃ gaurīṃ nāma kanyakāṃ kāmyarūpāṃ prāyacchat | asyāñcodapādi candranāṃkusu(?)kumāraḥ | sa ca dhātryā nājñāyi varṣajātaḥ kva yāta iti | ahaṃ tu muhiro mucira iva paribhramyākṛtārthaḥ khadiradhīrena ligunā madyano ramayatisrāśāḍvalam(?) | idaṃ tu śrutvā śibirindraketurasyā amalamahānadyāstīrthopoṣito ja(na ? la)praveśāya sastrībālavṛddhaṃ janapadaṃ samādiśat | praviṣṭāyāntu me jyeṣṭhabrāhmaṇyāmambhastad lohitā(yata ? yitam) | duśśīlā ca sā duśiruśivā kārmanibaddhā sārdhaṃ dhātryārbhakasya sasapāpatniṣyayārṇasiddhvāṃ praṇattiṃ vyāvarṇayati gṛhya caināṃ nyāyena pratyayāsīdamuṣminneva pitṛvane piśācī(?) | pratiṃjñātaṃ cāmuyā jātasya jāmiputrasyotsādanam | idaṃ ca paśyato mama jugupsaivāsyāṃ strī(jātau) jātā | sā svalviyamapare′pi smaraṇenāpi mohanakṣama viva(ma?)vallarīdarśanaināpi hṛdayavandhanasamarthā kūṭavāgurāśrayaṇenāpi śivalūni śilālasandhārāmaṃ kuruṃ bhayaivaṃ dṛṣṭaṃ hṛdayamāveśayanti mitabalosvumayi valannaṃ lagnamutsārayati śrīkumayipālikaṃ sakocanamācarati nibhayeva niyatimandaprevayā netibhirivāveśaṃ gāhaya.....ṃayātairaśātaṃ svāntannasvatantrayati dhīparivarābhicārād bhadrākārabaliśalagnānākarṣatyabhāvāya puruṣān(?) | api ceyamupaca(yaṃ ? yaḥ) cāpalānāṃ vyalīkānāmupastambhanaṃ.....ṃutejanamunmadānāmuda...... | 

.....ṭhānnayanaśvaśurasya sāhāyye niyuktaḥ sakalatrakośavāhano gatvāṭavyāṃ śabaraluptasarva(yorha ? svo ha)tvā bahūnaśmabhirnaśaṅkhoccamuhyat(?) | abuddhyata ca baddha(ca ? śca)ṇḍikāgṛhe purassaputrāyāḥ pravāsakarśitāṅgayaṣṭerāryadāsyāḥ | sā tvāsīdetadabandhamakṣṇāsrasyamāsyena cāmuñcati tā pādayossannipātya ca śabaravṛddhānavādīt yenāyaṃ datto me′rbhako yasyaiveyamaṭavīsvāmyaṃ samarpya premnā pitā so′yamiti dṛṣṭaiścaitaiḥ nādhikṛtastān yathārhamarthyamāno′nugṛhvānaḥ śaravādidattavārtā sahāmunā madhurāgāmī na svabhṛtyanītatsuhṛdatyomilakusūryavarmaśivamasāvapaśyat (?) | vayamunmuttabandho bandhudattasyānāmayaṃ śrutvā tasmai svavārtāṃ samādiśat | pitre ca vinayavatyāḥ | tayaiva cābhyarthitaḥ sampradhārya gurusuhṛdbhiḥ śūrasenāmaṣyudavahannagamacca | bandhudattaḥ sacarayaivaiyaṃ rājasyālākāmikāvairamayāt purādhivāsiteti raṅgapatākāmadarśayat(?) | arjunakaśca vindhyādāyātavān |

athātikṛṣṭastena jāmātrā sandhitsura(va)nipatiravaruddhasvātino tadbaleṣu ca bhagnaḥ suhṛtsandehaśeṣo rātrayotiśūdrako hṛtā cojjayinī sa tadbhiyaiva praviṣṭo nāmāgnimanalavaravaropasṛtya sindhuṣu hatā na rakṣitaṃ divyāśvagarbhrakaṃ ca dāsādhyapratinivṛtto bhinnanaukastena tīrtvārṇavamaruṣu mahato′śvasārthasya daśaikalābhapaṇabandhoddhṛtāmbusvayamanubhṛtastairarthalabdhaiḥ kūpe mahati bhekavṛttirvasa vayaṃ vānanasvanānimitaścāviṇmārgodgato′nusṛtya sārthaṃ girinagare vyavahṛtya jitvā suhṛtsahometo hatāśvabalena śibiramaviśadagrahīcca bandhubandhudatto pajaptapaurāmujjayinīṃ mandharājyavijayanatṛptena ca svātinā mahati yuddhe tamātmasaindhavāhaḥplutapratihastimastako jīvagrāhamagrahīda(nu ? nva)grahīcca mitrebhyo bhuvanasaṃvibhāge pitryeṇa rājyena(?) | sa caikaparameśvaro brahmarākṣasaniyuddhenoparajya kāmapāla iti dharmapālanāmno māgadhā(mabhyā ? mātyā)dutpadya vāsanānuba(ndha ? ddha)kāmajavyasanaḥ (saunda ? soda)ryeṇa jyāyasā sumitreṇa nirbhartsito′nusṛtya suci(rama ? raṃ)bhraman dha(kāṃ ? rāṃ) punaḥ kāśipuryāṃ vārāmsyāṃ kāntimatīṃ nāma rājaputrīṃ....l̤ocanendrasenābhirmaghava....r̤aheṣiṣaitkaraṇatriprakāraṃ pañcavidhamācaranti kanduvena krīḍitumakāmi kāmapālena | tāśca sakhyaścatasṛṣvapi tāsvamuṣṭiṃ ca yugapadeva.....ṇarupalakṣyaprabhāvatyā vikāramānujīvānniyamyātmānamaudāsīnyami(va) darśayantyo viśrāntāḥ ciraṃ vihṛtya nanvidānīmanaṅgarodhanāṅge dvijātiriveṣaṇe niyuyujya parijana.....ṃityavādiṣu (?) | itarā tu sva(yu)mevādhiṣṭhāya kārayāmīti kāmapālagrathitalīlāpāṅgadṛṣṭirevācaṣṭa kuṇḍalikāṃ nāma kubjāṃ ayi nimantrayasva dvijān yathālābhamiti | asau tu rājakulaparicayādā(ka ? kā)ragrahaṇa(ma ? pa)ṇḍitā sahānyaiḥ kaiścittamupānīya sarva ime′bhirū(parassara ? pāḥ sa) punarayamabhirūpata(ra) iti (jaya ? yaja)mānā(yai) niradiśat | upa(raci ? cari)teṣu gandhatailasrānīyāmalakaravasanasurabhikusumānulepasvādumauna(ca ? pa)ramānnapānapaṭa(vā?)vāsatāmbūlādibhirdvijeṣu tasyaikasyālikhitarathāṅgamākamithunamaṃśukayugamavagṛhītavisṛṣṭaghrāṇānilacalitakesaramavataṃsakamālyakaṃ bhūmayagrasparśipradeśinīniveśitakucakalaśailakalīlāvinduraṅgastāmbūlapallavāni cābhyantaraikadalanakhalikhitavarṇavinyāsābhyāsanasāvavyākośakuvalayadīrghikābhirivāyatāndhakārābhiraṅganāpāṅgapathikābhirantaḥ karaṇamarvasvamoṣaṇāya preṣayatpragalbhacoramiva nibhṛtacoramiva nibhṛtanicāraṃ kaṭākṣamarakṣaṇyalaktamayāniva mandamaspanditāsaraṇamaṇimayūrakharāgasanniṣekādāvādaya iva yogāpaśuddhadarśanāviṣkṛtaikapatrāntaritaparatale daḷe kāmī kāmapālaḥ kāmalekhamālo(ca ? ka)yat (?) |

mugdhā pañjarahaṃsī candraṃ nirvarṇya puṇḍarīkadhiyā |

sphuritāni kāni kānyapyabhilāpabalātkṛtā kurute ||

iti | madhumayamiva tadanubhūya mā(bhya ? dya)n ma(nda ? ntha)rāyamāṇadṛṣṭistatsaveṣṭakarṇakarṇamūle lambakuntalavihitaprāyamādhāya svayaṃ ca tatraiva raktāśokaśākhāvalambinaḥ kasyāpi kisalayarājimṛjodbhedamedaduramudaramuñcalaśikharairniravadyaninditapratilekhaḥ(?) kiñcidantaramapakrāntavāt | kāntimatyapi kusuṃmāpacāyāpadeśena katicanapavanapāda...... |

.....ṃasamayojayat | tāścānukṛṣṇatīkṣṇaṃ pathyāśanaiḥ kṣīrasarpiṣā ca puṣpagarbhakramādanehasābrāsoṣanakṛtyā ca khurāgrakalpanānyupakra.....ṃātrayā navanītabhakṣiṇaḥ ṣaṣṭhamāsāt paraṃ samidhotkārikābhirvastyabhyaṅgaiścopakramya (bhya?) trivarṣāt punaḥ kṣamayitvā śabdādiṣu mukheṣu gotreṣu pañcasu ca dhārāsu niṣṭhitān karmamaṇḍaleṣu triṣvapi ca vinayamaṇḍaleṣu lambhitakriyānamaṅgavataḥ kapālakaveṇirābhirāśītyāvasthāpanābhiraṣṭottareṇa ca muṣṭināmādinā bandhaśatena teṣu teṣu karmasvabhinītān vidadhe teṣāṃ tu pitā muktaśāpāsvevameva dhāmābhijagmuḥ(?) |

taṃ ca kuñjarapatiṃ hemakūṭaṃ ṣaṣṭhyāmapi madāvasthāyāṃ vartamānaṃ pārthivo vācaiva sāntvamiśrayā samāvarjayāñcakāra | (nava ? sapa)ryādibhistadanumagāminaśca tattanayāmairahāryā jajñire tāṃśca dṛṣṭvānirbhyaṣṭyapatirmahiṣīmabhāṣata(?) | devi! paśya te tanayasya prabhāvam | yato bhagavadbrahmagarbhabhūtavāsabhūtā pitāmahakarakamalasparśasambhāvitā sadaṇḍāt samāsaptakenaḥ rocyādinā saptabhiśca rathantarā(di)bhiḥ sāmabhirabhramukapikātāmraparṇyaṅganānupamā(ñjīna ? ñjanā)vatīśubhra(ga?)dantīpiṅgaletyādibhiḥ saha gajavadhūbhiraṣṭhābhiraṣṭāvutpannāḥ patayo vāraṇānāmairāvataḥ puṇḍarīkaḥ puṣpadanto vāmanassupratīko′ñjanassārvabhaumaḥ kumuda ityasuroraḥstha(ra?)ḷataṭavihārapaṭavastu darśavāhanānanepyeṣāṃ kalabhakānāmanukurvantīmudāralakṣaṇatayā(?) javatejobalaiścaika(ḥ) punareṣa potakaḥ sarveṣvapyeṣu varṣmaṇā ma(bhā ? hā)sattvatayā ca prati(ni ? vi)śiṣṭa iva lakṣyata iti | athā(na?)hani puṇye devatābhya iṣṭāsu parigṛhya kriyānurūpairbandhabhedairupakramya yathocitaiḥ pārāvatātaisthitaṃ bhaumamuttaratheyamiti trikriyeṇa damyenopaṃsthānaṃ vartanaṃ saṃyāpanaṃ vadhāvadho hastiyuddhaṃ nāgarāyaṇaṃ sāṅgrāmikamiti sa(ttva ? pta)vidhena sannāhyenaupavāhyena cāriṇamakuñjaropavāhya anugatīro yaṣṭhyopabāhyaḥ stotropabāhyo mārgāyukaḥ śuddhopavāhya iti saptadhā vibhaktena sarvopakaraṇaparikarmisaṃpatsamanvāgataṃ samayojayat samyak pratipannepu ca na teṣu vyālakarmarṇopakośo′bhūt(?) |

atha te′pi dārakāḥ samprabhavatara(?)ścaturthe māsi gṛhānni(ṣkra ? ṣkrā)mitāḥ ṣaṣṭhe′nnaprāśinaḥ prathame tṛtīye vā varṣe vṛttacaulakarmāṇo yathāsvavarṇaṃ garbhāṣṭamaikādaśadvādaśeṣu pañcama(saptama?)ṣaṣṭhasaptamāṣṭameṣu vopanītāḥ kārpṇarauravavāttacarmāṇi śāṇakṣaumāvikāni ca vasānā maurvīśoṇikauśyāmantakībalvajāśca samantravṛto mesvalāḥ paridadhānāḥ kārpāsaśaṇavidhūtravyadūrdhvadhṛtopavītāḥ vailyāpāṭavaidavapālāśa(bā ? khā)dirodumbarāśvakeśalalāṭanāsantikā.....ġrajūnasvaṇḍakaṇḍakā daṇḍānudvahanto′hvaḥ pūrvamadhyottarabhaikṣacaryāt kadabhyuditāt nācāpīnissṛptau(?) yāvadarkanakṣatradarśanaṃ pūrvāparasandhyayoḥ sāvitryāḥ sthānāsanacāriṇo (du ? dū)rāhṛtābhirākāśanihitābhissamidbhiḥ sāyaṃ prātaragnimindhānā śuśrūṣavo′nasūyakā guruṣu sthirabhaktayaḥ pūrvotthā(yānnaḥ ? yinaḥ) paścāt saṃveśino′nuyātapratiyātāsino nāmaṃśrave kathayitāro na bhojanaśayanakopastrīsamīpadevajitaprakarpeṣu toṣamarpayitāro na śilāphalakānekadadātivarjataḥ tadanujñātaśuddhabhaikṣabhujo madhumāṃsamadyagandhaśuktasasaropaghātānañjarābhyañjanopānacchatradhāraṇāḥ na kāmakrodhalobhanṛttagītavādikadyūtaparivādajanapadādyatānāṃ strīprekṣālambhayośca namasmāraḥ(?) taistairvedavrataiḥ sarvān vedān (pra?)sarvāṇi ca prātiśākhyāni samastāśca dhanuṃrvadasaṃhitā nikhilamitihāsavedamakhilāṃścāyurvedādīnupa(pekṛtavedādīnupapetuya?) vedādīna(di ? dhi)ja(ni ? gi)re | tathā ca śikṣātantre mantranirvacane śabdānuśāsane yajñavidyāyojyo(?) jñāne chandovibhāge (vai)cakṣaṇyaṃ paramavāpan | api ca mānavavāsiṣṭhagautamādiṣu dharmaśāstreṣvauśanasabārhaspatyavaiśālākṣabāhudantakādiṣvarthaśāstreṣu......bābhravyānādismṛteṣu kāmasūtreṣu vārtāvistareṣu nyakṣāyāmānvīkṣikyāṃ samagreṣu ca jaḍharaturagajñeṣu pāramāruruhuḥ snātāṃsnuhāni yantritvā(?) sakalāsu.....ṣarvāneva sarvatra sarvaguṇairatyarthamatyaśeta rājavāhanaḥ | snehena tu sama evābhavat | itthaṃ ca parisamāpitatīrthavāseṣu taruṇībhavatsu ca dārakeṣu pramāṇaṃ cāpūrya ṣoḍaśaṃ harṣamiva pitrorutsārayati rājavāhane rājahaṃsaṃ (jyā ? jā)yādvitīyaṃ sampradhārya vijñāpayāmbabhūvuḥ | deva vijaya(prā ? prayā)ṇasamaya eva devasya rājavāhavasya devatoddiṣṭo vartate | nārhati snihiti(ri?)rīhitamiha vihantum | nārtho′pyanarthaparyantaśreyatiktamauṣadhamadhuraṅgaropasṛṣṭe mato′sya tejasāṃ nidherāsanne′bhyudaye viramatu viramatu vistamomayī vibhāvarīva virahacintā ratnaśilāpaṭṭapīvara idānīṃ dadātvayamalaṃ kumārapatnīmapārāyerna rājalakṣmyai(?) | sā khalvenaṃ gahanagahvaramanadhigacchantī khedāyaiva dīrghamanvicchati | nirgacchatu vanādayaṃ mahāvarāha ivoddharan dharāmavadhūtāhimakaramādhā puruṣottaṃstametamanuttacitramaṇḍalamahākārambhamiva lambhayanta(?) dṛṣṭiphalāni dṛṣṭvā sanāthībhavada(hī?)bhinandatu (bha ? bhu)vanamiti | prakrānta eva sutavirahe sadyaḥ kliṣṭavarṇā paryākulībabhūva devī vasumatī | devo′pi niveditātmānandaviraho jahadamānuṣamapyavaṣṭambhadīnadṛṣṭiḥ kṣīṇapuṇya iva śuṣyanmukhaḥ śucā parītaḥ papāta bhūmau | a......jāvapi daśarathe dṛṣṭaśaktiḥ putraśaṅkā itya(vi ? bi) bha(kta?)yuḥ sumantrādayaḥ | tāvatyeva calitabhūbhṛtprati(sta ? mo) mahānā(yā?)jagāma sama(hi ? harṣi)gaṇo bhagavān vā(su ? ma)devaḥ | sasambhramotthitaṃ mantrimaṇḍalamabhito himajalasiktarājahaṃsakhaṇḍitamusvāravindaśobhākārairākāramārgaṇaiḥ.....ṣarva eva lokaṃ saviteva niratanmayaṃtemea nṛpo bharaṇeva guruṇāvarjitastasya dakṣasyavitaresandanena nātmani bhūtaśokapratyāśaśvāsa rājapatī(?) | devo′pi rāja(vāhano ? haṃso)′rthapālādiparivṛtaḥ pitāmahabhiva harivāhano muniguruṃ tamañjalisasve(na) maulinopatasthau | pādamūlagataṃ ca tamaca(nā ? lā)vasthaṃ pārthivaṃ toyada iva pādapaṃ lavabdhāya(?)snigdhaśabdāmṛtavarṣodgārī (ssūrīḥ?) sudhīramitthamāhlādaya(nva ? cca) | satyamasi rājahaṃso yadṛnānānamo(?) vimuhyasi mahatyā mānasotkaṇṭhayā kimabhyudayāmagamat samayamenamakāṇḍa eva durdinaṃ yasya maṅgalasadṛśairlocanasalīlāsārabindubhiḥ(?) yacciramidamekaḥ svayamevānubhavitumicchasi tribhuvanopabhogyamīśvaradravyam | nijatejaḥprakarṣaprakāśye saptadvīpavalayāntarāle śālābhyantara iva pradīpo yatra kvacana vartamāno′pi kamivāyaṃ virahaviṣyati pitaramadya surasabhāyāṃ rājarṣīripuñjayatā khalu rājahaṃsādacaladhṛteriha bhavataḥ padmaṇḍano ratnamaya iva sthairyāvalambanakṣamaḥ kṣamābhṛt prakāśībhavadyu babhāṣe(?) | bhagavan divyakhaḍgakhaṇḍitaprāṇaḥ prāṇitaḥ purāhamāmardakena bhagavatā | punaridānīṃ putraśokagrastajīvitastvayāsmi saṃjñāvalambitaḥ | labdhedānīṃ nirdṛśyanta eva santaścāsantaśca panthānaḥ, śāntaivādya śarmaparipanthinī (na?) virahacintā | sahatāsmi svastimati me bhagavago′vasan(?) tāvadanuśāstu kartavyeṣu bhagavāniti yatnastambhitātmā baddhāñjaliratiṣṭhat |

atha guruḥ kumāramukhaṃ devānīkamiva dhīramālokaya(n) vijayāya giramivamāvarjayatā tajjātiviśeṣakarmaguṇasamavāyino dravyabhūtā mahābhūtasadharmāṇaṃ sakalaṃ jagadbhoga.....ṇorutpatte bhavādṛśastekadekasyāpi te snāraḥ kṛtaḥ kṛtsnamidaṃ jagat saṃskarotīti(?) tvayyasmābhissarvātmanaivārpitā yatnarakṣitā vidyāśevadhayaḥ | śilādhauta ivāsiradya vidyāśodhitastavāsmai vālamarthasādhanāya | atha ca vinayanije jane guṇādhānavitṛṣṇānāṃ gurūṇāṃ na (saṃ?)punaruktadoṣā hitopadeśeṣviti prakānto′yaṃ madanuśāsanavistaraḥ | caritabrahmacaryasya pāramāgamānāṃ tāruṇyaṃ cādhirūḍhasya gārhasthyānuṣṭhānaḥ tayāyamapi kvasāvaśramotthamūlo yayaikādhīnāni ca kṣetrabandhordhanānya......vasu sambhūya hi puruṣamabhiyāsyatāmalabhyānarthavidveṣiṇāṃ kāmādiṣaḍvidhabalamagre sañjīvāpatitasya viṣayavilopasāmarikāṇāmindriyāṇāmapyu.....ṣṛjyamānāni ca nija ca prāṇamayānivāharantya evamasmiṃśca gaṇe saṅghātavartinyekasyāpyupekṣayetareṣāmapyapratikāryaprakopastārkṣyasyeva vakṣāpanīte......kṣaṇānīndriyagrāmo tasya śamonirupadravāṃ svasurasodbhavāyā tṛṣṇāyā śivāyā vātyayā iva gopāle nivartanta eva(?) | uddhatarajaḥprasaradhvastadṛṣṭayo mithyābhrāntayamakṛṣṇavartmasamanupāti......kasyāstribhuvanopabhogena vina(ā) sā svayaṃ paryavasya tadidamāmagamatvayīva viṣa(ya)grāmaṃ śoṣayanti brahmarṣayaḥ(?) | rājarṣayastvātmavanto jitvā jagatīṃ dattvā dhanāni yuktyā vopayujya bho(gā)niṣṭvā nijabhūridakṣiṇairmahākratubhirānantyāya punarasaṅgāstyaktava(ntyaḥ ? ntaḥ) | ta ime mantraprabhṛtayaḥ tvañcāpi tribhuvanasya vanaṣaṇḍasyeva gandhakuñca(ra ? raḥ) pratibhoktā prāktanānāṃ tu karmaṇāṃ bruvāṇāmiva phalāni nāntareṇa kālaṃ pacya(te ? nte) ca(?) | śokayātrākarṇa(sā ? dhā)raṃ hi daivamānuṣaṃ karma netara(t)nirapekṣamekamevānayoḥ samarthaṃ sādhanāya na khalu kāle′pi varṣannūṣareṣu vā pā(ṣā)ṇeṣu vā bījaropaṇāya bhagavān parjanyo na ca sukṛtakṣetrakṣiptenāpi bījaduṣṭineṣṭaṃ vṛṣṭiṃ anadhiṣṭhitena vṛṣṭaṃ prakṛṣṭā phalasiddhireto dṛṣṭakāritatvādyathāmān mānuṣākhyo yogakṣemayorniṣpattivipattirūpo′nayā cintayeti na tathā devākhyāviṣṭāniṣṭaphalāvadṛṣṭakāritatvādayācanāyāvā dīyate(?) | cintayanto′pi śrīsamākarṣāya vijigīṣavo vidhivadeva dvādaśarājakamaṇḍalaṃ praviśya nāśaṃsante mantraviddhi narendramantro rūpārābagūḍhaṃ cāgaśriyamutthāpayataḥ pṛthvībhṛtaḥ paramadhiṣṭhānaṃ bhavanī mantrotsāhaprajāpālaśce yadi trayo′pi saṃhanyante tribhuvanametadātmāṃśapraklṛptyarthamiva kṣiprameva sādhayati śaktiyuktaṃ ca(?) | siddhiprāsādamārurukṣo(ḥ) bahuguṇavadani.....ṣopānībhavantyatra kṣamaprārthyāḥ kṣayasthā(nna ? na)vṛddhayaḥ ṣaḍbhireva guṇairamukhairevottamāṅgabhūtaiḥ prasādhyate svābhitvam | ṣaḍveca(?) guṇān rasānivā......kṣaṇāndeśa(ka ? kā)lāveka......payujya jātabalāḥ samabhinajyāyaḥ so′bhibhavati tanaśatrāviśeṣapātibhiścapīḍanocchedanakarśanaistribhirdīptarūpaścakṣurbhirivaiti śobhāmīśvarasya vigrahaḥ(?) | ṣāḍguṇyavihāraśīlasya ca vijigīṣoḥ (pī ? krī)ḍopakaraṇamete mitrāmitramadhyamodāsīnalakṣaṇānvitāḥ sarva eva rājānaḥ | tava tu pitrānena kṛtavidyena vṛddhadarśinā vaśyendriyeṇa śuddhāmātyamantripurohitasakhenāṣṭādaśatīrthasamaprayuktopasarpeṇa sapuraprakṛtimaṇḍalāvarjanapareṇa mantrajñānasaṃvaraṇopāyapaṭunā trividhadūtaprayogādhikaraṇavedinā nityotthānaśīlena sarvāpāyadvārarodhinā sa(pta ? rva)vidhakarmānuṣṭhānapaṇḍitena śaktiśocānurūpe(?)yuktasarvādhyakṣeṇa lavamapyādeyamanutsṛjatā lakṣa(ra ? ma)pyanādeyamanāditsamānena vyavahārapratyavekṣiṇā yathārhaṃ daṇḍaya(thā ? tā) saṃvṛttinā citro ya (?) pratyuddhṛtarāṣṭradurgarājarājyakaṇṭakena maṇḍalavibhāgayoginā ṣāḍguṇyopayogarasikena sarvavyasanavarganirdhāraṇakṣameṇa yātrāṅgavinikṣayavicakṣaṇena sāṅgrāmikavidhiviśāradena samuccayavikalpayojitopāyavargeṇa balīyasā paddiyasāsatprakāralabhyadurgeṇa(?) sarvadravyasaṃyogaśaktikauśalādbhutacarite(nāttha ? na) trivargasevinā bhuktamidaṃ (ci ? cā)dvitīyātapatramatyāyataṃ bharateneva bhārataṃ varṣam | itthaṃprāyavṛtta eva bhūyasāmarṣaṇaprakṛtyā saṃtvaritastvavantipuryāmaikṣvāko mānasāra ityamoghanāmā narapatiramuṣya hetorāmardakena bhagavatā......kṣipya tataḥ kṣīṇaḥ kṣiteḥ kṣitirakṣatābhimānaḥ(?) punarasāvanavagītavīravrato jitassa devena | tenāhaṃ jita iti sadyo nyastaśastra(maiśvarya ? ścaiśvarye) putraṃ darpasāramabhiṣicya....r̤avantisundaryā yogyavarapratipādanonmukhaḥ tadasambhavādanalpodvegamadyāpyasatyāśāraso′pi darpasāro darpāt paribhaumān bhāvena......ṇḍaśīle syāle caṇḍavarmaṇi nidhāyādhipatya(matyonā?)matyugreṇa samādhinā samārādhayannandhakārimadhyāste śailaṃ kālam | asminnantare saha suhṛdbhi.....ḍasticchettavyaṃ bhavataḥ | tadyathā jambūśākakuśakrauñcaśalmaligomedapuṣkarocavādā(?) yojanalakṣādyuttarottaradviguṇavṛddhayā.....ṭaraprakṛṣṭāyurmogamāhātmyāḥ pūrvaṃ pūrvamāvṛtya cakravadavasthitāḥ saptaite dvīpāḥ | tasyāsya jambūdvīpasya dvisahasravistāro.....ṇta ṣaḍvarṣaparvatāḥ | tatra ca vicitrakūṭo′pi nityamadhyasyaḥ sadūravṛttārambho′pi sadākṛtiralayo′pi tryaśracaturaśraśobhī bahuma....r̤aśītisahasrayojanocchrāyaḥ ṣoḍaśasahasrāvanāhaḥ sauvarṇo nīlakaṇṭhahelātāṇḍavañvaṃśarāvayārurmeru.....ṣtārāvagāhaścatustriṃśataṃ sahasrāṇyānī(sa ? sra) niṣadhamāyato mandha(māda)nastataiva namolbadrīṃ pūrve śailo mālyavā....r̤ikiṃpurunmaharatāni tāvanta eva nīlaśvetaśṛṅgaśāṇavabhadrāśvā madhye tu hiraṇyagarbha......vetāni varṣāṇi vasanā santānakenāpi kṛṣṇadhanvaḥsannibhe mahākalatra iva tadakṣiṇo....l̤inaścakravartisahavasya bhāratavarṣasyendravaruṇasomagandharvanāgadvīpāstā.....ṃākumāri cāsya dvīpasya yojanasahasrā navasaddasrameva punareva tu......kuñjabhūmayaḥ kulaparvatā(?) | varṣaparvatasya tu hi(ma)vataḥ pṛṣṭhasye......śopaśamita iva candraścandraprabho nāmācchodasaraḥkṣaradacchodakaratnarodho....r̤aḥ pūrvadakṣiṇastu māṇicaradharmagoṣṭhyākṛṣṭayakṣavismṛtaviśokāraṇyasaṅketakupitakāmi.....ṣāvasekarūḍhāñjanataṭāndhakāritatribhabhūto brahmāpetaparigrahabrahmarākṣasīkucakṣobhalulitamānaso.....ṃastu paśupatipādānāṃ padmamudrābhūṣitapṛṣadutsaṅgaḥ saṅgītarasātisaṅga bhrāntabhūtavrātārpitaśītaśailodasarasnā......kulakuñjo muñjavānuttarāparaḥ punaruparivasada(va?)saṃkhyenāgastyacaritayajñāpetabrahmarākṣasakulakuḍuṃ......(bi)ndusaro hiraṇyaśṛṅgaḥ(?) | tatra sā tapasā kṛśabhinnabhagīrathānukrośamandakuladhīmauliruddhamuktā vyomāpagā pāvanī....r̤vivakṣuriti dakṣiṇantu bhagīrathānugrāhiṇī bhāgīrathītyekadhaiva bhedabhinnavindhyā viveśa himavataḥ paramasamaravilambijaṃ....r̤ikaḷatrayorvanaspatijyotiṣmatyoḥ pratyādiṣṭanandadyutiṣu tīrārāmarājiṣu rājīvarajotibhāra(bhāra?)mandacakravākaca....r̤akṣanti kṣīrāmikṣayo yadupabhogarāgeṇāmṛtaparibhāvinaḥ punaravataranti mānaveṣu devagaṇāḥ(?) | navānaṅgadehābhi......ṣavāsukitakṣa(ka)pradhānaviṣadharādhivāso viṣṇupasarasyandī(?) gandharvīṇāṃ bālāmbu.....ḥānasti krośamātravṛttaphalabandhabandhuro jambūvṛkṣaḥ sudarśano nāma | tataḥ pṛthuratnaśila......ṇātmasantararthyavicchedāyaiva bhāvayati | yatra ca vṛtrārigopa(yu ? pu)ñjadyuterjāmbūnadasya janma yā.....ṭapatreṇeva meruṇāntari(ta)tvādantarikṣatalasya tathāpitramānavākāmavadhūtamaṇi.....ṭrāndhakāradidṛkṣākautu(ka)madyāpi noparatameti prasiddha eva merupāraḥ sapari......bhūtibhūmidevā havirbhiradhvareṣu siddhabrahmarṣibandhayogāsanapavitravayavaiḍū...... ndaryābhiṣyandamiva darśayanti ramyaketurohimaṇamadhūpabhogabhāvitaratiprapañcapa.....ḥārasadyotsāmṛtakānte pitṛgaṇasaptakapratiṣṭhāmaṇimayasarvaratna.....ṃathyo vālukā raudramapi nisargasaumyaṃ saro rudraka.....ẏāṃsi sarāṃsi madhūnāmeva yugapad vandyānavadyapremabhārā......ṇḍikāsu panasaphalarasopayogāt kuvalapadaḷarucayoga.....ẏatra karikiṃpuruṣāyoṣvavarṣāyutamāyurindravajraprabhayā ṛṣabhadhūmradundubhayastrayovagā....l̤āmālijalāśano jātavedāḥ saṃvartakaḥ paścimatakaḥ somakavarāhanādarāścandra.....ṃeruścandro jaladharo raivato nāradaḥ (raivata?) śyāmo dundubhirastaḥ somakassuma(nāḥ).....ṣsapta varṣaparvatāḥ(?) | tatra merormeghārambhaścandre jalamindreṇa grāhyamaśvibhyāṃ....r̤vatāvutpannau śyāme śyāmatāṃ parāpannaḥ dundubhiśca surāsunirarāgāmi......ākṣamakṣapayadarcilomakhaliptavāsareṣu tu keriṇī saratidelomātariśvāpa.....ṇāma dhruvamityasthakīpāśramavyavasthāni satyaśaucaśālikhinityatretāyugānyarada.....ḍhenukā sukṛtā garbhagarbhasvinīti gaṅgābhedā nadyaḥ(?) |

kuśadvīpasya tu kumudo vidru......ṣo harirmandaraḥ kakudmāniti sapta ci(trāsa ? trasā)navo varṣaparvatāḥ | (haritā)lamaya unnato varāhako′ñjanamayaḥ puṣpa(vati ? vān) mṛtasañjīvanī viśalyakaraṇī....r̤e mahendrasaṅgraho ratnarāśiḥ | teṣāṃ tu varṣāṇi (vedamuktidaṃ ? śvetamunnataṃ), lohitaṃ veṇumaṇḍalakaṃ, jīmūtaṃ svairathākāraṃ, haritaṃ lavaṇaṃ, kakuddhṛtimad, mānasaṃ pravarakaṃ, kapilaṃ kākusmamiti vibhūtimanti sapta | saptaiva ca si(ddhovo ? ndhavaḥ) dhūtapāpā yonitoyā, śivā, pavitrā, vi(tṛ)ṣṇā ca, candrā hlādinī, vidyuccandrakā, vibhāvarī (daṇḍāvṛ ? puṇḍrā dhṛ)tirmahatīti |

krauñcadvīpe kro(ñceṇa ? ñco) vāmano′ndhakāro devā(vṛ)tirde(vendro ? vano) govindaḥ puṇḍarīka iti sapta varṣaparvatāḥ | dvividaḥ pāvaka iti govindavāmanāvāhuḥ | saptaiva ca varṣāṇi kuśalo manonuga uṣṇaḥ pāva(ra ? na)ko′ndha(kā)rako munideśo dundubhisvara iti | (dvā ? tā)vatya eva nadyaḥ | gaurī kumudvatī sandhyā rātriḥ khyātiḥ puṇḍarīkā manojaveti gaṅgābhedāḥ |

śalmalidvīpe tu su(ra?)manāḥ pitobhraṃputrānīta(?) iti parimaṇḍalāstrayo varṣaparvatāḥ | varṣāṇi kuśalāḥ pāparakamandhakārakamiti trīṇyeva |

gomedadvīpe surakumudāvañjanaśātakumbha(yoḥ ? mayau) pūrvapaścimo varṣaparvataḥ(?) | varṣe ca dve | varṣaparvataparimaṇḍalo mānasottaraṃ tasmiṃśca ratnagirau pūrvadakṣiṇāparottareṣu diṅnāgeṣu indrayamavaruṇasomanagarāṇyamarāvatī saṃyamanī su(khā ? ṣā) vibhāvarīti parvatadvīpānāmassyutsavaḥ pāre svādupāriparimaṇḍalo bhūtikamaghabhṛtaḥ sālokanirāloko lokāloka ityayutavistārośchrāyaścakravāḷagiriḥ(?) | adhaśca pra....l̤aṃ nāma kṛṣṇabhe.....ṃannamucimagā nāradaśarabhaśaṅkukarṇakabandhakiṣkindhādibhīmaladattaśvāpadādīnāṃ dānavendrāṇāṃ kālayakalaśajayādīnāṃ ca nāgarājānāṃ bhūtimadbhiḥ parassahasrairadhvā.....ṭīyamatalaṃ nāma pāṇḍubhaumajambhamahājāmbha......śagrīvasuvaśakhajagomukhapramukhāṇāmasurendrāṇāṃ nīlameghakrathanānāṃ ca rakṣodhipānāṃ takṣakāsvaṃtarakaṃ prabalaprabhṛtīnāṃ.....ṃīśvarāṇāṃ śrīmadbhiḥ śobhate purībhiḥ | tṛtīyaṃ tritalaṃ nāma rakta(vṛ ? mṛ)ttikaṃ triśiraḥśiṃśumāratārākṣaprahvādānuhvādā(nni ? gni)mukhādīnāṃ daityendrāṇāṃ cyavanakharavirādhakumbhikolkāmukhānāṃ ca.....ḥāmaṇidattapāṇḍarakapilaviśāviśrāṇāṃ(?) ca darśanaśravasāmṛddhapauravṛndairudyotate | caturthaṃ gabhastitalaṃ nāma pītamṛttikaṃ kālanemigajakarṇakuñjarāṇāṃ suradviṣāmeka eva sukumālimuñja.....ṃnāñca naktañcarāṇāṃ caturdaśasahasravihagaviśeṣāṇāṃ bhartuśca kāśyapasya marīci(da ? ta)paḥprabhāvasambhṛtasyendubha......ṇādbhutānubhāvalabdhamahendrasakhyasya yajñamayapuruṣavāhana.....ṃayasya bhagavato vainateyasya vibhāvanīti nagaramudāraśobhamābharaṇāni vedvamadbhiḥ(?) | pamcamaṃ vitalaṃ vāma śaktiriyaṃ virocanādīnāṃ dānavānāṃ mahāmeghadvijihvavidyuṣānāṃ ba....l̤akṛtaḥ sa rājakesarī | mantriṇaśca mahiṣyā saha vindhyaṃ vanaṃ vindhyavāsinīvarivasyāyai gatāstayānayā duṣpravṛttyā tatraiva tanuṃ tyaktavanta iti | sā ceyaṃ pratyāvṛttaprāṇasaṃśayā bhūyo′pi tenaivaṃ pratyāśvasyata sādhvī | duravabodhā.....ḍavagatiraprameyāḥ prabhāvamārgāḥ | tathā hi——(rapo ? kaco) nāmāmaragurusutaḥ dasu(?) sampīḍyāsuraiḥ (sarāssannitaḥ ? rahasi nihataḥ) pāṭito′pi bhagavato bhārgaveṇa svodarā(bhe ? de)vodabhāvyata | bhīmābhibhūtabhāradvājapreṣitaiṣīkāstragrastamamadhyottareyasyāḥ(?) pratyāhṛtaṃ dvāri dāmodareṇa | (vṛta ? pitṛ)śāpahataśca nāciketāḥ pretanagarametya pratyājagāma | jāmadagnyaśca rāmaḥ (kapi ? kupita)guruniyogānuvṛttakṛttaśirasaṃ tatprasādāt pratyajīvayat savitrīm | sāvitrī ca pātivratyāt patiṃ patyuḥ pare(tanā ? tānāṃ)hastādācakarṣa(ta?) | rāghavaśca śūdraśamiśambukopāyanena lebhe dharmarājā(d) dvijātidārakaṃ, bhīrathyaśca gāndhārarājo nagnabalayomaṃ vijitya prāpto nagnajatvam(?) | citravibhaktamūrtiḥ.....ṭānāmapi na.....ṃuktā natvabalā sukumārāntarvartī ca bhūtvā samuttīrṇamahārṇavā sarvāvasthāsbapyāyuṣmatāmamṛtyudaśane tvamevāsi pramāṇam, ato′ntareṇa.....ṣatīmṛte samāśvāsahetoḥ yadapi rājño rājahaṃsasya leśato′pyanupalabdhirnāmābhāvarūthaṃ so′pyaprahato maraṇamārgaḥ(?) | tathā ca tasyā devyā......cetarāṇi cānanaṃ puraḥ parā hi sañcarati tadavalambyate dhairyaṃ kvāpi tāpasāśrame tatkālapakṣaṃ karmaphalamaśarapānā nimīlya locane.....ṭaḥ samīpe kāñcidenāṃ kathañcideva jñātīyadvisṛṣṭaḥ(?) sa vidyārthī yathepsitāṃ diśamayāsīt | iyañca jaṭinī valkalinī vrataparā ca jarattapasvinī paricarantī gaṇanāyakaṃ prakṣa.....ṭā kukṣimāśuśukṣaṇeḥ kṣaṇenānena rakṣitaivaṃ deveneti bruvatyaiva sā rajakyarodīt | sa tvidamākarṇya santatāśru śoca(nva?)tīṃ bandhūṃśca niścitya mayā harṣagadga.....ẏonmāṇāmahīsurakucāśca so′timātraṃ sumedhāya kṛpayā vātāvādimāmasti(?) |

sa devo rājahaṃsaḥ saha vevyā vasumatyā pitṛbhyośca suśrutasumantrābhyāṃ mātṛbhyāñca(?).....ṇā viśrutamantramuptābhyāmanyaiśca mantridārakaissamaṃ samavardhata | upanītaścāpi hi vinīto vidyāsu ṣoḍaśasvṛṣervālmīkisamasya vāmadevasyādeśādvijayaprayāta.....ṇderyāpamānasyānugrahāyāsuraviva(ra)manuktvaivāvatīrṇe deve durava(rā ? bo)dhatayā nirgatapathānāmitastamanviccha......bhita dehānmṛtyumukhapraviṣṭaṃ niṣkrāntayoḥ pitrorvāmapa.....ḍvāgrahīṣameṣa cārthaḥ piturārdrārdrayāntaḥkaraṇapravṛttyā mātuśca me premaprasnutābhyāṃ payodharābhyāṃ pūrvamevāveditaḥ | punaruktaṃ tu mayā kṛtathavādhikamaceṣṭāḥ pralāpāścānantyāntyalakṣaṇā upalakṣayituṃ na śakyāḥ tadalamatiprapañcenāmunā(?) | vayantu māturāvasathaṃ gatāva.....ḥaratyavāhayāmaḥ parasminna.....ṭasya nidhiṃ janasyopayogamanvaveṃtya saṅgṛhītakatipayapuruṣasteṣāṃ pāpaśodhanāya ṣoḍaśahasta.....ṭānāṃ nagarāṇi nānāra(tna)mayāni dhāra.....ṣarisuvarṇaparvaṇāṃ surārīṇāmutkrośasya niśācarasya śakrasakhasya sarasā nandivardhanasya vāsukervasatimaṇimayabhava.....ṭi | saptamaṃ tu pātāḷanāma hemamayaṃ māyāvāmanatripadinā (na?) dṛṣṭāpadā(ta ? na)syadānavendravṛndārakasya balervairocanasya mucukundasyendranirviśeṣasya ca viṣagharendrasya indranīlāmbarasyendumaṇḍalapāṇḍarasya....l̤asyārcimālino dvisahasrajihvālocanasyā.....ṣsaha svānyeṣāñca nāgarājadanujanātharajanicareśvarāṇāṃ purāṇi pūrṇāni candramukhīnāmuddharatnadhāmāni nṛttagītanityaramyāṇi dhatte......paryapi (dyo ? jyo)tirmayālokaḥ sarvataśva bahirambuvalayaṃ daśaguṇamavanimaṇḍa......bhūtāni mahānti pūrvaṃpūrvamāvṛtya bhuvanaṃ dhairyamāpādayanti | paramanādimadhyanidhanamaparimāṇamavyaktaviyati bhuvanakośe yāstā lokapuryodavyagravyagraṃ merorevopari tadāloka(?)......bhavato devabrāhmaṇānugrahādājñāvidheyaṃ bhaviṣyati | vaiṣṇavānāṃ hi (ceta ? teja)sāmudita iva kaścidaṃśastvadātmanā sthitaḥ, sarva evāto sarvamuni bhraragrahitā bhavantaṃ paribhavadu dvimāsamātraṃ soḍhavyā dvīpasārvadvārikaṃ nakṣatraṃ sarvadigvijigīṣāsaṃvādi śrāvaṇasya tavānukūlavartainaiva prāyāsi pṛthuriva pṛthvīṃ svīkartumityetāvadabhidhāya viramati sma(?) |

sa tathā muniguruprakāśito′tiśakraścakravartīmabhimā sarvalepā......vasanagrahaṇamiva kandharoddharaṇamādāvaṅgeṣvakrāntakarṇaśravaṇatāmakarot, ātmajaprabhāvaśravaṇasumatī kṛtārthamātmānaṃ mene(?) | devo′pi kālavarṣamiva śaṅkaraḥ sarasvatīṃ pratijagrāha | bhagavāṃśca vāmadevo.....ṣapu......vargyaṃ vinayanibhṛtamanugacchanttaṃ visṛjya rājānaṃ nijaṃ tapovanaṃ jagāma | dampatī cāśramaṃ jagmatuḥ | tanayābhyudamacintayā modamānau muhurvirahotkaṇṭhayā dūyamānau muhuḥ prayāṇamaṅgaḷāni sampādayantau muhu.....ṃanvagra.....ṃuhusteṣāmājanuśceṣṭitānāmanusmṛtyā rudantau muhurapramādaṃ śikṣayantau muhurdevatābhyaḥ kṣemamāśaṃsamānau muhurdarśanāgatānāmṛṣīṇā.....ḍivasaśeṣamanayatām | vyaghradamano.....ṭṛputradārastaṃ vṛttāntamupalabhya snehadrāvitātmā yatnaniruddhabāṣpagadgadakaṇṭhaniṣṭhyūtaistairupastambhanavo.....'tha cakravartitejogranikaranikaṣāvabaddharohipūrajetasvikaśvakravāḷairbhartṛsamāgamonmusvīnāṃ digvadhūnāmātmasaṃskāradhūpa iva dhūsaritanabhasi jāyamāne nadīyamasi smayamāne cūḍāmaṇicāmarikāyāmakariṇīmiva yāminīmupasthāyapayatyāharantasamaye yatnanitayathocitaniyataḥ kṣāmaḥ kṣāmasthemā kṣaumakomaḷamāpramāṇāgaṇapuḷinamadhyāsīnaṃ sthagaṇena narapatiṃ parivārayāñcakre(?) | cirañca kiñcida dhyāya(nnivartini ? ntīva nirni)miṣanayanā sthitvā muktadīrghaniśvāsā putramālalāpa | tāta! janayitrīmiḥ sarvadaiva sūnuśocatīyāṃ viśeṣataḥ pravasanta ityasyāṃ lokasthityāmudiddikṣannaśakṣyasyeva nirvopuḥ vivakṣitavicitrakṣaṇamasya me hṛdayaṃ kiṃ vā pareṇopadeśyaṃ, dṛśyate eṣa yatnaścodyate mānyo mitravarga iti upadiṣṭe piṇḍīkamastavātmamāno na suhṛdbhirviharaṇīyamiti nisargata eva sukhanibaddhākhyo kiṃ mayā bhuvanabhūtaye bhavantassañcaranti(?) | sa cenniyogataḥ kimuta vajrācalakadarthanocitasthairyasambhārabhājanairbhavadbhirudyadaśrubindusantānasannitāntapakṣmā śuṣyatka.....ẏa uttānaśayo yaḥ kalapravāvīryau kṛdhāvannāśramahariṇapotakāya āṣāḍhī mokhalīraścedānīṃ viditaveditavyo vartase sarvāvartasthaḥ sama evāsi snehamapāsya nirvivekasya strīhṛdayasya.....ṇedānīmabhihṛtamamṛtamivābhyavahāryaṃ pravāse tvā prīṇayiṣyati......cintayati satyapyeva śrutvāpi tathā taptavacobhiḥ pravāsaḥ pravāsamivāsubhistvamagrajavirahamaviṣahyaṃ viṣahyadatta.....ẏasyāḥ sphuṭantaṃ puṭapākamiva śokaśāpavatyakasmādaṅga.....ṭo tvayā ca tvatsuhṛdbhiśca parasparasukhabalātkārākṛṣṭapītau tadanuvṛttadrāvitahṛdayānāpakārapayodharāpi dṛśyapi.....ṣānamabhyudanujāne punardarśanāśa......balānāṃ cāsūnāṃ na kathañcana khaṇḍanīyā manorathā iti paryaśruṇā mukhena pādayoḥ pipatiṣantīṃ mātaramatisamagraṃ gṛhītahastadvayo yantrita iva kiñcidaṃ.....ṣtoyava......vyājahāra(?) | kiṃ phalamanba! vaiklavyameṣa dharmaḥ prākṛtaprakādānāṃ yadevaṃvidheṣu vaidhuryamāyā khalu dhairyamevāvakāśe′pi śokasyāśrayati, smara pṛthā sā prasthiteṣvapi vana.....ẏodaśa samāḥ samādhimāsthāyāsthitārātinagarāya, alamatrāpya(trya?)pāyaśaṅkayā vayasyavargaparivṛtasya hi mama seyamudyānavihāravarṇapuṣpodbhavānāma pitaro mātaraśca kiyati kiyati......khavartantamā......kathayatāmavo muhurasyābhirāgamitāstadagre sarvakṛtānāmadviṣyā bhava patnīrapārāvacarāpārapātino gurujanasya(?) | yasya mamāgragaśchadmahaṃsāpanītaḥ tasyāpi (ki)la darśanotsavaścarato′sma.....ṭayā yadyetadevamenamarthamabhisandhāyasi pravasato′smān bhagavatpādārādhansukhaṃ ṛṣiputrakuśāstragoṣṭhīvinoditastātasya ca tava ca pādaśuśraṣārasastātasutāmātyādīnāṃ divāniśamupadeśāmṛ.....ṇāvyāghradamanayorasakṛdāloka(le ? ne) prītiriti katipayadinadurlabhāyamānamapi naitatsarvamutsukayati | asmadviyogautsukyapratikriyārthaṃ copasthita evaiṣa siṃhadamana iti.....ṃanyatra saputradāro′dhyagacchad vyāghradamanaḥ | so′bravīcca | devapādapaṅkajayugaḷamṛte na mātaraṃ pitaramanyamanyaṃ vā bandhumaparaṃ vā daivatamanujānāti janmanaḥ prabhṛti tiṃhadamanaḥ | tasyaiva ca pādavanādanugrahājjalavṛttiṃ tivisarganiṣkalaṅko jaladhara iva dhavalībhūtaḥ sosavanādiṣṭe′pi yatra yatra bhavadīyā patīti pādapadmamātre tatra prathamasannihitā siṃhadamanamadhukaropavāraṇīyo yadi tapovanapariṇalanāya yaduktamātyeva kaścit kandamūlakakhananakaṇṭake......vinatikra(ti?)mipyatītyanavasitavacana eva bhartari saṃrabdheva kiñcidabhyadhatta vindhyasenā(?) | kvaca yāhamadya devasya daśakulakuṭumbapakṣapātitvaṃ kvaca.....ṭāvayamanugrāhyapakṣaṃ devasya daivaha......kena jitamajānyavṛttibhiḥ puṣkarairityudaśrumukhīṃ mātaramuvāca siṃhadamanaḥ | kimamba rodiṣi.....ṣtamanupatanti cāsvāminamarthānarthaṃ cintāviklavā khalu tiryagdharmāṇi no jātirāvṛ(?)......bhoragragamanāyeti kṣubhiteṣu ca teṣu lajjāspṛṣṭa iva kiñcit kṣaṇaṃ tūṣṇīṃ sthitvā prītisnigghena cakṣuṣā kṣāḷayanniva siṃhadamanasyānanaṃ praṇa(ya)kopakāluṣyamālalāpa devo rājavāhanaḥ | sakhe! mā sma tvidamanyathā śrutaṃ (ru ? ku)taścida......ca citrāṃ kathāṃ kathayanti vṛddhāḥ trikādyasahata(?) pitāmahena me caṇḍakṛṣṇaḥ | tasya sūnurapara iva kālaḥ kāladaṇḍanāmā mālaveṣu caṇḍavarmāṇamāśritya tadanujānāmekādaśānāmugrabalamugravarmāṇamaṭavīmardanāya labdhvāyanirgamiva.....ṭi na hi bubhūṣavo dviṣo′vajānate taccedaribalamupanaṃsyati upanatayāyudhasparśatayānugurupānāmokasyai tātavyāghradamanasyoparibhavo bhaviṣyati(?) | sthiteṣu cāsmāsvīdṛśe′rthe yadi vṛddhā vyāpriyante kimebhirlohastambhadīrghastambai(rvāhu?)bāhubhiḥ balino dhanvi(nenā ? no)′pra(ma)ttāḥ sattvavantaśva na santyevānyabhūmau prāyaśo bhavādṛśāḥ | tvayi sthite niśśaṅkaṃ śakyate gantum | gatasyāpi na me suhṛdgaṇabhujavajrapañjaragatasyāśivāśaṅkā tadapriye′pi madvacasyadhisva punastvameva mā......bāṃ cānuneṣyasītyanuttaraṃ tamakarot | evaṃ taistaiḥ prāptakālairālāpaiḥ pūrvamarthaṃ pratiśayya śarvaryā sarva eva śayanamanvatiṣṭhan |

aparedyu(ranvi ? runmi)pati mattapīnacīraṇḍiga......kalatviṣi nnaṃ ca......kravālacāmalatviṣi(?) dhvāndurvilāsamuṣi kumudavanaprabhāsadrohiṇīradotthitamuktapaṅkajavyākṛtamukhapītakomaloṣmaṇi bhaumautsukavakravākapūka......ṣi bhuvanabhūṣaṇe pūṣaṇi puruṣasiṃhaḥ purohitastamberamarohiṇīviṣāṇakoṇāvarjitābhirājyabinducandrakiṇībhiḥ kṣaudraveśalāñchitābhiradbhirabhyukṣitamaulirya.....ṣamupasthāya devaṃ savitāramabhyarcya bhagavantaṃ bhāpāpatimitarāśca parivasitvā devatā japtvā bahūni japyābhihutamatisamāhitenātharvaṇo′nupadrutābhirājyāhutibhi(?)....l̤ālamiva pradakṣiṇāvartitaśitvākalāpajaṭilāgraṃ dhṛmodgāritayaiva sūcitasukṛtapākaṃ rājyacihvasantarpaṇāyeva hayagajadhvajātapatrākṛtiṃ darśayantamavisphuliṅgajarjaramavadāta....r̤ṇaṃ hiraṇyaretasamatulabhaktiḥ pradakṣiṇīkṛtya śuklamālyāṅgarāgavāsāssaha samānaveṣaiḥ suhṛdbhirindugamamtibhaṅgasiddhamivāmṛtasurami saurabheyīkṣīreṇānubhūyamānabahulamanavagīta......pyajjitamāvarjitarasanendriyamakliṣṭaśuddhikarṇakaṃ payo′khaṇḍapāṇḍusikatakṣarūpaṃ pararasama(na?)bhyavahṛtya pītadhūmavartirācānto gṛhītavāsatāmbūlo′bhivandya magavantaṃ vāmadevamanyānapi tapodhanā(nā)śramādhidaivatānyātmanaśca gurujanamāgāmisampatsampādinīrāśiṣaḥ pratigṛhṇana apratirathaṃ japadbhirdevarakṣitapramatimitraguptādibhiḥ savayobhiśca muniputraiḥ parītaḥ pāvayannivānyadurnṛpopabhogapāṃsulāmiḷāṃ (bhava ? ibha)patiyātalīlāvilambibhiḥ pādakamalanyāsaiḥ snigdhagambhīrapuṇyāha(po ? gho)ṣanirhāriṇo nijamandirānmahendradvāreṇa upadvāranihitaratnagarbhamithunakumbhapūrṇaṃ ni(rji ? rga)tya jāyamānasaumanasyaḥ saumyāṃ diśamabhiprātiṣṭhata(?) |

atha prasthitānāṃ ca teṣāṃ dakṣiṇataḥ ko′pi brahmacārī brāhmaṇakumāraḥ kumudotpalakalhārahāriṇi harinmaṇibhaṅgavarṇavāriṇi sarasi sārasāvataṃse haṃsapotāya svahastadattavanyavardhitāya śikharastaprapīḍitenāṅgṛṣṭhamukhālapātinā bisakṣīreṇānutīravirūḍhacarapadmapatrapuṭaṃ tamāpūrayan tribhuva(na)vaiśavyaśālinyā śaradvribhūtyā samāvarjamānadṛṣṭiriyaṃ(?) vasantatilakamuccairujjahāra——

saptacchadastabakacāmara(dhūnano′yaṃ

jāto maruddhana)sitaṃ viyadātapatram |

hāraprasādisaridambusarojalīlaḥ

kālo′yamudbhavati nanditarājahaṃsaḥ ||

iti | labdhevedaṃ pādanimittavṛṣabhaṃ cakramavirepātaṭakhananalagnaraktamṛ....r̤opaviṣāṇayā sahelamudgarjantaṃ saurājyārambhahṛddharmamiva jātidhavaḷaniryāyavandimaṅgaḷagīti(ri ? mi)va vijayaśaṃsinīṃ valgumañjuḷavihaṅgamavirutimākarṇayanto gavyūtimātramiva gatvā same sadme sārapati......ṇodake puṣpaphalasamṛddhasaumyavṛkṣamālini vānaprasthānāṃ sapatnīkānāṃ pratiśraye triphalapāṇibhiḥ....l̤ikākusumadāmabhiḥ pūrṇakalaśapāṇibhiḥ puraskṛtapradīpairaindrīṇāmṛcāṃ māṅgalyānāñca sāmnāṃ jaitrāṇāṃ ca yujuṣāṃ puṇyānāṃ cātharvaṇāmudīrayadbhiḥ ghoṣād dvijātibhiḥ pratigṛhītapraveśaḥ prītapeśalābhistāpasānāṃ.....ṇāmātmanaśca suhṛdāṃ vicitrābhiḥ kathābhiḥ vinodyamānastatra taddinamuvāsa devo′pi rājavāhanaḥ | tasmiṃśca vāsare sumatiri(ddha ? ttha)mātmasutau pramatidevarakṣitāvupahvare samanuśaśāsa——vatsau rājā nāma jambhārijaleśajīvitādhipamanuṣyadharmamārtāṇḍarohiṇīśvararohidaśvaśvasanānāṃ viśvajanīnajanmā sadhrīcīno mātrāsamūhaḥ | tathā hi sthāne varṣati sīmānaṃ rakṣati śāsanīyānanuśāsti svānāmīṣṭe kāle tapati taptānāhlādayatyapakvaṃ pāvayati karmārambheṣu prerayati | asatyasmin na smaryeta dharmo......vedā nārabhyeran īśvarā nārādhyeran devatā na prīṇīyeran varṇā nādriyeran āśra(mā ? mo) na varteta cārtānapatyavatīn paricareyuḥ(?) na bhṛtyāḥ svāminā′nuvarteran na putrāḥ pitṝn pe.....ġurūnupāsīran na karadāḥ karān prayaccheyuḥ, na ca kālenauṣadhivanaspatayaḥ phaleyuḥ | asya hi daṇḍamayādakhaṇḍavāhinī lokayātrā | yadayaṃ prātarutthāya dharmā......vṛttyā samaḥ śatruputrayorādānamṛṇamya nikṣepo′rthānāmasvāmibhirvikrayaḥ (sambhūya?) sambhūya samutthānamana.....ṭāṃ vyatikramaḥ krayavikrayayoranuśayamasvāmipālayorvikrayaḥ sambhūyayoranuśayadasvāmipālayorvivāda(?).....ṣuvipratipattirvāgdaṇḍayoḥ pāruṣya.....ṣtrīpuṃsadharmo dāyavibhāgo dyūta(sa)māhvānamityaṣṭādaśasu vivādapadeṣu(śu?)deśadaivādibhiryathābhūtadarśanādakṛtaṃ dharmānu......prajā.....ṭatpratyanantaraṃ pada.....ṃa yatra vayaṃ vartāmahe | tena cānena mantriṇā trayī vārtā daṇḍanītirānvīkṣikoti catasṛṣu vidyāsvabhivinītena samagreṇa sarvaiḥ prajāguṇairanlpa......bhīruṇā svabhāvadhītapravādavalguvācistambhacāpalālasyānāṃ kadācidapyadattāvakāśena maitreṇa śucinā mahotsāhena satpriyeṇa sattvavatā kṛcchreṣu pratyutpannabuddhinā dva.....ġeṇo vairāyakeṇa(?) vaśinā bharturātmanaśca dharmārthayoḥ pra(ya)titavyam | api cādiṣṭāyāṃ bhūmāvanujñayo vaśye samuditāsanasthena praśnānurūpaṃ priyahitaprāyamaśvīkṛtākṣibhruvo dharmamapi graho ha.....ṣambhāvyamarthadharmānapetamatiparisphuṭaṃ ca kāryāṇi kathayatā sabhyag vṛttamanupraviśya protsāhayatā pramādeṣu mitaṃ pratiṣedhayatā saṃvādamanyairbhedaṃ vānupayatā dveṣyādibhirasaṃvarjinī.....ṇanyābhyarthinā sarvadā sarvatra prekṣākāriṇā daivatavadamāyayopastheyaḥ svā(mi ? mī) sarvaiśca guṇaiḥ sama.....ġatā bhāvasamudetāraśca yūyaṃ yastu sa doṣaḥ sahapāṃsukrīḍayā bālabhāvāhatvena ca mahetvotkaṇṭhādavagṛhya pracārabuddhiriti tadubhayaṃ bhayaṅkaramāvayamiva(?).....ḥyāsevanīyaḥ kumāraḥ sarvaiścāyaṃ mahākulīnatādibhirāgāmikaguṇaiḥ samagrayā cātmasaṃpadāditasvāmītyevameva cāpare′syāmātyāḥ svān sutān santoṣādguṇeṣu.....ṭraṇa kathaṃ......kumāraḥ prathama eva vāsare pitṛparijanaṃ dvitīye paricitān muniputrakān tṛtī(ye) saṃhāryaṃ vyāghradamanaṃ caturthe sahānuyātraṃ siṃhadamanaṃ nivartayitumaśakanmāsaṃ cakra......eva pārśvajāmba.....ṭabhāso hiṃgurukapuṇḍarīkalakṣmīmuṣaḥ kṣaudraharidrābhaṅgaharitālapatrāṃsavarṇābhiroṣadhībhirudakaiścāśūnyaparyantān sahasravedhino rasāṃstāmrapītakāṃśca ra(so ? sa)dhātūn kṛsaramudgamāṣapa.....ṭānapyapalāśaśaivalaniśāhayānavardhayakṛtplīhābhyāṃśca darvībinducyuti......kapān kanakadhātūn padmapāṭalīsphaṭikapārāvatavahikaṇṭhamatsyaṇḍikādyanekavarṇān rūpyadhātūnanyanarendraprārthanīyānabhijño′pi sannakautukamavalokamāno dhṛtisaṃsthitavikaṭavaṃśapaṅktiprāṃśuranuvartibhiranokahairmanojñamāthījjānajīvañjīvakāṃ kūjatkokilāmāpuṣṭamukharakoyaṣṭikāmāguñjadbhṛṅgajālāmacalaguhāmativiśālāmabhitastaṭaśilātalaradvitapuṣpaliṅgayā(?) tuṅgaśṛṅgapatanaratnodbhinnaprastaroccalitabindumālatārakitamūlayā śailakandarapratiravopavṛṃhitamātaṅganirghoṣanirjhariṇyā parigṛhītaṃ kamapi suciraśūnyābhogamekasmiṃśca sikatile vanaspatimūle prāṅmukhamāsīnamakṣamālikāgaṇanayā kimapi japantamanekavraṇakiṇa(kane?)karkaśakā.....ṭtarājinavākṣitekṣaṇāpāṅgamanassaṃskāraparuṣaṃ nīlakālamūrdhajamugratapaścaraṇarūkṣakālavarṇamunnatamukhapalitānumeyadvijātibhāvaṃ kamapi cīravāsasaṃ dadarśa |

sa ca dṛṣṭvai.....ṭthāya pādyamardhyañca padmapatrapuṭena svāgatābhidhānopakramamupajahāra | phalamūlena vanasulabhena svādunā nimantrayāñcakre | tasya ca praṇayamanurūpamakhaṇḍayanto′pi......bhartṛbhāvāḥ suciramaikṣanta devarakṣitaṃ vidhṛtākṛtayaḥ kumārāḥ | sa caivamūce——bhostapodhana! so′yaṃ prabhāvo yastiraśco(pa ? pi)visraṃsa.....ṭāṃ parāmutpādayati ciradarśanamapi netaratra bhujyate hi kṣaṇadṛṣṭo′pi nirviśaṅkamārgadrumo nāma grāmasīmāninyopavīrasthānaṃ vṛkṣastayā ca durādharṣama......pumāṃsamāpādayati svairaniyojyaṃ jagatastatakramasvānuyogā hi mārṣamārdrakautukasya hṛdayasya vapuridamadyāpi viprajāto jātiśuklayā yakṣādisulabhamanupalabdhapūrvamasya(?) cai......śastrakṛttasyāścaryamiva pratisandhānaṃ tāvadavasthānaṃ ca kāraṇaṃ nāma yadeva kiñcinnimittīkṛtya gatvarāṇāṃ vismayasthānamapi ca viṣa(ya)mogaprāgbhāge bharasahe′smin vayasi smṛtivihitagārhasthyaya.....ṣthāya vana iha vānaprasthamekākī caran guruṇā nirvedakāraṇenopatapto bhavitumarhasiṃ | na ca tadvicāryamāṇamanavasānaṃ maraṇamagatiḥ sphuṭaṃ vā kaḥ śarīrapātapratīkṣaṃ narakaduḥkhaṃ mantrauṣadhividveṣaṇam anūṣmadāhajaparokṣaraṃ malamupāvṛtyamavamānakośaṃ prasāritamadhipasyamupacaritanindāmandiramūrcchito viṣādadhvajaḥ salagnaṃ prāṇaśalyaṃ sunihito jugupsānidhimākalitamalakṣmīhastasāramalacchannadainyasarvasvamakhiladaityakaratantutāravismṛtopadeśo dhoratamaḥ pāparogaḥ sakalalokakulīkaraṇarandhrānveṣaṇaikacchāpākajāgarūkaṃ dāridcaṃ tasya hi sannihitaiva pratikriyā yadime viśadavikaraṇaviśadaudumbarāṇāṃ śatavedhināṃ sahasravedhināṃ cātyanta eva dṛśyante kāñcanikārasānavanītakapotagomedakavamaśulyakandhāyakṣaumomākusumavarṇāśca tānnāśīlānaikalokaprabhāgarbha dhāvataḥ(?) | tadevama(yaṃno ? yatno)panateṣvapyubhayalokasādhanakṣameṣvadattadṛṣṭirartheṣu kamarthamabhisandhāya niṣṭhureṇa tapasā karśa.....ṭvā tu sa vipraḥ pratyuvāca——saumya santo′pi sampaśyanti garimāṇamaparamārthaṃ pareṣu citramāryāṇāṃ bhāvāstathā mayi praśnānugraho mukhamapyaparādhyatātmānaṃ bhavānapyu......kṣareṣvasmṛtasmṛtivedeṣu aśrutayajña(pārthe ? vārte)ṣvanāghrātadharmagandheṣvaprasiddhadravyaśuddhiṣvanavekṣitabhakṣyābhakṣyacinteṣvanavagate....r̤yamātrapaṇḍite(ṣva ? ṣu) kāṇḍapṛṣṭheṣu yatnādhigatajātimātrasmaraṇasampradāyeṣu vanacaratulyavṛttiṣu vrātyeṣu vindhyapārśvavāsiṣu śavaraśrāddhapiṇḍāsvādarasānusāribhiriva śāvaraireva bhāvairākā(rairvadhva ? raiḥ pa)rigṛhīteṣu brāhmaṇabruveṣu jāto mā(taḥ na ? taṅgaḥ) kṛtrimagrāmagrāmaṇībhūtajaratkirātanāmadhāro dvijo′smi | ahamekadā kodaṇḍapāṇirāraṇyakairamā caran paripathaṃ pānthamekaṃ palitapāṇḍaramātmaprāṇānurūpayaṣṭyabaṣṭambhasarpiṇaṃ karpaṭāntaḥpinaddhanīvārakathamuṣṭimūṭikābharaparikrāntamandavikra(mā ? mama)śītiyarṣadeśīyaṃ dvijātimāsādayam | asmadīyastu kaścit tena dṛṣṭena raipoṣaṃ pu(ṭa ? ṣṭa) iva hṛṣṭo lākuṭamudyamyābhihantumabhyadhāvat | ārtaḥ saviṣayānubhayakaraniruddhayaṣṭiśikharāyaṣṭabdhaśithilalamyacarmavakṣāstrāsottānatārakatvāt pratyunma(na?)gnadṛṣṭiḥ prayasronnamitamūrdhā ninihirihacīnāṅgahāravṛtajaṅgho viṣṭabhya kathañcideva padbhyāṃ tiṣṭhan putra mā sma hamtuṃ gṛhāṇemaṃ svayamunmucyābhilakṣālagnaṃ vanyamuṣṭimiti śvāsacchinnavāg bruvāṇa eva nirdayābhidhātapātitaḥ prasabhākṛṣyamāṇakarpaṭo vyaveṣṭanara(?) jātadayaḥ punaravārayam | apasara kimanayā dhānya.....ṭrakayā karpaṭikayā varajaradvijān gṛhītavān yataḥ prabhūtamanvicchāma iti | sa māṃ nirbhartsyābhyadhatta satyaṃ sarvāvasthamapyakarmaṇyameva brāhmaṇyaṃ yadayamapi nāma mātaṅgako hasto ghṛṇopahata(?)......bhraṃśayitumicchati | tanmūle ca kalahe (e)namanyāṃścātatā(yīṃ ? yina)ścaturo′hamavadhiṣam | hataśeṣāḥ punaravayavaśaḥ sāmarṣā vikṛtya māmagaman | nāgāmahamabhraṃlihaduttatoraṇaṃ hai(ma)prākāramālamujjvala.....ṇmaṇibhavanapaṅktiṃ dṛśyādṛśyaṃ divyapuṣpaṃ puṣpodakadvārinīravihāracaritapuṇyatāruṇyasundarīvṛndamanantabhogīyam (?) | punarada(rśayaṃ ? rśaṃ) ca mahati siṃhāsane niṣaṇṇamekato divyākṛti......pairupāsyamānaṃ dharmādharmadarśanamiva kurvantaṃ bhagavantaṃ dharmarājam | sa māṃ santrāsena jānuśiraḥspṛṣṭabhūmiṃ vepathuśithilāñjaliyogaṃ ślakṣṇayā girotthāpya sa eṣa sarvayātanāpāra......kṛṣṇo (yasya ? yaḥ sa) purā rājarṣiṇā ripuñjayena yathoktaṃ śāsitaḥ kṣapitakalmaṣāṇāṃ rāśiḥ sasāndhidānimāśītikasya(?) sādhorvasantayājinaḥ śāntipālasyārthe muktajīvito matsamīpamāyātavān.....ḥārho yatra duṣkṛtinaḥ kuṭumbinaḥ | tānimān (dharma ? padma)mahāpadmarauravamahārauravasaptatālakālasūtrāndhakārāhvayā(maya ? n)mahānarakān vibhāgena darśayitvā visṛjainaṃ nityogramityugrakarmanityo......citraguptavānītvāñcāhamitthaṃ citraguptena pātyaitān(?) paricitaṃ tava nirupamānaṃ duḥkhasambhārasambhāramātmambhariṇāmadhīracetasāṃ pretyabhāvapratyākhyāyināṃ bhagavato dharmarājasya yātanāsthānam | atra hi jahi jahīti jātakru(ddhāt ? dhāṃ) kiṅkarāṇāṃ pralayame(va ? gha)nirghātavātabhairavaikabhartsitena yānyaśastrapātyamanānārarjakāśānāṃ vajrakuñjakamaṣṭadaṣṭatradagdhādasthisācchedanāducchūnena cūskṛtena bandhanayantrasaṃveṣṭyamānavigrahāṇāmaṅgabhaṅgavirāvabṛṃhitena hāhāraveṇa āmastakajaghanasandhabrahmasūtrānusārapāṭyamānānāṃ paṭṭasadhārādvidhākṛtena, īkṣaṇoddharaṇasaṃrabdhadakṣiṇakararakṣaḥpādāvaṣṭabdhavakṣasāṃ savyakaranikṛtamanuvalīkṛtagalaghaṭṭitanivṛttena nirbhajyamānaparaśukāsthipañjarajharajharāśabdasāmānyanirgamena niṣṭanitena śiśirajalaprapāpranālīyācanāñjaliharapulitacalitamastakānāṃ paryastadṛṣṭipātakopitakharaduruṣparighamudgaramusalagulikṣepamuṇḍāgaṇḍapiṇḍitapravisṛtena vikranditena śuddhagandhaśālisiddhavardhitakapavamānagandhābhidravaṇaruddhanirdhāritānāṃ jaṅghājānubhaṅgajhaṭajhaṭāra ṭitapaṭutareṇa patanakolāhalena, alīkapākakarkaśajihmajihvoddharaṇaprakaṭakaṇṭhamārganirbādhanirgamānāṃ rakṣaḥkaṭiruddhaduṣkṛtidṛtisadṛkṣatrakṣikṣobhakṣubhitānāṃ prāṇapañcamānāṃ niṣpotadhvanitena, hastadattasikagrapiṇḍapratyākṣeparaukṣya sandhukṣitākṣudrakṣudhālubdhānāṃ.....ṇamiva ca na....l̤ambhitādhvanā ru(mi ? di)tadhvānenāprāṇivairūpyadānadarpitā(nonne ? nāṃ nai)kaśatavarṣānubandhināṃ sandhyasthikaṭhorakāṣāyakuṇḍa......pārśvapāṇipādakṣodanādena, pariṣva(ge ? ṅga)gebhayapalāyamānapāradārikānudhāvatīnāṃ channakaḷatrākāradīptalohaputrikāṇāmuddhāṭitapūrvavṛttacitrakandarpacarttaravistāreṇa prakaṭīkṛtapraṇayakopaprasādanaprakrameṇa marmacchidā kadarthinā pralapitena taptatāmradravānupātadīptāyogulukaphalabhakṣitotthitānāṃ paramarmasparśadurbhāṣitapuruṣabahubhāṣyabhāṣiṇo moṣādgāraprakārakalatalpavāmapārśvaśayanavijṛmbhitena vasāmedastrehamasaikoddāmadhūmaḷasambhāragarbhodyatena dīrghaśūtkṛtena vṛkavarāhasiṃhavyāghravarmi(ha?)mahiṣakurukoṣṇikāvalupyamānasarvāvayavānāṃ mṛgavanavihārasiṃhikānāmasahyenārambhitena vanadahanavisargaśīlānām analajālagarbhāśayacibṛttiviṣphūrjitaraveṇa cāratavividhacaturāṇāṃ varṣasahasrāndhakārakuharamāsaduḥkhanissahavisṛṣṭena viparatāpanapaṇḍitānāṃ uttotsarpasarpaharitabhañjanāvarjitanimajjitonmajjitānām arundhakaraṇabhaṅgalicacilālikhayā khajamathanagorasacoraghorārañjarakalakalenāsitālavanapatrapātrotkṛtyamānacaityacchedakāṅkacchikṛtena dharmakṛtataṭākanāśakanaraśanabhīmatailikayabhrānticitkṛtena śaucāśaucavicāramaśūnyadurmānuṣamamalasasarittaraṇāsphāvācālapālaśaivālajālajaṭilapūgavīcīpūgavega......bhaśabdena kṣutsandhukṣitaprakācipenadhanasamavasāravodarāndhavadidhakṣakṣaḥ sahastatālapaṭahadhvānesanasanasyādvaśanaprāgṛnāsaktasūcīgaḷa....r̤okṣābhihanyamānodaramṛdaṅganisvanena ca brahmastambhasīmaspṛśā bhidyanta iva nityaśravaṇakarkaśānyasmākamapi nāma śravaṇarandhrāṇi(?) | api ca pratītānyeva brāhmaṇavadhaḥ surāpāna.....ṣteyaṃ gurutalpagamanaṃ patitasaṃprayoga iti pañca mahāpātakāni ta(trai ? tra) brahmahaṇo (na?)vanakuṭīgrāmasīmaśūnyagovrajavṛkṣamūlānāmanya(tama)vāsino vāpitaśirasaḥ śavaśirodhvajā......śacaritavanto bhaikṣānnaṃ gosavena sva(ñjita ? rjida)bhijidviśvajidbhiraśvame(dha ? dhe)na (tṛva ? trivṛ)tstomena vā niṣṭhu(te ? reṇe)ṣṭavanto gṛ(havo ? haṃ vā) saparibarhaṃ dhanaṃ vā jīvanakṣamaṃ sarvameva vā svaṃ viprāya vidu.....ṇanabhibhujaḥ sarasvatyā pratisrotonusāriṇo na triradhītavedasaṃhitā naticitrabhānau samindhatyāvācīnaśirasaḥ patitāḥ na vidhivallakṣabhūtāḥ śastriṇāṃ na gobrāhmaṇakṛte vikramya si......bahuprakāramohitā mṛtā vā na ca brahmakṣatrasaṃsaduddhoṣitāpārvā no′śvamedhāvabhṛthasrātā yāntyante tu sarv