anto(?) vilomatāṃ gatā vighaṭamānasandhayo bhidyamānāntaraṅgā nirargaḷapravṛttāṅgajanmanissārībhūtā bhūtimātrabhāvinaḥ pratyāsannajanāñjalipratigrahābhilāṣiṇaḥ praruditaprajāduḥkhopahṛtabalipiṇḍalabdhavṛttayo jīvadavasthāyāmapyanātmavṛttayaḥ pretanirviśeṣāḥ kṣatrabandhavaste′mī yathoktaguṇino duḥkhapūreṣvapāra......ṣu mahānarakeṣu saha sarvaduṣkarakapaṭopadeśanirghṛṇairasaṅkhyeyasamudraśaṅkhapadmaśaṅkuparvanikharvanyarbudārbudāni saṅkhyāvacchinnāni sahasrāṇyuṣitvā punarasmin padmanarake janma mānuṣya kapra.....ṇatibhinnaṃ manyante | yamapuruṣāścātra kāsavamadhupratiśvāyadayakapāstāṃ mama kanakapratāmanādayaścāpāyujāḥ pānarogamukhāśca pāyumūlāmahāḥ sarvaprāṇisaṃhāriṇā jvareṇa....l̤olayanti rakṣāṃsi ca dāruṇāni ca(?) | tvayāpyetā yātanāḥ sahasraśo′nubhūtāḥ tathedānīmācara yatheha punarna patiṣyasītyabhihitaśca bhīto hṛṣitaromā (haṃdadyama ? hantādyā)hamanugṛhītaścāsmi yadevaṃ prabhavatānukaṃ......punarahamapadiṣṭo nityogra iti bhagavatā dharmarājena tanme bhagavatprasādādavajigamiṣyāsulabhānukrośadattāśvāsaṃ hṛdayamityañjalimuparacayato sa(mā ? me) samabhyadhāt |

astyetadabhūd vidarbho(datta ? pānta)vāsinaḥ pulindānāmīśvarasya hālabhali(kā ? kanā)mnaḥ kolāhalikanā(mnaḥ ? mā) cauryāpahṛtaḥ sutaḥ | sa jātu sagaṇaḥ svadharmānuṣṭhāyī saha vadhvā kāñcidāryavidhavāmadhvani pratyarundhat | sā tvanāthā hā nā(tha!) dīrghada(rśī ? rśinā) devena satā kathaṃ na dṛśyate kalatramitthamāpadgatam | hā putra! (nītvo ? nityo)gra! īdṛśamapyapatyaṃ labdhvā kimīdṛśī na hīmanubhavanīyā(?) hā putraka! mahogra! mātrā saha paritrāyasva bhāryāmi(trā ? tyā)rtanādaṃ vyasṛjat | anantaraṃ ca vyāghra iva ko′pi kopāt prajvalan adhijyadhanvā yuvā tañjanasamūhamabhyadravat | taṃ ca kolāhalikaṃ ca rūpato vivektumakṣamā muhya(nta i ? ntī)va kṣaṇama(ṇḍum ? bhūt) | pulindapatistu tāṃ striyaṃ saputrasnuṣāṃ samāśvāsya ko′sau dīrghadarśī nāma kaśca sa nityograḥ kā (sa casiktattha ? cāsi katha)ñce(dāṃ ? māṃ) daśāmārūḍhetyavaśaklinnacetāḥ sadayamanvapṛcchat | sā kimapi prasnutastanī piba(nni ? ntī)va tamatṛpta(ta?)yā dṛśā pratyavocat | jāta! jā(le dhana ? landhara)sya nāma kuṇḍinapateruttamāmātyaḥ sa yathārthanāmā dīrghadarśī | tasya mahābhāgasya māmavehi mandabhāgāṃ gṛhiṇī(yamārya ? m | mayya)bhūtāṃ sutau yamau nityogro mahogra iti | ādyaḥ kaścidājīvakaśravaṇasvatantro′yaṃ prabhuḥ bhāvitāviṣṭavān naṣṭaśca so(ṣa ? ′ṣṭa)varṣasteṣvahassu rakṣādoṣādārabdhākrandāni ca nigṛhyaivaṃ bodhitāsmi bhartrā bhadre! mā sma naḥ kṛtsnaṃ kulamekasya kṛte samūlamutkṛttaṃ sannivāpā pārthivasya grāhayitāraḥ putraiśvaryamādeśapratyayādāśaṃsamānastvadbhayādamuṃ gopāyati nāśanādeneti(?) | tadbhavedabhāvāya mahato naḥ kuṭumbasya tatpa.....ṃahakulaṃ mahogramadyaiva netum | tataḥ pātayema vārtāṃ dvau cāpi dārakau kalyāṇakṛtena mātāmahena snehānnītāviti | kṛcchrācca māmabhyupagamayyaṃ (tu ? kṛ)tvā caiva sthito......ṇāmayasundaro mattahasti mahatkraro purakaṃ daśanamiti(?) sambhramāveditastvarayā nirgatastaṃ cireṇa grāhayitvopāvṛtto vimanāyamānaḥ śayane madanuyogādabhāṣata | gata idānīṃ tamasi mattagajavidrāvitānuyātraḥ kimapyagāraṃ bhayādupaśliṣṭo niśīthanirbhāriṇaṃ bhittyantaritaṃ pravācamaśrauṣam | bhadre bhāmini! mā māṃ vilambitāgamanamanyathāsambhavavibhavaṃ śrutvaitat satyeva kāraṇe rudibhi(?)nṛpatināhamadya rātrāvityupahlare′bhihitaḥ jāne tvā kṛtātmānaṃ manasvinaṃ mayi ca bhaktimantam | mātulastu dīrghadarśītvadguṇavat tavaihino vivardhanātime tvayi samīcīṃ vṛttim (?) | udvṛttaśca sa (bāhvā ? bahū)napi vañcayitvā putraḥ kila bhavitā rājeti tamidānīṃ gopāyituṃ pravṛ(tta)ssa yadi manyase vijahi tasyā(jyaṃ?)śā(mu)tsādayannupāṃ(pā?)śu nityogram | ataśca prītiruttamā vairiniryātanācca dharmārthau ca puṣkalau svāmyarthasādhanād bhavantamabhyāvarteranniti | hṛṣṭa iva tannideśamāśrutyāgato′smīti | nanu tadanuṣṭheyameva devādiṣṭamapi nihatya śīlam | asulabhā evārthaṃ sveṣvapi cāpahṛtya ślāghanta eva satpuruṣāḥ | pītaṃ hi rudhiramuṣṇaṃ bhīmena bhrāturduśśāsanasya | evaṃbhāṣiṇīṃ bhāryāṃ sodvegamavocadacyutakaḥ | kitaṃ parikṣipyase, kimapāyamahāvaśaṃsi śīlaviparyayaḥ kiṃ vāpi kṣamācaritā citpriyānurūpeṇa māṃ mohayasi(?) | ka ivāpakartāro nāma gu(ravo ? ruṣu) yattatkilbiṣamayeṣu naikaprāṇāpahāriṣu kṣudreṣu dhārtarāṣṭreṣu kṣatriyeṇa bhīmenācaritaṃ tat kila mātṛkalpe mātule śukle śuklavṛtte viśvopagamyasampadimabhyavahiteneva kenāpi hetunā mayi kiñciddūropakrame′duṣkulīne devopahatya lokadvayaṃ mā ceṣṭitamiti nirbhartsitā ca bhartrā vepathuviṣamagadgadaṃ vadhūrabhāṣiṣṭa priyaprasara.....ṇaiva nirghṛṇe pāpakarmaṇi bhartāraṃ niyojayet, api tu hṛṣṭa ivāgato′smīti tvat nirantarvepamānā tvatkrodhanāya jijñāsārthaṃ tato′nupanyastavinītyapatadasya pādayoḥ(?) | praviṣṭaścāhaṃ padasthānotthastenaśaṅkena kastvityāttaśastreṇa tena pṛṣṭo vatsa! yo′sāvadīrghadarśino bālasya te vṛddhasyāparapārśvapāpaḥ tvāmabhyānunetumāyāta iti savrīḷamavādiṣam | a(ndha ? nva)naiṣīdatho svarābhijñānābhyāṃ? pādayornipatya | bhāgineyatayā mayā caivaṃ bodhitaḥ——te na jātu kopanīyāḥ (su ? kṣi)prakopādussantoṣaṃ sadyaḥpākānalpakopaphalā dūrapatītya prītyudarkā rājānaḥ sa yatho(kta) kārīnāma tatra gatvā pratyāgacchad yatra te bhrātā pratyāgataścamatkāritajanapanyuṣitamiva nityograśiraḥpūrtamayatrapāya kenacidapyanupalakṣito neṣyasi tadiyamāpa samantato nerthāḥ pratikṛtaḥ syāditi(?) | pratipanne ca tena tamanuyātaṃ nivartya nirgato gajamapyālānayitvāhamāgato′smi | sarvathānena durnyastajīvitamityasmin nindayā ca nakapraśaṃsayā ca kṛtopacitayā ca jāgratoreva no vibhātāsā vibhāvarī | tathaiva ca tadarthamahīnakālaṃ nirvartya kuladharmaṃ yaśo′smānīśvaraṃ ca sa sādhurārādhayat | aviśvastavarṇaṃ ca me bhartā(ra)(ma ? mā)kāraceṣṭitairavadhāya prāyo (ma)tkṛtamanenābuddhamiti buddhyutsāhaprabhāvajito bhūpatī rā(jāno ? jño)′siyaṣṭimabhijñānaṃ dattvā kañcit kañcukinamantaraṅgaṃ vikāle preṣitavān | veṣeṇa kṣaṇadācarakṣameṇa sampratyevāgantavyamasti kāryaṃ tādṛśamiti | vātyeva khalu tṛṇyāmākṣipanti kṛtadhiyo′pi matimanto′pi.....ṭāyaḥ sa mahān maivamayamartho bhāvīti mahyamuktvā manniṣedhanibaddho′pi na vicārayogyā bhṛtyaiḥ piṇḍadānāmādeśā iti nīlanivasanārdhorukapari...... |

.....ṣavibhramavilambitanitambinīnikāyastasya madhye tanutapanīyanirmitagrīvasūtraikataraḷamāṇikaṃ.....ṭilagnabālātapeva lakṣyamāṇā veṇībhūtanīlaśikhaṇḍihāratayā mukhajanitacandrasandehasannihitarāhuriva sambhāvyamānā....r̤dhvabhāgaṃ saṃsarpibhirlocanadyutibhirambu(ja)vanacumbanāśāvibhramabhramadbhramarasainyapurassareva salilamadhyasañcāriṇī vāridevānāṃ tathā dṛḍhenāpyū......ṣadapi madhyayaṣṭikāmayā maṇirajvā gurupayodharabhā(nu ? ra)bandhamudvahantī pārihāryakeyūraprabhṛtibhūṣaṇaparityāgetyanupagṛhītamarakatāṅgulī......pādhikārasannihitaṃ dharmasamayamiva darśayantī caraṇāravindalobhena kiṃ nakhamaṇikiraṇakṣīradhārābhilāṣeṇa kimātmakulamañjuśiñjito.....ġeṇa na jāne kuto′pyanubadhnantaṃ bhavanahasaṃ(ko?)potaka(pra?)māprapadīnaśuklāṃśukadaśāvalambabaddhacaramavadyasakhalaṃ niśaśima(?).....ṃava kāciduttamāṅganā pratyadṛśyata | sā ca gatvā tamehi nātha sanāthībhavatvayamidānīmānāthyacāranirviṇṇo jana ityañjalimukuḷa.....ṭidṛśaṃ nirvartya svāgataṃ mahābhāgāya tvatprasādādiyamasmākiṃnoki nāvaimaculabho(?)......palabandhaśālī saṃvṛtto manorathaḥ | tadanubhavatu mahābhāgaḥ sambhava.....ṭya radamṛtadhārayābhibhāṣya devaṃ rājavāhanaṃ saha tābhyāṃ tamevāgniva.....ġresarakanakavetrahastakāñcukīyahuṅkāradū(rīkṛta)janasaṃ.....ṇa maṇimayena vartmanā nagaramāviveśa | āsasāda ca vividhamaṅgalavidhānavya.....ṇāgaṇamaṅgaṇaraṇadattāṅgatūryāyamāṇagaṇatithavāra....r̤aṇaṃ bhavanam | tatraca mahati vaidūryamaṇḍape sasakhījanasambhrā.....ẏorvāsatāmbṛlaca......pāradattavisrambhāparāśayostayoḥ svayaṃ ca mantriyaddhaprapannahīnaviṣṭarā(?).....ṃapi dhyātvā bhūyo rājavāhana(vāhana?)mukhe nidhāya dṛ....r̤aprāṇadakṣa mama badhāna dānamabhyarthayate tvatprasādaṃ ca vardhitaḥ praṇayo yadidamindranīlamaṇimayadharaṇīpṛṣṭhamambaratalagolamūlābhogavibhramaṃ samālakṣya.....ṇnāmava(?) | yaśca sa vikramodyatatrivikramacaraṇavikṣepalakṣabhūto′rthi(ta?)ja(na)praṇayākhaṇḍanaprati(jño) namucirnāma dānavendrastasyedaṃ puram | anu.....ṣya mandākinī nāma duhitā | hate pitari tribhuvanavijigīṣuṇā kalpādimahīvarāhasamparkarāgasagbhūtena tridaśapatisundarīvṛndasāndra.....ṭrāsodīrṇaśvāsapavanasevitena sakalamahāsurendravṛndavandite(na) narakeṇāsmi saṃvardhitā | tasya ca duhituryajñavatyā.....ṭi paraṃ maitramāsīt | āsīcca punarāvayorapi sakhī sandopasundasaubhrātragrāvabhedamadanakuṭākaṭaṅkadhārā śaṅkarānanapaṅka.....ṭridaśalokalocanabhrama(ra)kadambakāhampūrvikāvaluptayauvanakusumodgamā tilottamā nāma | tilassa...... ndarī yajñavatī tu manmathamanodhirohiṇi prathamasopānaparvaṇi vayasi vartamānā mayā tilottamayā....r̤isānukānanāni samanubhūya pratinivṛttā bhavanamekākinī śayanametya nissahe...... |

.....ṭha tadavadhāraṇo jīvituṃ na śakyamiti dayamāneva tasyā ratira(cara ? pa)jahāra hṛdayaṃ satyaṃ na veti dūtīvyāvarṇitamāmenaiva gatvā dikṣu(ru ? u)jjhaniva dehaṃ mumoha (?) | nipuṇayā punaḥ patralekhayā kādambarīśikhaṇḍabhūṣaṇaśrīvatsamudrāṅkitānmaṇisamudgāduddhṛtya tatkarakisalayasaṃ(ṅkṛ ? skṛ)tena (rakto?)raktacanda(no ? nenā)nulipya pratyāśvasīt | atha kaṭakādāgataḥ prajñātata(po ? ro) manojavo nāma dūto vyajñāpayat | sa ca saha meghanādenāgrataḥ patralekhāmitaḥ preṣya prayāṇadundubhimādiśyācchodataṭe mahāśvetāśramāntikamaṇigṛhāgataṃ haramabhipraṇamya niryātamātraḥ kimapyaspṛśyata jvararūpeṇāmayena mantrikumāro vaiśampāyanaḥ | tadāsīt katipayadivasāvasthāyi sainyam |

atha yaḥ sa devena jitvā suvarṇapurānnirastaḥ kirātānāṃ hemajaṭānāṃ patirmahābalaḥ sa kimpuruṣaiḥ saṃbhūyābhyaṣeṇayat | ayudhyatobhaṃ daridraṃ rājanyamākalayyākalayya śamitaḥ saṃrambheṇa mantriputrasya tena cāsau hema(kū ? ja)ṭeśvaraḥ kiṃpuruṣāṅgaṃ kiṃpuruṣa evāsanniti(?) | tacca sarvaṃ pitre nivedya kiṃpuruṣavarṣābhiyogamiṣṭajanadarśanotsuko′bhyarthayāmbabhūva | snehaviklavevāhyasyatyeva rājani vismayaparamparodveṣakṣītaḥ(?) kṣitimavatatāra tārāpathāt ko′pi ratnamālī rathaḥ, tato′vatīrya puruṣastaruṇādityadīpto hemacitramaulimānamayya......janaṃ savya......padi kvaṃ cakravartigurave sandiśati gandharvarājaścitrarathaḥ prastuto′tra madduhituḥ kādambaryāḥ svayaṃvaravidhiḥ sannipatitaśca deva......pārthivo deva iva kārtavīryo hehayānāṃ lalāmabhūto varate yadi......jānannapi kṣobhaparyantatāṃ prāyaḥ svayaṃvarāṇāṃ dharmo′yaṃ kṣatriya.....ṭaḥ sarva ete parijanāstameva rathamindrāyudhañca svayamāsthāya kailāsa(ni)kaṭavartikaṭakamāpede | saha.....ġaṇaiḥ gandharvarājena satkṛ(tānta ? tastanni)rdiṣṭaṃ raktavimālibhavanamadhyatiṣṭhata | tathātihṛṣṭaṃ kumāramudyānacitraśālāgatamanekai(payadharaḥ ? rupacāraiḥ) paryacārayat keyūrakatama......pramukhaṃ kādambarīṣarijanaḥ | sāyañca sāraprābhṛtabhārahastaparijanānuyāte mahāśvetāmadalekhe samāsedatuḥ | te tamanaṅgakṣīṇamāpāṇḍuraṃ ca dṛṣṭvā sa(mbhāyā ? mabhāvaya)tām | so′pi tayordarśanena jātyandha iva labdhacakṣu(rna)nanda | tābhyāñca sasambhramotthitacaraṇapraṇāmakaṇṭhagrahopa(ri?)caritābhyāṃ yathārhaṃ sambhāvya kaccit kuśalābhyāmanārye vijane parāṅmukhībhavaturdudurdāmahṛdayavirahadāhajvaravyasanamūḍhahṛdayāhlādanāsu smaraṇasannidhibhyāṃ devapādapaṅkajābhyāmiti madalekhāpyavekṣya papracha(?) | sā cādya kuśalamiti sasmitaṃ mahāśvetāmavekṣāñcakre | teṣāñca yathārhapratipannāsanānāmāgamanadarśanautsukyabhā....l̤aghuṣu locaneṣu niryantraṇapracaritāsu visṛtamadhulavāsu visrambhiṇīṣu sphuṭopajātapratyayaiḥ prasīda(pra?)tyantarātmani mahāśvetā rājaputramityuvāca | kumāra! tvayi gate (sa?) rājadhānīṃ tvaddarśanapratyā(śaila ? śayai)va gandharvarājakanyāmadhārayakāraṇe punarabhimānasakhījanopadeśānām | atha krameṇa kṣoyamāṇe vapuṣi pīyamāneṣu pratikṣaṇamanena rakṣasā dehabhāradhāraṇeṣu rasādiṣvanta(ra ? ka)puramārgādeśanacāṭukāriṇīṣviva bahuśaḥ parimukhīṣu mūrcchāsūtarottaravila.....ṭasthitāgameṣvananyaśaraṇā sakhi prasīda nātaḥ paraṃ pārayāmi dhārayituṃ hataśarīra? ja(ra?)vyathāturaṃ śarīra(vyatha?)matidakṣiṇaḥ kumāraḥ sa me′śakyaḥ pratyānetumālambaya pāṇimanu evāyamartho mātustato′pi na tanmatimanuvartiṣyata iti śiśapiṣṭamanunādhyamānāpi sa yadā nājahādeva taṃ hatapratijñātaṃ(?) tadā paryāptamaśru muktvā sarvaduḥkhaviṣāṃkurakṣetramidamutsisṛkṣuḥ jyotiṣmatī(tī)ramandāraṣaṇḍametya tīrthasnātā puṇḍarīkairdhānyadhāmabhirambikāramaṇamabhyarcyāsti kimapi hato(?) bhavitavyamiti edhāṃsyāhārya havyavāhanamavardhayam | atha tasyāḥ puṇyā(stāto ? t tata u)ttīrṇo devarṣirnāradaḥ tanme bhāvamārṣeṇa cakṣuṣopalabhya vatse mahāśvete! vimuktassarvadurvikalpākārāyāḥ kādambaryāḥ svayaṃvaramityeva divamagāhata(?) | maharṣivacanapratyayācca madvacarayatiṣṭhadaṃścātanmate ca rājā citraratho na tu jāne kathaṃbhāvītyasminneva kṣaṇe rājādiṣṭaḥ pramādaṃ kathayitukāmaḥ tadevoddeśaṃ vaiśampāyanaḥ prāviśat | katipayakṣaṇādarśanācca taṃ paraṃ proṣitāgatamiva gāḍhamāśliṣyātiṣṭhata | tadanantare raktaviṣṭare rājaputraḥ tasya kila darśane yathāpuramavartanta puṇḍarīkadarśanasamayānubhūtāni mahośvatāntaritāni digantarāṇi(?) | so′pi na kevalamākṛtyā sadyaḥ prāṇapātanakṣamayā kāmāvasthayāpi kamūlemanucakāra | ta.....ġāśvetāpi parā......jyamā....r̤atamapārayantī tirayituṃ hṛdaya....r̤bhāmāgavilāsapratyudvṛttaṃ tatra jālamiva calaṃ cāṅga.....ṃandaṃ madalekhayā saha jagāma | gatvā caki......khyassandiśya gulmāntaritāyāmeva tasyāṃ durvyavasāyine hṛdayā.....ṇitambā tu nāṅgabhaṅgaṃ lege | durnimittanivartitekṣaṇā purastā......kaitaṃ dṛṣṭvā tathātithitā.....ḥa kādambaryā sakalamavakasyā....r̤amugdhamṛgīkulamiva trāsobhrāntadṛṣṭi tameva giritaṭavanamabhyadhāvadākrośanta rudita viśramevaināṃ caitrarathī saśapathaiḥ sāñjalibhiranunayavacanasahasrairātmatyāgahetuṃ śaśāka śaṃsayitumevaṃ cābravīt || ......



